  ('113489892702625268', 'Majikoi - Oh! Samurai Girls', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Yuu Asakawa, Akane Tomonaga, Yokote Kumiko, Yuko Goto, Shizuka Itoh, Takeshi Kusao, Katsuyuki Konishi', null, 'Kawakami City is famous for its strong dedication to its samurai ancestors. A healthy fighting spirit is always valued and it''s even an important factor for success at school. Yamato, a second year student from Kawakami High school, is always with his close friends (4 boys and 3 girls). They have all known each other since they were young and have done many things together. While they have many other friends, this group of seven is a close-knit, inseparable group. They even have a secret base where they meet. With the new semester, they welcome two girls into their group and shortly after things begin to change...', 'Kawakami City is famous for its strong dedication to its samurai ancestors. A healthy fighting spirit is always valued and it''s even an important factor for success at school. Yamato, a second year student from Kawakami High school, is always with his close friends (4 boys and 3 girls). They have all known each other since they were young and have done many things together. While they have many other friends, this group of seven is a close-knit, inseparable group. They even have a secret base where they meet. With the new semester, they welcome two girls into their group and shortly after things begin to change...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wD6brkjoMIXlirEyqY5hoijmi6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45281'),
  ('59118317452447811', 'Majin Bone', 2014, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'KENN, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Hiroki Yasumoto, Yuko Sanpei, Eri Sendai, Minako Kotobuki, Kazunari Tanaka', null, 'Majin, the creator of the Universe, has been resurrected in the present day. Shougo Ryuujin, an ordinary high school student who transforms into the Bone Fighter, Dragon Bone with the Bone Card in order to save Earth. Together, with the other White Bone warriors take a stand against the Dark Bone, a foe that has appeared from darkness to devastate Earth. However, "could the true enemy be ourselves?"', 'Majin, the creator of the Universe, has been resurrected in the present day. Shougo Ryuujin, an ordinary high school student who transforms into the Bone Fighter, Dragon Bone with the Bone Card in order to save Earth. Together, with the other White Bone warriors take a stand against the Dark Bone, a foe that has appeared from darkness to devastate Earth. However, "could the true enemy be ourselves?"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6niT3oJyu4Gt0yj0IsaUpycGEZm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79057'),
  ('359405508757203472', 'Majisuka Academy', 2010, 'Drama', 'Yasushi Akimoto', null, null, null, 'Two transfer students, Atsuko Maeda and Onizuka Daruma came at the all-girls school Majisuka Gakuen. In this school violence and fighting are common among the Yankee students. Noisy and trouble maker Daruma made a fuss as soon as she entered the school, win in her first fight but then was beaten easily by another gang shortly after. In contrary to Daruma''s bold-but-powerless attitude, Maeda who is truthfully a strong girl despite of her silent nature found Daruma is beaten by Team Hormon before her. The word "Majisuka?" (means are you serious?) instantly awaken her true nature and made her won the battle against Daruma''s attackers easily, thus made a big fuss at the school and the news even reached the strongest fighting group, Rappapa. Afterwards, Daruma acknowledged Maeda as her boss and as a result the friendship between the two girls began to grow along with their fights with fellow students at their school.', 'Two transfer students, Atsuko Maeda and Onizuka Daruma came at the all-girls school Majisuka Gakuen. In this school violence and fighting are common among the Yankee students. Noisy and trouble maker Daruma made a fuss as soon as she entered the school, win in her first fight but then was beaten easily by another gang shortly after. In contrary to Daruma''s bold-but-powerless attitude, Maeda who is truthfully a strong girl despite of her silent nature found Daruma is beaten by Team Hormon before her. The word "Majisuka?" (means are you serious?) instantly awaken her true nature and made her won the battle against Daruma''s attackers easily, thus made a big fuss at the school and the news even reached the strongest fighting group, Rappapa. Afterwards, Daruma acknowledged Maeda as her boss and as a result the friendship between the two girls began to grow along with their fights with fellow students at their school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtesRu93qYwS0YtIqkSjCY3ErUY.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:40361'),
  ('816854727154144205', 'Major', 2004, 'Animation', null, null, 'Showtaro Morikubo, Masakazu Morita, Noriko Hidaka, Junko Noda, Fuyuka Ono, Mitsuki Saiga, Shunsuke Sakuya, Koji Ochiai', null, 'Honda Goro the son of a famous baseball player loves nothing more than baseball itself. His biggest dream is to show his father that he can become the best pitcher in the world despite all the hardships he had to endure he keeps on running towards his goal at full speed.', 'Honda Goro the son of a famous baseball player loves nothing more than baseball itself. His biggest dream is to show his father that he can become the best pitcher in the world despite all the hardships he had to endure he keeps on running towards his goal at full speed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvVfxP9GiWMXct2ZJOXFF4l7dn.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:29602'),
  ('517592898049271312', 'Major 2nd', 2018, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Natsumi Fujiwara, Koutaro Nishiyama, Natsumi Takamori, Kana Hanazawa, Showtaro Morikubo, Masakazu Morita, Shintaro Ohata, Tomokazu Sugita', 'TV-14', 'Shigeno Daigo is an elementary student whose father, Goro, is a professional baseball player. Inspired by his father, who was once a Major League player, Daigo started playing baseball with the Mifune Dolphins, a youth team. However, he was unable to live up to the expectations of being the son of a professional, and quit baseball after less than a year. Then, in the spring of his sixth-grade year, Daigo''s school welcomes a transfer student, Sato Hikaru, whose father is Sato Toshiya, a former Major League player and Goro''s close friend. The fate of these two young men begins to move forward!', 'Shigeno Daigo is an elementary student whose father, Goro, is a professional baseball player. Inspired by his father, who was once a Major League player, Daigo started playing baseball with the Mifune Dolphins, a youth team. However, he was unable to live up to the expectations of being the son of a professional, and quit baseball after less than a year. Then, in the spring of his sixth-grade year, Daigo''s school welcomes a transfer student, Sato Hikaru, whose father is Sato Toshiya, a former Major League player and Goro''s close friend. The fate of these two young men begins to move forward!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UmoNij31C7zlC3hiF5UJ4DDD9C.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:78476'),
  ('1091679683419346063', 'Major Crimes', 2012, 'Crime, Drama', 'James Duff', null, 'Mary McDonnell, G.W. Bailey, Tony Denison, Michael Paul Chan, Raymond Cruz, Phillip P. Keene, Kearran Giovanni, Graham Patrick Martin', 'TV-14', 'Major Crimes explores how the American justice system approaches the art of the deals as law enforcement officers and prosecutors work together to score a conviction. Los Angeles Police Captain Sharon Raydor heads up a special squad within the LAPD that deals with high-profile or particularly sensitive crimes.', 'Major Crimes explores how the American justice system approaches the art of the deals as law enforcement officers and prosecutors work together to score a conviction. Los Angeles Police Captain Sharon Raydor heads up a special squad within the LAPD that deals with high-profile or particularly sensitive crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZ502JXujnxVtprmigTO2jA205P.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:39483'),
  ('675638920201545976', 'Major Dad', 1989, 'Comedy, Family', 'Richard C. Okie', null, 'Gerald McRaney, Shanna Reed, Matt Mulhern, Jon Cypher, Beverly Archer, Marisa Ryan, Nicole Dubuc, Chelsea Hertford', 'TV-PG', 'Major Dad is an American sitcom created by Richard C. Okie and John G. Stephens, developed by Earl Pomerantz, that originally ran from 1989 to 1993 on CBS, starring Gerald McRaney as Major John D. MacGillis and Shanna Reed as his wife Polly. The cast also includes Beverly Archer, Matt Mulhern, Jon Cypher, Marisa Ryan, Nicole Dubuc and Chelsea Hertford.', 'Major Dad is an American sitcom created by Richard C. Okie and John G. Stephens, developed by Earl Pomerantz, that originally ran from 1989 to 1993 on CBS, starring Gerald McRaney as Major John D. MacGillis and Shanna Reed as his wife Polly. The cast also includes Beverly Archer, Matt Mulhern, Jon Cypher, Marisa Ryan, Nicole Dubuc and Chelsea Hertford.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOFp3vszwK8qQ24JvytgvalURUi.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3484'),
  ('628755770933650750', 'Major Lazer', 2015, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Nick Weidenfeld, Ferry Gouw, Diplo', null, 'Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, James Adomian, John Boyega, Ashante ''Taranchyla'' Reid, J.K. Simmons, Angela Trimbur', 'TV-MA', 'Set in the future, Major Lazer is a Jamaican superhero who fights against the dystopian forces that have ruined society that are led by President Whitehall and General Rubbish. Major Lazer is assisted in his fight by President Whitehall''s daughter Penny and hacker Blkmrkt.', 'Set in the future, Major Lazer is a Jamaican superhero who fights against the dystopian forces that have ruined society that are led by President Whitehall and General Rubbish. Major Lazer is assisted in his fight by President Whitehall''s daughter Penny and hacker Blkmrkt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxBkd0iHlWFQGSwrF74H0Fsm9Sq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62744'),
  ('1119772358046343181', 'Makai Ouji: Devils and Realist', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takuya Eguchi, Takuma Terashima, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Jun Fukuyama, Tetsuya Kakihara', 'TV-14', 'A brilliant, skeptical noble accidentally summons a powerful demon and is forced to choose Hell''s next ruler, while demons and angels battle for his nomination.', 'A brilliant, skeptical noble accidentally summons a powerful demon and is forced to choose Hell''s next ruler, while demons and angels battle for his nomination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mayvfdEDk3aedSBA0wGPTl2XBs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77260'),
  ('621562793083053223', 'Makari', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Claudio Gioè, Domenico Centamore, Ester Pantano', null, 'Saverio Lamanna, a journalist turned spokesman for an influential government politician, is fired after committing imprudence at work. Defeated both emotionally and professionally, Saverio decides to leave Rome and return to Màkari, his birthplace in Sicily: here he rediscovers a great passion that has remained dormant for years, that of the writer. Driven by the curiosity that characterizes him, Saverio decides to improvise as an investigator and investigate the various local cases, forming an unlikely trio together with the eccentric and light-hearted friend Peppe Piccionello and the determined architecture student Suleima.', 'Saverio Lamanna, a journalist turned spokesman for an influential government politician, is fired after committing imprudence at work. Defeated both emotionally and professionally, Saverio decides to leave Rome and return to Màkari, his birthplace in Sicily: here he rediscovers a great passion that has remained dormant for years, that of the writer. Driven by the curiosity that characterizes him, Saverio decides to improvise as an investigator and investigate the various local cases, forming an unlikely trio together with the eccentric and light-hearted friend Peppe Piccionello and the determined architecture student Suleima.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJuNWtg64Pu8a8nAsdHn6mQAIe9.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:120954'),
  ('656487782803320673', 'Makarov and The Girls', 2021, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Pavel Maykov, Alevtina Tukan, Elena Polyanskaya, Valeriya Astapova, Vladislava Ermolaeva, Nikita Tarasov, Natalya Bardo, Georgiy Dronov', null, 'The head of the Criminal Investigation Department of the Butovo region, Makarov, is completely replaced by the personnel as a result of a conflict with the leadership. Instead of experienced male cops, four young students are singled out.', 'The head of the Criminal Investigation Department of the Butovo region, Makarov, is completely replaced by the personnel as a result of a conflict with the leadership. Instead of experienced male cops, four young students are singled out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksm9dfDNjuXQwWEnZM90shykEUD.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:119058'),
  ('628903914518719319', 'Make It or Break It', 2009, 'Drama', 'Holly Sorensen', null, 'Josie Loren, Ayla Kell, Cassie Scerbo', 'TV-14', 'Set in the world of competitive gymnastics, the series follows a group of teen Olympic hopefuls as they train for their day in the spotlight.', 'Set in the world of competitive gymnastics, the series follows a group of teen Olympic hopefuls as they train for their day in the spotlight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qT20SwKLFiHEeSwqrccLwLQYzHR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:17518'),
  ('775761241546577280', 'Make It Pop', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Erika Tham, Megan Lee, Louriza Tronco, Dale Whibley', 'TV-G', 'What do an aspiring pop diva, a fashionista and a book worm have in common? Music! After being randomly selected to room together at Mackendrick Prep, Sun Hi, Jodi and Corki must learn to live together in harmony... literally. Can they achieve pop stardom in a school where academics come first and the arts come last? How will these rising stars balance music, grades, relationships and crushes? There''s only one way to find out! Get ready for fun, drama, and musical comedy with a K-pop twist and an EDM beat!', 'What do an aspiring pop diva, a fashionista and a book worm have in common? Music! After being randomly selected to room together at Mackendrick Prep, Sun Hi, Jodi and Corki must learn to live together in harmony... literally. Can they achieve pop stardom in a school where academics come first and the arts come last? How will these rising stars balance music, grades, relationships and crushes? There''s only one way to find out! Get ready for fun, drama, and musical comedy with a K-pop twist and an EDM beat!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymQYPPk9MJcFyE2FFsSRNXVMWZq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62375'),
  ('458638662850739145', 'Make It Right', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Peemapol Panichtamrong, Krittapak Udompanich, Vitchapol Somkid, Nonthanee Jirapun', null, 'Heartbroken and confused, Fuse wakes up next to a friend—and starts questioning love, identity, and what comes next.', 'Heartbroken and confused, Fuse wakes up next to a friend—and starts questioning love, identity, and what comes next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2GFdT3B4Or4pi77nw4mQVNU22S.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70101'),
  ('231300418382616017', 'MAKE MY DAY', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Yasuo Ohtagaki', null, 'Masaomi Yamahashi, Ayahi Takagaki, Kazuhiro Yamaji, Akio Otsuka, Tomoko Shiota, Atsuko Tanaka, Yohei Tadano, Mitsuru Shiraishi', 'TV-MA', 'On an isolated icy planet promising a bright future, prisoners are forced to excavate a rare energy source that leads to a deadly, unwelcome discovery.', 'On an isolated icy planet promising a bright future, prisoners are forced to excavate a rare energy source that leads to a deadly, unwelcome discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gWb9o0XVyXwFk2aRPqyVJV8mXE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217710'),
  ('290339288658216559', 'Make Some Noise', 2022, 'Comedy, Reality', 'Sam Reich', null, 'Sam Reich', null, 'A game show where talented contestants compete to bring to life silly prompts.', 'A game show where talented contestants compete to bring to life silly prompts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bMo4TKU48d3OUaSC4824Ruewj3.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:204031'),
  ('958263657322504471', 'Makeine: Too Many Losing Heroines!', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Shuichiro Umeda, Hikaru Tono, Shion Wakayama, Momoka Terasawa', null, 'Meet the girls on the losing side of romance! First is Anna Yanami, the girl-next-door type who can’t say no to delicious food. Then there’s Lemon Yakishio, a beautiful and spirited athlete. Last but not least is Chika Komari, the cute yet shy heroine with gentle charm. Together, they navigate awkward setbacks hoping to finally find love!', 'Meet the girls on the losing side of romance! First is Anna Yanami, the girl-next-door type who can’t say no to delicious food. Then there’s Lemon Yakishio, a beautiful and spirited athlete. Last but not least is Chika Komari, the cute yet shy heroine with gentle charm. Together, they navigate awkward setbacks hoping to finally find love!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLBBhmzN6tPhxMy9aFzDqMbAc4V.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:241535'),
  ('1082716148031844662', 'Maken-Ki! Battling Venus', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Tomoaki Maeno, Sayuri Yahagi, Iori Nomizu, Misuzu Togashi, Mina, Hitomi Harada, Noriko Shitaya, Shizuka Furuya', 'TV-MA', 'This romantic comedy is about Takeru Ohyama, a typical perverted teenage boy. His new school doesn''t require entrance exams, and it just turned co-ed! Unfortunately, his dreams of a happy high school life are dashed when he finds out the school is much more than it seems. All of the students wield a special item—a Maken—to unleash their magical abilities in duels! Can Takeru find a Maken that works for him? Even while trying to fit in at a new school and dealing with all kinds of girl problems?', 'This romantic comedy is about Takeru Ohyama, a typical perverted teenage boy. His new school doesn''t require entrance exams, and it just turned co-ed! Unfortunately, his dreams of a happy high school life are dashed when he finds out the school is much more than it seems. All of the students wield a special item—a Maken—to unleash their magical abilities in duels! Can Takeru find a Maken that works for him? Even while trying to fit in at a new school and dealing with all kinds of girl problems?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQub2j7xzXxjtjELPqDYgDmru4r.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60732'),
  ('129426184995398057', 'Makeover! Dramatic Before & After', 2002, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Eguchi Tomomi, George Tokoro', null, 'Japanese home reform. Homes are chosen from viewers who write in explaining unique problems, like small space, broken or damaged home, no bathroom, no insulation, too old, not elderly friendly, etc. The show showcases some of the worst living conditions before, then goes through a reformation to modernize the home and meet the needs of the owners. Alias name is "Before After"', 'Japanese home reform. Homes are chosen from viewers who write in explaining unique problems, like small space, broken or damaged home, no bathroom, no insulation, too old, not elderly friendly, etc. The show showcases some of the worst living conditions before, then goes through a reformation to modernize the home and meet the needs of the owners. Alias name is "Before After"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncDQ1nJqdlw6J4o1KZq8jb9LZuG.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:90412'),
  ('184782767694089313', 'Making a Murderer', 2015, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Moira Demos, Laura Ricciardi', null, 'Kathleen Zellner', 'TV-14', 'Filmed over 10 years, this real-life thriller follows a DNA exoneree who, while exposing police corruption, becomes a suspect in a grisly new crime.', 'Filmed over 10 years, this real-life thriller follows a DNA exoneree who, while exposing police corruption, becomes a suspect in a grisly new crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sy2nV3rCcJQaRK5M0NWvvTU7CBx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64439'),
  ('145743498267852734', 'Making History', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Julius Sharpe', null, 'Adam Pally, Yassir Lester, Leighton Meester, John Gemberling, Neil Casey', 'TV-14', 'A professor creates a device that allows him and his colleague to change the course of events from the past in order to improve their current life.', 'A professor creates a device that allows him and his colleague to change the course of events from the past in order to improve their current life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQvEkVxOtRlTqjRwTGl989oEeL8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67991'),
  ('223843792013398706', 'Making It', 2018, 'Reality', null, null, 'Nick Offerman, Amy Poehler, Dayna Isom Johnson, Simon Doonan', 'TV-PG', 'In this reality competition, craft makers from all walks of life take on a series of projects. Over the course of each episode, the contestants must tackle a different theme, hand-making items in different disciplines — the difficulty of which increases with every episode until a winner is crowned.', 'In this reality competition, craft makers from all walks of life take on a series of projects. Over the course of each episode, the contestants must tackle a different theme, hand-making items in different disciplines — the difficulty of which increases with every episode until a winner is crowned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jv1FZvMx3Sj3z1E40c5GFNfnoOa.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:74040'),
  ('465686349204132856', 'Making the Cut', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Heidi Klum, Tim Gunn, Nicole Richie, Jeremy Scott, Emily Bargeron, Curtis Cassell, Rafael Chaouiche, Georgia Hardinge', 'TV-14', 'Heidi Klum and Tim Gunn host designers who face challenges and assignments that will test their design skills and their abilities to run all aspects of a business.', 'Heidi Klum and Tim Gunn host designers who face challenges and assignments that will test their design skills and their abilities to run all aspects of a business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lS53aYWSjx9qHf2RODATEbsX3yZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:101046'),
  ('1127757292255932995', 'Mako: Island of Secrets', 2013, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Jonathan M. Shiff', null, 'Allie Bertram, Isabel Durant, Linda Ngo, Chai Hansen, Gemma Forsyth', 'TV-G', 'Real-life mermaids, Sirena, Nixie and Lyla are part of a mermaid pod, which lives in the waters of Mako Island. As young members of the pod, it is their job to protect the Moon Pool and guard it from trespassers. But on the night of a full moon, the mischievous mermaid girls neglect their duties. Sixteen-year-old land-dweller Zac enters the Moon Pool and forms a special connection with Mako. Zac is given a fish-like tail and amazing powers. The mermaid pod is forced to leave Mako, leaving behind the three mermaid girls, cast out of the pod. They know there''s only one way they will be allowed to rejoin the pod: They must get legs, venture onto land and take back Zac''s powers – or risk being outcasts forever.', 'Real-life mermaids, Sirena, Nixie and Lyla are part of a mermaid pod, which lives in the waters of Mako Island. As young members of the pod, it is their job to protect the Moon Pool and guard it from trespassers. But on the night of a full moon, the mischievous mermaid girls neglect their duties. Sixteen-year-old land-dweller Zac enters the Moon Pool and forms a special connection with Mako. Zac is given a fish-like tail and amazing powers. The mermaid pod is forced to leave Mako, leaving behind the three mermaid girls, cast out of the pod. They know there''s only one way they will be allowed to rejoin the pod: They must get legs, venture onto land and take back Zac''s powers – or risk being outcasts forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyo0V8p2RrBCUx7bAVroOssTRR9.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:42025'),
  ('583560651603573233', 'Malaka', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Daniel Corpas, Samuel Pinazo', null, 'Salva Reina, Maggie Civantos, Vicente Romero Sánchez, Laura Baena, Antonio Gil, Susana Córdoba, Ignacio Mateos, Cuca Escribano', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uE97hikY1jO5X9v3Gl2sX3PL7y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93448'),
  ('1113061134645885138', 'MalaYerba', 2021, 'Drama', 'Natalia Echeverri', null, 'María Elisa Camargo, Sebastián Eslava, Carolina Gaitán, Juan Pablo Urrego', 'TV-14', 'Three young entrepreneurs, Felix, Mariana and Ignacio, are paving their way into a market that has just been legalized in Colombia: medicinal cannabis.', 'Three young entrepreneurs, Felix, Mariana and Ignacio, are paving their way into a market that has just been legalized in Colombia: medicinal cannabis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwRKia3GIOgfIGhPDp0eC882sSV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136479'),
  ('272701148635266006', 'Malcolm & Eddie', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Joel Madison', null, 'Malcolm-Jamal Warner, Eddie Griffin, Karen Malina White, Christopher Daniel Barnes, Ron Pearson', null, 'Malcolm and Eddie are as different as one can imagine. Nevertheless, they''re best friends who manage to be roommates as well as co-workers and not kill each other.', 'Malcolm and Eddie are as different as one can imagine. Nevertheless, they''re best friends who manage to be roommates as well as co-workers and not kill each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6zPtpkP0wejienR6KBZboeEMR0.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71'),
  ('1047239695264651431', 'Malcolm in the Middle', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Linwood Boomer', null, 'Frankie Muniz, Jane Kaczmarek, Bryan Cranston, Justin Berfield, Erik Per Sullivan, Christopher Masterson', 'TV-PG', 'A gifted young teen tries to survive life with his dimwitted, dysfunctional family.', 'A gifted young teen tries to survive life with his dimwitted, dysfunctional family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uftxEWbn3OSykTy4DX4BrdVeiuv.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2004'),
  ('809132347645157533', 'Malcolm in the Middle: Life''s Still Unfair', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Linwood Boomer', null, 'Frankie Muniz, Jane Kaczmarek, Bryan Cranston, Christopher Masterson, Justin Berfield, Emy Coligado, Caleb Ellsworth-Clark, Anthony Timpano', 'TV-14', 'After shielding himself and his daughter from his family for over a decade, Malcolm is dragged back into their orbit when Hal and Lois demand his presence at their 40th anniversary party.', 'After shielding himself and his daughter from his family for over a decade, Malcolm is dragged back into their orbit when Hal and Lois demand his presence at their 40th anniversary party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqYCU8Xv8CCfJm4HfznGzfgRJOp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279471'),
  ('982998194791017094', 'Maldivas', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Natalia Klein', null, 'Bruna Marquezine, Carol Castro, Sheron Menezzes, Klebber Toledo, Enzo Romani, Natalia Klein, Manu Gavassi, Samuel Melo', 'TV-MA', 'Liz, a girl from Goiás moves to a capital in Rio de Janeiro to re-encounter her mother, who ends up dying in a mysterious fire. Trying to escape investigator Denilson, she will move among the residents of the Maldivadas condominium.', 'Liz, a girl from Goiás moves to a capital in Rio de Janeiro to re-encounter her mother, who ends up dying in a mysterious fire. Trying to escape investigator Denilson, she will move among the residents of the Maldivadas condominium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTGH2NXwFwFv2VmrrPY0b4cVgFz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134955'),
  ('196940748387118460', 'Maledictions', 2025, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Daniel Burman', null, 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Gustavo Bassani, Francesca Varela, Alejandra Flechner, Mónica Antonópulos', 'TV-MA', 'At a career-defining moment, a governor''s child vanishes. Torn between ambition and family secrets, he must choose: politics or his daughter''s safety.', 'At a career-defining moment, a governor''s child vanishes. Torn between ambition and family secrets, he must choose: politics or his daughter''s safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXze4Ya0DhcnF3qeypE0b7X1DZ5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261617'),
  ('1088562912341760193', 'Malevolent Spirits: Mononogatari', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takeo Otsuka, Yuuki Takada, Chikahiro Kobayashi, Reina Ueda, Aimi Tanaka, Yoshiki Nakajima, Miyuki Sawashiro, Saori Onishi', 'TV-14', 'Filled with rage against spirits known as tsukumogami, Kunato Hyoma is sent to live with Nagatsuki Botan to help him see a different side. Though both are part of a clan that return the spirits back to their world with divine powers, their experiences with the otherworldly vessels are vastly different. Kunato, robbed of a loved one, and Nagatsuki, saved by them. Can she get through to him?', 'Filled with rage against spirits known as tsukumogami, Kunato Hyoma is sent to live with Nagatsuki Botan to help him see a different side. Though both are part of a clan that return the spirits back to their world with divine powers, their experiences with the otherworldly vessels are vastly different. Kunato, robbed of a loved one, and Nagatsuki, saved by them. Can she get through to him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j79vHpQsZ9vlQ3PQWfYKf1FsSkx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138948'),
  ('667772960940364346', 'Malgudi Days', 1987, 'Drama, Family', 'Shankar Nag', null, 'Manjunath, Girish Karnad', null, 'Malgudi Days is an Indian television series based on the works of R.K. Narayan. The series was directed by Kannada actor and director, Shankar Nag and Carnatic musician L. Vaidyanathan composed the score. R. K Narayan''s brother and acclaimed cartoonist R. K. Laxman was the sketch artist. The series was made in 1986 by film producer T. S. Narasimhan with Anant Nag as the lead actor. Thirty-nine episodes of Malgudi Days were telecast on Doordarshan over three seasons, starting in 1986. The first season was simultaneously made in English and in Hindi. Subsequent seasons were made in Hindi, and have been dubbed into other languages. It was re-telecast on Doordarshan and later on Sony Entertainment Television, and Maa Television in Telugu. This television series was shot entirely near Agumbe in Shimoga District, Karnataka. In 2004, the project was revived with film-maker Kavitha Lankesh replacing Shankar Nag as director. The new series of fifteen episodes was telecast from April 26, 2006 on Doordarshan.', 'Malgudi Days is an Indian television series based on the works of R.K. Narayan. The series was directed by Kannada actor and director, Shankar Nag and Carnatic musician L. Vaidyanathan composed the score. R. K Narayan''s brother and acclaimed cartoonist R. K. Laxman was the sketch artist. The series was made in 1986 by film producer T. S. Narasimhan with Anant Nag as the lead actor. Thirty-nine episodes of Malgudi Days were telecast on Doordarshan over three seasons, starting in 1986. The first season was simultaneously made in English and in Hindi. Subsequent seasons were made in Hindi, and have been dubbed into other languages. It was re-telecast on Doordarshan and later on Sony Entertainment Television, and Maa Television in Telugu. This television series was shot entirely near Agumbe in Shimoga District, Karnataka. In 2004, the project was revived with film-maker Kavitha Lankesh replacing Shankar Nag as director. The new series of fifteen episodes was telecast from April 26, 2006 on Doordarshan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4CLepIXSgZ7FN5VTTQIfJhynSd.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:15211'),
  ('57151237586844713', 'Malibu Rescue: The Series', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Savage Steve Holland, Scott McAboy', null, 'Ricardo Hurtado, Breanna Yde, Jackie R. Jacobson, Abby Donnelly, Alkoya Brunson', 'TV-G', 'On the heels of Junior Rescue training, Team Flounder returns to brave the beach in a series of thrilling saves and lighthearted laughs.', 'On the heels of Junior Rescue training, Team Flounder returns to brave the beach in a series of thrilling saves and lighthearted laughs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9eJhVAEe5HjWLmd5OlaAEdY2q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85958'),
  ('560477336236919208', 'Malice', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'James Wood', null, 'Jack Whitehall, David Duchovny, Carice van Houten, Teddie Allen, Phoenix Laroche', 'TV-MA', 'A charming tutor infiltrates a wealthy family''s life, revealing a sinister agenda.', 'A charming tutor infiltrates a wealthy family''s life, revealing a sinister agenda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKhHzRk1VIJY1nz1cRhAfAaYfnA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244416'),
  ('565628933954940623', 'Malory Towers', 2020, 'Family, Drama', 'Rachel Flowerday, Sasha Hails', null, 'Ella Bright, Danya Griver, Beth Bradfield, Imogen Lamb, Natasha Raphael, Sienna Arif Knights, Ashley McGuire, Carys John', 'TV-G', 'Follow the adventures of Darrell Rivers as she leaves home for the first time to attend an all-girls’ boarding school. Set in post-war Britain on the sun-drenched cliffs of the Cornish coast, the series explores a nostalgic world of midnight feasts, lacrosse, pranks, a mystery ghost and lasting friendships.', 'Follow the adventures of Darrell Rivers as she leaves home for the first time to attend an all-girls’ boarding school. Set in post-war Britain on the sun-drenched cliffs of the Cornish coast, the series explores a nostalgic world of midnight feasts, lacrosse, pranks, a mystery ghost and lasting friendships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zU5yHvPmAWFIdz0cbCAmw0ONYQU.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:101149'),
  ('373665578884439437', 'Malpractice', 2023, 'Drama', 'Grace Ofori-Attah', null, 'Jordan Kouamé, Helen Behan, Tom Hughes, Selin Hizli, Zoe Telford, Katherine Dow Blyton, Adei Bundy, Jessica Layde', null, 'Dr Lucinda Edwards is a smart, battle-hardened doctor, but we meet her on a nightmare shift that ends in the death of an opioid overdose victim, Edith Owusu. Despite the support of her medical supervisor, Dr Leo Harris, Edith’s grieving father Sir Anthony Owusu, demands an enquiry into Lucinda’s actions on the fateful night.', 'Dr Lucinda Edwards is a smart, battle-hardened doctor, but we meet her on a nightmare shift that ends in the death of an opioid overdose victim, Edith Owusu. Despite the support of her medical supervisor, Dr Leo Harris, Edith’s grieving father Sir Anthony Owusu, demands an enquiry into Lucinda’s actions on the fateful night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uYHrIyFsN6Dhv8xKaLkQRemgVk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:223389'),
  ('19009213252009021', 'Maltese', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Gianluca Maria Tavarelli', null, 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Antonio Milo, Rike Schmid, Francesco Scianna, Valeria Solarino, Eros Pagni, Roberto Nobile, Paolo Ricca', null, 'Inspector Dario Maltese travels from Rome to the city of his birth, Trapani in Sicily, to attend his best friend''s wedding. But tragedy strikes and he finds himself pulled into a murder investigation.', 'Inspector Dario Maltese travels from Rome to the city of his birth, Trapani in Sicily, to attend his best friend''s wedding. But tragedy strikes and he finds himself pulled into a murder investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mElovuwmvayvgNk9fLfmnXd1pjL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71770'),
  ('825090016562568674', 'Malverde: El Santo Patrón', 2021, 'Soap, Crime, Drama', 'Luis Zelkowicz', null, 'Claudio Roca, Pedro Fernández, Carolina Miranda, Mark Tacher, Alejandro Nones, Luis Felipe Tovar, Ivonne Montero, Sofía Castro', 'TV-MA', 'Jesús Juárez overcomes his childhood as an orphan to become a Robin Hood like hero During the Mexican Revolution, but can''t forget his first love - Isabel.', 'Jesús Juárez overcomes his childhood as an orphan to become a Robin Hood like hero During the Mexican Revolution, but can''t forget his first love - Isabel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67treAktbvtXLdwRhtlPjPvV60J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135193'),
  ('436590500726305033', 'Malviviendo', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Sainz', null, 'David Sainz, David Valderrama, Tomás Moreno, Carlos Medrano, Javi Lería, Daniel Mantero, Amanda Mora, Manuel Noguera del Ojo', 'TV-14', 'Malviviendo is an online series produced by Diffferent and directed by David Sainz. In July 2011, the show released its fourteenth episode. The first episode launched in November 24, 2008 and became successful in a few months with positive reviews by the public. It employs mostly amateur actors, and those involved in the series do it for free. The series is set in the fictional neighborhood of "Los Banderilleros" of the Spanish city of Seville. The characters are a group of friends trapped in their everyday bad lives related to consumption of cannabis or other problems individual to each character. The show contains allusions to and parodies of a variety of other series, including Dexter, My Name Is Earl, The Sopranos, Lost, ALF, The X-Files, Prison Break, Sex and the City, The Brady Bunch, South Park, Boardwalk Empire, The IT Crowd and How I Met Your Mother. Also the Spanish program Callejeros chain Cuatro in the fifth episode called Callejosos. In the third episode of the second season spoof the header of the series Misfits, but the content of the episode is a parody of the movie Inception. In June 2009, the series got the support of Qualid. There it launched two mini-episodes minicapítulos. One focused on the character of Mateo and the other in "el Puto".', 'Malviviendo is an online series produced by Diffferent and directed by David Sainz. In July 2011, the show released its fourteenth episode. The first episode launched in November 24, 2008 and became successful in a few months with positive reviews by the public. It employs mostly amateur actors, and those involved in the series do it for free. The series is set in the fictional neighborhood of "Los Banderilleros" of the Spanish city of Seville. The characters are a group of friends trapped in their everyday bad lives related to consumption of cannabis or other problems individual to each character. The show contains allusions to and parodies of a variety of other series, including Dexter, My Name Is Earl, The Sopranos, Lost, ALF, The X-Files, Prison Break, Sex and the City, The Brady Bunch, South Park, Boardwalk Empire, The IT Crowd and How I Met Your Mother. Also the Spanish program Callejeros chain Cuatro in the fifth episode called Callejosos. In the third episode of the second season spoof the header of the series Misfits, but the content of the episode is a parody of the movie Inception. In June 2009, the series got the support of Qualid. There it launched two mini-episodes minicapítulos. One focused on the character of Mateo and the other in "el Puto".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4B3P4mTndyelLkSjP8KllnBwL0e.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:39485'),
  ('119076747599640693', 'Mama Is a Bartender: Let''s Dance Tonight', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Jun Shibuki, Moeno Sumida, Moro Morooka', null, 'Hoshino Akari is a single mother who, after losing her husband, struggles to maintain the balance between her dual role of raising her two children while carrying out her duties as a bartender. In her job serving cocktails to troubled customers at BAR 1511, she listens empathetically and solves their troubles with her kind words of advice.', 'Hoshino Akari is a single mother who, after losing her husband, struggles to maintain the balance between her dual role of raising her two children while carrying out her duties as a bartender. In her job serving cocktails to troubled customers at BAR 1511, she listens empathetically and solves their troubles with her kind words of advice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnAUI8hhysCrXquPv96A5dqiihd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215493'),
  ('760691265342152671', 'Mama June: Family Crisis', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, 'June Shannon, Alana Thompson, Lauryn Shannon, Josh Efird', 'TV-14', 'June Shannon (''Mama June'') gained fame as the mother of young beauty-pageant contestant ''Honey Boo Boo'' (Alana Thompson) on various reality shows. With that notoriety came jokes from comedians and people on social media about her weight. Ending her marriage to Sugar Bear and facing health issues, Mama June wants to slim down so she can start a new life with a new body and, she hopes, a new love.', 'June Shannon (''Mama June'') gained fame as the mother of young beauty-pageant contestant ''Honey Boo Boo'' (Alana Thompson) on various reality shows. With that notoriety came jokes from comedians and people on social media about her weight. Ending her marriage to Sugar Bear and facing health issues, Mama June wants to slim down so she can start a new life with a new body and, she hopes, a new love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HLTSpT9FfXnNhfn7zUDkXmXsfC.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:70284'),
  ('894457460119392552', 'Mama, ožeň ma!', 2011, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7m9FQK0jpFGjzPmGObdze5fOxPc.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:130907'),
  ('677337717484890617', 'Mama''s Family', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Dick Clair, Jenna McMahon', null, 'Vicki Lawrence, Ken Berry, Dorothy Lyman, Beverly Archer, Allan Kayser', 'TV-PG', 'Thelma Harper and her spinster sister Fran open their home to Thelma''s recently divorced son Vinton and his teenage son and daughter. It''s quite an adjustment for everyone, especially the cranky, argumentative Thelma.', 'Thelma Harper and her spinster sister Fran open their home to Thelma''s recently divorced son Vinton and his teenage son and daughter. It''s quite an adjustment for everyone, especially the cranky, argumentative Thelma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRzbRLRJ8VgEJyTVyoVwDfGOfVr.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:2016'),
