  ('35430764414558538', 'María Félix La Doña', 2022, 'Drama', 'Larissa Andrade', 'María Fernanda Suárez', 'Úrsula Pruneda, Ximena Romo, Guillermo García Cantú, Iker Madrid, Sandra Echeverría, Jeronimo Guerra, Emiliano González, Aida López', null, 'The life story of María Félix, from her humble beginnings as one of fifteen children to her rise to fame and infamy as one of the most storied Mexican actresses of the 1940s and beyond.', 'The life story of María Félix, from her humble beginnings as one of fifteen children to her rise to fame and infamy as one of the most storied Mexican actresses of the 1940s and beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZ21OETzyz2lYpaSkKRNeUYnUSL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205443'),
  ('1134466071732614480', 'Maria Holic', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ryoko Shintani, Saori Goto, Marina Inoue, Akemi Kanda, Miyuki Sawashiro, Asami Sanada, Yu Kobayashi, Yuhko Kaida', 'TV-14', 'Maria†Holic is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Minari Endō, the author of Dazzle. The manga was first serialized in the Japanese seinen manga magazine Monthly Comic Alive on June 27, 2006, and is published by Media Factory. The manga was licensed by Tokyopop with the first volume in English being released in September 2009. The first anime adaptation animated by Shaft aired in Japan between January and March 2009. A second anime season, Maria†Holic: Alive, premiered on April 8, 2011. Both seasons of the anime series have been licensed by Sentai Filmworks, and the first season is being distributed by Section23 Films.', 'Maria†Holic is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Minari Endō, the author of Dazzle. The manga was first serialized in the Japanese seinen manga magazine Monthly Comic Alive on June 27, 2006, and is published by Media Factory. The manga was licensed by Tokyopop with the first volume in English being released in September 2009. The first anime adaptation animated by Shaft aired in Japan between January and March 2009. A second anime season, Maria†Holic: Alive, premiered on April 8, 2011. Both seasons of the anime series have been licensed by Sentai Filmworks, and the first season is being distributed by Section23 Films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxQbLZxIqtH5xFQY5UzfMCzwjay.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34667'),
  ('1133538288645372620', 'María Isabel', 1997, 'Soap, Drama, Family', 'Yolanda Vargas Dulché', 'René Muñoz, Liliana Abud', 'Adela Noriega, Fernando Carrillo, Lorena Herrera, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Lilia Aragón, José Carlos Ruiz, Mónica Miguel, Alejandro Aragón', 'TV-PG', 'Native American girl Maria Isabel makes friends with Graciela, a rich white girl, despite Graciela''s father''s opposition; their friendship lasts into their adulthood.', 'Native American girl Maria Isabel makes friends with Graciela, a rich white girl, despite Graciela''s father''s opposition; their friendship lasts into their adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4MZiXMWU8F1eHLxA0ZwLDptNNu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43284'),
  ('601777824802254158', 'María la del Barrio', 1995, 'Drama, Soap', 'Inés Rodena', null, 'Thalia, Fernando Colunga, Itatí Cantoral, Ana Patricia Rojo, Irán Eory, Ricardo Blume, Héctor Soberón, Montserrat Gallosa', 'TV-PG', 'A brave, poor young girl is welcomed into a rich family and develops a romance with their misogynist youngest son, driving a woman already in love with him to go to great lengths to destroy their relationship.', 'A brave, poor young girl is welcomed into a rich family and develops a romance with their misogynist youngest son, driving a woman already in love with him to go to great lengths to destroy their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGMquh71mh3w3QzUrl1AhCniHys.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12965'),
  ('445890575308144712', 'Maria Magdalena', 2018, 'Drama', 'Felipe Cano, Rodrigo Lalinde', null, 'María Fernanda Yepes, Luis Roberto Guzmán, Andrés Parra, Manolo Cardona, Diana Lein, César Mora, Gustavo Sánchez Parra, Juan Fernando Sánchez', null, 'Maria Magdalena, a woman different than the others and capable of challenging a corrupt society completely dominated by men, is faced with evils and betrayals forcing her to escape her homeland and attempt to forget her past. On the verge of her death, she meets Jesus – a man who will teach her the true meaning of love, a love so pure she will regain her faith and will to live. She will transform from an excluded, outcast, and vilified woman to one of the most important disciples of the Nazarene prophet.', 'Maria Magdalena, a woman different than the others and capable of challenging a corrupt society completely dominated by men, is faced with evils and betrayals forcing her to escape her homeland and attempt to forget her past. On the verge of her death, she meets Jesus – a man who will teach her the true meaning of love, a love so pure she will regain her faith and will to live. She will transform from an excluded, outcast, and vilified woman to one of the most important disciples of the Nazarene prophet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAEoftibZgxvJOl9k048bB2wCHR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86361'),
  ('407997035655736118', 'María Marta: The Country Club Crime', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Daniela Goggi', 'Martín Méndez, Germán Loza', 'Laura Novoa, Jorge Marrale, Muriel Santa Ana, Carlos Belloso, Mike Amigorena, Guillermo Arengo, Nicolás Francella, Esteban Bigliardi', null, 'Based on the true story of one of the most notorious crimes in Argentina, the series intimately follows all those involved in the case, and those who are still seeking an answer to the question: Who killed María Marta?', 'Based on the true story of one of the most notorious crimes in Argentina, the series intimately follows all those involved in the case, and those who are still seeking an answer to the question: Who killed María Marta?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljxCQ1bNFAnXMuUsWBDMYwK9E8H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203822'),
  ('489651608437713102', 'Maria Mercedes', 1992, 'Drama, Soap', 'Inés Rodena', null, 'Thalia, Arturo Peniche, Laura Zapata, Gabriela Goldsmith, Carmen Amezcua, Carmen Salinas, Nicky Mondellini, Fernando Ciangherotti', 'TV-PG', 'María Mercedes, a poor girl who sells lottery tickets, meets a rich man who hates his own family and sees in María Mercedes an opportunity to make their lives miserable.', 'María Mercedes, a poor girl who sells lottery tickets, meets a rich man who hates his own family and sees in María Mercedes an opportunity to make their lives miserable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yS7rhCh7nc1lOrIjd4Oqsq93xr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6547'),
  ('792105107531015972', 'Mária Terézia', 2017, 'Drama', 'Robert Dornhelm', null, 'Dominik Warta, Tatiana Pauhofová, Martin Pechlát', 'NR', 'The young Maria Theresia sees her life clearly in front of her: she will marry Franz Stephan of Lorraine and start a family of many with him. Even if Franz Stephan is not quite sure of his luck and her father, Emperor Charles VI, and his powerful advisor Prince Eugene of Savoy forge quite different plans for them. It looks quite as if the young archduchess must sacrifice her happiness to the cause of the state', 'The young Maria Theresia sees her life clearly in front of her: she will marry Franz Stephan of Lorraine and start a family of many with him. Even if Franz Stephan is not quite sure of his luck and her father, Emperor Charles VI, and his powerful advisor Prince Eugene of Savoy forge quite different plans for them. It looks quite as if the young archduchess must sacrifice her happiness to the cause of the state', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmeULvlcbPU4SVyANslh9PecDWe.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:75961'),
  ('982872433343015504', 'Maria the Virgin Witch', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mamiko Noto, Kikuko Inoue, Ai Kakuma, Mikako Komatsu, Yuki Ono, Miyuki Ichijou, Kana Hanazawa, Hisako Kanemoto', 'TV-MA', 'During the Hundred Year''s War between England and France in the Middle Ages, a powerful witch named Maria lives in a secret forest with her familiars. She hates the war around her, and will sometimes stir up trouble against the church that does nothing to stop it. Her interventions into the world, however, run against the plans of heaven, earning her the attention of the Archangel Michael.', 'During the Hundred Year''s War between England and France in the Middle Ages, a powerful witch named Maria lives in a secret forest with her familiars. She hates the war around her, and will sometimes stir up trouble against the church that does nothing to stop it. Her interventions into the world, however, run against the plans of heaven, earning her the attention of the Archangel Michael.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5pPTsWVqtYUrScTydAhE2piAXa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62157'),
  ('709182607134837667', 'Maria Watches Over Us', 2004, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Kana Ueda, Miki Ito, Megumi Toyoguchi, Mamiko Noto, Haruna Ikezawa, Kaori Shimizu, Emi Shinohara, Shizuka Itoh', null, 'When Yumi Fukuzawa entered the Lillian Girls'' Academy, a prestigious all-girls Catholic school in Tokyo, she never imagined she would catch the eye of beautiful and demure Sachiko Ogasawara, one of the school''s most popular students. Now Sachiko has offered to be Yumi''s soeur, her "sister" and guide for all her years at the academy. The whole idea has Yumi completely flustered—after all, they hardly know each other! The entire campus is abuzz with rumors about the two of them, but Yumi is conflicted over accepting Sachiko''s offer. While she admires Sachiko, being her soeur would also mean constantly being at the center of the entire school''s attention!', 'When Yumi Fukuzawa entered the Lillian Girls'' Academy, a prestigious all-girls Catholic school in Tokyo, she never imagined she would catch the eye of beautiful and demure Sachiko Ogasawara, one of the school''s most popular students. Now Sachiko has offered to be Yumi''s soeur, her "sister" and guide for all her years at the academy. The whole idea has Yumi completely flustered—after all, they hardly know each other! The entire campus is abuzz with rumors about the two of them, but Yumi is conflicted over accepting Sachiko''s offer. While she admires Sachiko, being her soeur would also mean constantly being at the center of the entire school''s attention!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wVQp2naji7O9guJO1UbVseQPbx.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:42468'),
  ('685654005416165899', 'Maria Wern', 2008, 'Drama, Crime', 'Erik Leijonborg', null, 'Eva Röse, Oscar Pettersson, Peter Perski, Erik Johansson, Matilda Wännström, Allan Svensson', 'NR', 'Crime Inspector Maria Wern returns to duty at the Police Department on the island of Gotland, and is immediately thrown into a murder investigation.', 'Crime Inspector Maria Wern returns to duty at the Police Department on the island of Gotland, and is immediately thrown into a murder investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFrX07DZMLPQq3VzBYUIv3JB1By.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:51976'),
  ('110526397031246068', 'Mariachis', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Toño Mauri, Antonio Mauri, Hammudi Al-Rahmoun Font', null, 'Pedro Fernández, Consuelo Duval, Vadhir Derbez, Antonio Mauri, Alberto Estrella, Regina Orozco, Ricardo Polanco, Costanza Andrade', 'TV-MA', 'When Rosendo is diagnosed with Alzheimer’s, his wife and family – along with his estranged brother – form a mariachi band in hopes of delaying the effects...but ultimately uncover decades of deeply buried secrets.', 'When Rosendo is diagnosed with Alzheimer’s, his wife and family – along with his estranged brother – form a mariachi band in hopes of delaying the effects...but ultimately uncover decades of deeply buried secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmWNGnb2GFbQyW0KcBBGKfT7xMh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220009'),
  ('23011979946773077', 'Mariah''s World', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Mariah Carey', null, 'Follow the life of singer Mariah Carey as she begins her “The Sweet Sweet Fantasy” Tour around Europe and plans to get married.', 'Follow the life of singer Mariah Carey as she begins her “The Sweet Sweet Fantasy” Tour around Europe and plans to get married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKqzpevBfF41kaYSugqQlyC8N4f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68931'),
  ('853649255896293331', 'Marianne', 2019, 'Mystery', 'Samuel Bodin', 'Samuel Bodin, Quoc Dang Tran', 'Victoire du Bois, Lucie Boujenah, Tiphaine Daviot, Ralph Amoussou, Corinne Valancogne, Mehdi Meskar, Bellamine Abdelmalek, Alban Lenoir', 'TV-MA', 'When a novelist realizes her terrifying stories are coming true, she returns to her hometown to face the demons from her past that inspire her writing.', 'When a novelist realizes her terrifying stories are coming true, she returns to her hometown to face the demons from her past that inspire her writing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpeaMzflHMEepUGiCjXld7lrnC2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92916'),
  ('275659860339362797', 'Marianne', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Myriam Vinocour, Alexandre Charlot, Franck Magnier', null, 'Marilou Berry, Alexandre Steiger, Stéphane Pezerat, Laurent Olmedo', null, 'Marianne Vauban is an outspoken investigating judge with surprising methods and disarming sincerity. Accompanied by Captain Pastor and her clerk Yves, Marianne must draw on all her experience, sagacity, and empathy to investigate complex cases in astonishing worlds. But one case is particularly close to her heart: the murder of a prostitute ten years ago. She promised the victim''s son that she would get to the bottom of this murder.', 'Marianne Vauban is an outspoken investigating judge with surprising methods and disarming sincerity. Accompanied by Captain Pastor and her clerk Yves, Marianne must draw on all her experience, sagacity, and empathy to investigate complex cases in astonishing worlds. But one case is particularly close to her heart: the murder of a prostitute ten years ago. She promised the victim''s son that she would get to the bottom of this murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sxVbaAvxBEEVXKxumetjASm4Ap.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:208446'),
  ('380901822455525333', 'Marie Antoinette', 2022, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Deborah Davis', null, 'Emilia Schüle, Louis Cunningham, Jack Archer, Oscar Lesage, Jasmine Blackborow, Roxane Duran, Freya Mavor, Guy Henry', 'TV-14', 'Marie Antoinette is just a teenager when she leaves Austria to marry the Dauphin of France. At Versailles, under the complex rules of the French court, she suffers from not being able to live her life the way she wants, under pressure to continue the Bourbon line and secure the Franco-Austrian alliance.', 'Marie Antoinette is just a teenager when she leaves Austria to marry the Dauphin of France. At Versailles, under the complex rules of the French court, she suffers from not being able to live her life the way she wants, under pressure to continue the Bourbon line and secure the Franco-Austrian alliance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHx98HeZOPNCJjXXLr7WRoE4NeY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:158439'),
  ('551926223627424724', 'Marielle - The Documentary', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Eliane Scardovelli, Caio Cavechini', 'Eliane Scardovelli, Caio Cavechini', 'Marielle Franco, Marcelo Freixo, Fernanda Chaves Canaud', null, 'The life and death of city councilor Marielle Franco and driver Anderson Gomes, murdered on the night of 14 March, 2018, in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil.', 'The life and death of city councilor Marielle Franco and driver Anderson Gomes, murdered on the night of 14 March, 2018, in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LCEBNJdN4X7BRde24GBw0H0tpR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100417'),
  ('799305601440876664', 'Marika''s LoveMeter Malfunction', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kohei Amasaki, Maaya Uchida, Sairi Ito, Yurie Igoma, Rie Kugimiya', null, 'Now I can see how much my crush likes me. I lack the courage to confess to my childhood friend, Marika. One day, I make a strong wish upon a shooting star: To read someone''s feelings like in a dating sim. The very next day, much to my surprise, that wish came true…?! Lovemeters now appear over the girls in my class. Confused by this surreal sight, I check Marika''s, only to find her meter''s plummeted to the rotten depths of hell...?! Marika, if you hate me, then why were you always so kind...? What are Marika''s hidden true feelings? Does she really hate me, or...?!', 'Now I can see how much my crush likes me. I lack the courage to confess to my childhood friend, Marika. One day, I make a strong wish upon a shooting star: To read someone''s feelings like in a dating sim. The very next day, much to my surprise, that wish came true…?! Lovemeters now appear over the girls in my class. Confused by this surreal sight, I check Marika''s, only to find her meter''s plummeted to the rotten depths of hell...?! Marika, if you hate me, then why were you always so kind...? What are Marika''s hidden true feelings? Does she really hate me, or...?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsjIgTsE8uS5IJuzCQPmUrnRh3x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315816'),
  ('562776492208150831', 'Mariliendre', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Javier Ferreiro', null, 'Blanca Martínez, Martin Urrutia, Omar Ayuso, Carlos González, Yenesi, Álvaro Jurado, Mariona Terés, Mariano Peña', null, 'Formerly a diva in Madrid''s gay scene, Meri Román''s mundane life is upended by her father''s death, reconnecting her with old friends. Together they reminisce about the past and forge a new path forward.', 'Formerly a diva in Madrid''s gay scene, Meri Román''s mundane life is upended by her father''s death, reconnecting her with old friends. Together they reminisce about the past and forge a new path forward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1u2RRhLz2Bkr9enHBwNpPe1PxZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250836'),
  ('92323499158462253', 'Marimar', 1994, 'Drama, Soap', 'Inés Rodena', 'Valeria Phillips, Inés Rodena, Carlos Romero', 'Thalia, Eduardo Capetillo, Chantal Andere, Alfonso Iturralde, René Muñoz, Miguel Palmer, Ada Carrasco, Tito Guízar', 'TV-PG', 'Story of love between Marimar and Sergio. Sergio is from a wealthy family, and Marimar lives with her poor grandparents in a hut in front of the ocean.', 'Story of love between Marimar and Sergio. Sergio is from a wealthy family, and Marimar lives with her poor grandparents in a hut in front of the ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lfgLiOVZwMG5rD6RVbR7jYCtmd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12782'),
