  ('759544935149511981', 'Marked', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sydney Dire, Akin Omotoso, Steven Pillemer', 'Sydney Dire, Wendy Gumede, Charleen Ntsane', 'Lerato Mvelase, Sphamandla Dhludhlu, S''Dumo Mtshali, Bonko Khoza, Desmond Dube, Jabulani Mthembu, Mduduzi Mabaso, Natasha Thahane', 'TV-MA', 'Desperate to pay for her daughter''s life-saving surgery, devout ex-cop Babalwa turns to an unholy savior to help her stage a daring heist.', 'Desperate to pay for her daughter''s life-saving surgery, devout ex-cop Babalwa turns to an unholy savior to help her stage a daring heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XFP7vl4KDAuCNOdtq8lFm5LeSW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:293808'),
  ('928390068857197301', 'Markus Lanz', 2008, 'Talk', 'Markus Lanz', null, 'Markus Lanz', 'NR', 'TV presenter Markus Lanz invites prominent guests and experts from all areas of public life to his colourful talk show. As a rule, there are four guests, introduced individually to contribute their personal experiences to the topics.', 'TV presenter Markus Lanz invites prominent guests and experts from all areas of public life to his colourful talk show. As a rule, there are four guests, introduced individually to contribute their personal experiences to the topics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tr4cLn4ecRASV0SPM9FRv0AJOQF.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:23915'),
  ('1024398332253189567', 'Marley''s Ghosts', 2015, 'Comedy', null, 'Daniel Peacock', 'Sarah Alexander, John Hannah, Jo Joyner, Nicholas Burns', null, 'Marley has a rare gift that comes with mixed blessings - she can talk to the dead, who sadly now include both her husband Adam, her lover Michael and her vicar… Awkward.', 'Marley has a rare gift that comes with mixed blessings - she can talk to the dead, who sadly now include both her husband Adam, her lover Michael and her vicar… Awkward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DJivY5LOvRkxX4AsulktsIJwU4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64077'),
  ('708686321903515852', 'Marlon', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marlon Wayans, Christopher Moynihan', null, 'Marlon Wayans, Essence Atkins, Diallo Riddle, Notlim Taylor, Amir O''Neil, Bresha Webb', 'TV-PG', 'A loving (but immature) father is committed to co-parenting his two kids with his very-together ex-wife. While his misguided fatherly advice, unstoppable larger-than-life personality and unpredictable Internet superstardom might get in the way sometimes, for Marlon, family really always does come first - even if he''s the biggest kid of all.', 'A loving (but immature) father is committed to co-parenting his two kids with his very-together ex-wife. While his misguided fatherly advice, unstoppable larger-than-life personality and unpredictable Internet superstardom might get in the way sometimes, for Marlon, family really always does come first - even if he''s the biggest kid of all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jCZupMTSyS3SohvE14T3xVT36n.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71887'),
  ('1127174966284038258', 'Marmalade Boy', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Mariko Kouda, Ryotaro Okiayu, Wakana Yamazaki, Jun''ichi Kanemaru, Akira Ishida, Shinichiro Ohta, Aya Hisakawa, Toru Furuya', 'NR', 'Miki''s parents come home from their vacation to announce that they are getting a divorce. But what is more shocking is that they have switched partners with another couple! And to top things off, this other couple has a handsome son, Yuu, who Miki begins to develop feelings for. To make things more disturbing, everyone moves into one house. What will everyone think about Miki''s family lifestyle?', 'Miki''s parents come home from their vacation to announce that they are getting a divorce. But what is more shocking is that they have switched partners with another couple! And to top things off, this other couple has a handsome son, Yuu, who Miki begins to develop feelings for. To make things more disturbing, everyone moves into one house. What will everyone think about Miki''s family lifestyle?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87zd7UF3akCWU2cpb7QF33SRerx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35507'),
  ('162130725885134949', 'Marnalı', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Gürkan Uygun, Melike İpek Yalova, Mert Dogan, Elif Uslusoy, Osman Albayrak, Engin Benli, Murat Göçmez', null, 'Ali Reşat, a man of traditions, is released with an amnesty after many years in prison. While plotting revenge against his enemies in the mafia who put him in this situation, he seeks ways to win back his estranged son.', 'Ali Reşat, a man of traditions, is released with an amnesty after many years in prison. While plotting revenge against his enemies in the mafia who put him in this situation, he seeks ways to win back his estranged son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vKtwh6pPqcvIcUstWlu122Bgy3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273940'),
  ('5994096601060184', 'Marnow Murders', 2021, 'Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Minh-Khai Phan-Thi', null, 'The city of Schwerin is melting – it is the hottest summer in years. Detectives Lona Mendt and Frank Elling are on the trail of a serial murderer, who seems to choose his victims randomly. But nothing is as it seems. The detectives have apparently made some powerful enemies that will do everything in their power to keep the truth from coming to light. The further along with their investigation Frank Elling, a devoted husband and father, and the aloof Lona Mendt get, the bigger the obstacles become.', 'The city of Schwerin is melting – it is the hottest summer in years. Detectives Lona Mendt and Frank Elling are on the trail of a serial murderer, who seems to choose his victims randomly. But nothing is as it seems. The detectives have apparently made some powerful enemies that will do everything in their power to keep the truth from coming to light. The further along with their investigation Frank Elling, a devoted husband and father, and the aloof Lona Mendt get, the bigger the obstacles become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKemaHnEga7EEeJT69kZs8ySZaN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:120223'),
  ('979923012131701024', 'Maron', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Marc Maron', null, 'Dave Anthony, Marc Maron, Andy Kindler', 'TV-MA', 'Marc Maron has been a comedian for 25 years. He’s had his problems. He was an angry, drunk, self involved, twice divorced compulsive mess for most of his adult life, but with the popularity of a podcast he does in his garage and a life of sobriety, his life and career are turning around. MARON explores a fictionalized version of Marc’s life, his relationships, and his career, including his incredibly popular WTF podcast, which features conversations Marc conducts with celebrities and fellow comedians. Neurosis intact, Maron is uniquely fascinating, absolutely compelling and brutally funny.', 'Marc Maron has been a comedian for 25 years. He’s had his problems. He was an angry, drunk, self involved, twice divorced compulsive mess for most of his adult life, but with the popularity of a podcast he does in his garage and a life of sobriety, his life and career are turning around. MARON explores a fictionalized version of Marc’s life, his relationships, and his career, including his incredibly popular WTF podcast, which features conversations Marc conducts with celebrities and fellow comedians. Neurosis intact, Maron is uniquely fascinating, absolutely compelling and brutally funny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cQf0ftd6ljblYmUeMu39W7fd8F.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:46653'),
  ('256174109761331082', 'Marooned with Ed Stafford', 2014, 'Reality, Documentary', 'Tigress Productions', null, 'Ed Stafford', 'TV-14', 'Adventurer and survivalist Ed Stafford is back, pushing his survival skills to the limit and pitting himself once again against Mother Nature. Ed is left high and dry in some of the most inhospitable and extreme environments – equipped with nothing but an emergency phone, medical kit and his camera to record his adventures.', 'Adventurer and survivalist Ed Stafford is back, pushing his survival skills to the limit and pitting himself once again against Mother Nature. Ed is left high and dry in some of the most inhospitable and extreme environments – equipped with nothing but an emergency phone, medical kit and his camera to record his adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2nMjviwJfz1XArfRypfBW3WR8o.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:72438'),
  ('19365669050059791', 'Marriage', 2022, 'Drama', 'Stefan Golaszewski', null, 'Sean Bean, Nicola Walker, Chantelle Alle, Henry Lloyd-Hughes, Jack Holden, James Bolam', null, 'Marriage sees married couple Ian and Emma negotiate the ups and downs of their 30-year marriage. We see them dealing with the insecurities, the ambiguities, the hopes and the fears that are part of all marriages, as the drama explores the risks and the gifts of a long-term intimate relationship.', 'Marriage sees married couple Ian and Emma negotiate the ups and downs of their 30-year marriage. We see them dealing with the insecurities, the ambiguities, the hopes and the fears that are part of all marriages, as the drama explores the risks and the gifts of a long-term intimate relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30tGawKsSHc0n3xsaDX14izGU64.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157016'),
  ('481312521141547086', 'Marriage Boot Camp: Reality Stars', 2014, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Quintessential reality star couples are forced to face their personal demons in an extreme relationship boot camp, hoping to fix their broken unions. Raw, unbridled truth ensues when they are pushed to their emotional and physical limits to see if their relationships are worth saving or they should pull the plug.', 'Quintessential reality star couples are forced to face their personal demons in an extreme relationship boot camp, hoping to fix their broken unions. Raw, unbridled truth ensues when they are pushed to their emotional and physical limits to see if their relationships are worth saving or they should pull the plug.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s16jQQ8OvrLtG66J9Cs21x4y89T.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:61841'),
  ('429949286379669855', 'Marriage Contract', 2016, 'Drama', 'Kim Jin-min, Jeong Yu-gyeong', null, 'Lee Seo-jin, Uee, Kim Yong-geon, Park Jung-soo, Lee Hwi-hyang, Kim Young-pil, Shin Rin-a, Kim Kwang-kyu', null, 'A poor, widowed woman desperate to support her 7-year-old daughter and a wealthy business executive with a sick mother enter into a contract marriage.', 'A poor, widowed woman desperate to support her 7-year-old daughter and a wealthy business executive with a sick mother enter into a contract marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i29HTwpnlqTmDtSWS9ZC0kTdZNx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65728'),
  ('721646703690647762', 'Marriage Is Difficult for a Ninja', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Nanao, Nobuyuki Suzuki, Ryo Katsuji, Maika Yamamoto, Ayako Yoshitani, Taiyu Fujiwara, Miwako Kakei, Rie Tomosaka', null, 'Hotaru Kusakari is married to Gorō Kusakari, and she works as a pharmacist. She holds a secret that she is really a ninja and part of the Kōka ninja clan. Her husband holds a routine job as a postal delivery man, but he has a secret as well. He is also a ninja and part of the Iga ninja clan. Even though Hotaru and Gorō are a married couple, they are each unaware that their partner is a ninja.', 'Hotaru Kusakari is married to Gorō Kusakari, and she works as a pharmacist. She holds a secret that she is really a ninja and part of the Kōka ninja clan. Her husband holds a routine job as a postal delivery man, but he has a secret as well. He is also a ninja and part of the Iga ninja clan. Even though Hotaru and Gorō are a married couple, they are each unaware that their partner is a ninja.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AltC2KXyK9msukvKam0XqpVQJmc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204043'),
  ('707822976271925039', 'Marriage Toxin', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Haruki Ishiya, Shion Wakayama, Anna Nagase, Mariya Ise, Asaki Yuikawa, Soma Saito, Hinano Shirahama, Shimba Tsuchiya', null, 'For centuries, the deadly arts have been perfected by Masters, and Five Great Families hold the greatest power and influence. Hikaru Gero, an heir to the Gero family, lives in the underworld as an elite assassin. When his sister is pressured to produce an heir, Hikaru asks Mei Kinosaki, a brilliant marriage swindler, to find him a bride. The most challenging mission of his life begins!', 'For centuries, the deadly arts have been perfected by Masters, and Five Great Families hold the greatest power and influence. Hikaru Gero, an heir to the Gero family, lives in the underworld as an elite assassin. When his sister is pressured to produce an heir, Hikaru asks Mei Kinosaki, a brilliant marriage swindler, to find him a bride. The most challenging mission of his life begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2b1akkaoutSo3xbykjAKnEb92Rs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:301944'),
  ('929661141895834472', 'Marriage, Not Dating', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Joo Hwa-mi', 'Yeon Woo-jin, Han Geu-ru, Jeong Jin-woon, Han Seon-hwa, Heo Jung-min, Yoon So-hee, Kim Hae-sook, Kim Kap-soo', 'NR', 'A romantic comedy about a man who doesn''t want to get married and a woman who has no luck in marriage prospect. Gong Ki Tae is a successful bachelor who keeps getting pressured by his family to settle down. He then comes up with a plan to introduce Joo Jang Mi, whom he thinks will never be approved by his family.', 'A romantic comedy about a man who doesn''t want to get married and a woman who has no luck in marriage prospect. Gong Ki Tae is a successful bachelor who keeps getting pressured by his family to settle down. He then comes up with a plan to introduce Joo Jang Mi, whom he thinks will never be approved by his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bIzHopjSReKacLt3OaU22UEwf7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61171'),
  ('635706180804752592', 'Married', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrew Gurland', null, 'Judy Greer, Nat Faxon, Jenny Slate, Brett Gelman', 'TV-MA', 'Married is a half hour comedy about being miserably in love. Russ and Lina Bowman can barely remember what life was like before kids, debt, and suburbia rained on their romance -- but every once in a while, in between the arguments about their declining sex life and who''s driving carpool, they are reminded what drew them together in the first place -- they''re best friends. The show also features Russ and Lina''s friend AJ, who is recently divorced and pretending he''s over his wife, and their other friend Jess, who is married to a much older man who can''t keep up with her.', 'Married is a half hour comedy about being miserably in love. Russ and Lina Bowman can barely remember what life was like before kids, debt, and suburbia rained on their romance -- but every once in a while, in between the arguments about their declining sex life and who''s driving carpool, they are reminded what drew them together in the first place -- they''re best friends. The show also features Russ and Lina''s friend AJ, who is recently divorced and pretending he''s over his wife, and their other friend Jess, who is married to a much older man who can''t keep up with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRZsQ730CC1TzuRSaHoqBwcR2Sw.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60782'),
  ('853069949646947308', 'Married at First Sight', 2014, 'Reality', 'Lotte Offenberg Bergqvist', null, 'Pepper Schwartz', 'TV-PG', 'The cart comes way before the horse in the reality series "Married at First Sight." Based on a hit Danish format, "Married..." features people who agree to participate in an extreme experiment: Each covenants legal marriage with a complete stranger. Specialists -- including a spiritualist, a relationship coach and a sociologist -- use scientific matchmaking methods to determine each couple, who will not have met or had contact with each other until the wedding day. The series then documents the relationships, including honeymoons and other relatable events of married life. After several weeks, each couple must decide whether to remain together or go their individual ways.', 'The cart comes way before the horse in the reality series "Married at First Sight." Based on a hit Danish format, "Married..." features people who agree to participate in an extreme experiment: Each covenants legal marriage with a complete stranger. Specialists -- including a spiritualist, a relationship coach and a sociologist -- use scientific matchmaking methods to determine each couple, who will not have met or had contact with each other until the wedding day. The series then documents the relationships, including honeymoons and other relatable events of married life. After several weeks, each couple must decide whether to remain together or go their individual ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXfwttpCqqrNGu6di9BCG9wbyg0.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:60989'),
  ('764364697512903537', 'Married at First Sight', 2015, 'Reality', 'John Walsh, Tara McWilliams', null, 'John Aiken, Mel Schilling, Alessandra Rampolla', null, 'Working with leading relationship experts, eight Australian singles are carefully match-made into four married couples, who each meet each other - for the very first time - at their wedding. We''ll follow them as they marry, honeymoon, meet the in-laws and set up home, all the while getting to know one another more and more deeply, to see if the matchmakers have got it right and they will have a future together.', 'Working with leading relationship experts, eight Australian singles are carefully match-made into four married couples, who each meet each other - for the very first time - at their wedding. We''ll follow them as they marry, honeymoon, meet the in-laws and set up home, all the while getting to know one another more and more deeply, to see if the matchmakers have got it right and they will have a future together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2F0ADv2beVB4tRG0qx7YlWMvnDN.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:62705'),
  ('698529016229756200', 'Married at First Sight', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Carlo Boszhard, Eveline Stallaart, Lennart Klipp, Anne Campagne, Marcella, Bjorn, Eva, Bram', null, 'Reality program in which singles who have never seen each other before are matched to each other after scientific research. The participants, who are linked by a team of three experts, see each other for the first time at their wedding.', 'Reality program in which singles who have never seen each other before are matched to each other after scientific research. The participants, who are linked by a team of three experts, see each other for the first time at their wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyA5HtEziGBtLSejtK0mb60RSYC.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:100466'),
  ('797654137099822014', 'Married at First Sight Sweden', 2014, 'Reality', 'Lotte Offenberg Bergqvist', null, null, null, 'Six singles who have tried everything in the search for great love are matched by a team of experts. In front of the television cameras, they will then get married, even though they have never met before. The couple will live as husband and wife for four weeks. If love arises, the experiment has been successful, if not - they must divorce. Could an arranged marriage be the way to great love?', 'Six singles who have tried everything in the search for great love are matched by a team of experts. In front of the television cameras, they will then get married, even though they have never met before. The couple will live as husband and wife for four weeks. If love arises, the experiment has been successful, if not - they must divorce. Could an arranged marriage be the way to great love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SWU1VTp4MGuFk88Kt7isqUjzak.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:87754'),
  ('436655273403749606', 'Married to Medicine', 2013, 'Reality, Drama, Documentary', 'Mariah Huq', null, 'Dr. Jackie Walters, Dr. Simone Whitmore, Toya Bush-Harris, Quad Webb, Dr. Heavenly Kimes, Kari Wells, Lateasha Lunceford, Phaedra Parks', 'TV-14', 'Follows a group of successful and educated women who are connected to the world of medicine in Atlanta, including doctors and wives of doctors. Whether delivering babies in Louboutins or rushing off to galas in Buckhead, these women do everything with style, drama, and of course, southern flair.', 'Follows a group of successful and educated women who are connected to the world of medicine in Atlanta, including doctors and wives of doctors. Whether delivering babies in Louboutins or rushing off to galas in Buckhead, these women do everything with style, drama, and of course, southern flair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXLEtYR7xKCiqVnfMC10jHYlhQk.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:46733'),
  ('953576025314767600', 'Married... with Children', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Michael G. Moye, Ron Leavitt', null, 'Ed O''Neill, Katey Sagal, Amanda Bearse, Christina Applegate, David Faustino, Ted McGinley', 'TV-PG', 'Al Bundy is an unsuccessful middle aged shoe salesman with a miserable life and an equally dysfunctional family. He hates his job, his wife is lazy, his son is dysfunctional (especially with women), and his daughter is dim-witted and promiscuous.', 'Al Bundy is an unsuccessful middle aged shoe salesman with a miserable life and an equally dysfunctional family. He hates his job, his wife is lazy, his son is dysfunctional (especially with women), and his daughter is dim-witted and promiscuous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxdOgESOkBMmfcWUizL01mbdqzl.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:4239'),
  ('1002860916402327245', 'Marry Him If You Dare', 2013, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoon Eun-hye, Han Chae-a, Lee Dong-gun, Choi Myung-gil, Jung Yong-hwa, Lee Mi-do, Goh Doo-shim, Oh Jung-se', null, 'Set in the world of television broadcasting, Na Mi-rae travels back in time to prevent her 32-year-old self from marrying news anchor Kim Shin, thus sending her past self down a different path and enabling her to pursue the things she really wanted in life.', 'Set in the world of television broadcasting, Na Mi-rae travels back in time to prevent her 32-year-old self from marrying news anchor Kim Shin, thus sending her past self down a different path and enabling her to pursue the things she really wanted in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Av5nkc0Jlew11pf1EInx4ggFfu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:59046'),
  ('488844728358133137', 'Marry Me', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Barbara Hall', 'Lucy Liu, Steven Pasquale, Bobby Cannavale, Enrique Murciano, Danielle Nicolet, Vanessa Marano, David Andrews, Elizabeth Bogush', 'TV-PG', 'Rae Ann Carter always wanted the fairytale where she meets a prince, falls in love and gets married, but feared that dream would never come true. Suddenly, Rae goes from having no man in her life to having three – charming Luke, passionate Adam, and sophisticated Harry – all in love with Rae and asking to marry her. Which man will she choose?', 'Rae Ann Carter always wanted the fairytale where she meets a prince, falls in love and gets married, but feared that dream would never come true. Suddenly, Rae goes from having no man in her life to having three – charming Luke, passionate Adam, and sophisticated Harry – all in love with Rae and asking to marry her. Which man will she choose?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qc1RrwXA5xjFE8kPRrRLRVYWhDI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38735'),
  ('1051343996096873842', 'Marry Me', 2014, 'Comedy', 'David Caspe', null, 'Casey Wilson, Ken Marino, John Gemberling, Sarah Wright, Tymberlee Hill, Tim Meadows, Dan Bucatinsky', 'TV-14', 'Six years ago, Annie and Jake bonded over their mutual love of nachos and they''ve been inseparable ever since. Now, after returning from a romantic two-week island vacation, Jake’s all set to pop the question. Before he can ask, though, Annie lets loose on Jake for his inability to commit. She was expecting him to “put a ring on it” in paradise and now Jake’s perfect proposal is ruined. Not wanting to spend the next 60 years talking about that mess of a proposal, Jake and Annie decide to hold off on the engagement until they can do it right. Yet if history tells us anything, it’s when we really want things to go right that they all tend to go wrong. The only thing we know for sure is these two are destined to be together whether they can get it together or not.', 'Six years ago, Annie and Jake bonded over their mutual love of nachos and they''ve been inseparable ever since. Now, after returning from a romantic two-week island vacation, Jake’s all set to pop the question. Before he can ask, though, Annie lets loose on Jake for his inability to commit. She was expecting him to “put a ring on it” in paradise and now Jake’s perfect proposal is ruined. Not wanting to spend the next 60 years talking about that mess of a proposal, Jake and Annie decide to hold off on the engagement until they can do it right. Yet if history tells us anything, it’s when we really want things to go right that they all tend to go wrong. The only thing we know for sure is these two are destined to be together whether they can get it together or not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUT8oHqb8N7jqaZCU8NpRlylZFd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61499'),
  ('1069583049965012049', 'Marry Me Again', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ren Shihao, Zhang Chuhan, Ian Yi, Pan Ziyan, Li Ximan, Du Xiujun', null, 'Mi Chuxia partners with influencer Lu Yi to revive her late fiancé Tang Jingxing’s jewelry brand, only to uncover that Lu Yi is actually Tang Jingxing, who vanished after a car accident three years ago. As their relationship deepens, the truth behind his disappearance gradually comes to light.', 'Mi Chuxia partners with influencer Lu Yi to revive her late fiancé Tang Jingxing’s jewelry brand, only to uncover that Lu Yi is actually Tang Jingxing, who vanished after a car accident three years ago. As their relationship deepens, the truth behind his disappearance gradually comes to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pautvgifD5ggwjlNOIrjHYicN32.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286445'),
  ('225077611759785764', 'Marry Me, Let''s Have a Baby!', 2025, 'Animation', null, null, 'Kei Shirai, Rei Kagami, Hana Yurimoto', 'TV-MA', 'At a speed-dating event, Taika hits it off with a woman named Ayano, a doctor who’s eager to have children. However, just as the matching couples are about to be announced, he panics and makes a break for it when his fears about his erectile dysfunction begin to surface... Later, at an appointment for his condition, Taika is shocked to discover that his doctor is none other than Ayano herself! On top of that, he realizes that when he''s with Ayano, his erectile dysfunction disappears! This is a story about two people who decide to enter into a secret contractual marriage with one goal, to have a child in less than a year!', 'At a speed-dating event, Taika hits it off with a woman named Ayano, a doctor who’s eager to have children. However, just as the matching couples are about to be announced, he panics and makes a break for it when his fears about his erectile dysfunction begin to surface... Later, at an appointment for his condition, Taika is shocked to discover that his doctor is none other than Ayano herself! On top of that, he realizes that when he''s with Ayano, his erectile dysfunction disappears! This is a story about two people who decide to enter into a secret contractual marriage with one goal, to have a child in less than a year!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KouLBIT2W1aacqMx9sxuHCwYEY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:292554'),
  ('1118706347752732514', 'Marry Me, Mary!', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Moon Geun-young, Jang Keun-suk, Kim Jae-uck, Kim Hyo-jin, Kim Min-gyu, Park Jun-gyu, Shim Yi Young, Lee Seon-ho', 'TV-14', 'Wi Mae-ri is the cheerful, pragmatic girl who finds herself reluctantly being set up in an arranged marriage by her father. In order to avoid it, she enlists help from an indie rocker Kang Mu-gyul who pretends to be her husband.', 'Wi Mae-ri is the cheerful, pragmatic girl who finds herself reluctantly being set up in an arranged marriage by her father. In order to avoid it, she enlists help from an indie rocker Kang Mu-gyul who pretends to be her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yp3Uzctyy6Os5ayxklv2EtnUw2M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38167'),
  ('471655225501438268', 'Marry Me, or Not?', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Yu Chung-chung', 'Chi-Feng Chien, Hsin Hui Lin', 'Roy Chiu, Ko Chia-Yen, Joanne Tseng, Harry Chang, Li Chung-lin, Paul Hsu, Wang Dao-nan, Lei Ko', null, 'Opposites attract, but can a lasting relationship survive between two very different people? Cai Huan Zhen works in the tourism industry and is a top performer at her job. She is a meticulous planner and plans out every detail of her professional and personal life. She is a romantic and strives to find true love in every relationship. On the other hand, He Meng is a successful lawyer who specializes in helping his clients through messy divorces. He has never lost a case, but a side effect of his profession is that he doesn’t believe in a happy marriage. He wants to avoid the entanglements of marriage altogether in his personal life. Could romance survive with this unlikely couple?', 'Opposites attract, but can a lasting relationship survive between two very different people? Cai Huan Zhen works in the tourism industry and is a top performer at her job. She is a meticulous planner and plans out every detail of her professional and personal life. She is a romantic and strives to find true love in every relationship. On the other hand, He Meng is a successful lawyer who specializes in helping his clients through messy divorces. He has never lost a case, but a side effect of his profession is that he doesn’t believe in a happy marriage. He wants to avoid the entanglements of marriage altogether in his personal life. Could romance survive with this unlikely couple?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irCL1BBfe9IAs2C6MAaqaxdQUJ2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64323'),
  ('546452669818075887', 'Marry My Husband', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Shin Yoo-dam', 'Shin Yoo-dam', 'Park Min-young, Na In-woo, Lee Yi-kyung, Song Ha-yoon, Lee Gi-kwang, Gong Min-jeung, Kwon BoA, Choi Gyu-ri', null, 'Kang Ji-won, a terminally ill cancer patient, is killed by her husband and best friend after she witnesses them having an affair. She wakes up 10 years before the incident and decides to seek revenge with the help of Yu Ji-hyuk, a director at the company where she works. Now, she must reclaim her fate and eliminate the trash from her life.', 'Kang Ji-won, a terminally ill cancer patient, is killed by her husband and best friend after she witnesses them having an affair. She wakes up 10 years before the incident and decides to seek revenge with the help of Yu Ji-hyuk, a director at the company where she works. Now, she must reclaim her fate and eliminate the trash from her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/899KcBqooj8nEyPcAEU3h7AdfUo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221851'),
  ('1044159461873826398', 'Marry My Husband: Japan', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Fuka Koshiba, Takeru Satoh, Sei Shiraishi, You Yokoyama, Tomoko Tabata, Reina Kurosaki, Taiko Katono, Ryuya Shimekake', null, 'Misa has been a supporting character all her life, blindly trusting her best friend and husband. When she discovers their affair, the betrayal results in her death. Waking up ten years in the past, Misa vows to become the main character of her own story. She plans to ruin her betrayers by making them marry each other, but after meeting her director at work, starts to consider who she truly is.', 'Misa has been a supporting character all her life, blindly trusting her best friend and husband. When she discovers their affair, the betrayal results in her death. Waking up ten years in the past, Misa vows to become the main character of her own story. She plans to ruin her betrayers by making them marry each other, but after meeting her director at work, starts to consider who she truly is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxBKb1DEqzhUUHh9EI1H7ZVErRD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:290160'),
  ('832663732855308406', 'Mars', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Ron Howard, Brian Grazer', null, 'Jihae, Alberto Ammann, Clémentine Poidatz, Anamaria Marinca, Sammi Rotibi, Nicholas Wittman, Cosima Shaw, Kata Sarbó', 'TV-PG', 'The maiden crew of the Daedalus spacecraft must push itself to the brink of human capability in order to successfully establish the first sustainable colony on Mars. Set both in the future and in the present day, this series blends scripted elements set in the future with documentary vérité interviews with today’s best and brightest minds in modern science and innovation, illuminating how research and development is creating the space technology that will enable our first attempt at a mission to Mars.', 'The maiden crew of the Daedalus spacecraft must push itself to the brink of human capability in order to successfully establish the first sustainable colony on Mars. Set both in the future and in the present day, this series blends scripted elements set in the future with documentary vérité interviews with today’s best and brightest minds in modern science and innovation, illuminating how research and development is creating the space technology that will enable our first attempt at a mission to Mars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlT7aBrVqrRVnlaHQLCW12q3NK9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68427'),
  ('855287325355795277', 'Mars Daybreak', 2004, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Keiji Fujiwara, Houko Kuwashima, Takumi Yamazaki, Yui Horie, Tomokazu Seki', null, 'Mars is almost entirely covered in water. Humanity exists in large city-ships that float through the open seas.', 'Mars is almost entirely covered in water. Humanity exists in large city-ships that float through the open seas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xy1l8vprRwDPqPf2nz2wj4FAu7W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21997'),
  ('795957255477040020', 'Mars Intelligence Agency', 2016, 'Talk, Reality', null, null, 'Xue Zhiqian, Yang Di, Wowkie Zhang, Liu Wei', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOSgxGRs2eYrWfVPdHULIfKdkH4.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:66502'),
  ('709090464004407668', 'Mars Ravelo''s Darna', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Jane De Leon, Joshua Garcia, Janella Salvador, Zaijian Jaranilla, Paolo Gumabao, Rio Locsin, Simon Ibarra, Zeppi Borromeo', null, 'When fragments of a green crystal scatter in the city and turn people into destructive monsters, Narda embraces her destiny as Darna—the mighty protector of the powerful stone from Planet Marte.', 'When fragments of a green crystal scatter in the city and turn people into destructive monsters, Narda embraces her destiny as Darna—the mighty protector of the powerful stone from Planet Marte.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CFOce6pbb3FRNaBaVdvNsCv5kR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:121750'),
  ('804105898574791832', 'MARS RED', 2021, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tasuku Hatanaka, Junichi Suwabe, Koichi Yamadera, Akira Ishida, Hiroshi Yanaka, Kenichi Suzumura, Makoto Furukawa, Fumiko Orikasa', 'TV-14', 'It’s 1923, and the mysterious blood source Ascra has unleashed a horde of vampires across Japan. In response, the government spawns Code Zero. With S-rank vampire Defrott and the rookie Kurusu, this kill squad is made for one reason: to hunt the undead!', 'It’s 1923, and the mysterious blood source Ascra has unleashed a horde of vampires across Japan. In response, the government spawns Code Zero. With S-rank vampire Defrott and the rookie Kurusu, this kill squad is made for one reason: to hunt the undead!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0AaUo0hCb2RF2JGr9AmaDyJj7d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99099'),
  ('915853009282987524', 'Marseille', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Florent-Emilio Siri, Dan Franck', null, 'Valentine Lescure, Natacha Régnier, Jérôme Cachon, Vladimir Consigny', 'TV-MA', 'The longtime mayor of Marseille is preparing to hand over the reins to his protégé when a sudden and ruthless battle erupts for control of the city.', 'The longtime mayor of Marseille is preparing to hand over the reins to his protégé when a sudden and ruthless battle erupts for control of the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZgqnJpfmPka87GFHfuVrllxLOV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65466'),
  ('142702550053550374', 'Marshals', 2026, 'Drama', 'Spencer Hudnut', 'Maggie Schroeder, Lyle Mitchell Corbine Jr.', 'Luke Grimes, Logan Marshall-Green, Arielle Kebbel, Ash Santos, Tatanka Means, Brecken Merrill, Mo Brings Plenty, Gil Birmingham', 'TV-14', 'With the Yellowstone Ranch behind him, Kayce Dutton joins an elite unit of U.S. Marshals, combining his skills as a cowboy and Navy SEAL to bring range justice to Montana, where he and his teammates must balance family, duty and the high psychological cost that comes with serving as the last line of defense in the region''s war on violence.', 'With the Yellowstone Ranch behind him, Kayce Dutton joins an elite unit of U.S. Marshals, combining his skills as a cowboy and Navy SEAL to bring range justice to Montana, where he and his teammates must balance family, duty and the high psychological cost that comes with serving as the last line of defense in the region''s war on violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nInfaveN1iFpRIcMGNKENoVVUT2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:290856'),
  ('516759663802707449', 'Marsupilami', 1993, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Kids, Drama', null, null, 'René Auberjonois, April Winchell, Jeff Bennett, Jason Marsden, Charlie Adler, Dan Castellaneta, Jim Cummings, Frank Welker', 'NR', 'Marsupilami is an animated series that first appeared on television in Raw Toonage in 1992, and was then spun off into his own eponymous show on the CBS television network for the 1993–1994 season. the seasons end around 1994', 'Marsupilami is an animated series that first appeared on television in Raw Toonage in 1992, and was then spun off into his own eponymous show on the CBS television network for the 1993–1994 season. the seasons end around 1994', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mf0V9NtGTN8V8L46u0zGZKTdnRY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35483'),
  ('137327341145453500', 'Marsupilami', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy', 'André Franquin', null, null, null, 'Marsupilami is an animated series based on the original Marsupilami comics created by André Franquin. It was produced by Marathon Media and later, Samka Productions. Its first season was simply known as Marsupilami, however the series has been renamed multiple times throughout its run.', 'Marsupilami is an animated series based on the original Marsupilami comics created by André Franquin. It was produced by Marathon Media and later, Samka Productions. Its first season was simply known as Marsupilami, however the series has been renamed multiple times throughout its run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cO6EiGXSVXKncYqoPsi5UcY1q22.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:49289'),
  ('623190792125280177', 'Martha & Snoop''s Potluck Dinner Party', 2016, 'Talk', null, null, 'Martha Stewart, Snoop Dogg', 'TV-14', 'The Queen of Cuisine and the King of Kush are coming together to invite their celebrity friends over for a little potluck fun. Games, recipes and musical guests. It''s guaranteed to have everyone buzzing.', 'The Queen of Cuisine and the King of Kush are coming together to invite their celebrity friends over for a little potluck fun. Games, recipes and musical guests. It''s guaranteed to have everyone buzzing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKahWiEtLRKC4lxeVPyPkNaTirO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:68597'),
  ('860180647323702497', 'Martha Speaks', 2008, 'Animation, Kids, Family', 'Susan Meddaugh', null, 'Alex Ferris, Tabitha St. Germain, Madeleine Peters', 'TV-Y', 'Martha, a beloved family dog, is accidentally fed alphabet soup — this gives her the power of speech and the chance to speak her mind to anyone that will listen.', 'Martha, a beloved family dog, is accidentally fed alphabet soup — this gives her the power of speech and the chance to speak her mind to anyone that will listen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHL9EBFqyiT2d4oIxRxjwyg46dI.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:7736'),
  ('973885894338082838', 'Martial God Asura', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Wei Yifan, Chang Wentao, Tong Yin, Fu Chen Yang', null, 'Regarding potential—even if you are not considered a genius, you can still learn Mysterious Techniques and martial skills. Anyone can be enlightened without a master. Regarding strength—despite having a myriad of artifacts, you may not defeat my army of World Spirits. Who am I? All of the world’s living perceives me as Asura, but I was ignorant to such a thing. I thus ascend to be the Martial God as Asura.', 'Regarding potential—even if you are not considered a genius, you can still learn Mysterious Techniques and martial skills. Anyone can be enlightened without a master. Regarding strength—despite having a myriad of artifacts, you may not defeat my army of World Spirits. Who am I? All of the world’s living perceives me as Asura, but I was ignorant to such a thing. I thus ascend to be the Martial God as Asura.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQHlgqZpP8lrTenh9dqKh9TnPdm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:235808'),
  ('316727830023814382', 'Martial Law', 1998, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Carlton Cuse', null, 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Gretchen Egolf, Kelly Hu, Arsenio Hall', null, 'Sammo Law spins, kicks, and chops his way through crime as a one-man police force in Los Angeles. He''s a tough law enforcer who comes to the U.S. in search of a former friend and protegée — and gets drafted as part of the LAPD.', 'Sammo Law spins, kicks, and chops his way through crime as a one-man police force in Los Angeles. He''s a tough law enforcer who comes to the U.S. in search of a former friend and protegée — and gets drafted as part of the LAPD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLseFnM1UwzHLQxnNTiCqfRMgkx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:586'),
  ('388004856240880966', 'Martial Universe', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Zhang Wei', 'Yang Yang, Zhang Tian''ai, Wang Likun, Wu Chun, Suo Xiaokun, Ashton Chen, Yang Haoyu, Dong Qing', null, 'Lin Dong, a child from a small village isn''t favored by his clan. By chance, Lin Dong obtains a mysterious artifact that is coveted by many clans in the martial world. Because of this artifact, Lin Dong is approached by many people of different clans and is forcibly involved in various events of the martial universe', 'Lin Dong, a child from a small village isn''t favored by his clan. By chance, Lin Dong obtains a mysterious artifact that is coveted by many clans in the martial world. Because of this artifact, Lin Dong is approached by many people of different clans and is forcibly involved in various events of the martial universe', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpzNbL0PntJprEtO4uKQq8hJmcb.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:73078'),
  ('938537355213052935', 'Martial Universe', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Muqing Ke, KIYO, Shujun Lv, Guo Hongbo, Du Qingqing, Liu Shisi, Wan Suwan, Yang Ou', 'TV-14', 'Hailing from a banished family of the Great Lin Clan, when Lin Dong was very young, he watched, powerless, as his talented father was easily crushed and crippled by the overwhelming genius of the great Lin Clan, Lin Langtian. With a despairing father, a heartbroken grandfather, and a suffering family, ever since that fateful day, Lin Dong has been driven by a deep purpose; to take revenge on the man who had taken everything and more from his family. Armed with nothing but willpower and determination, join Lin Dong as he unknowingly discovers a destiny greater than he could ever hope to imagine when he stumbles upon a mysterious stone talisman…', 'Hailing from a banished family of the Great Lin Clan, when Lin Dong was very young, he watched, powerless, as his talented father was easily crushed and crippled by the overwhelming genius of the great Lin Clan, Lin Langtian. With a despairing father, a heartbroken grandfather, and a suffering family, ever since that fateful day, Lin Dong has been driven by a deep purpose; to take revenge on the man who had taken everything and more from his family. Armed with nothing but willpower and determination, join Lin Dong as he unknowingly discovers a destiny greater than he could ever hope to imagine when he stumbles upon a mysterious stone talisman…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pl81yA352H1YEcJ36ZIkjFw5OH2.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:87007'),
  ('644137640420430038', 'Martian Successor Nadesico', 1996, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'Sho Aikawa', 'Yuji Ueda, Houko Kuwashima, Omi Minami, Naoko Takano, Maya Okamoto, Kentaro Ito, Tomokazu Seki, Chisa Yokoyama', 'NR', 'Only one ship stands between earth and total annihilation! The High Mobile Battleship Nadesico is the most formidable fighting machine ever conceived, but due to a shortage of trained soldiers, the crew is a little unorthodox. The poor Jovians don''t stand a chance against the largest contingent of geeks and misfits ever sent into orbit!', 'Only one ship stands between earth and total annihilation! The High Mobile Battleship Nadesico is the most formidable fighting machine ever conceived, but due to a shortage of trained soldiers, the crew is a little unorthodox. The poor Jovians don''t stand a chance against the largest contingent of geeks and misfits ever sent into orbit!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKd4q8iY1mcCCJ0GYBh9uJdlpUn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35544'),
  ('737167394859164114', 'Martin', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Martin Lawrence, John Bowman, Topper Carew', null, 'Martin Lawrence, Tichina Arnold, Tisha Campbell, Carl Anthony Payne II, Thomas Mikal Ford', 'TV-PG', 'Sassy sitcom centering on radio and television personality Martin Payne. Series focuses on his romantic relationship with girlfriend Gina, her best friend Pam and escapades with best friends Tommy and Cole.', 'Sassy sitcom centering on radio and television personality Martin Payne. Series focuses on his romantic relationship with girlfriend Gina, her best friend Pam and escapades with best friends Tommy and Cole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inQQEpHiaSy8BEd9XEFF2W39vO0.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:171'),
  ('193041435256652343', 'Martin Morning', 2003, 'Animation, Kids', 'Claude Prothée', null, 'Kaycie Chase, Brigitte Lecordier, Kelly Marot, Philippe Ariotti', null, 'Martin, an ordinary nine-year-old boy, has one strange characteristic: every morning he awakes to find himself transformed into fantastic and legendary beings. Despite the transformations, he goes to school with his friends, and adventures then ensue.', 'Martin, an ordinary nine-year-old boy, has one strange characteristic: every morning he awakes to find himself transformed into fantastic and legendary beings. Despite the transformations, he goes to school with his friends, and adventures then ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hRjWz6tmJuUqfvFlQdBArVtPLb.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:14525'),
  ('619067522147893808', 'Martin Mystery', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Mystery', 'David Michel', null, 'Alexis Tomassian, Dorothée Pousséo, Sylvain Lemarie, Yann Le Madic, Laurence Dourlens, Emmanuel Garijo, Donald Reignoux', null, 'Martin Mystery has a passion for all things paranormal. When he''s not at school, this teenage lover of supernatural ooze works undercover for a secret bureau specialising in mysterious phenomena. Together with his older stepsister Diana, Java (a massive caveman lost in time) and Billy (a small green hovering creature), he checks out weird wonders. Martin is always bursting with energy and seldom thinks before he leaps. Diana is his guardian angel – a straight-A student, she brings the brains to their missions. Seen a zombie, alien or ghost? Call Martin Mystery.', 'Martin Mystery has a passion for all things paranormal. When he''s not at school, this teenage lover of supernatural ooze works undercover for a secret bureau specialising in mysterious phenomena. Together with his older stepsister Diana, Java (a massive caveman lost in time) and Billy (a small green hovering creature), he checks out weird wonders. Martin is always bursting with energy and seldom thinks before he leaps. Diana is his guardian angel – a straight-A student, she brings the brains to their missions. Seen a zombie, alien or ghost? Call Martin Mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAxpKhVuaMmPXx4iLUPa7lpEySY.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:140'),
  ('1104375178736858762', 'Martin Scorsese Presents: The Saints', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Matti Leshem', null, null, null, 'Explore the remarkable stories of eight men and women who risked everything to embody humanity''s most noble and complex trait — faith.', 'Explore the remarkable stories of eight men and women who risked everything to embody humanity''s most noble and complex trait — faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Fvvaacm57Sb8VjNEQxByTWtfE1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:250449'),
  ('339344285674332346', 'Marumaru no Smartphone', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'Takeshi Takemura', 'Utaha, Kaya Soya, Sae Miyazawa, DOTAMA, Shinya Kote', null, 'Mini-drama with a historical character having a smartphone.', 'Mini-drama with a historical character having a smartphone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCVq31pNUlI0I1ENnztpIP7yhia.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:215953'),
  ('275435485118656508', 'Marvel Disk Wars: The Avengers', 2014, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Ryu King', 'Kazuhiro Nakaya, Mitsuki Saiga, Yuichi Iguchi, Yusuke Kuwahata, Yayoi Sugaya, Naomi Ohzora, Eiji Hanawa, Yasuyuki Kase', null, 'A group of teenagers join forces with the Avengers, Earth''s mightiest heroes, to fight against the tyrannical Loki and his mighty empire.', 'A group of teenagers join forces with the Avengers, Earth''s mightiest heroes, to fight against the tyrannical Loki and his mighty empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wQAZaWSvBJOIIt68cqmC0KJjeE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70801'),
  ('919793083929448148', 'Marvel Knights: Spider-Woman, Agent of S.W.O.R.D.', 2009, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, 'Brian Michael Bendis', 'Nicolette Reed, Stephanie K. Thomas, Andy Mackenzie, Geoff Boothby, Jessica Boone', null, 'Feeling like the most hated person on Earth after the events of Secret Invasion, Jessica Drew aka Spider-Woman is approached by a mysterious stranger to join S.W.O.R.D. (Sentient World Observation and Response Department), a counter-terrorism and intelligence agency for extraterrestrial threats.', 'Feeling like the most hated person on Earth after the events of Secret Invasion, Jessica Drew aka Spider-Woman is approached by a mysterious stranger to join S.W.O.R.D. (Sentient World Observation and Response Department), a counter-terrorism and intelligence agency for extraterrestrial threats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93pxdXPT8RC2pArLU3iQPGyQkAX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77269'),
  ('794465438469533438', 'Marvel Lucha Libre Edition: El origen de la máscara', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Franco Escamilla, Emmanuel Roman Morales, Miguel Ángel Olivo Castro, Brian Button', null, 'The new series was revealed during the pre-shot of AAA’s event, TripleMania XXX: CDMX, where the first trailer was shown. This new series features wrestling matches, but with wrestlers in outfits that are inspired by Marvel Super Heroes.', 'The new series was revealed during the pre-shot of AAA’s event, TripleMania XXX: CDMX, where the first trailer was shown. This new series features wrestling matches, but with wrestlers in outfits that are inspired by Marvel Super Heroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrSxTzfVZMig68bbX85za2gpxGb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212423'),
  ('105208722229492472', 'Marvel Rising: Initiation', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Alfred Gimeno', null, null, null, 'Gwen Stacy AKA Ghost-Spider, wrongly accused of a crime she didn’t commit, seeks to clear her name and deliver justice. Unfortunately, her dad is not only Captain of the NYPD, but spearheading the manhunt! To make matters worse, other young heroes—Ms. Marvel, Squirrel Girl, Quake and Patriot—are after Ghost Spider as well. But, as the chase to uncover the truth winds down, a darker threat looms along the horizon, and very soon, these heroes will need to put aside their differences and work together as a team.', 'Gwen Stacy AKA Ghost-Spider, wrongly accused of a crime she didn’t commit, seeks to clear her name and deliver justice. Unfortunately, her dad is not only Captain of the NYPD, but spearheading the manhunt! To make matters worse, other young heroes—Ms. Marvel, Squirrel Girl, Quake and Patriot—are after Ghost Spider as well. But, as the chase to uncover the truth winds down, a darker threat looms along the horizon, and very soon, these heroes will need to put aside their differences and work together as a team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8z8Z7ZwFgatxp33fvxRKLyl2xd9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:83043'),
  ('231575674171187460', 'Marvel Studios Assembled', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Go behind the scenes of the shows and movies of the Marvel Cinematic Universe, following the filmmakers, cast and crew, and Marvel heroes every step of the way.', 'Go behind the scenes of the shows and movies of the Marvel Cinematic Universe, following the filmmakers, cast and crew, and Marvel heroes every step of the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2BHRwtQVkt5fssLdo5MpFgHJPY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118924'),
  ('324198912405016825', 'Marvel Studios Legends', 2021, 'Documentary, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Revisit the epic heroes, villains and moments from across the MCU in preparation for the stories still to come. Each dynamic segment feeds directly into the upcoming series — setting the stage for future events. This series weaves together the many threads that constitute the unparalleled Marvel Cinematic Universe.', 'Revisit the epic heroes, villains and moments from across the MCU in preparation for the stories still to come. Each dynamic segment feeds directly into the upcoming series — setting the stage for future events. This series weaves together the many threads that constitute the unparalleled Marvel Cinematic Universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EpDuYIK81YtCUT3gH2JDpyj8Qk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:114695'),
  ('390816813176380336', 'Marvel Zombies', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Iman Vellani, Todd Williams, David Harbour, Simu Liu, Awkwafina, Elizabeth Olsen', 'TV-MA', 'After the Avengers are overtaken by a zombie plague, a desperate group of survivors discover the key to bringing an end to the super-powered undead, racing across a dystopian landscape and risking life and limb to save their world.', 'After the Avengers are overtaken by a zombie plague, a desperate group of survivors discover the key to bringing an end to the super-powered undead, racing across a dystopian landscape and risking life and limb to save their world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwKj9ERGFXsWot0nXgQ5yMQf9I7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138505'),
  ('911472544256691647', 'Marvel''s 616', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Explore Marvel’s rich legacy of pioneering characters, creators and storytelling to reflect the world outside your window. Each documentary, helmed by a unique filmmaker, showcases the intersections of storytelling, pop culture, and fandom within the Marvel Universe.', 'Explore Marvel’s rich legacy of pioneering characters, creators and storytelling to reflect the world outside your window. Each documentary, helmed by a unique filmmaker, showcases the intersections of storytelling, pop culture, and fandom within the Marvel Universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBOIVb6zgsnfRhvCgdX04pLaYXQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102693'),
  ('1094076684615678442', 'Marvel''s Agent Carter', 2015, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Stephen McFeely, Christopher Markus', null, 'Hayley Atwell, James D''Arcy, Enver Gjokaj, Wynn Everett', 'TV-PG', 'It''s 1946, and peace has dealt Peggy Carter a serious blow as she finds herself marginalized when the men return home from fighting abroad. Working for the covert SSR (Strategic Scientific Reserve), Peggy must balance doing administrative work and going on secret missions for Howard Stark all while trying to navigate life as a single woman in America, in the wake of losing the love of her life - Steve Rogers.', 'It''s 1946, and peace has dealt Peggy Carter a serious blow as she finds herself marginalized when the men return home from fighting abroad. Working for the covert SSR (Strategic Scientific Reserve), Peggy must balance doing administrative work and going on secret missions for Howard Stark all while trying to navigate life as a single woman in America, in the wake of losing the love of her life - Steve Rogers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kqIsjjDMZA5GRMH5VCdQYZJqc6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61550'),
  ('642515503279363421', 'Marvel''s Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.', 2013, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Joss Whedon, Jed Whedon, Maurissa Tancharoen', null, 'Clark Gregg, Chloe Bennet, Elizabeth Henstridge, Ming-Na Wen, Henry Simmons, Natalia Cordova-Buckley, Jeff Ward', 'TV-14', 'Agent Phil Coulson of S.H.I.E.L.D. (Strategic Homeland Intervention, Enforcement and Logistics Division) puts together a team of agents to investigate the new, the strange and the unknown around the globe, protecting the ordinary from the extraordinary.', 'Agent Phil Coulson of S.H.I.E.L.D. (Strategic Homeland Intervention, Enforcement and Logistics Division) puts together a team of agents to investigate the new, the strange and the unknown around the globe, protecting the ordinary from the extraordinary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHUCCMy1vvj58tzE3dZqeC9SXus.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1403'),
  ('1007354167353202114', 'Marvel''s Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.: Slingshot', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Natalia Cordova-Buckley', null, 'Elena "Yo-Yo" Rodriguez, an Inhuman with the ability to move at super-speed, is required to sign the Sokovia Accords. However, the restrictions of the Accords are in direct conflict with a personal mission she''s desperate to fulfill, one that will test her abilities and will include tense encounters with S.H.I.E.L.D. team members.', 'Elena "Yo-Yo" Rodriguez, an Inhuman with the ability to move at super-speed, is required to sign the Sokovia Accords. However, the restrictions of the Accords are in direct conflict with a personal mission she''s desperate to fulfill, one that will test her abilities and will include tense encounters with S.H.I.E.L.D. team members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwJej7WdmGRMCMyuDlotwAqVX7S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69088'),
  ('715366941173943581', 'Marvel''s Ant-Man', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Josh Keaton, Melissa Rauch, Dee Bradley Baker, William Salyers, Laura Bailey, Eric Bauza, Nolan North, Sam Riegel', null, 'Follow Scott Lang as Ant-Man, dealing with everything from super villains to miniature alien invasions (and occasionally helping Cassie with her homework). Along with The Wasp and Hank Pym, Ant-Man protects the world one inch at a time.', 'Follow Scott Lang as Ant-Man, dealing with everything from super villains to miniature alien invasions (and occasionally helping Cassie with her homework). Along with The Wasp and Hank Pym, Ant-Man protects the world one inch at a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6msLuFmP5MjyDW6x8vXHnFM86li.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73919'),
  ('455824699740366879', 'Marvel''s Avengers', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Steven T. Seagle, Joe Kelly, Joe Casey', null, 'James C. Mathis III, Daisy Lightfoot', 'TV-Y7', 'The further adventures of the Marvel Universe''s mightiest general membership superhero team. With an all-star roster consisting of Iron Man, Captain America, Thor, Hulk, Hawkeye, Falcon and, occasionally--when she feels like it and only when she feels like it--Black Widow, the Avengers are a team in the truest sense. The Avengers save the world from the biggest threats imaginable--threats no single super hero could withstand.', 'The further adventures of the Marvel Universe''s mightiest general membership superhero team. With an all-star roster consisting of Iron Man, Captain America, Thor, Hulk, Hawkeye, Falcon and, occasionally--when she feels like it and only when she feels like it--Black Widow, the Avengers are a team in the truest sense. The Avengers save the world from the biggest threats imaginable--threats no single super hero could withstand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVYPq7FSvsdNQOXVIFnndXJPCXn.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:59427'),
  ('1020717600338950803', 'Marvel''s Cloak & Dagger', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Joe Pokaski', null, 'Aubrey Joseph, Olivia Holt, Gloria Reuben, Andrea Roth, J.D. Evermore, Emma Lahana', 'TV-14', 'Two teenagers from very different backgrounds awaken to newly acquired superpowers which mysteriously link them to one another.', 'Two teenagers from very different backgrounds awaken to newly acquired superpowers which mysteriously link them to one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pYnRJuBPEqZO1o4fcxBTgmKNHfy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66190'),
  ('8094448569759605', 'Marvel''s Daredevil', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Drew Goddard', null, 'Charlie Cox, Deborah Ann Woll, Elden Henson, Vincent D''Onofrio, Jay Ali, Wilson Bethel', 'TV-MA', 'Lawyer-by-day Matt Murdock uses his heightened senses from being blinded as a young boy to fight crime at night on the streets of Hell’s Kitchen as Daredevil.', 'Lawyer-by-day Matt Murdock uses his heightened senses from being blinded as a young boy to fight crime at night on the streets of Hell’s Kitchen as Daredevil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QWbPaDxiB6LW2LjASknzYBvjMj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61889'),
  ('530620119238149014', 'Marvel''s Future Avengers', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'L. Daniel LaBrune, Rob Blatt, Ryu King', 'Aki Kanada, Juri Kimura, Atsushi Tamaru, Shinya Hamazoe, Eiji Hanawa, Kazuhiro Nakaya, Yasuyuki Kase, Kenichirou Matsuda', 'TV-PG', 'Makoto, Adi, and Chloe attend a special training school where they train to become the heroes of the next generation. Unfortunately for them they are actually science experiments for Hydra. When Adi and Chloe get captured by Hydra for learning the truth, Makoto seeks out the one group he believes could help them- The Avengers. After rescuing the kids The Avengers decide to take them in and train them to be the heroes of the future.', 'Makoto, Adi, and Chloe attend a special training school where they train to become the heroes of the next generation. Unfortunately for them they are actually science experiments for Hydra. When Adi and Chloe get captured by Hydra for learning the truth, Makoto seeks out the one group he believes could help them- The Avengers. After rescuing the kids The Avengers decide to take them in and train them to be the heroes of the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buxBvftqx3g57FTYtdrfGSHlWfQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91278'),
  ('105897967100165822', 'Marvel''s Guardians of the Galaxy', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Family', null, null, 'Will Friedle, Trevor Devall, Vanessa Marshall, David Sobolov, Jeff Bennett, Jonathan Adams, Kevin Michael Richardson', 'TV-Y7', 'Peter Quill is Star-Lord, the brash adventurer who, to save the universe from its greatest threats, joins forces with a quartet of disparate misfits — fan-favorite Rocket Raccoon, a tree-like humanoid named Groot, the enigmatic, expert fighter Gamora and the rough edged warrior Drax the Destroyer.', 'Peter Quill is Star-Lord, the brash adventurer who, to save the universe from its greatest threats, joins forces with a quartet of disparate misfits — fan-favorite Rocket Raccoon, a tree-like humanoid named Groot, the enigmatic, expert fighter Gamora and the rough edged warrior Drax the Destroyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXwe3wVhdvvxiixL9UJf6PgBybZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:63181'),
  ('948065801820675472', 'Marvel''s Hero Project', 2019, 'Documentary, Reality, Family, Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'This 20-episode series shares the remarkable, positive change several young heroes are making in their own communities across the country. These inspiring kids have dedicated their lives to selfless acts of bravery and kindness, and now, Marvel celebrates them as the true Super Heroes they are by welcoming them into Marvel''s Hero Project.', 'This 20-episode series shares the remarkable, positive change several young heroes are making in their own communities across the country. These inspiring kids have dedicated their lives to selfless acts of bravery and kindness, and now, Marvel celebrates them as the true Super Heroes they are by welcoming them into Marvel''s Hero Project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tImFadmLA2k2TJTw1a4nDgALJV0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95313'),
  ('869010290202186330', 'Marvel''s Hit-Monkey', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Will Speck, Josh Gordon', null, 'Fred Tatasciore, Jason Sudeikis, Olivia Munn, Ally Maki, Eric Roberts, Leslie Jones', 'TV-MA', 'After a high-profile political assassination goes sideways, an injured hitman hides out amongst a tribe of snow monkeys in the mountains of Japan.', 'After a high-profile political assassination goes sideways, an injured hitman hides out amongst a tribe of snow monkeys in the mountains of Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aK7hApRSDUv8xxDQXyQil7qBjN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:133903'),
  ('50587707549154327', 'Marvel''s Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H.', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Fred Tatasciore, Clancy Brown, Ben Diskin, Eliza Dushku, Seth Green', 'TV-Y7', 'Joined by the Agents of S.M.A.S.H., a humorously dysfunctional group of teammates who double as family, Hulk tackles threats that are too enormous for any other heroes to handle.', 'Joined by the Agents of S.M.A.S.H., a humorously dysfunctional group of teammates who double as family, Hulk tackles threats that are too enormous for any other heroes to handle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkGIiIIkHOeVXzwjBNFTRqTCnqF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:40044'),
  ('77340331392974415', 'Marvel''s Inhumans', 2017, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Scott Buck', null, 'Anson Mount, Serinda Swan, Iwan Rheon, Isabelle Cornish, Ken Leung, Eme Ikwuakor, Sonya Balmores, Ellen Woglom', 'TV-PG', 'After the Royal Family of Inhumans is splintered by a military coup, they barely escape to Hawaii where their surprising interactions with the lush world and humanity around them may prove to not only save them, but Earth itself.', 'After the Royal Family of Inhumans is splintered by a military coup, they barely escape to Hawaii where their surprising interactions with the lush world and humanity around them may prove to not only save them, but Earth itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKfGip55oJ9tdzhyd9ayGyFFhuo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68716'),
  ('836841668841652317', 'Marvel''s Iron Fist', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Scott Buck', null, 'Finn Jones, Jessica Henwick, Jessica Stroup, Tom Pelphrey, Sacha Dhawan, Alice Eve', 'TV-MA', 'Danny Rand resurfaces 15 years after being presumed dead. Now, with the power of the Iron Fist, he seeks to reclaim his past and fulfill his destiny.', 'Danny Rand resurfaces 15 years after being presumed dead. Now, with the power of the Iron Fist, he seeks to reclaim his past and fulfill his destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4l6KD9HhtD6nCDEfg10Lp6C6zah.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62127'),
  ('66866831255818528', 'Marvel''s Jessica Jones', 2015, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Melissa Rosenberg', null, 'Krysten Ritter, Rachael Taylor, Eka Darville, Benjamin Walker, Carrie-Anne Moss', 'TV-MA', 'After a tragic ending to her short-lived super hero stint, Jessica Jones is rebuilding her personal life and career as a detective who gets pulled into cases involving people with extraordinary abilities in New York City.', 'After a tragic ending to her short-lived super hero stint, Jessica Jones is rebuilding her personal life and career as a detective who gets pulled into cases involving people with extraordinary abilities in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paf9wL3mOW9LT3ZjRxXqJcjeMEv.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:38472'),
  ('413995703656997841', 'Marvel''s Luke Cage', 2016, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Cheo Hodari Coker', null, 'Mike Colter, Alfre Woodard, Simone Missick, Theo Rossi, Mustafa Shakir, Gabrielle Dennis', 'TV-MA', 'Given superstrength and durability by a sabotaged experiment, a wrongly accused man escapes prison to become a superhero for hire.', 'Given superstrength and durability by a sabotaged experiment, a wrongly accused man escapes prison to become a superhero for hire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzM1hMB3PUJqbISX0f421b3xOjB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62126'),
  ('494657546430113745', 'Marvel''s M.O.D.O.K.', 2021, 'Comedy, Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Patton Oswalt, Jordan Blum', null, 'Patton Oswalt, Melissa Fumero, Aimee Garcia, Ben Schwartz, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Beck Bennett, Jon Daly, Sam Richardson', 'TV-MA', 'The megalomaniacal supervillain M.O.D.O.K. has long pursued his dream of one day conquering the world. But after years of setbacks and failures fighting the Earth’s mightiest heroes, M.O.D.O.K. has run his evil organization A.I.M. into the ground. Ousted as A.I.M.’s leader, while also dealing with his crumbling marriage and family life, the Mental Organism Designed Only for Killing is set to confront his greatest challenge yet: a midlife crisis!', 'The megalomaniacal supervillain M.O.D.O.K. has long pursued his dream of one day conquering the world. But after years of setbacks and failures fighting the Earth’s mightiest heroes, M.O.D.O.K. has run his evil organization A.I.M. into the ground. Ousted as A.I.M.’s leader, while also dealing with his crumbling marriage and family life, the Mental Organism Designed Only for Killing is set to confront his greatest challenge yet: a midlife crisis!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kXRzRjQZs9kAIm3K9MkQgsZR9C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111312'),
  ('377994882246647037', 'Marvel''s Moon Girl and Devil Dinosaur', 2023, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Diamond White, Fred Tatasciore, Alfre Woodard, Gary Anthony Williams, Sasheer Zamata, Jermaine Fowler, Libe Barer', 'TV-Y7', 'After 13-year-old super-genius Lunella accidentally brings ten-ton T-Rex, Devil Dinosaur into present-day New York City via a time vortex, the duo works together to protect the city''s Lower East Side from danger.', 'After 13-year-old super-genius Lunella accidentally brings ten-ton T-Rex, Devil Dinosaur into present-day New York City via a time vortex, the duo works together to protect the city''s Lower East Side from danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oFkjiF9fT2asKWjRiJtlbhu3hn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:92788'),
  ('744159206477647750', 'Marvel''s Rocket & Groot', 2017, 'Kids, Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family', null, 'Kevin Burke, Chris Wyatt', 'Trevor Devall, Kevin Michael Richardson', null, 'Before becoming Guardians of the Galaxy, Rocket and Groot were bounty hunters trying to get a ship.', 'Before becoming Guardians of the Galaxy, Rocket and Groot were bounty hunters trying to get a ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rCNP3beEllDgMHhqHFzMbQRFf9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70784'),
  ('841352301897927864', 'Marvel''s Runaways', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Josh Schwartz, Stephanie Savage', null, 'Rhenzy Feliz, Lyrica Okano, Virginia Gardner, Ariela Barer, Gregg Sulkin, Allegra Acosta, Brigid Brannagh, Annie Wersching', 'TV-14', 'Every teenager thinks their parents are evil. What if you found out they actually were? Six diverse teenagers who can barely stand each other must unite against a common foe – their parents.', 'Every teenager thinks their parents are evil. What if you found out they actually were? Six diverse teenagers who can barely stand each other must unite against a common foe – their parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnHEhbzh0F7kN3Ah1lzRjtQuW16.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67466'),
  ('196662718695373469', 'Marvel''s Spider-Man', 2017, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Robbie Daymond, Nadji Jeter, Fred Tatasciore, Laura Bailey, Melanie Minichino, Nancy Linari, Patton Oswalt, Scott Menville', 'TV-G', 'An insecure but courageous and intelligent teen named Peter Parker, a new student of Midtown High, is bitten by a radioactive spider and given powers. He becomes a hero named Spider-Man after the death of his uncle and he must adapt to this new way of life.', 'An insecure but courageous and intelligent teen named Peter Parker, a new student of Midtown High, is bitten by a radioactive spider and given powers. He becomes a hero named Spider-Man after the death of his uncle and he must adapt to this new way of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKdcyyHUR5WTMnrbPdYN5y9xPVp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:72705'),
  ('433358974478803087', 'Marvel''s The Defenders', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Douglas Petrie, Marco Ramirez', null, 'Charlie Cox, Krysten Ritter, Mike Colter, Finn Jones, Élodie Yung', 'TV-MA', 'Daredevil, Jessica Jones, Luke Cage and Iron Fist join forces to take on common enemies as a sinister conspiracy threatens New York City.', 'Daredevil, Jessica Jones, Luke Cage and Iron Fist join forces to take on common enemies as a sinister conspiracy threatens New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49XzINhH4LFsgz7cx6TOPcHUJUL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62285'),
  ('18711185022783634', 'Marvel''s The Punisher', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Steve Lightfoot', null, 'Jon Bernthal, Ben Barnes, Amber Rose Revah, Josh Stewart, Jason R. Moore, Floriana Lima, Giorgia Whigham', 'TV-MA', 'A former Marine out to punish the criminals responsible for his family''s murder finds himself ensnared in a military conspiracy.', 'A former Marine out to punish the criminals responsible for his family''s murder finds himself ensnared in a military conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tM6xqRKXoloH9UchaJEyyRE9O1w.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67178'),
