  ('576702797630683903', 'Matchday: Inside FC Barcelona', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Lionel Messi, Gerard Piqué, Luis Suárez, Jordi Alba, Sergio Busquets, Marc-André Ter Stegen, Ernesto Valverde, Arturo Vidal', null, 'Inside FC Barcelona, which follows the famed soccer club through its 2018-2019 season.', 'Inside FC Barcelona, which follows the famed soccer club through its 2018-2019 season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHB3uysBq2hiyDmkYKrH7QqVXAR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95356'),
  ('447438432414730831', 'Matching! Boys Archery', 2016, 'Comedy', null, 'Lee Ah Yeon', 'Baek Chul-Min, Kei, Cha Ji Hoon, Jo Jae-yun, Yong Woo, Kim Chang-hwan, Seo Ji-hoon', null, 'Hong Shi Ah wants to become a successful webtoon artist but is stumped for good material for her comics. When she stumbles upon the Boys Archery Club, she is mesmerized by all the good-looking boys who belong to the club. She decides to join the club as the team manager to find inspiration for her work, only to become entangled with two of its members, Joo Seung Joon and Yoo Ji Wan.', 'Hong Shi Ah wants to become a successful webtoon artist but is stumped for good material for her comics. When she stumbles upon the Boys Archery Club, she is mesmerized by all the good-looking boys who belong to the club. She decides to join the club as the team manager to find inspiration for her work, only to become entangled with two of its members, Joo Seung Joon and Yoo Ji Wan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cR0B5yBOrtzEkquh9L7e4hMNUh8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73141'),
  ('567974281516519744', 'Matchless Raijin-Oh', 1991, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Hideki Sonoda, Fumihiko Shimo, Toshifumi Kawase', 'Rica Matsumoto, Rie Iwatsubo, Mari Maruta, Konami Yoshida, Mami Matsui, Kyōko Minami, Bin Shimada, Saori Sugimoto', null, 'The warrior of light Eldran and his robot Raijin-Oh, get injured in a battle with the Jaku Empire from the 5th-dimensional world. They fall down into the 5th grade class at Hinobori School. On behalf of the damaged Eldran, the “Earth Defense Class” takes up protecting the Earth.', 'The warrior of light Eldran and his robot Raijin-Oh, get injured in a battle with the Jaku Empire from the 5th-dimensional world. They fall down into the 5th grade class at Hinobori School. On behalf of the damaged Eldran, the “Earth Defense Class” takes up protecting the Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6vJwdDKwqFlKa7AlUdKUONUBlN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87166'),
  ('901416360167966138', 'Mate', 2024, 'Drama', 'Chao Planoy', null, 'Ponchanok Theerawan, Budsarin Wonglelanont, Boss Thapanat Athikompokin, Palita Visitsak, Thanaporn Suriyakham, Chawinroj Likitchareonsakul', null, 'Kenlong has always had it all—beauty, wealth, and brains. Perfection is her standard, especially when it comes to love. But her world is turned upside down when she reunites with her childhood friend, Oengoei, an innocent and carefree girl. As their paths intertwine, Kenlong finds herself drawn to Oengoei, leading to a forbidden attraction that challenges her meticulously crafted life.', 'Kenlong has always had it all—beauty, wealth, and brains. Perfection is her standard, especially when it comes to love. But her world is turned upside down when she reunites with her childhood friend, Oengoei, an innocent and carefree girl. As their paths intertwine, Kenlong finds herself drawn to Oengoei, leading to a forbidden attraction that challenges her meticulously crafted life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bu07vXvmdFHREbrn4MOGorw0MXo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:260807'),
  ('502782423957436425', 'Matinee Theater', 1955, 'Drama', null, null, 'John Conte', null, 'Matinee Theater is an American anthology series that aired on NBC during the Golden Age of Television, from 1955 to 1958. The series, which ran daily in the afternoon, was frequently live. It was produced by Albert McCleery, Darrell Ross, George Cahan and Frank Price with executive producer George Lowther. McCleery had previously produced the live series Cameo Theatre which introduced to television the concept of theater-in-the-round, TV plays staged with minimal sets. Jim Buckley of the Pewter Plough Playhouse recalled: When Al McCleery got back to the States, he originated a most ambitious theatrical TV series for NBC called Matinee Theater: to televise five different stage plays per week live, airing around noon in order to promote color TV to the American housewife as she labored over her ironing. Al was the producer. He hired five directors and five art directors. Richard Bennett, one of our first early presidents of the Pewter Plough Corporation, was one of the directors and I was one of the art directors and, as soon as we were through televising one play, we had lunch and then met to plan next week’s show. That was over 50 years ago, and I’m trying to think; I believe the TV art director is his own set decorator —yes, of course! It had to be, since one of McCleery’s chief claims to favor with the producers was his elimination of the setting per se and simply decorating the scene with a minimum of props. It took a bit of ingenuity.', 'Matinee Theater is an American anthology series that aired on NBC during the Golden Age of Television, from 1955 to 1958. The series, which ran daily in the afternoon, was frequently live. It was produced by Albert McCleery, Darrell Ross, George Cahan and Frank Price with executive producer George Lowther. McCleery had previously produced the live series Cameo Theatre which introduced to television the concept of theater-in-the-round, TV plays staged with minimal sets. Jim Buckley of the Pewter Plough Playhouse recalled: When Al McCleery got back to the States, he originated a most ambitious theatrical TV series for NBC called Matinee Theater: to televise five different stage plays per week live, airing around noon in order to promote color TV to the American housewife as she labored over her ironing. Al was the producer. He hired five directors and five art directors. Richard Bennett, one of our first early presidents of the Pewter Plough Corporation, was one of the directors and I was one of the art directors and, as soon as we were through televising one play, we had lunch and then met to plan next week’s show. That was over 50 years ago, and I’m trying to think; I believe the TV art director is his own set decorator —yes, of course! It had to be, since one of McCleery’s chief claims to favor with the producers was his elimination of the setting per se and simply decorating the scene with a minimum of props. It took a bit of ingenuity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sL6FFh0JultfM2K7PJq4iDVu8AL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:13126'),
  ('169297783831184552', 'Matka King', 2026, 'Drama, Crime', 'Nagraj Popatrao Manjule, Abhay Koranne', 'Nagraj Popatrao Manjule, Abhay Koranne', 'Vijay Varma, Sai Tamhankar, Kritika Kamra, Gulshan Grover, Siddharth Jadhav, Bhupendra Jadawat, Bharat Jadhav, Girish Kulkarni', null, 'In this fictional tale set in 1960s Mumbai, an enterprising cotton trader who craves legitimacy and respect, starts a new gambling game dubbed ‘Matka’, that takes the city by storm and democratizes a terrain previously reserved for the rich and elite.', 'In this fictional tale set in 1960s Mumbai, an enterprising cotton trader who craves legitimacy and respect, starts a new gambling game dubbed ‘Matka’, that takes the city by storm and democratizes a terrain previously reserved for the rich and elite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAWIMbCmzVBi86kEOHKjHZCKGyo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249765'),
  ('93055999650610203', 'Matlock', 1986, 'Drama, Crime', 'Dean Hargrove', null, 'Andy Griffith, Daniel Roebuck, Carol Huston', 'TV-PG', 'Matlock is an American television legal drama, starring Andy Griffith in the title role of criminal defense attorney Ben Matlock. The show, produced by The Fred Silverman Company, Dean Hargrove Productions, Viacom Productions and Paramount Television originally aired from September 23, 1986 to May 8, 1992 on NBC; and from November 5, 1992 until May 7, 1995 on ABC. The show''s format is similar to that of CBS''s Perry Mason, with Matlock identifying the perpetrators and then confronting them in dramatic courtroom scenes. One difference, however, was that whereas Mason usually exculpated his clients at a pretrial hearing, Matlock usually secured an acquittal at trial, from the jury.', 'Matlock is an American television legal drama, starring Andy Griffith in the title role of criminal defense attorney Ben Matlock. The show, produced by The Fred Silverman Company, Dean Hargrove Productions, Viacom Productions and Paramount Television originally aired from September 23, 1986 to May 8, 1992 on NBC; and from November 5, 1992 until May 7, 1995 on ABC. The show''s format is similar to that of CBS''s Perry Mason, with Matlock identifying the perpetrators and then confronting them in dramatic courtroom scenes. One difference, however, was that whereas Mason usually exculpated his clients at a pretrial hearing, Matlock usually secured an acquittal at trial, from the jury.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2eGYyekQjcAXVmcYW1g4keR4plV.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:2093'),
  ('242327232067695601', 'Matlock', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jennie Snyder Urman', null, 'Kathy Bates, Skye P. Marshall, Jason Ritter, Leah Lewis, Sam Anderson, Aaron D. Harris', 'TV-14', 'After achieving success in her younger years, the brilliant septuagenarian Madeline Matlock rejoins the workforce at a prestigious law firm where she uses her unassuming demeanor and wily tactics to win cases and expose corruption from within. Inspired by the classic television series of the same name.', 'After achieving success in her younger years, the brilliant septuagenarian Madeline Matlock rejoins the workforce at a prestigious law firm where she uses her unassuming demeanor and wily tactics to win cases and expose corruption from within. Inspired by the classic television series of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kEAVyhalzv4HCAfnLfXUcF3nQZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:226174'),
  ('479370352839247586', 'Matoi the Sacred Slayer', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ayaka Suwa, Naomi Ohzora, Haruka Tomatsu, Hiroki Touchi, Ayako Kawasumi, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Atsushi Abe', 'TV-14', 'Matoi Sumeragi wishes for nothing more than to lead a normal life away from the spotlight. She is quite satisfied alternating between school and her part-time job at her best friend Yuma Kusanagi''s family shrine. But this routine life is permanently disturbed when a Night—an evil extra-dimensional entity—attacks the shrine. Matoi is able to drive it off after unwittingly calling upon the powers of a god, the natural enemies of the Nights. Matoi and Yuma are soon joined by Claris Tonitolus, an experienced exorcist from the Vatican, and agent Haruka Luciela, who works for the secretive Night defense organization IATO. Despite not knowing the perpetrator behind these attacks nor their motive, Matoi must come to master this newfound power in order to protect both the people around her and the once normal life she holds so dear.', 'Matoi Sumeragi wishes for nothing more than to lead a normal life away from the spotlight. She is quite satisfied alternating between school and her part-time job at her best friend Yuma Kusanagi''s family shrine. But this routine life is permanently disturbed when a Night—an evil extra-dimensional entity—attacks the shrine. Matoi is able to drive it off after unwittingly calling upon the powers of a god, the natural enemies of the Nights. Matoi and Yuma are soon joined by Claris Tonitolus, an experienced exorcist from the Vatican, and agent Haruka Luciela, who works for the secretive Night defense organization IATO. Despite not knowing the perpetrator behind these attacks nor their motive, Matoi must come to master this newfound power in order to protect both the people around her and the once normal life she holds so dear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwwk7C4y4mQh5QSbMR6YBYpvd1r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68402'),
  ('50299517562957262', 'Matrimonial Chaos', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Eita Nagayama, Machiko Ono, Yoko Maki, Go Ayano, Kaoru Yachigusa, Miwako Ichikawa, Satoru Matsuo, Yuriko Ono', null, 'Ordinary salaryman Hamasaki Mitsuo works for a company which installs vending machines. He complains about his marriage life while at the dentist office. Mitsuo isn''t happy at all with his marriage with his wife, Hoshino Yuka, who has the complete opposite personality from him. He doesn''t know if he loves Yuka or not. At this time, Mitsuo meets Kono Akari, his ex-girlfriend from his university days, who is now married to Uehara Ryo.', 'Ordinary salaryman Hamasaki Mitsuo works for a company which installs vending machines. He complains about his marriage life while at the dentist office. Mitsuo isn''t happy at all with his marriage with his wife, Hoshino Yuka, who has the complete opposite personality from him. He doesn''t know if he loves Yuka or not. At this time, Mitsuo meets Kono Akari, his ex-girlfriend from his university days, who is now married to Uehara Ryo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ymtS20jigLrGETCDMT2zNDZtNL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50111'),
  ('312772954346891228', 'Matt Helm', 1975, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Donald Hamilton, Sam Rolfe', null, 'Anthony Franciosa, Gene Evans, Laraine Stephens', null, 'Matt Helm is an American mystery television series which aired on the ABC Network during the 1975-1976 season. The title character was played by Anthony Franciosa.', 'Matt Helm is an American mystery television series which aired on the ABC Network during the 1975-1976 season. The title character was played by Anthony Franciosa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOaZA1jZbejG3tIV9M82ojw8Esw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2338'),
  ('780603505170496584', 'Matt Houston', 1982, 'Drama', 'Lawrence Gordon', null, 'Lee Horsley, Pamela Hensley, Lincoln Kilpatrick, Buddy Ebsen', null, 'Matt Houston is an American crime drama series that aired on ABC from 1982 to 1985. Created by Lawrence Gordon, the series was produced by Aaron Spelling.', 'Matt Houston is an American crime drama series that aired on ABC from 1982 to 1985. Created by Lawrence Gordon, the series was produced by Aaron Spelling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Z7mPPey5QWueCrdgvjjAdElKn2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10365'),
  ('12833538755040212', 'Matter of Respect', 2014, 'Family, Drama', 'Berkun Oya, Nuran Evren Şit', 'Hasan Cömert, Teodosio Losito', 'Kerem Bürsin, Şükrü Özyıldız, Yasemin Kay Allen, Şükran Ovalı, Burcu Biricik, Alma Terzić, Uğur Uzunel, Ece İrtem', 'NR', 'Ayvalik is brought into play by the mob from a family who came to Istanbul. Yigit''s father committed suicide because of the mob.', 'Ayvalik is brought into play by the mob from a family who came to Istanbul. Yigit''s father committed suicide because of the mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7o1cYAABDFuHWf7GXNHtUV8M6t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107075'),
  ('180078347910427393', 'Maude', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Norman Lear', null, 'Bea Arthur, Bill Macy, Adrienne Barbeau, Rue McClanahan, Conrad Bain', 'TV-PG', 'Well-educated and upper middle class, Maude Findlay is the archetypal feminist of her generation. She lives in suburban Tuckahoe, New York, with her fourth husband, Walter, their divorced daughter, Carol, and grandson Phillip.', 'Well-educated and upper middle class, Maude Findlay is the archetypal feminist of her generation. She lives in suburban Tuckahoe, New York, with her fourth husband, Walter, their divorced daughter, Carol, and grandson Phillip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhMiyho8wYrHz8mv4Nvqpm0Ml6a.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:2184'),
  ('73227964621090438', 'Maury', 1991, 'Talk', 'Maury Povich', null, 'Maury Povich', 'TV-PG', 'Veteran TV journalist Maury Povich tackles volatile issues with his guests and studio audience on this daily, hourlong talk show.', 'Veteran TV journalist Maury Povich tackles volatile issues with his guests and studio audience on this daily, hourlong talk show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYLXRiNi1TClZmXQPcZ5mDnpc0T.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:385'),
  ('980556828285050165', 'Maverick', 1957, 'Comedy, Western', 'Roy Huggins', null, 'Jack Kelly', 'TV-PG', 'The Maverick boys - Bret, Bart, Beau and Brent - are a clan of well-dressed dandies, gamblers who''d much rather make their money playing cards than messing up their fine clothing with actual work. Sly and clever, none of the Mavericks are much for acts of derring do, but they can be courageous when the situation calls for it. Most often, however, they live by their wits and considerable charm.', 'The Maverick boys - Bret, Bart, Beau and Brent - are a clan of well-dressed dandies, gamblers who''d much rather make their money playing cards than messing up their fine clothing with actual work. Sly and clever, none of the Mavericks are much for acts of derring do, but they can be courageous when the situation calls for it. Most often, however, they live by their wits and considerable charm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psVbZjMHt9f9X7EIks9IQdCMZke.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:953'),
  ('1023112320130149663', 'MaveriX', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Rachel Clements, Sam Meikle, Isaac Elliott', null, 'Darcy Tadich, Tatiana Goode, Sam Winspear-Schillings, Tjiirdm McGuire, Sebastian Tang, Charlotte Maggi', null, 'Six young motocross riders come together to form a team, to make the national titles, or crash out trying. But the biggest win of all might be the friends they make for life.', 'Six young motocross riders come together to form a team, to make the national titles, or crash out trying. But the biggest win of all might be the friends they make for life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kb6NH1HXMBoSprurYr6ftRJjZ3p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196556'),
  ('811892649771371225', 'Max & Maple: The Can-Do Kids', 2025, 'Animation, Family', null, 'Peter Hannan, Liz Hara, Christie Insley', 'Risa Mei, Kelsey Jaffer, Chris Okawa, Finty Kelly, Dave Droxler', null, 'Sibling duo Max and Maple spend their days adventuring with their dependable red wagon and its magical little Wheelios in the yard behind Grandpa Tony’s Fix-It Shop.', 'Sibling duo Max and Maple spend their days adventuring with their dependable red wagon and its magical little Wheelios in the yard behind Grandpa Tony’s Fix-It Shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Num7xMwjq8l7ihpV8pyVRQ0VTY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:305963'),
  ('758310882988101404', 'Max & Ruby', 2002, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy', 'Rosemary Wells', null, 'Kay Hawtrey, Gavin MacIver-Wright, Lana Carillo, Isabella Leo, Nicholas Fry, Julie Lemieux, Loretta Jafelice, Linda Ballantyne', 'TV-Y', 'Meet two funny bunny siblings, the energetic and mischievous Max, and the patient, smart and goal-oriented Ruby. The show models empowering messages by showing Max and Ruby playing together and resolving their differences respectfully and supportively.', 'Meet two funny bunny siblings, the energetic and mischievous Max, and the patient, smart and goal-oriented Ruby. The show models empowering messages by showing Max and Ruby playing together and resolving their differences respectfully and supportively.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIiWnjewlhINR1bv1sRfBiIEn9a.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:11982'),
  ('667909257991082165', 'Max and Paddy''s Road to Nowhere', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Peter Kay', null, 'Peter Kay, Paddy McGuinness', null, 'Max And Paddy''s Road To Nowhere is the much-loved sequel to Peter Kay''s critically-acclaimed comedy series, "Phoenix Nights". Written by and starring Peter Kay and Patrick McGuinness, this six-part comedy/drama series is the story of clueless Phoenix Club bouncers Max (Kay) and Paddy (McGuinness), as they escape clubland in their prized motor-home and take to the open highway.', 'Max And Paddy''s Road To Nowhere is the much-loved sequel to Peter Kay''s critically-acclaimed comedy series, "Phoenix Nights". Written by and starring Peter Kay and Patrick McGuinness, this six-part comedy/drama series is the story of clueless Phoenix Club bouncers Max (Kay) and Paddy (McGuinness), as they escape clubland in their prized motor-home and take to the open highway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lenZvwj3gCXl4GDZlxTzWi5L4f1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2491'),
  ('1020770209731073028', 'Max Headroom', 1987, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Annabel Jankel, Rocky Morton', null, 'Matt Frewer, Chris Young, Jeffrey Tambor, William Morgan Sheppard, Concetta Tomei, Amanda Pays, George Coe, Lee Wilkof', 'TV-PG', 'Television networks battle one another in an unrelenting ratings war. Whoever controls the airwaves controls the dystopic world in which they broadcast. So when Network 23''s star reporter, Edison Carter, uncovers a deadly secret that could shake up the station''s dominion over its viewers, the only option is to eliminate Carter before he can make his story public. After Carter''s "accident," his mind is uploaded to create the world''s first self-aware, computer-generated TV host — Max Headroom! But will Max bow to his creators? Or will he be the key to his human alter ago bringing down a network superpower?', 'Television networks battle one another in an unrelenting ratings war. Whoever controls the airwaves controls the dystopic world in which they broadcast. So when Network 23''s star reporter, Edison Carter, uncovers a deadly secret that could shake up the station''s dominion over its viewers, the only option is to eliminate Carter before he can make his story public. After Carter''s "accident," his mind is uploaded to create the world''s first self-aware, computer-generated TV host — Max Headroom! But will Max bow to his creators? Or will he be the key to his human alter ago bringing down a network superpower?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXuXeYuv80WJJ9zvA756WCfK1KD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4617'),
  ('82003675624027178', 'Max Steel', 2000, 'Animation', 'Greg Weisman, Jeff Kline', null, 'Jacob Vargas, Debi Mae West, Christian Campbell, Martin Jarvis, Shannon Kenny', null, 'A teenage boy with accidental body enhancements fights the enemies of peace as a super-powered secret agent.', 'A teenage boy with accidental body enhancements fights the enemies of peace as a super-powered secret agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thDuNE7KmVowSK2U8JVAEa387sH.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:5283'),
  ('199566017307200100', 'Max Steel', 2013, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Len Wiseman', null, 'Andrew Francis, Sam Vincent, Michael Dobson, Brian Dobson, Brian Drummond, Lee Tockar, Richard Ian Cox, Giles Panton', 'TV-Y7', 'Max Steel is a science fiction–comedy, CGI–animated series. It is a re-imagining of its predecessor of the same name, as well as being based on the Mattel action-figure also of the same name. Max Steel premiered on March 25, 2013 on Disney XD.', 'Max Steel is a science fiction–comedy, CGI–animated series. It is a re-imagining of its predecessor of the same name, as well as being based on the Mattel action-figure also of the same name. Max Steel premiered on March 25, 2013 on Disney XD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuLkBrqnA5hzGkRoSN4lbVbXK0x.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46974'),
  ('572256729006275051', 'Máxima', 2024, 'Drama', 'Marcia Luyten', null, 'Delfina Chaves, Martijn Lakemeier', null, 'From the moment Máxima Zorreguieta appears at the Dutch crown prince’s side, she finds herself in the spotlight. When Willem-Alexander asks her to marry him, the past catches up with her. Heated discussion erupts about her father’s political career in the Videla regime – a discussion she never faced in her own circles. What allows this Argentine to finally thrive at an old European court? And how can Máxima stay true to herself without giving up her family – or do these things not go together?', 'From the moment Máxima Zorreguieta appears at the Dutch crown prince’s side, she finds herself in the spotlight. When Willem-Alexander asks her to marry him, the past catches up with her. Heated discussion erupts about her father’s political career in the Videla regime – a discussion she never faced in her own circles. What allows this Argentine to finally thrive at an old European court? And how can Máxima stay true to herself without giving up her family – or do these things not go together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8nhNXY2SPfrsNO0zXyUCm9ILA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:241889'),
  ('1125930874325297522', 'Maximilian and Marie De Bourgogne', 2017, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Martin Ambrosch', 'Stefan Pohl, Christa Théret, André Penvern, Björn Freiberg, Jannis Niewöhner, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Martin Wuttke, Fritz Karl', null, 'Known as The Last Knight for his bravery and battle skills, the great European emperor Maximilian and his story is as spectacular as it is familiar: It is the story of a prince who must learn to be king. But above all, it is the struggle of a son who steps out of his father''s shadow with the help of a most unexpected ally: Marie de Bourgogne.', 'Known as The Last Knight for his bravery and battle skills, the great European emperor Maximilian and his story is as spectacular as it is familiar: It is the story of a prince who must learn to be king. But above all, it is the struggle of a son who steps out of his father''s shadow with the help of a most unexpected ally: Marie de Bourgogne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nz2jRroBZaNPmtHAqiwcmsdE3B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70541'),
  ('683541092933110143', 'Maxton Hall – The World Between Us', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'When Ruby unwittingly witnesses an explosive secret at Maxton Hall private school, the arrogant millionaire heir James Beaufort has to deal with the quick-witted scholarship student for better or worse: He is determined to silence Ruby. Their passionate exchange of words unexpectedly ignites a spark...', 'When Ruby unwittingly witnesses an explosive secret at Maxton Hall private school, the arrogant millionaire heir James Beaufort has to deal with the quick-witted scholarship student for better or worse: He is determined to silence Ruby. Their passionate exchange of words unexpectedly ignites a spark...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slKAbvY2CjAIyJFqoLSh1WICzg6.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:250670'),
  ('851968586214032728', 'May December Love', 2014, 'Family, Drama', null, null, 'Wang Zhiwen, Li Xiaoran, Yu Feihong, Han Tongsheng, Yang Le, Guan Xiaotong, Xu Di, Tian Yu', null, 'Two sisters, Gu Xiaojun and Gu Xiaoyan, face love, family drama, and personal challenges — from disapproving parents and chaotic reunions to workplace conflicts.', 'Two sisters, Gu Xiaojun and Gu Xiaoyan, face love, family drama, and personal challenges — from disapproving parents and chaotic reunions to workplace conflicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDxcfrD61ubHoeb8NBb7YyHCQOZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78646'),
  ('995982945574684107', 'May I Ask for One Final Thing?', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Asami Seto, Wataru Katoh, Shoya Ishige, Miyu Tomita, Kazuki Ura, Taito Ban, Ai Kakuma, Sally Amaki', 'TV-14', 'In the middle of a ball, Scarlet''s fiancé, Kyle, suddenly calls off their engagement. She''s falsely accused of being a bully and people unfairly call her a "Villainess." The aristocrats and noble families all denounce her. For years, she had to put up with his abuse and idiocy, but she can''t take anymore of it! At her wit''s end, she asks for one last favor; to give him a good fist in the face. So begins Scarlet''s story of revenge against Kyle and his cronies! A fantasy about an elegant yet rebellious fighter, who doesn''t let anyone take advantage of her!!', 'In the middle of a ball, Scarlet''s fiancé, Kyle, suddenly calls off their engagement. She''s falsely accused of being a bully and people unfairly call her a "Villainess." The aristocrats and noble families all denounce her. For years, she had to put up with his abuse and idiocy, but she can''t take anymore of it! At her wit''s end, she asks for one last favor; to give him a good fist in the face. So begins Scarlet''s story of revenge against Kyle and his cronies! A fantasy about an elegant yet rebellious fighter, who doesn''t let anyone take advantage of her!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WUSl1NP5I66IGiI6n9BwOzZTbY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271605'),
  ('10366629528942528', 'May I Help You?', 2022, 'Drama', 'Lee Seon-Hye', 'Lee Seon-Hye', 'Lee Hye-ri, Lee Jun-young, Song Duk-ho, Han Dong-hee, Tae In-ho, Lee Kyu-han, Oh Dae-hwan, Seo Hye-won', null, 'Baek Dong Joo, a newly hired funeral director, has the uncanny gift, or curse, to momentarily resurrect and talk to the recently deceased. She has to grant their last wishes or have her days be filled with a series of bad luck and accidents. And helping the little boy that first terrified her when he came to life will lead her down a path she never could have expected. Kim Tae Hee works as a man for hire. Employed by his uncle Vincent running the newly opened errand service company “A Dime A Job” he can be hired for any odd (but legal) task. One day, Kim Tae Hee encounters Baek Dong Joo, when he is hired by her boyfriend to break up with her in his stead. After that, their paths continue to cross, and by the virtue of their jobs, their fates get intertwined deeper and deeper in a series of life and death situations, surrounding the wishes of the people who had died, and the painful past it is going to unravel for both of them.', 'Baek Dong Joo, a newly hired funeral director, has the uncanny gift, or curse, to momentarily resurrect and talk to the recently deceased. She has to grant their last wishes or have her days be filled with a series of bad luck and accidents. And helping the little boy that first terrified her when he came to life will lead her down a path she never could have expected. Kim Tae Hee works as a man for hire. Employed by his uncle Vincent running the newly opened errand service company “A Dime A Job” he can be hired for any odd (but legal) task. One day, Kim Tae Hee encounters Baek Dong Joo, when he is hired by her boyfriend to break up with her in his stead. After that, their paths continue to cross, and by the virtue of their jobs, their fates get intertwined deeper and deeper in a series of life and death situations, surrounding the wishes of the people who had died, and the painful past it is going to unravel for both of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5raBam3P9PypmcNsK7RDgyC5wAm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209275'),
  ('1037190940711806505', 'May It Please the Court', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Kim Dan', 'Jung Ryeo-won, Lee Kyoo-hyung, Jung Jin-young, Kim Hye-eun, Kim Sang-ho, Park So-jin, Ko Kyu-pil, Hong Seo-jun', null, 'Noh Chak-hee, the ace lawyer of the big law firm, Jangsan, becomes a public defender overnight and must defend the criminal who killed her loved one.', 'Noh Chak-hee, the ace lawyer of the big law firm, Jangsan, becomes a public defender overnight and must defend the criminal who killed her loved one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ma4Nexq6LGfCPeCHRaXQwJWilXQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200945'),
  ('633789918430889136', 'May Queen', 2012, 'Drama', null, 'Son Young-Mok', 'Han Ji-hye, Kim Jae-won, Jae Hee, Son Eun-seo, Ahn Nae-sang, Geum Bo-ra, Lee Duck-hwa, Yang Mi-kyung', null, 'A woman overcomes the hardships in her life and experiences growth as an expert of the seas.', 'A woman overcomes the hardships in her life and experiences growth as an expert of the seas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAMPszZhQzzOuUswplqhaB6Obqk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:53727'),
  ('789846444933672951', 'Maya & Marty', 2016, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Maya Rudolph, Martin Short, Kenan Thompson', 'TV-14', 'Within comedy circles, Maya Rudolph and Martin Short are considered two of the best sketch performers in the business. This series will feature sketches that spoof current events, celebrities and topical trends, as well as musical performances.', 'Within comedy circles, Maya Rudolph and Martin Short are considered two of the best sketch performers in the business. This series will feature sketches that spoof current events, celebrities and topical trends, as well as musical performances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6wbOsArJoWoEukj1tdS4zuQ3Py.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66623'),
  ('932578428772315825', 'Maya and the Three', 2021, 'Animation, Family, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids', 'Jorge R. Gutierrez', null, 'Zoe Saldaña, Jorge R. Gutierrez, Sandra Equihua, Dee Bradley Baker, Diego Luna, Gael García Bernal, Allen Maldonado, Stephanie Beatriz', 'TV-Y7', 'A spirited princess with the heart of a warrior embarks on a mission to fulfill an ancient prophecy and save humanity from the wrath of vengeful gods.', 'A spirited princess with the heart of a warrior embarks on a mission to fulfill an ancient prophecy and save humanity from the wrath of vengeful gods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUBixNeHU0cbSUH7JMktl9OMEMV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132141'),
  ('916156908707009080', 'Maya the Bee', 1975, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Michiko Nomura', 'TV-Y', 'The adventures of a young and happy bee who is sent by her queen to search for pollen, and in doing so she finds a new world that surrounds her, making friends with various forest creatures.', 'The adventures of a young and happy bee who is sent by her queen to search for pollen, and in doing so she finds a new world that surrounds her, making friends with various forest creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aViIrap16cmxz6dbBwI9JCremrD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10620'),
  ('539527250061394227', 'Maya the Bee', 2013, 'Animation, Kids', 'Fin Edquist, Martin Quaden, Alexs Stadermann', null, 'Zalina Sanchez, Hans-Jürgen Dittberner, Ben Hadad, Sonja Deutsch, Lukas Till Berglund, Axel Lutter, Klaus-Dieter Klebsch, Gerd Meyer', 'TV-Y', 'Hello everyone, I''m Maya the Bee! What do I love? Freedom! That''s why I live in the meadow instead of the hive. I have a thousand and one adventures with my friends: Shelby snail, Max the worm ... and of course Willy! Willy is very lazy and greedy ... But he''s my best friend. Together, we go on an many adventures! Let''s go!', 'Hello everyone, I''m Maya the Bee! What do I love? Freedom! That''s why I live in the meadow instead of the hive. I have a thousand and one adventures with my friends: Shelby snail, Max the worm ... and of course Willy! Willy is very lazy and greedy ... But he''s my best friend. Together, we go on an many adventures! Let''s go!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBl8YASck7z2PWgCWHXRBuWyvCU.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61740'),
  ('516574362491935599', 'Mayans M.C.', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kurt Sutter, Elgin James', null, 'J. D. Pardo, Clayton Cardenas, Edward James Olmos, Sarah Bolger, Michael Irby, Antonio Jaramillo, Danny Pino, Carla Baratta', 'TV-MA', 'Set in the aftermath of Jax Teller’s death, Ezekiel "EZ" Reyes is fresh out of prison and a prospect in the Mayans M.C. charter on the Cali/Mexi border. Now, EZ must carve out his new identity in a town where he was once the golden boy with the American Dream in his grasp.', 'Set in the aftermath of Jax Teller’s death, Ezekiel "EZ" Reyes is fresh out of prison and a prospect in the Mayans M.C. charter on the Cali/Mexi border. Now, EZ must carve out his new identity in a town where he was once the golden boy with the American Dream in his grasp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/510A0upV9WRAynEgs1E2B3eBxi5.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:76231'),
