  ('372136856426273308', 'MeatEater', 2012, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Steven Rinella', 'TV-14', 'Hunter, author, cook and conservationist Steven Rinella treks into the world''s most remote, beautiful regions, bringing game meat from field to table.', 'Hunter, author, cook and conservationist Steven Rinella treks into the world''s most remote, beautiful regions, bringing game meat from field to table.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIBlBmYupUT8n5jyiGyuh3EDmDq.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:46504'),
  ('1128281726001783854', 'Mech Cadets', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Aaron Lam, Eileen Shim', null, 'Brandon Soo Hoo, Aparna Brielle, Anairis Quinones, Victoria Grace, Josh Sundquist, Daniel Dae Kim, James Yaegashi, Scott Whyte', 'TV-Y7', 'An underdog teen joins a group of young Cadets who''ve been chosen to bond with Robo Mechs from space and defend Earth against alien invaders.', 'An underdog teen joins a group of young Cadets who''ve been chosen to bond with Robo Mechs from space and defend Earth against alien invaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5awFqxnqJHQD0TQCasf8VjAWqTb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205214'),
  ('122137675150876665', 'MECH-X4', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Steve Marmel', null, 'Nathaniel J. Potvin, Kamran Lucas, Raymond Cham Jr., Alyssa Jirrels, Pearce Joza', 'TV-Y7', 'Ryan Walker mysteriously awakens MECH-X4, a giant robot built to defend Bay City against impending doom. When monsters begin to descend, Ryan recruits his two best friends and his brother to help pilot the robot that is their only hope of saving their town from mass destruction.', 'Ryan Walker mysteriously awakens MECH-X4, a giant robot built to defend Bay City against impending doom. When monsters begin to descend, Ryan recruits his two best friends and his brother to help pilot the robot that is their only hope of saving their town from mass destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b031Y3PuzK8gZBRrfQ97lFN84F4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68654'),
  ('764822010994793937', 'Mecha-Ude: Mechanical Arms', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Tomokazu Sugita, Yu Shimamura, Romi Park, Yuichi Nakamura, Kaito Ishikawa, Amatsuki, Hiroki Touchi', null, 'Hikaru’s ordinary middle school life takes a thrilling turn when he encounters Alma, an alien entity resembling a mechanized limb called Mecha-Ude. Alma, a member of a rare species, is fleeing from a sinister group hunting their kind down in search of one possessing unparalleled power. Tasked by the resistance group ARMS, this unlikely duo will embark on a perilous journey to save the Mecha-Ude.', 'Hikaru’s ordinary middle school life takes a thrilling turn when he encounters Alma, an alien entity resembling a mechanized limb called Mecha-Ude. Alma, a member of a rare species, is fleeing from a sinister group hunting their kind down in search of one possessing unparalleled power. Tasked by the resistance group ARMS, this unlikely duo will embark on a perilous journey to save the Mecha-Ude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uryb30IYNtFCovDWKMvr8reFJu2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210355'),
  ('589977984677764315', 'Mechanical Marie', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nao Toyama, Haruki Ishiya, Chiaki Kobayashi, Yuuichirou Umehara, Ami Koshimizu, Daishi Kajita, Saima Nakano, You Taichi', 'TV-14', 'Former martial arts legend Marie has accepted a new job as a “mechanical maid”… except she’s 100% human, and Arthur, her new boss, despises humans. Luckily, Marie’s naturally expressionless face helps her keep up the robot act while secretly protecting Arthur from constant assassination attempts. But when Arthur falls in love with his “perfect” maid, things quickly spiral out of control!', 'Former martial arts legend Marie has accepted a new job as a “mechanical maid”… except she’s 100% human, and Arthur, her new boss, despises humans. Luckily, Marie’s naturally expressionless face helps her keep up the robot act while secretly protecting Arthur from constant assassination attempts. But when Arthur falls in love with his “perfect” maid, things quickly spiral out of control!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vsH56qFI4GEjeIPcIFIBEF6aaT9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287278'),
  ('889341900127144409', 'Medabots', 1999, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Michiru Yamazaki, Junko Takeuchi, Eri Sendai, Masami Suzuki', 'TV-Y7', 'Set in the near future, Medabots revolves around the super charged battling adventures of a group of kids and their pet robots. Fueled with artificial intelligence and a specialized arsenal of high powered weapons, Medabots compete against each other in exciting Robattles, with the winners acquiring Medaparts from the defeated Medabot. With over 370 unique robots ready to Robattle, Medabots is filled with explosive adventures in a world where kids have the ultimate power. But more than anything else, these challenges are about courage and mind power, where the soul of the Medafighter and Medabot combine to emerge victorious.', 'Set in the near future, Medabots revolves around the super charged battling adventures of a group of kids and their pet robots. Fueled with artificial intelligence and a specialized arsenal of high powered weapons, Medabots compete against each other in exciting Robattles, with the winners acquiring Medaparts from the defeated Medabot. With over 370 unique robots ready to Robattle, Medabots is filled with explosive adventures in a world where kids have the ultimate power. But more than anything else, these challenges are about courage and mind power, where the soul of the Medafighter and Medabot combine to emerge victorious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4bQto8Jsphbd0VxLKcvqDQS0Mj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11235'),
  ('1059369144414313081', 'Medaka Box', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Aki Toyosaki, Yuki Ono, Daisuke Namikawa, Ai Kayano, Emiri Kato, Minako Kotobuki, Romi Park, Kiyoshi Katsunuma', 'TV-14', 'Kurokami Medaka is an exceptional first year student at Hanokiwa Academy who got elected as president of the student council with a smashing 98% of the votes. Extremely intelligent, strong, and rich; she wants to help anyone in need. To do that, she introduces a suggestion box that allows any student to contact her. Later known as the Medaka Box, it will bring forth incredible challenges to Kurokami and her friends of the student council.', 'Kurokami Medaka is an exceptional first year student at Hanokiwa Academy who got elected as president of the student council with a smashing 98% of the votes. Extremely intelligent, strong, and rich; she wants to help anyone in need. To do that, she introduces a suggestion box that allows any student to contact her. Later known as the Medaka Box, it will bring forth incredible challenges to Kurokami and her friends of the student council.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7W0wmXZa8ZOgawGXvHD3Gv1vVQ6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45858'),
  ('1144803279118335657', 'Medaka Kuroiwa Is Impervious to My Charms', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ryota Iwasaki, Yu Serizawa, Sora Amamiya, Kana Hanazawa, Hinaki Yano, Kaori Maeda, Tasuku Hatanaka, Daiki Yamashita', 'TV-14', 'For Mona Kawai, winning hearts and turning heads comes naturally. Everything changes when Medaka Kuroiwa, a new transfer student, arrives. He won’t even give Mona a second look, and it turns her life upside down! Mona tries everything she can to win Medaka over, even going to the extreme at times. Tune in to a new rom-com about a queen bee and an unfazed boy among the school’s halls.', 'For Mona Kawai, winning hearts and turning heads comes naturally. Everything changes when Medaka Kuroiwa, a new transfer student, arrives. He won’t even give Mona a second look, and it turns her life upside down! Mona tries everything she can to win Medaka over, even going to the extreme at times. Tune in to a new rom-com about a queen bee and an unfazed boy among the school’s halls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cjNjEYJVqj0nTeuZlMv8IUvI65.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:258994'),
  ('626238388286440950', 'Medal of Honor', 2018, 'Documentary', null, 'Lorna Graham', 'Josh Charles', 'TV-MA', 'Honoring service members whose courage merited the awarding of a Medal of Honor, this docudrama series re-creates their inspiring true stories.', 'Honoring service members whose courage merited the awarding of a Medal of Honor, this docudrama series re-creates their inspiring true stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljXTw77h4IENaB228rimG1NV3n8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83109'),
  ('48337902334911365', 'Medal of the Republic', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'An anthology about the lives of eight legendary figures in China: Yu Min, Shen Jilan, Sun Jiadong, Li Yannian, Zhang Fuqing, Yuan Longping, Huang Xuhua, and Tu Youyou.', 'An anthology about the lives of eight legendary figures in China: Yu Min, Shen Jilan, Sun Jiadong, Li Yannian, Zhang Fuqing, Yuan Longping, Huang Xuhua, and Tu Youyou.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8U8SYW0lCaNaIpECt3vlTGEspGW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134983'),
  ('407311494520450690', 'Medalist', 2025, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Natsumi Haruse, Takeo Otsuka', 'TV-14', 'Tsukasa Akeuraji, a frustrated skater, meets Inori Yuitsuka, a girl who yearns to be a figure skater. Motivated by Inori''s obsession on the rink, Tsukasa begins coaching Inori. Inori''s talent blossoms, and Tsukasa becomes a brilliant mentor. Together they aim to make her a glorious medalist!', 'Tsukasa Akeuraji, a frustrated skater, meets Inori Yuitsuka, a girl who yearns to be a figure skater. Motivated by Inori''s obsession on the rink, Tsukasa begins coaching Inori. Inori''s talent blossoms, and Tsukasa becomes a brilliant mentor. Together they aim to make her a glorious medalist!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hK5eKFaj99mZwpmILnvKehWe9t1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:237529'),
  ('1020215843300543641', 'Medcezir', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ece Yörenç', 'Melek Gençoğlu, Ece Yörenç', 'Çağatay Ulusoy, Serenay Sarıkaya, Metin Akdülger, Taner Ölmez, Hazar Ergüçlü, Barış Falay, Şebnem Dönmez, Murat Aygen', null, 'Yaman, who lives in the suburb of Tozludere (Istanbul), is arrested and put in jail with his brother because his brother decided to steal a car at a petrol station. Until that day he tried to change his destiny by working hard to earn a good life. That evening he was unwillingly introduced to crime and his clean dossier was tainted. He meets a rich lawyer, Selim Serez.', 'Yaman, who lives in the suburb of Tozludere (Istanbul), is arrested and put in jail with his brother because his brother decided to steal a car at a petrol station. Until that day he tried to change his destiny by working hard to earn a good life. That evening he was unwillingly introduced to crime and his clean dossier was tainted. He meets a rich lawyer, Selim Serez.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQw5nPY0Z0ZGN0yatzPwmdzNTQ7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61867'),
  ('411449949759615231', 'Medianoche en Asia: Comer · Bailar · Soñar', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Night brings out the most playful side of Asia''s metropolises. This docuseries captures the food, drink, music — and night owls who shine in the dark.', 'Night brings out the most playful side of Asia''s metropolises. This docuseries captures the food, drink, music — and night owls who shine in the dark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qLYkhY5AWev0bWUXvWDYNQ0LLh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155618'),
  ('1074250083073417270', 'Mediator', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Artyom Aksenenko, Anna Kozlova', null, 'Andrey Burkovskiy, Irina Starshenbaum, Anna Kamenkova, Sofia Lebedeva, Vladislav Tsenev, Elizaveta Goncharenko, Kristina Korbut, Pavel Savinkov', null, 'Andrey is a professional negotiator. When people can''t agree, he helps them to — for a lot of money. For each dispute, he changes himself beyond recognition. Andrey can convince anyone of anything, anytime and anywhere, but he seems to have a hard time accepting his own self. This twisted psychological thriller tests the limits of how far people can go to get what they want. Cruel, dark, and shockingly manipulative, Andrey proves to be extremely efficient. But is it all worth it in the end? And what is the real cost of his abilities?', 'Andrey is a professional negotiator. When people can''t agree, he helps them to — for a lot of money. For each dispute, he changes himself beyond recognition. Andrey can convince anyone of anything, anytime and anywhere, but he seems to have a hard time accepting his own self. This twisted psychological thriller tests the limits of how far people can go to get what they want. Cruel, dark, and shockingly manipulative, Andrey proves to be extremely efficient. But is it all worth it in the end? And what is the real cost of his abilities?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10XqG3RLo4C54AmDyCzGGcdoDHi.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:124185'),
