  ('995084105695675892', 'Medina: The Celebrity Scammer', 2024, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Jorge Ponce, Javier Valera', null, 'Jorge Ponce, Andreu Buenafuente, Miguel Rellán, Carlos Areces, Berto Romero, Kira Miró, Joaquín Reyes, Borja González Santaolalla', null, 'Jorge Ponce sets out to try and discover the identity of "Medina," a mysterious character who has spent the last 20 years scamming dozens of TV personalities by pretending to be a former colleague with a personal drama.', 'Jorge Ponce sets out to try and discover the identity of "Medina," a mysterious character who has spent the last 20 years scamming dozens of TV personalities by pretending to be a former colleague with a personal drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WbFQd0lcsDXa7lsUcVyItBc5hz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259425'),
  ('926619168697421576', 'Medium', 2005, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Glenn Gordon Caron', 'Jacob Cooney', 'Patricia Arquette, Jake Weber, Miguel Sandoval, David Cubitt, Sofia Vassilieva, Feodor Lark', 'TV-14', 'Allison Dubois works in the District Attorney’s office using her natural intuition about people and her ability to communicate with the dead to help to solve crimes. Her dreams often give her clues to the whereabouts of missing people.', 'Allison Dubois works in the District Attorney’s office using her natural intuition about people and her ability to communicate with the dead to help to solve crimes. Her dreams often give her clues to the whereabouts of missing people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tOxspW2MbbAQ0s3jtfs8QATcx.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:36'),
  ('248033235085064867', 'Medium Detective Hisui Jozuka', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Kaya Kiyohara, Koji Seto, Fuka Koshiba, Mitsuhiro Oikawa, Michiko Tanaka', null, 'Hisui Jozuka can “see” the culprits with her clairvoyance, but this won’t hold up as evidence. Just how will she solve complex cases? “I have the ability to know the truth, but why am I so useless?” Hisui, with her green eyes, is in anguish. As a medium, she can trace down culprits with her special gift of clairvoyance, but this won’t hold up as evidence. What must she do to get the police to investigate? Will they manage to catch the perpetrator? This is a unique detective drama series that features a psychic detective who goes face to face with criminals.', 'Hisui Jozuka can “see” the culprits with her clairvoyance, but this won’t hold up as evidence. Just how will she solve complex cases? “I have the ability to know the truth, but why am I so useless?” Hisui, with her green eyes, is in anguish. As a medium, she can trace down culprits with her special gift of clairvoyance, but this won’t hold up as evidence. What must she do to get the police to investigate? Will they manage to catch the perpetrator? This is a unique detective drama series that features a psychic detective who goes face to face with criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onA2BQKzJ1IYm3qvjIhEXRo7lK7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209846'),
  ('124163937489103000', 'Medusa', 2025, 'Drama', 'Said Chamie, Claudia Sánchez', null, 'Juana Acosta, Manolo Cardona, Sebastián Martínez, Mariana Mozo, Carlos Torres, Mabel Moreno, Diego Trujillo, Juanita Molina', 'TV-MA', 'Somebody wants to kill CEO Bárbara Hidalgo. Can she find the culprit as her family schemes ruthlessly for control of their Colombian business empire?', 'Somebody wants to kill CEO Bárbara Hidalgo. Can she find the culprit as her family schemes ruthlessly for control of their Colombian business empire?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFsjwJdNBKDRYLqPdBFaoVCKXLq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:284792'),
  ('6889632214678064', 'Meerkat Manor', 2005, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Caroline Hawkins', null, 'Bill Nighy, Stockard Channing, Sean Astin', null, 'Meerkat Manor is a British television programme produced by Oxford Scientific Films for Animal Planet International that premiered in September 2005 and ran for four series until its cancellation in August 2008. Blending more traditional animal documentary style footage with dramatic narration, the series told the story of the Whiskers, one of more than a dozen families of meerkats in the Kalahari Desert being studied as part of the Kalahari Meerkat Project, a long-term field study into the ecological causes and evolutionary consequences of the cooperative nature of meerkats. The original programme was narrated by Bill Nighy, with the narration redubbed by Mike Goldman for the Australian airings and Sean Astin for the American broadcasts. The fourth series, subtitled The Next Generation, saw Stockard Channing replacing Astin as the narrator in the American dubbing.', 'Meerkat Manor is a British television programme produced by Oxford Scientific Films for Animal Planet International that premiered in September 2005 and ran for four series until its cancellation in August 2008. Blending more traditional animal documentary style footage with dramatic narration, the series told the story of the Whiskers, one of more than a dozen families of meerkats in the Kalahari Desert being studied as part of the Kalahari Meerkat Project, a long-term field study into the ecological causes and evolutionary consequences of the cooperative nature of meerkats. The original programme was narrated by Bill Nighy, with the narration redubbed by Mike Goldman for the Australian airings and Sean Astin for the American broadcasts. The fourth series, subtitled The Next Generation, saw Stockard Channing replacing Astin as the narrator in the American dubbing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLhIQxM5IZlW6qeYgXOv4CLuP4z.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1934'),
  ('828060956652341430', 'Meet Me After School', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kasumi Arimura, Koshi Mizukami, Keita Machida, Yoh Yoshida, Tomochika, Yui Natsukawa, Makita Sports, Rina Ono', null, 'Emotions resurface when a school teacher and her former student reconnect three years after sharing a forbidden attraction that scarred them both.', 'Emotions resurface when a school teacher and her former student reconnect three years after sharing a forbidden attraction that scarred them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mU5baLDpeMz9tH9JD7yZzRwA6Ru.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83165'),
  ('480601713323405663', 'Meet The Adebanjos', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Andrew Osayemi, Debra Odutuyo', 'Nick Withers, Jessica Golding, Andrew Osayemi', 'Wale Ojo, Yetunde Oduwole, Andrea Ama Aboagye, Daniel Davids, Moji Bamtefa, Tolulope Ogunmefun, Andrew Apraku, Lateef Lovejoy', 'TV-PG', 'In South London, tradition clashes with culture as a Nigerian father tries to instill his old-fashioned African values into his modern British family.', 'In South London, tradition clashes with culture as a Nigerian father tries to instill his old-fashioned African values into his modern British family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecAnIpKMzri66Pk5rl0SrC78SbD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:110384'),
  ('501003007851347786', 'Meet the Press', 1947, 'News, Talk', 'Martha Rountree, Lawrence E. Spivak', null, 'Kristen Welker, Chuck Todd', 'TV-G', 'Meet the Press is a weekly American television news/interview program airing on NBC. It is the longest-running television series in American broadcasting history, despite bearing little resemblance to the original format of the program seen in its television debut on November 6, 1947. Meet the Press is the highest-rated of the American television Sunday morning talk shows. It has been hosted by 11 moderators, beginning with Martha Rountree. Meet the Press and similar shows specialize in interviewing national leaders on issues of politics, economics, foreign policy and other public affairs.', 'Meet the Press is a weekly American television news/interview program airing on NBC. It is the longest-running television series in American broadcasting history, despite bearing little resemblance to the original format of the program seen in its television debut on November 6, 1947. Meet the Press is the highest-rated of the American television Sunday morning talk shows. It has been hosted by 11 moderators, beginning with Martha Rountree. Meet the Press and similar shows specialize in interviewing national leaders on issues of politics, economics, foreign policy and other public affairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCLynKB2KB2Raqv7UufWwuQghtp.jpg', 79, 'tmdb:tv:4496'),
  ('750864929779004586', 'Meet the Richardsons', 2020, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Jon Richardson, Lucy Beaumont, Damion Priestley, Emma Priestley', null, 'Stand-up comedians Richardson and Beaumont play exaggerated versions of themselves as viewers get a glimpse into their home and work lives, surrounded by their celebrity friends and their Hebden Bridge neighbours.', 'Stand-up comedians Richardson and Beaumont play exaggerated versions of themselves as viewers get a glimpse into their home and work lives, surrounded by their celebrity friends and their Hebden Bridge neighbours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kusxxNmOTypdXP7exQwUMl6LNAI.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:90241'),
  ('903803869764028127', 'Meet the Romans with Mary Beard', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Mary Beard', null, 'Mary Beard', null, 'Professor Mary Beard looks beyond the stories of emperors, armies, guts and gore to meet the everyday people at the heart of Ancient Rome''s vast empire.', 'Professor Mary Beard looks beyond the stories of emperors, armies, guts and gore to meet the everyday people at the heart of Ancient Rome''s vast empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0d8SfhpkvgQQ78KbNE1nqXGrof.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74778'),
  ('567873718238310541', 'Meet You at the Blossom', 2024, 'Drama', 'Shui Qian Cheng', null, 'Leslie Li, Wang Yunkai, Li Junliang, Kou Weilong, Li Yimu, Sukonlaphat Sribubpha, Jing Feng, Ni Songyang', null, 'After a fateful and unexpected encounter, the son of Jiangnan''s wealthiest man falls for the icy beauty Huai En, but she hides a secret.', 'After a fateful and unexpected encounter, the son of Jiangnan''s wealthiest man falls for the icy beauty Huai En, but she hides a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSDdU9NZeLaLllvzSbJf5PWTvec.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247264'),
  ('1066178943623980325', 'Meet Yourself', 2023, 'Drama', 'Ding Ziguang', null, 'Liu Yifei, Li Xian, Hu Bingqing, Niu Junfeng, Wu Yanshu, Gong Beibi, Dong Qing, Fan Shuaiqi', null, 'Because of the death of her best friend, Xu Hongdou''s life and work falls into a slump. She goes to the "windy courtyard" in Yun Miao Village, Dali, to recuperate by herself. There, she meets Xie Zhiyao, a local who quit his high-paying job and has returned to his hometown to start a business, with a group of peers from big cities. Xie Zhiyao begins to see Xu Hongdou''s kindness and seriousness. He invites her to use her years of experience in the hotel industry to help local employees improve their service awareness and help develop Yun Miao Village''s cultural tourism business. At the same time, Xu Hongdou is moved by Xie Zhiyao''s ideal of building a hometown so that the villagers can be independent and lead a purposeful life. The two fall in love and finally came together. As they work together they re-examin their past, help and inspire each other, start to heal and gain the strength to begin their lives again in this "windy place".', 'Because of the death of her best friend, Xu Hongdou''s life and work falls into a slump. She goes to the "windy courtyard" in Yun Miao Village, Dali, to recuperate by herself. There, she meets Xie Zhiyao, a local who quit his high-paying job and has returned to his hometown to start a business, with a group of peers from big cities. Xie Zhiyao begins to see Xu Hongdou''s kindness and seriousness. He invites her to use her years of experience in the hotel industry to help local employees improve their service awareness and help develop Yun Miao Village''s cultural tourism business. At the same time, Xu Hongdou is moved by Xie Zhiyao''s ideal of building a hometown so that the villagers can be independent and lead a purposeful life. The two fall in love and finally came together. As they work together they re-examin their past, help and inspire each other, start to heal and gain the strength to begin their lives again in this "windy place".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIPAvmgFlOYVoKMmMGsiSBsdAgh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216424'),
  ('1141335883820439608', 'Meeting Mr. Right', 2019, 'Reality, Comedy, Family', 'Yan Ji', null, 'Zhang Yuqi, Meng Ziyi, Li Shaminzi, Grace Chow, Shaogang Zhang, Ge Bi Lao Fan', null, 'Dads observed their daughter''s love process with the host Zhang Shaogang and the observer Cheng Lisha', 'Dads observed their daughter''s love process with the host Zhang Shaogang and the observer Cheng Lisha', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhcEwjqpeIg8igKlQhoMbmuJMfW.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:111897'),
  ('449004516047908938', 'Mega Man', 1994, 'Animation', null, null, 'Ian James Corlett, Jim Byrnes, Robyn Ross, Scott McNeil, Terry Klassen, Garry Chalk', 'TV-Y7', 'Mega Man is a robot created by a brilliant scientist named Dr. Light, who hoped many his many creations would only be used for good. One day however, a mad scientist named Dr. Wily stole Light''s original 6 robots and creation plans. From them he began creating a whole new series of robots, with one goal... World Domination! But Dr. Light gave Mega Man the ultimate trump card when he built him. Mega Man possesses the ability to absorb the powers of other robots. Now Mega Man and his best friend, a robotic dog named Rush fight for everlasting peace against the evil Dr. Wily!', 'Mega Man is a robot created by a brilliant scientist named Dr. Light, who hoped many his many creations would only be used for good. One day however, a mad scientist named Dr. Wily stole Light''s original 6 robots and creation plans. From them he began creating a whole new series of robots, with one goal... World Domination! But Dr. Light gave Mega Man the ultimate trump card when he built him. Mega Man possesses the ability to absorb the powers of other robots. Now Mega Man and his best friend, a robotic dog named Rush fight for everlasting peace against the evil Dr. Wily!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3osBPmtvdm5oxnW7oSzYxug4QF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1323'),
  ('550749590499527299', 'Megabeast Investigator Juspion', 1985, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hikaru Kurosaki, Kiyomi Tsukada, Noboru Nakaya, Junichi Haruta, Hiroshi Watari, Isao Sasaki, Shozo Iizuka, Tōru Ōhira', 'NR', 'Juspion''s parents were killed by space pirates when he was a baby. After escaping to the planet Eijin, he is raised by a space hermit. He eventually embarks on a quest to fight the Mega beasts and defeat Satan Gorth. Hetravels from planet to planet until he finally arrives on Earth. Wearing a special suit, he has super human powers and a transforming spaceship.', 'Juspion''s parents were killed by space pirates when he was a baby. After escaping to the planet Eijin, he is raised by a space hermit. He eventually embarks on a quest to fight the Mega beasts and defeat Satan Gorth. Hetravels from planet to planet until he finally arrives on Earth. Wearing a special suit, he has super human powers and a transforming spaceship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaJoavE7Dcy1lokvnwzCHIZTrj5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6263'),
  ('8616751202163762', 'MEGALOBOX', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chikara Sakuma', null, 'Yoshimasa Hosoya, Hiroki Yasumoto, Michiyo Murase, Nanako Mori, Tatsuhisa Suzuki', 'TV-MA', 'A desolate land stretches out from the city of poverty. A motorcycle speeds recklessly, blowing clouds of sand and dust. The rider is the protagonist of this story – he has neither a name nor a past. All he has is his ring name, “Junk Dog” and a technique for rigging MEGALOBOX matches with his pal Gansaku Nanbu, which they use to support their hand-to-mouth lives. JD is bored, resigned, and unfulfilled. Yuri has been the reigning champion of MEGALOBOX for the past few years. He has the skills and presence of a true champion. This is a story of JD and his rival, Yuri.', 'A desolate land stretches out from the city of poverty. A motorcycle speeds recklessly, blowing clouds of sand and dust. The rider is the protagonist of this story – he has neither a name nor a past. All he has is his ring name, “Junk Dog” and a technique for rigging MEGALOBOX matches with his pal Gansaku Nanbu, which they use to support their hand-to-mouth lives. JD is bored, resigned, and unfulfilled. Yuri has been the reigning champion of MEGALOBOX for the past few years. He has the skills and presence of a true champion. This is a story of JD and his rival, Yuri.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfXCEFdiMMWEUCGcCbdEo7bfhKK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:77939'),
  ('81602127639001664', 'MegaMan NT Warrior', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kenichi Araki', null, 'Kumiko Higa, Akiko Kimura, Kaori Mizuhashi, Masako Jo, Mitsuki Saiga, Masaya Matsukaze, Yuji Ueda', 'TV-Y7', 'In the year 20XX, a young boy named Netto Hikari receives a very special gift as he enters the 5th grade: his very own customized Net Navi, Rockman.', 'In the year 20XX, a young boy named Netto Hikari receives a very special gift as he enters the 5th grade: his very own customized Net Navi, Rockman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roZllkX4mOoDAKljFtpYJzD41Kn.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:5653'),
  ('493888865368709171', 'Megamind Rules!', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Action & Adventure, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Brent Simons, Alan Schoolcraft', 'Alan Schoolcraft, Brent Simons', 'Keith Ferguson, Laura Post, Josh Brener, Maya Tuttle, Adam Lambert, Emily Tunon, Talon Warburton, Scott Adsit', 'TV-G', 'Megamind finds his footing as the new protector of Metro City and faces a legion of villains while becoming the world''s first hero influencer.', 'Megamind finds his footing as the new protector of Metro City and faces a legion of villains while becoming the world''s first hero influencer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yI9Tus6ZpPlBmb1AsrOSkI9nGXj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157432'),
  ('158285026168322204', 'Megas XLR', 2004, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'George Krstic, Jody Schaeffer', null, 'Wendee Lee, Steve Blum, David DeLuise', 'TV-Y7', 'Megas XLR is a series about an overweight couch potato named Coop who stumbles across a giant robot in a junkyard. He soon discovers that the robot was sent from the future when a woman named Kiva returns to the past to claim what is rightfully hers, though Coop made so many modification to the machine so he''s the only one who can fully operate it. Things also heat up when Coop learns that an alien race called the Glorft are also after his MEGAS robot, so he teams up with Kiva and his best friend Jamie to fight them off, though mostly so he can keep his new toy.', 'Megas XLR is a series about an overweight couch potato named Coop who stumbles across a giant robot in a junkyard. He soon discovers that the robot was sent from the future when a woman named Kiva returns to the past to claim what is rightfully hers, though Coop made so many modification to the machine so he''s the only one who can fully operate it. Things also heat up when Coop learns that an alien race called the Glorft are also after his MEGAS robot, so he teams up with Kiva and his best friend Jamie to fight them off, though mostly so he can keep his new toy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4Mc687WE8wFAk5nlmJJh4qNuIO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:472'),
  ('371242428155780175', 'MegaStructures', 2004, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'MegaStructures is a documentary television series appearing on the National Geographic Channel in the United States and the United Kingdom, Channel 5 in the United Kingdom, France 5 in France, and 7mate in Australia. Each episode is an educational look of varying depth into the construction, operation, and staffing of various structures or construction projects, but not ordinary construction products. Generally containing interviews with designers and project managers, it presents the problems of construction and the methodology or techniques used to overcome obstacles. In some cases this involved the development of new materials or products that are now in general use within the construction industry. MegaStructures focuses on constructions that are extreme; in the sense that they are the biggest, tallest, longest, or deepest in the world. Alternatively, a project may appear if it had an element of novelty or are a world first. This type of project is known as a Megaproject.', 'MegaStructures is a documentary television series appearing on the National Geographic Channel in the United States and the United Kingdom, Channel 5 in the United Kingdom, France 5 in France, and 7mate in Australia. Each episode is an educational look of varying depth into the construction, operation, and staffing of various structures or construction projects, but not ordinary construction products. Generally containing interviews with designers and project managers, it presents the problems of construction and the methodology or techniques used to overcome obstacles. In some cases this involved the development of new materials or products that are now in general use within the construction industry. MegaStructures focuses on constructions that are extreme; in the sense that they are the biggest, tallest, longest, or deepest in the world. Alternatively, a project may appear if it had an element of novelty or are a world first. This type of project is known as a Megaproject.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/su1CZwwZ7lx2RQvBIsijOcoXV9s.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:4199'),
  ('950988980126994754', 'MEGATON MUSASHI', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Toshiki Masuda, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Soma Saito, Koki Uchiyama, Sumire Morohoshi, Megumi Han, Ayumu Murase, Yuki Kaji', 'TV-14', 'In 2118, 99.9% of humanity was wiped out by an invading alien force known as the Draktor. The survivors'' memories are wiped before resuming life in fortified shelters. Humanity mounts an attack to take back the planet using giant robots known as Megaton-class Rogues. Yamato Ichidaiji is called to pilot one of the Rogues, just as memories of the invasion return and dangerous questions arise.', 'In 2118, 99.9% of humanity was wiped out by an invading alien force known as the Draktor. The survivors'' memories are wiped before resuming life in fortified shelters. Humanity mounts an attack to take back the planet using giant robots known as Megaton-class Rogues. Yamato Ichidaiji is called to pilot one of the Rogues, just as memories of the invasion return and dangerous questions arise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jiHOGpdUYtdmEa3zTXWLlxrRq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129553'),
  ('1018846220884571113', 'Mehmed: Sultan of Conquests', 2024, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Eyüp Gökhan Özekin', null, 'Serkan Çayoğlu, Sinan Albayrak, Bülent Alkış, Ertuğrul Postoğlu, Ali Sinan Demir, Recep Çavdar, Kenan Çoban, Sena Çakır', null, 'The project, which will follow the story on the life of one of the most important rulers in Ottoman history, Fatih Sultan Mehmed, will also feature important stages of the life of Eyüp el Ensari, an important figure in the Islamic world, in parallel with Fatih''s life.', 'The project, which will follow the story on the life of one of the most important rulers in Ottoman history, Fatih Sultan Mehmed, will also feature important stages of the life of Eyüp el Ensari, an important figure in the Islamic world, in parallel with Fatih''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8fHgHmcEQU1UcOcXhW3NXtwwcZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:246621'),
  ('434589485129229467', 'Mehmed: The Conqueror', 2018, 'Drama, Reality, War & Politics', 'Cevdet Mercan', 'Onur Güvenatam', 'Kenan İmirzalıoğlu, Çetin Tekindor, Gürkan Uygun, Hazal Filiz Küçükköse, Büşra Develi, Funda Eryiğit, Sedef Avci, Toprak Sağlam', null, 'Fatih series will be about the life of Ottoman sultan Fatih Sultan Mehmet.', 'Fatih series will be about the life of Ottoman sultan Fatih Sultan Mehmet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87HyVI8CufLQIvDqWsybgGHYN4V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78203'),
