  ('901244492443871286', 'Mekakucity Actors', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', null, null, 'Yuhko Kaida, Soichiro Hoshi, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Kana Hanazawa, Nanami Kashiyama, Kana Asumi, Takuma Terashima, Misuzu Togashi', null, 'The incidents which occurred on August 14th and 15th bring a group of young boys and girls together… They are members of a group they call themselves the "Mekakushi Dan" (Blindfold Organization) and each member possesses a strange power involving their eyes.', 'The incidents which occurred on August 14th and 15th bring a group of young boys and girls together… They are members of a group they call themselves the "Mekakushi Dan" (Blindfold Organization) and each member possesses a strange power involving their eyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgHTJ0jZpuD67ZDy7LNu6bfCFXs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60842'),
