  ('275858265657642458', 'Men in Kilts: A Roadtrip with Sam and Graham', 2021, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Sam Heughan, Graham McTavish, Alex Norouzi', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A celebration of Scottish history and culture, with Outlander stars Sam Heughan and Graham McTavish discovering the heritage of their native country, meeting local artisans and experts and experiencing genuine moments of awe and fascination as they share their travels with the audience.', 'A celebration of Scottish history and culture, with Outlander stars Sam Heughan and Graham McTavish discovering the heritage of their native country, meeting local artisans and experts and experiencing genuine moments of awe and fascination as they share their travels with the audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XxC7cnwRxBQ0wgb2oUdHb0XO23.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:104712'),
  ('348798403938407569', 'Men In Love', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Hu Yitian, Liang Jie, Dai Xu, Liu Chang, Sun Jialing, Wu Qianying, Li Dianzun', null, 'The self-disciplined and diligent editor-in-chief of a magazine, Ye Han, helped the clumsy and lovely physical education teacher Li Xiaoxiao resolve embarrassing crises again and again by chance. Due to past experiences, it was difficult to take the step of love. The enthusiastic and direct magazine publisher Xu Jiacheng met their former model sister Tong Yiwen. The two continued to seek balance in their pursuit of love and career.', 'The self-disciplined and diligent editor-in-chief of a magazine, Ye Han, helped the clumsy and lovely physical education teacher Li Xiaoxiao resolve embarrassing crises again and again by chance. Due to past experiences, it was difficult to take the step of love. The enthusiastic and direct magazine publisher Xu Jiacheng met their former model sister Tong Yiwen. The two continued to seek balance in their pursuit of love and career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyPsv0ZdsqC792e5IJnuU468Cuo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253335'),
  ('510956029329311259', 'Men in Trees', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jenny Bicks', null, 'Anne Heche, Emily Bergl, Derek Richardson, James Tupper, John Amos, Abraham Benrubi, Suleka Mathew, Sarah Strange', null, 'Relationship coach Marin Frist knows what to look for, what to avoid and what will make her happy. As the many fans of her two bestselling books could tell you, we''re all in charge of our own happiness. But like many people full of advice, she fails to apply it to herself. On her way to a speaking engagement in Alaska, she learns that her fiancé has cheated on her. Slapped in the face with personal failure, a snowstorm then leaves her stuck in a small town full of the one thing she really doesn''t need—available men.', 'Relationship coach Marin Frist knows what to look for, what to avoid and what will make her happy. As the many fans of her two bestselling books could tell you, we''re all in charge of our own happiness. But like many people full of advice, she fails to apply it to herself. On her way to a speaking engagement in Alaska, she learns that her fiancé has cheated on her. Slapped in the face with personal failure, a snowstorm then leaves her stuck in a small town full of the one thing she really doesn''t need—available men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJd1inZFj272LDh9ZdrKA2fpyAU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1757'),
  ('55046165813281563', 'Men of a Certain Age', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ray Romano, Mike Royce', null, 'Ray Romano, Scott Bakula, Andre Braugher, LisaGay Hamilton, Richard Gant, Brian J. White, Melinda McGraw, Kwesi Boakye', 'TV-MA', 'Three male friends experience the changes and challenges of midlife.', 'Three male friends experience the changes and challenges of midlife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8G9hjlji95ysRf2g32Dr6KU4btF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:16208'),
  ('198752216700224228', 'Men of Anjolos', 1997, 'Drama, Reality', 'Farajollah Salahshoor', null, 'Jafar Dehghan, Jahanbakhsh Soltani, Mahtab Keramati, Hossein Yari', null, 'The story of six nobles and one sheepman who become Christian, run away from Romans to a cave where they will sleep 309 years, from Islamic view', 'The story of six nobles and one sheepman who become Christian, run away from Romans to a cave where they will sleep 309 years, from Islamic view', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mOYtS8q60IgtowsxsNCpaxZwGp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60332'),
  ('736788912638925056', 'Men on a Mission', 2015, 'Reality, Comedy', null, 'Yoo Ji-hee, Choi Mi-yeon, Lee Ji-young', 'Kim Young-cheol, Min Kyung-hoon, Kang Ho-dong, Lee Su-geun, Kim Hee-chul, Seo Jang-hoon, Lee Sang-min', 'TV-14', 'Male celebs play make-believe as high schoolers, welcoming star transfer students every week and engaging in battles of witty humor and slapstick.', 'Male celebs play make-believe as high schoolers, welcoming star transfer students every week and engaging in battles of witty humor and slapstick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jIi55JtYKJTL1km8qHMuUilOWo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70672'),
  ('116010802532449761', 'Menace imminente', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Leora Kamenetsky, David Dusa', 'Négar Djavadi, David Dusa, Bruno Fay', 'Patrick Bruel, Natacha Lindinger, Cyril Gueï, Christiane Millet, Gaia Weiss, Rascha Bucvik, Agathe Mougin, Théau Courtès', null, 'A legend of Israeli intelligence, Zeev Abadi, is urgently called back to track down the traitor who stole extremely dangerous software developed in the utmost secrecy by Unit 8200, a branch of the Israeli Army, and used for the first time in Paris. This mission leads him to collaborate with a French anti-terrorism cop, Fleur Giroud, who is tasked with solving a strange disappearance that occurred in broad daylight at Charles de Gaulle Airport...', 'A legend of Israeli intelligence, Zeev Abadi, is urgently called back to track down the traitor who stole extremely dangerous software developed in the utmost secrecy by Unit 8200, a branch of the Israeli Army, and used for the first time in Paris. This mission leads him to collaborate with a French anti-terrorism cop, Fleur Giroud, who is tasked with solving a strange disappearance that occurred in broad daylight at Charles de Gaulle Airport...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AydsFj77pYjiAuptQYlyIwvWQT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228179'),
  ('66174538192611029', 'Menem: The President Show', 2025, 'Drama', 'Mariano Varela', null, 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Sergio Gabriel D''Angelo, Juan Minujín, Griselda Siciliani, Jorgelina Aruzzi, Marco Antonio Caponi, Cumelén Sanz, Alberto Ajaka', null, 'Menem, an extravagant and charismatic politician, becomes president of a troubled nation. His term, marked by privatization of public enterprises, dollarization of the economy, and consulting fortunetellers, is overshadowed by terrorist attacks and the death of his son. His photographer, Olegario Salas, witnesses his life change along with Argentine society amid economic recovery and corruption.', 'Menem, an extravagant and charismatic politician, becomes president of a troubled nation. His term, marked by privatization of public enterprises, dollarization of the economy, and consulting fortunetellers, is overshadowed by terrorist attacks and the death of his son. His photographer, Olegario Salas, witnesses his life change along with Argentine society amid economic recovery and corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQAfWpbme4JJzczx3Ys9DaENtby.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:292073'),
