  ('200698098911729459', 'Mental', 2009, 'Mystery, Drama, Comedy', 'Deborah Joy LeVine', null, 'Chris Vance, Annabella Sciorra, Nicholas Gonzalez, Jacqueline McKenzie, Marisa Ramirez, Derek Webster, Edwin Hodge', null, 'A psychiatrist balances unorthodox treatments and his conservative boss.', 'A psychiatrist balances unorthodox treatments and his conservative boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iekhdfm5yz8rDlrhLCs8FCGAf57.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8131'),
  ('920668582197269894', 'Mental', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Victor Lockwood, Marine Maugrain-Legagneur', 'Marine Maugrain-Legagneur, Victor Lockwood', 'Alicia Hava, Louis Peres, Riad Gahmi, Léo Grêlé, Julien Lopez, Lauréna Thellier, Constantin Vidal, Nicole Ferroni', null, 'Welcome to the Primevères child psychiatry clinic. Marvin, 17, more used to police custody than medical examinations, was interned following a court decision. He does not understand at all what he is doing there and makes him feel good to the other residents and the healthcare team ...', 'Welcome to the Primevères child psychiatry clinic. Marvin, 17, more used to police custody than medical examinations, was interned following a court decision. He does not understand at all what he is doing there and makes him feel good to the other residents and the healthcare team ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izCEtqqajbfwN0QkT7EvaTLvQR3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:95123'),
  ('658944806536148130', 'Mental', 2021, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', null, 'Aleksandr Dulerayn, Andrey Zolotarev', 'Evgeniy Stychkin, Elena Lyadova, Evgeny Tsyganov, Anna Kotova, Aglaya Tarasova, Dmitry Kolchin, Maxim Ivanov', null, 'Dmitry is a psycho. This secret is safe with his therapist, and Dmitry has a high-paid white-collar job. His boss would be totally surprised to learn that Dmitry’s best financial forecast moves were guided by the voices in his head. Dmitry has several voices, each seems to be 100% real with own ambitions and personality. However, to stay sane, Dmitry has to constantly keep him imaginary population at bay and steer clear of new characters settling in. The permanent inhabitants include Dmitry’s ex-wife and her lover - both found dead in their bed. Dmitry sets to find their murderer in order to get rid of the couple, become normal and win back custody of his son.', 'Dmitry is a psycho. This secret is safe with his therapist, and Dmitry has a high-paid white-collar job. His boss would be totally surprised to learn that Dmitry’s best financial forecast moves were guided by the voices in his head. Dmitry has several voices, each seems to be 100% real with own ambitions and personality. However, to stay sane, Dmitry has to constantly keep him imaginary population at bay and steer clear of new characters settling in. The permanent inhabitants include Dmitry’s ex-wife and her lover - both found dead in their bed. Dmitry sets to find their murderer in order to get rid of the couple, become normal and win back custody of his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQMzJ8rVbemB77knDcc2miGzZ5r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138981'),
  ('713089382343646869', 'Mental Coach Jegal', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jung Woo, Lee You-mi, Kwon Yul, Park Se-young, Moon You-kang, Yun Ju-sang, Kim Do-yoon, Kil Hae-yeon', null, 'Je Gal-gil causes an unprecedented scandal after he loses a match that he almost won due to the referee’s biased call and injures his leg. Even though permanently expelled from the national team as a player, he overcomes the trauma and comes back as a sports psychology counselor also called a mental healthcare coach. Together with the retired masters, Gal-gil works to help athletes who are going through a hard time as he did in the past.', 'Je Gal-gil causes an unprecedented scandal after he loses a match that he almost won due to the referee’s biased call and injures his leg. Even though permanently expelled from the national team as a player, he overcomes the trauma and comes back as a sports psychology counselor also called a mental healthcare coach. Together with the retired masters, Gal-gil works to help athletes who are going through a hard time as he did in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aPmsRyHCOpL8itZZxYVcZng8ga.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195627'),
  ('895614624216243780', 'Mentiras Perfectas', 2013, 'Drama', 'Caroline Kunti-Leconte, María Cecilia Vásquez, Ryan Murphy', null, 'Carolina Gómez, Michel Brown, Emmanuel Esparza, Manuela González, Natasha Klauss, Javier Ramírez, Laura Ramos, Carlos Serrato', null, 'Cristóbal is a handsome, ambitious and challenging surgeon who never follows the rules, and is just the exact opposite of his partner and friend Santiago, who is a rigid man caught in a routine marriage. For her part, Julia is a woman who after the birth of her son, abandoned her dreams of becoming a doctor, and without realizing it ended up saddened, living under the shadow of Santiago and his professional achievements.', 'Cristóbal is a handsome, ambitious and challenging surgeon who never follows the rules, and is just the exact opposite of his partner and friend Santiago, who is a rigid man caught in a routine marriage. For her part, Julia is a woman who after the birth of her son, abandoned her dreams of becoming a doctor, and without realizing it ended up saddened, living under the shadow of Santiago and his professional achievements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f94x1iLkFTirDBCjQXzDUXnzRJQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107078'),
  ('55491879253944703', 'Mentiras verdaderas', 2011, 'Talk, News', null, null, null, null, 'Daily interviews discussing the guest''s personal lives and national contingency.', 'Daily interviews discussing the guest''s personal lives and national contingency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBm5uxFGU40Hz7wztTAcsvh6Ng9.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:114863'),
  ('11337920808103792', 'Mentiras, The Series', 2025, 'Comedy, Soap', 'Gabriel Ripstein', 'Ilse Apellaniz, Natalia García Agraz, Gabriel Ripstein', 'Belinda, Diana Bovio, Mariana Treviño, Regina Blandón, Luis Gerardo Méndez, Michelle Rodríguez, Daniela Romo, Guillermo Capetillo', null, 'After discovering that Emmanuel Mijares has died, Daniela, Dulce, Yuri, and Lupita are summoned to a mysterious mansion. Forced to interact, the tensions between them quickly ignite, and the lies they''ve been hiding for years come to light. But little by little, these women begin to question themselves, to reflect, and to realize that they share much more than they ever imagined.', 'After discovering that Emmanuel Mijares has died, Daniela, Dulce, Yuri, and Lupita are summoned to a mysterious mansion. Forced to interact, the tensions between them quickly ignite, and the lies they''ve been hiding for years come to light. But little by little, these women begin to question themselves, to reflect, and to realize that they share much more than they ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzfyq5YqzpGG83ZBcODK5BwvcGM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:290321'),
  ('683208242185007347', 'Menudo: Forever Young', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Sergio Blass, Ralphy Rodríguez, Angelo Garcia, Andy Blázquez, Raül Reyes, Raymond Acevedo, Ashley Ruiz, Damarisse Martinez Ruiz', 'TV-MA', 'The rise and fall of Menudo, the most iconic Latin American boy band in history. But behind the glitz and glamour was a web of abuse and exploitation at the hands of the band’s manager, Edgardo Diaz. Through revealing interviews with former Menudo members, this docuseries examines how this extravagant facade was disguising serious wrongdoings by Diaz.', 'The rise and fall of Menudo, the most iconic Latin American boy band in history. But behind the glitz and glamour was a web of abuse and exploitation at the hands of the band’s manager, Edgardo Diaz. Through revealing interviews with former Menudo members, this docuseries examines how this extravagant facade was disguising serious wrongdoings by Diaz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mEfYiNgHfELd4xXWqapqZpfKCy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:198110'),
  ('5591018187129199', 'Meow, the Secret Boy', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'L, Shin Ye-eun, Seo Ji-hoon, Yoon Ye-joo, Kang Hoon, Jeon Ik-ryoung, Lee Yoo-jin, Ahn Nae-sang', null, 'What if your cat was capable of turning into a charming boy? After taking time off, Sol Ah returns to school as she finds herself a place to live alone. Per her friend’s favor, Sol Ah takes in a cat named Hong Jo, and a story of the life of two housemates unfolds. However, Sol Ah is not aware that the cat, Hong Jo, has the ability to shapeshift into a human. Sol Ah’s friends start to notice weird things about Hong Jo whenever they run into his human form. Things are about to change around the peaceful single-resident complex, and Hong Jo finds it difficult just being a mere cat whenever Sol Ah is too busy with her life to pay attention to him. Will Sol Ah be able to recognize Hong Jo in his human form? Sol Ah and Hong Jo “Welcome!” you into their romance fantasy story.', 'What if your cat was capable of turning into a charming boy? After taking time off, Sol Ah returns to school as she finds herself a place to live alone. Per her friend’s favor, Sol Ah takes in a cat named Hong Jo, and a story of the life of two housemates unfolds. However, Sol Ah is not aware that the cat, Hong Jo, has the ability to shapeshift into a human. Sol Ah’s friends start to notice weird things about Hong Jo whenever they run into his human form. Things are about to change around the peaceful single-resident complex, and Hong Jo finds it difficult just being a mere cat whenever Sol Ah is too busy with her life to pay attention to him. Will Sol Ah be able to recognize Hong Jo in his human form? Sol Ah and Hong Jo “Welcome!” you into their romance fantasy story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwWiYRlDLECxkHTQ2kkkr2MkqLo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97957'),
  ('552443190575600755', 'Merciless', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Glória Perez', null, 'Bruno Gagliasso, Débora Falabella, Luana Piovani, Marcello Novaes, Marisa Orth, Aderbal Freire Filho, Paulo Tiefenthaler, Yanna Lavigne', 'TV-MA', 'Eduardo Borges is a young man above all suspicion: handsome, smart, and sensitive. However, his perfect man appearance is simply a mask that covers up his fearsome personality: a dangerous psychopath behind a number of crimes that have caught the police’s attention. A cold, conniving, and callous criminal; a serial killer who kills purely out of pleasure.', 'Eduardo Borges is a young man above all suspicion: handsome, smart, and sensitive. However, his perfect man appearance is simply a mask that covers up his fearsome personality: a dangerous psychopath behind a number of crimes that have caught the police’s attention. A cold, conniving, and callous criminal; a serial killer who kills purely out of pleasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ndgchW4aaKUfalIl469w5toyAA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65063'),
  ('556945983531911987', 'Mercy', 2009, 'Drama', 'Liz Heldens', null, 'Taylor Schilling, Michelle Trachtenberg, Jaime Lee Kirchner, Guillermo Díaz, James Le Gros, James Tupper, Diego Klattenhoff, Charlie Semine', null, 'Mercy is a medical drama which aired on NBC from September 23, 2009 to May 12, 2010. The series initially aired on Wednesday nights at 8/7c, as part of the 2009 fall season, but was pushed back to 9/8c in April. On October 23, 2009, Mercy was picked up for a full twenty-two-episode first season. On May 14, 2010, NBC announced that Mercy had been cancelled and would not return for a second season due to low ratings.', 'Mercy is a medical drama which aired on NBC from September 23, 2009 to May 12, 2010. The series initially aired on Wednesday nights at 8/7c, as part of the 2009 fall season, but was pushed back to 9/8c in April. On October 23, 2009, Mercy was picked up for a full twenty-two-episode first season. On May 14, 2010, NBC announced that Mercy had been cancelled and would not return for a second season due to low ratings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eezeyYKkf97BMpXFkVglJrMuduJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18395'),
  ('624387194814858898', 'Mercy for None', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'So Ji-sub, Huh Joon-ho, Gong Myoung, Choo Young-woo, An Kil-kang, Cho Han-cheul, Lee Jun-hyuk, Cha Seung-won', 'TV-MA', 'After severing ties with his gang, a former gangster returns to uncover the truth behind his brother''s death — embarking on a relentless path of revenge.', 'After severing ties with his gang, a former gangster returns to uncover the truth behind his brother''s death — embarking on a relentless path of revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjL335mFBe7LgCqo3w0RNBSbbZU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232766'),
  ('497760860975670729', 'Mercy Street', 2016, 'Drama', 'David Zabel, Lisa Q. Wolfinger', null, 'Josh Radnor, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, McKinley Belcher III, Hannah James, Tara Summers, Norbert Leo Butz, AnnaSophia Robb, Shalita Grant', null, 'Follows the lives of two volunteer nurses on opposing sides of the Civil War - New England abolitionist Mary Phinney and Confederate supporter Emma Green. Based on true stories and set in a Union hospital in the occupied Confederate city of Alexandria, viewers are taken beyond the battlefield and into the lives of Americans on the Civil War home front as they face the unprecedented challenges of one of the most turbulent times in our nation’s history.', 'Follows the lives of two volunteer nurses on opposing sides of the Civil War - New England abolitionist Mary Phinney and Confederate supporter Emma Green. Based on true stories and set in a Union hospital in the occupied Confederate city of Alexandria, viewers are taken beyond the battlefield and into the lives of Americans on the Civil War home front as they face the unprecedented challenges of one of the most turbulent times in our nation’s history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3HNGQnmu9WurwETVAATRSwMXzg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63508'),
  ('1014095122785828247', 'Mère et Mensonges', 2026, 'Drama, Family, Soap', null, null, null, null, 'When Aminata returns to Dakar, her presence reopens old wounds and unsettles lives that seemed carefully rebuilt. Between love, jealousy, and unspoken betrayals, marriages are tested and loyalties begin to crack. As secrets surface and desires clash, the line between truth and lies becomes dangerously thin. Motherhood, power, and obsession collide in a story where every choice has consequences.', 'When Aminata returns to Dakar, her presence reopens old wounds and unsettles lives that seemed carefully rebuilt. Between love, jealousy, and unspoken betrayals, marriages are tested and loyalties begin to crack. As secrets surface and desires clash, the line between truth and lies becomes dangerously thin. Motherhood, power, and obsession collide in a story where every choice has consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KzxuMyCjaDCGDtMkIf6DazfQF7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315177'),
  ('1123564076010817540', 'Merhamet', 2013, 'Drama', 'Hande Altaylı', 'Mahinur Ergun', 'Özgü Namal, İbrahim Çelikkol, Burçin Terzioğlu, Mustafa Üstündağ, Yasemin Kay Allen, Turgut Tunçalp, Mehmet Ali Kaptanlar, Haldun Boysan', null, 'A successful lawyer meets her lost childhood love after 13 years of deserting her poor hometown and abusive family. That encounter forces her to reconcile with her traumatic past and search for her lost family and their tragic fate.', 'A successful lawyer meets her lost childhood love after 13 years of deserting her poor hometown and abusive family. That encounter forces her to reconcile with her traumatic past and search for her lost family and their tragic fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pO3fZhGpYlLiO1KUfg3meaBtzzZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:53677'),
  ('640549791748141358', 'Merlí', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Héctor Lozano', null, 'Francesc Orella, Carlos Cuevas, David Solans, Elisabet Casanovas, Adrian Grösser, Marcos Franz, Júlia Creus, Albert Baró', 'TV-MA', 'He’s surly, unorthodox, unapologetically blunt, and he’s about to change your life. Meet the new philosophy teacher, Merlí, who will help his students view the world in a whole new light, both in and out of the classroom.', 'He’s surly, unorthodox, unapologetically blunt, and he’s about to change your life. Meet the new philosophy teacher, Merlí, who will help his students view the world in a whole new light, both in and out of the classroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQaGnuwIHhmB1jgY6CM3rJgScYR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62914'),
