  ('31744814375679273', 'Mewkledreamy', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'A middle school girl named Yume sees something fall from the sky, and meets a pale violet-colored kitten named Mew. It turns out that Mew has the power of "Yume Synchro" (Dream Synchro), the power to enter dreams. In the dream world, the girl and Mew collect Dream Stones.', 'A middle school girl named Yume sees something fall from the sky, and meets a pale violet-colored kitten named Mew. It turns out that Mew has the power of "Yume Synchro" (Dream Synchro), the power to enter dreams. In the dream world, the girl and Mew collect Dream Stones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fp8MhdmqSVg9w3FpWBT5CAdYvLH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:98903'),
  ('688683883281945820', 'México campeón del mundo', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'A journey through the history of the Mexican National Team to understand how and why a world champion is built from long before, off the pitch, in aspects that determine what can be done inside it.', 'A journey through the history of the Mexican National Team to understand how and why a world champion is built from long before, off the pitch, in aspects that determine what can be done inside it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyfsZTM9VkODo3IDKicH6x5vim4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214033'),
  ('74587040407643636', 'Mézga Aladár különös kalandjai', 1972, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'József Gémes, József Nepp, Béla Ternovszky', null, 'Attila Némethy, Margit Földessy, Endre Harkányi, Nándor Tomanek, Illona Györi, Ottó Szabó, Pál Horváth, Judit Tóth', null, 'Every night Aladár visits a different inhabited planet using an inflatable interstellar cosmic ship with his talking dog Blöki.', 'Every night Aladár visits a different inhabited planet using an inflatable interstellar cosmic ship with his talking dog Blöki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4PfkWfnuqhdqSwkDfxCsvIrNGc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62463'),
  ('643486647415014701', 'Mezzo DSA', 2004, 'Animation, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Yasuomi Umetsu', null, 'Misato Fukuen, Taichiro Hirokawa, Takumi Yamazaki, Tomoko Kotani, Miyu Matsuki', 'TV-14', 'Her name is Mikura, and she’s all about service with a smile. So what if that service is cracking skulls and the smile happens to be on the other end of a loaded gun? Get ready for this chick with a killer body and vicious skills to wreak havoc and mayhem all in the name of the Danger Service Agency!', 'Her name is Mikura, and she’s all about service with a smile. So what if that service is cracking skulls and the smile happens to be on the other end of a loaded gun? Get ready for this chick with a killer body and vicious skills to wreak havoc and mayhem all in the name of the Danger Service Agency!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivI7ISS407kA7QgvAxTFe8l83Lh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12174'),
  ('33390354968501813', 'MF GHOST', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yuma Uchida, Ayane Sakura', 'TV-14', 'Japan adopts self-driving electric automobiles and renders most gas engines obsolete by 202X. The fastest cars find new life in the MFG, a racing circuit held on Japanese motorways. Drivers from around the world race for a shot at the title. Kanata Rivington returns from Britain to Japan for the MFG—and to find his father. Can he win the title and find answers? Buckle up and push it to the limit!', 'Japan adopts self-driving electric automobiles and renders most gas engines obsolete by 202X. The fastest cars find new life in the MFG, a racing circuit held on Japanese motorways. Drivers from around the world race for a shot at the title. Kanata Rivington returns from Britain to Japan for the MFG—and to find his father. Can he win the title and find answers? Buckle up and push it to the limit!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqkDWnBDltFCjAdhxCqUWg9GXFB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154526'),
  ('413292601363808786', 'MGM: When the Lion Roars', 1992, 'Documentary', null, 'Frank Martin', 'Patrick Stewart, Stanley Donen, Helen Hayes, Esther Williams, Freddie Bartholomew, William Hanna, Luise Rainer, Joseph Barbera', null, 'On April 24, 1924, the movies changed forever: The Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer studio opened and soon assembled “more stars than there are in the heavens.” Patrick Stewart hosts this enthralling Emmy® winner as Outstanding Informational Series, a three-part story of M-G-M’s reign as Hollywood’s class act and legendary entertainment empire. Bursting with memorable film clips, rare interviews, behind-the-scenes footage and insider info, this is a mother lode for film fans, profiling perfectionist moguls, glamorous and charismatic actors, innovative filmmakers and landmark movies.', 'On April 24, 1924, the movies changed forever: The Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer studio opened and soon assembled “more stars than there are in the heavens.” Patrick Stewart hosts this enthralling Emmy® winner as Outstanding Informational Series, a three-part story of M-G-M’s reign as Hollywood’s class act and legendary entertainment empire. Bursting with memorable film clips, rare interviews, behind-the-scenes footage and insider info, this is a mother lode for film fans, profiling perfectionist moguls, glamorous and charismatic actors, innovative filmmakers and landmark movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nghUm8RAn5KHEdlJ1XzU4G9zVM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22939'),
  ('883710003169421965', 'MH370: The Plane That Disappeared', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Intan Othman, Jeff Wise, Ghislain Wattrelos, Peter Foley', 'TV-14', 'In 2014, a plane with 239 people aboard vanishes from all radar. This docuseries delves into one of our greatest modern mysteries: Flight MH370.', 'In 2014, a plane with 239 people aboard vanishes from all radar. This docuseries delves into one of our greatest modern mysteries: Flight MH370.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n16M7juqhFpX7Ti3z1fHywjgmZk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220499'),
