  ('430073926612611829', 'Mi Camino es Amarte', 2022, 'Soap, Drama', 'Susana González, Ximena Herrera, Mark Tacher', null, 'Susana González, Gabriel Soto, Mark Tacher, Ximena Herrera, Sara Corrales, Claudia Álvarez, Ingrid Martz, Fabián Robles', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Fp0IVmjRdTUD2FyXAzn07H4Dvt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213852'),
  ('730942360915494447', 'Mi corazón es tuyo', 2014, 'Soap, Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Pablo Ferrer García-Travesí, Marcia del Río, Alejandro Pohlenz', 'Pablo Ferrer García-Travesí, Alejandro Pohlenz, Ricardo Tejeda', 'Silvia Navarro, Jorge Salinas, Mayrín Villanueva, Adrián Uribe, Fabiola Campomanes, Pablo Montero, René Casados, Paulina Goto', 'TV-Y', 'Fernando Lascurain is a wealthy businessman and recent widower, attempting to raise his seven unruly children. He seeks the assistance of a new nanny. He hires and falls in love with Ana Leal, a struggling exotic dancer who tries to hide her double life. Although Ana lacks experience and a refined education, she quickly bonds with the Lascurain children. Ana dreams of being a mother, but when her home is destroyed following an accident, she must borrow money from her ruthless boss at "Chicago", the night club where she is secretly employed. When Fernando simultaneously falls for Ana and Isabela, an economist and sophisticated woman who is trained by her mother to marry a millionaire, he must choose between both women.', 'Fernando Lascurain is a wealthy businessman and recent widower, attempting to raise his seven unruly children. He seeks the assistance of a new nanny. He hires and falls in love with Ana Leal, a struggling exotic dancer who tries to hide her double life. Although Ana lacks experience and a refined education, she quickly bonds with the Lascurain children. Ana dreams of being a mother, but when her home is destroyed following an accident, she must borrow money from her ruthless boss at "Chicago", the night club where she is secretly employed. When Fernando simultaneously falls for Ana and Isabela, an economist and sophisticated woman who is trained by her mother to marry a millionaire, he must choose between both women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMF4iYqlnsQMglOsr0C6KIVtB2X.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63407'),
  ('676148617883167941', 'Mi Destino Eres Tú', 2000, 'Drama', 'Jorge Lozano Soriano, Carmen Daniels', null, 'Lucero, Susana Zabaleta, Jorge Salinas, Jaime Camil, Jacqueline Andere, Mauricio Islas, Sylvia Pasquel, Julio Alemán', null, 'Mi destino eres tú is a 2000 Mexican telenovela. It is a production of Carla Estrada and the protagonists were Lucero and Jorge Salinas.', 'Mi destino eres tú is a 2000 Mexican telenovela. It is a production of Carla Estrada and the protagonists were Lucero and Jorge Salinas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QBk9ersspOxGYdBOQBNsxCVVJh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16690'),
  ('1076431891869724077', 'Mi lista de exes', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Sigal Avin', null, 'Adriana Montes de Oca, Christopher Aguilasocho, Marcos Radosh', 'NR', 'After a tarot reader tells her that the love of her life is not in the future, but in the past, and that she must find him before her 30th birthday, young and impulsive María undertakes a desperate search to find love, with the help of her best friends: Pedro, Ana and Lolo, and thus create her list of exes.', 'After a tarot reader tells her that the love of her life is not in the future, but in the past, and that she must find him before her 30th birthday, young and impulsive María undertakes a desperate search to find love, with the help of her best friends: Pedro, Ana and Lolo, and thus create her list of exes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaQCylD3DQTmkQi5bGddfJeoLwX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82360'),
  ('1148749921718114748', 'Mi marido tiene familia', 2017, 'Soap, Comedy, Drama', 'Aurelio Ávila, Juan Osorio Ortiz, Héctor Forero López', null, 'Zuria Vega, Daniel Arenas, Susana González, Arath de la Torre, Diana Bracho, Silvia Pinal, Rafael Inclán, Carmen Salinas', 'TV-PG', 'Julieta is quite happy in her relationship with her live in boyfriend, Robert... and thrilled that she won''t have to deal with in-laws since Robert doesn''t know his family. Things start going downhill for the couple when they rent an apartment from a very eccentric family dealing with a traumatic incident from their past.', 'Julieta is quite happy in her relationship with her live in boyfriend, Robert... and thrilled that she won''t have to deal with in-laws since Robert doesn''t know his family. Things start going downhill for the couple when they rent an apartment from a very eccentric family dealing with a traumatic incident from their past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSuUar73WzYWgf0fwB2oKQTSr2r.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:77567'),
