  ('856724971679309542', 'Mike Judge Presents: Tales from the Tour Bus', 2017, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Dub Cornett, Mike Judge, Richard Mullins', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'The raucous adventures of some of music’s most legendary artists, as told by those who knew them best. Featuring animated interviews with former bandmates, friends and other erstwhile associates, who share uncensored anecdotes about these artists, brought to life with animated reenactments and woven together with live-action archival performance footage and photos.', 'The raucous adventures of some of music’s most legendary artists, as told by those who knew them best. Featuring animated interviews with former bandmates, friends and other erstwhile associates, who share uncensored anecdotes about these artists, brought to life with animated reenactments and woven together with live-action archival performance footage and photos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6e7CMl6LJ70F6034KHoR7c2kEr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:73610'),
  ('909102391465633586', 'Mike Judge''s Beavis and Butt-Head', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Mike Judge', null, 'Mike Judge', 'TV-14', 'Two teenage heavy-metal music fans occasionally do idiotic things because they''re bored. For them, everything is "cool" or "sucks."', 'Two teenage heavy-metal music fans occasionally do idiotic things because they''re bored. For them, everything is "cool" or "sucks."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75am8jsmRHHcpIPkm4RyrMn851A.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:203489'),
  ('627251978902084961', 'Mike Tyson Mysteries', 2014, 'Mystery, Animation, Comedy', 'Lee Stimmel, Hugh Davidson, Mike Tyson', null, 'Mike Tyson, Norm Macdonald, Rachel Ramras, Jim Rash', 'TV-14', 'Mike Tyson is taking the fight from the boxing ring to the streets … by solving mysteries! Aided by the Mike Tyson Mystery Team — the Ghost of the Marquess of Queensberry, Mike’s adopted Korean daughter and a pigeon who was once a man — Mike Tyson will answer any plea sent to him.', 'Mike Tyson is taking the fight from the boxing ring to the streets … by solving mysteries! Aided by the Mike Tyson Mystery Team — the Ghost of the Marquess of Queensberry, Mike’s adopted Korean daughter and a pigeon who was once a man — Mike Tyson will answer any plea sent to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQq8OApBL5sCgtLGnKKWwAgN8Zy.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61949'),
  ('453972039086189581', 'Mike, Lu & Og', 1999, 'Animation', 'Charles Swenson, Mikhail Aldashin, Mikhail Shindel', null, 'Nika Futterman, Nancy Cartwright, Dee Bradley Baker, S. Scott Bullock, Kath Soucie, Corey Burton, Brian George, Charlie Adler', 'TV-Y7', 'Mike, Lu, & Og features a spunky, red-haired girl named Mike, a stuck-up island princess named Lu and her cousin Og, a scientific genius.', 'Mike, Lu, & Og features a spunky, red-haired girl named Mike, a stuck-up island princess named Lu and her cousin Og, a scientific genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOpkcqj2vspPQ3J1At9ZvIrrq70.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4350'),
  ('928509891849761940', 'Mila in the Multiverse', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Janaina Tokitaka, Cássio Koshikumo', 'Laura Luz, Malu Mader, Yuki Sugimoto, Dani Flomin, João Victor Gonçalves, Rafaela Mandelli, Felipe Montanari, Danilo de Moura', null, 'Mila is 16 years old and living the adventure of her life traveling through the multiverse in search of her mother, Elis. As she travels, she will come face to face with The Operators, a mysterious and dangerous group that wants to exterminate all universes. She will have to face them in order to save the vast multiverse.', 'Mila is 16 years old and living the adventure of her life traveling through the multiverse in search of her mother, Elis. As she travels, she will come face to face with The Operators, a mysterious and dangerous group that wants to exterminate all universes. She will have to face them in order to save the vast multiverse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZUW5Rf6oJUJXWqeTNVbciLyT7G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137430'),
  ('1126818842046229485', 'Mildred Pierce', 2011, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kate Winslet, Guy Pearce, Evan Rachel Wood, Brían F. O''Byrne, Melissa Leo, James Le Gros, Mare Winningham, Marin Ireland', 'TV-MA', 'Mildred Pierce depicts an overprotective, self-sacrificing mother during the Great Depression who finds herself separated from her husband, opening a restaurant of her own and falling in love with a man, all the while trying to earn her spoiled, narcissistic daughter''s love and respect.', 'Mildred Pierce depicts an overprotective, self-sacrificing mother during the Great Depression who finds herself separated from her husband, opening a restaurant of her own and falling in love with a man, all the while trying to earn her spoiled, narcissistic daughter''s love and respect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZ7TUocetldADAXZfnMSEVl7SbJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39468'),
  ('538868883253264290', 'Mile High', 2003, 'Drama', null, null, 'Naomi Ryan, Tom Wisdom, Jo-Anne Knowles, Christopher Villiers, Stacey Cadman, Adam Sinclair, Emma-Jane Portch, Luke Roberts', 'TV-14', 'Mile High is a British television drama based on the lives of the cabin crew members of Fresh!, a budget airline based in London. The name of the show comes from the "Mile High Club". The show was broadcast on Sky1 from 2003 to 2005 and subsequently aired again on Sky Three. In 2012, CBS Drama obtained the rights to the series and began to re-run it from the beginning.', 'Mile High is a British television drama based on the lives of the cabin crew members of Fresh!, a budget airline based in London. The name of the show comes from the "Mile High Club". The show was broadcast on Sky1 from 2003 to 2005 and subsequently aired again on Sky Three. In 2012, CBS Drama obtained the rights to the series and began to re-run it from the beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSvEF0zSNjvZqHN8Ahoz8EL3YO8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3128'),
  ('112055083810390447', 'Miles from Tomorrowland', 2015, 'Family, Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sascha Paladino', null, 'Fiona Bishop, Dee Bradley Baker, Diedrich Bader, Danny Jacobs, Ivy Bishop, Sam Lavagnino, Justin Felbinger, Neil deGrasse Tyson', 'TV-Y', 'This intergalactic adventure charts the outer space missions of young adventurer Miles Callisto and his family – mom and ship captain, Phoebe; mechanical engineer dad, Leo; tech-savvy big sister, Loretta; and robo-ostrich pet, Merc – as they help connect the universe on behalf of the Tomorrowland Transit Authority.', 'This intergalactic adventure charts the outer space missions of young adventurer Miles Callisto and his family – mom and ship captain, Phoebe; mechanical engineer dad, Leo; tech-savvy big sister, Loretta; and robo-ostrich pet, Merc – as they help connect the universe on behalf of the Tomorrowland Transit Authority.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrFeGDHg7XStVlRIxBDOTGSEZav.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62181'),
  ('1028397844615493496', 'Miles to Go', 2023, 'Drama', 'Yao Lu', 'Yang Xiaoyuan, Hong Jinghui', 'Li Qin, Chen Xiao, Zhang Jiani, Wang Tianchen, Tang Zeng, Lin Yongjian, Liu Wei, Guo Xiaoting', null, 'In the 1980s, Gao Jialin, a young man living in Gaojiagou in northern Shaanxi Province,Gao Jialin was not defeated. He strived to learn new knowledge in accordance with the times, and through the changes of the world, he wrote an extraordinary life story of an ordinary man in the tide of the times.', 'In the 1980s, Gao Jialin, a young man living in Gaojiagou in northern Shaanxi Province,Gao Jialin was not defeated. He strived to learn new knowledge in accordance with the times, and through the changes of the world, he wrote an extraordinary life story of an ordinary man in the tide of the times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnL2nfynpS8lGY1zBsaslLt7Arj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222663'),
  ('1134107747600424428', 'Miley Jab Hum Tum', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sudhir Sharma, Seema Sharma', null, null, null, 'Miley Jab Hum Tum is a youth oriented television series that aired on Indian television channel STAR One, premiering September 22, 2008. The series ran for two years successfully covering two seasons before ending on November 19, 2010. The show is about falling in love during college and developing relations for a lifetime. The show was successful amongst the youth of the country that even after so years following its conclusion, the actors of the show like Rati pandey, Mohit Sehgal, Sanaya Irani, and Arjun Bijlani are still fondly remembered by people.', 'Miley Jab Hum Tum is a youth oriented television series that aired on Indian television channel STAR One, premiering September 22, 2008. The series ran for two years successfully covering two seasons before ending on November 19, 2010. The show is about falling in love during college and developing relations for a lifetime. The show was successful amongst the youth of the country that even after so years following its conclusion, the actors of the show like Rati pandey, Mohit Sehgal, Sanaya Irani, and Arjun Bijlani are still fondly remembered by people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UhUhOeis1j8wHwqaGUKwWxmeHV.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:8039'),
  ('812812236596684943', 'MILF Manor', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'From cities all across the country, eight confident and strong-minded women leave home for the chance to find love at a paradise destination.', 'From cities all across the country, eight confident and strong-minded women leave home for the chance to find love at a paradise destination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVP7wggDSmLfLG6H8Vw86Xn2XWL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:217417'),
  ('115465896477024057', 'Military Prosecutor Doberman', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Yoon Hyun-ho', 'Ahn Bo-hyun, Cho Bo-ah, Oh Yeon-soo, Kim Young-min, Kim Woo-seok, Kang Young-suk, Kwon Dong-ho, Nam Kyung-eup', 'TV-MA', 'An army prosecutor with ambitions of power and wealth finds his plans disturbed by an unyielding newbie with an agenda of her own.', 'An army prosecutor with ambitions of power and wealth finds his plans disturbed by an unyielding newbie with an agenda of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FICze3QdBj1mJ0eUriroAJDFly.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135652'),
  ('970313671292122131', 'Military!', 2015, 'Animation', null, null, 'Ayane Sakura, Nao Toyama, Yoshitaka Yamaya, Misaki Suzuki, Inori Minase, Ai Kayano, Satomi Arai, Takahiro Sakurai', null, 'The Krakozhia Dukedom and the Grania Republic are at war, and high school student Sōhei Yano wants no part of it. But when two Lieutenants show up in tanks at his door, his life becomes an exercise in dodging stray bullets!', 'The Krakozhia Dukedom and the Grania Republic are at war, and high school student Sōhei Yano wants no part of it. But when two Lieutenants show up in tanks at his door, his life becomes an exercise in dodging stray bullets!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOvdCJzphgpjm9ZUrLrRNJPGKMt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72823'),
  ('290736399605646544', 'Miljoenenjacht', 2000, null, 'John de Mol', null, 'Linda de Mol', null, 'Miljoenenjacht, officially Postcode Loterĳ Miljoenenjacht, is a Dutch game show, sponsored by the country''s postcode lottery, where a contestant and at-home viewer could win up to €5,000,000 or as little as €0.01. The show is broadcast at various times, spanning across six episodes for each set. The program was originally shown by TROS on Nederland 2, but moved to creator John de Mol''s channel Tien in 2005. After the channel was discontinued after its sale to the RTL Group, the program moved to RTL 4. Originally based on the German game show "Die Chance deines Lebens", the format of the programme''s final round used since 2002 has been exported worldwide by Dutch producer Endemol under the title Deal or No Deal, a title also used for Miljoenenjacht''s lower-stakes sister spinoff on RTL 5, which is based more off the global format and removes the additional elements.', 'Miljoenenjacht, officially Postcode Loterĳ Miljoenenjacht, is a Dutch game show, sponsored by the country''s postcode lottery, where a contestant and at-home viewer could win up to €5,000,000 or as little as €0.01. The show is broadcast at various times, spanning across six episodes for each set. The program was originally shown by TROS on Nederland 2, but moved to creator John de Mol''s channel Tien in 2005. After the channel was discontinued after its sale to the RTL Group, the program moved to RTL 4. Originally based on the German game show "Die Chance deines Lebens", the format of the programme''s final round used since 2002 has been exported worldwide by Dutch producer Endemol under the title Deal or No Deal, a title also used for Miljoenenjacht''s lower-stakes sister spinoff on RTL 5, which is based more off the global format and removes the additional elements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVJ7Q51S6r9eLrR3FyE2Y4wx1Dg.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:2425'),
  ('64109552603735772', 'Milky☆Subway: The Galactic Limited Express', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yohei Kameyama', null, 'Momoka Terasawa, Anna Nagase, Mikako Komatsu, Hisako Kanemoto, Makoto Koichi, Koki Uchiyama, Yoshitaka Yamaya', null, 'Arrested for reckless space driving, super human Chiharu and cyborg Makina are sentenced to clean the Milky☆Subway—an old interplanetary train. Easy enough, right? Wrong. When the train suddenly takes off, they are thrown into a high-speed space-train spectacle packed with chaos, no plans, and zero strategy. Just pure momentum!', 'Arrested for reckless space driving, super human Chiharu and cyborg Makina are sentenced to clean the Milky☆Subway—an old interplanetary train. Easy enough, right? Wrong. When the train suddenly takes off, they are thrown into a high-speed space-train spectacle packed with chaos, no plans, and zero strategy. Just pure momentum!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRQalzrXA5OTI6dDDi4eqrpIzbN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:294766'),
  ('727555904378815620', 'Millennium', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chris Carter', null, 'Lance Henriksen, Klea Scott, Peter Outerbridge, Stephen E. Miller', 'TV-14', 'A retired FBI serial-profiler joins the mysterious Millennium Group, a team of underground ex-law enforcement experts dedicated to fighting against the ever-growing forces of evil and darkness in the world.', 'A retired FBI serial-profiler joins the mysterious Millennium Group, a team of underground ex-law enforcement experts dedicated to fighting against the ever-growing forces of evil and darkness in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctTG2tps3tbcYvFAguKgsc6y8C7.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4330'),
