  ('117515376724003688', 'Minami-ke', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', null, 'Rie Kojika, Masashi Suzuki, Takashi Aoshima', 'Tetsuya Kakihara, Eri Kitamura, Marina Inoue, Nana Mizuki, Saeko Chiba, Daisuke Ono, Shintaro Asanuma, Saeko Chiba', 'TV-14', 'There are three of the Minami sisters: Haruka, Kana and Chiaki, who have an average life. The girls only have each other to depend on and help each other get through everything from love confessions to cooking.', 'There are three of the Minami sisters: Haruka, Kana and Chiaki, who have an average life. The girls only have each other to depend on and help each other get through everything from love confessions to cooking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgdsmw06yv8JeLzw4Vp1ODgSrjj.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:56354'),
  ('1142418175137333386', 'Minamoto no Yoshitsune', 1966, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kikunosuke Onoe IV, Ken Ogata, Sumiko Fuji, Kuriko Namino, Isuzu Yamada, Haruo Tanaka, Taketoshi Naitō, Fujio Tokita', null, 'The chronicles of the life of Minamoto no Yoshitsune (1159 - May 17th, 1189). He was a late Heian and early Kamakura general of the Minamoto clan of Japan. Yoshitsune was the ninth son of Minamoto no Yoshitomo. His older brother Minamoto no Yoritomo founded the Kamakura shogunate.', 'The chronicles of the life of Minamoto no Yoshitsune (1159 - May 17th, 1189). He was a late Heian and early Kamakura general of the Minamoto clan of Japan. Yoshitsune was the ninth son of Minamoto no Yoshitomo. His older brother Minamoto no Yoritomo founded the Kamakura shogunate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewueBqCRcarTJfZntcKzHp0e5C3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118086'),
  ('1125881897884975198', 'Minas de Pasión', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Family, Soap', null, null, 'Livia Brito Pestana, Osvaldo de León, Anette Michel, Alejandro Camacho, Cynthia Klitbo, César Évora Díaz, Karyme Lozano, Carlos Gatica', 'TV-14', 'Emilia a single mother who works in a mine fall in love with Leonardo the son of Roberta Castro the most powerful of the people. Roberta will seek revenge on Emilia by making her life miserable.', 'Emilia a single mother who works in a mine fall in love with Leonardo the son of Roberta Castro the most powerful of the people. Roberta will seek revenge on Emilia by making her life miserable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKQGa9HvBVkrGth8ouNofOGxMtx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232937'),
  ('1087186280572942616', 'Minato''s Laundromat', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yuzu Tsubaki', null, 'Takuya Kusakawa, Sho Nishigaki, Seiji Fukushi, Yu Inaba, Tomoya Oku, Hana Toyoshima', null, 'Akira Minato, a middle-aged coin laundry owner, befriends Shintarō Katsuki, a high schooler. Their bond deepens as Shintarō learns about Akira''s identity.', 'Akira Minato, a middle-aged coin laundry owner, befriends Shintarō Katsuki, a high schooler. Their bond deepens as Shintarō learns about Akira''s identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pDh8UK0KvqFUcuTIAZJK1NSHEc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:202985'),
  ('1037686342987242632', 'Mind Field', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Michael Stevens', null, 'Michael Stevens', 'TV-14', 'Explore the surprising things we know (and don’t know) about why people are the way they are through expert interviews, rare footage from historical experiments, and brand-new, ground-breaking demonstrations of human nature at work.', 'Explore the surprising things we know (and don’t know) about why people are the way they are through expert interviews, rare footage from historical experiments, and brand-new, ground-breaking demonstrations of human nature at work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7cC9Ix3qz1xPg540koRtWHjLbN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69763'),
  ('240674190760350459', 'Mind Games', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Steve Zahn, Christian Slater, Megalyn Echikunwoke, Gregory Marcel, Cedric Sanders, Jaime Ray Newman', 'TV-PG', 'Clark and Ross Edwards are brothers and partners in a unique agency committed to solving clients’ problems using the hard science of psychological manipulation. Clark is a former professor and a world-renowned expert in the field of human behavior. He has a checkered history due to bipolar disorder, which sometimes results in quirky, manic episodes. His older brother Ross is a slick con man who spent time in prison. Each in their own way knows what makes people tick. Drawing from the most cutting edge research in psychology, they can a tailor a plan to influence any situation. It’s a little bit science, a little bit con artistry plus a smattering of Jedi mind tricks. The brothers, along with their team of master manipulators are offering clients an alternative to fate.', 'Clark and Ross Edwards are brothers and partners in a unique agency committed to solving clients’ problems using the hard science of psychological manipulation. Clark is a former professor and a world-renowned expert in the field of human behavior. He has a checkered history due to bipolar disorder, which sometimes results in quirky, manic episodes. His older brother Ross is a slick con man who spent time in prison. Each in their own way knows what makes people tick. Drawing from the most cutting edge research in psychology, they can a tailor a plan to influence any situation. It’s a little bit science, a little bit con artistry plus a smattering of Jedi mind tricks. The brothers, along with their team of master manipulators are offering clients an alternative to fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAnfbp1rvKdksaxHK7N865R6E4P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:51170'),
  ('1147316879280720485', 'Mind of Mencia', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Mencia, Robert Morton', null, 'Carlos Mencia', 'TV-14', 'Mind of Mencia was an American television comedy series on the cable channel Comedy Central. Hosted by Carlos Mencia, it aired from 2005 to 2008.', 'Mind of Mencia was an American television comedy series on the cable channel Comedy Central. Hosted by Carlos Mencia, it aired from 2005 to 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3cjxVPYi8iAqcDcfKFuCl4FQPw.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2496'),
  ('305613135303341369', 'Mind Our Own Business', 1993, 'Family, Soap', null, null, 'Michelle Yim, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Esther Kwan Wing-Ho, Marco Ngai Chun-Git, Liu Kai-Chi, Tam Sin-Hung, Woo Fung, Gloria Yip Wan-Yee', null, 'The frugal and harsh father, CHENG SAM, and the open-minded and generous mother, LEUNG HANG MUI, are a lively couple in the family. Other family members include their lazy and rude son, YUEN YUK PO; their optimistic and irresponsible daughter, YUEN YUET CHU; their defiant and domineering daughter-in-law, HO SHUK KIANG, and their honest and confident son-in-law, YEUNG JO GAI. Their granddaughter, MUN HEI, is a free-spirited girl while their grandson, MUN CHOI, is a cunning and opportunistic businessman. The family''s fortunes are tied to their partners, CHU CHI WAH and CHAN WING MAN. Together, they form a tapestry of modern urban life.', 'The frugal and harsh father, CHENG SAM, and the open-minded and generous mother, LEUNG HANG MUI, are a lively couple in the family. Other family members include their lazy and rude son, YUEN YUK PO; their optimistic and irresponsible daughter, YUEN YUET CHU; their defiant and domineering daughter-in-law, HO SHUK KIANG, and their honest and confident son-in-law, YEUNG JO GAI. Their granddaughter, MUN HEI, is a free-spirited girl while their grandson, MUN CHOI, is a cunning and opportunistic businessman. The family''s fortunes are tied to their partners, CHU CHI WAH and CHAN WING MAN. Together, they form a tapestry of modern urban life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ote6nMem0bXPr96d48YVUyStlcA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225590'),
  ('286418294755713820', 'Mind Over Murder', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Nanfu Wang', null, 'Scott Watson', 'TV-MA', 'Chronicles the bizarre and psychologically complex story of six individuals who were convicted for the 1985 murder of a beloved 68- year-old grandmother, Helen Wilson, in Beatrice, Nebraska.', 'Chronicles the bizarre and psychologically complex story of six individuals who were convicted for the 1985 murder of a beloved 68- year-old grandmother, Helen Wilson, in Beatrice, Nebraska.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDhVWwcRCXSFJuIOfLyvj1buTzY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203282'),
  ('158072083973971463', 'Mind Your Language', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Vince Powell', 'Vince Powell', 'Barry Evans, George Camiller, Ricardo Montez, Albert Moses, Jacki Harding, Zara Nutley, Anna Bergman, Harry Littlewood', 'TV-14', 'Mind Your Language is a British sitcom broadcast on ITV. Created and written by Vince Powell, and directed by Stuart Allen, three series were produced by London Weekend Television between 1977 and 1979, and it was briefly revived in 1985 (or 1986 in most ITV regions) with six of the original cast members. Jeremy Brown, a language teacher, tries to make a living by teaching English to immigrants. With pupils from India, France, China, and many other countries, his lessons do not always go as planned.', 'Mind Your Language is a British sitcom broadcast on ITV. Created and written by Vince Powell, and directed by Stuart Allen, three series were produced by London Weekend Television between 1977 and 1979, and it was briefly revived in 1985 (or 1986 in most ITV regions) with six of the original cast members. Jeremy Brown, a language teacher, tries to make a living by teaching English to immigrants. With pupils from India, France, China, and many other countries, his lessons do not always go as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58RfYeIwDnJFbahMEy2yCDWyRAY.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2508'),
