  ('723857903612184723', 'Minning Town', 2021, 'Drama', null, 'Mantang Gao, Wang Sanmao', 'Huang Xuan, Zhang Jiayi, Yan Ni, Huang Jue, Yao Chen, Tao Hong, Wang Kai, Rayzha Alimjan', null, 'It tells the story of villagers from Ningxia who migrated and built Minning Town from scratch. The government wants to build the rural housing land and encourages the farmers of Xiji Country to migrate or relocate. However, the conditions of the desert are too harsh. The villagers who moved there mostly left the second day. Ma Defu tries his best to get the villagers to stay and build the Minning Town. In 1996, the Party Central Committee made a strategic plan to promote counterpart cooperation between the East and the West, which identified Fujian counterparts to promote poverty alleviation work in Ningxia. As time passes, Minning Town was given a new lease of life.', 'It tells the story of villagers from Ningxia who migrated and built Minning Town from scratch. The government wants to build the rural housing land and encourages the farmers of Xiji Country to migrate or relocate. However, the conditions of the desert are too harsh. The villagers who moved there mostly left the second day. Ma Defu tries his best to get the villagers to stay and build the Minning Town. In 1996, the Party Central Committee made a strategic plan to promote counterpart cooperation between the East and the West, which identified Fujian counterparts to promote poverty alleviation work in Ningxia. As time passes, Minning Town was given a new lease of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIYxfWYe9hM6HPHFsxaUGnuX6uy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116586'),
  ('806464822106064745', 'Minority Report', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Max Borenstein', null, 'Meagan Good, Stark Sands, Nick Zano, Daniel London, Laura Regan, Li Jun Li, Wilmer Valderrama', 'TV-14', 'Ten years after the demise of Precrime, crime-solving is different and justice leans more on sophisticated and trusted technology than on the instincts of the precogs—individuals who able to see the future. In Washington, D.C., a man haunted by the future and a cop haunted by her past race to stop the worst crimes of the year 2065 before they happen.', 'Ten years after the demise of Precrime, crime-solving is different and justice leans more on sophisticated and trusted technology than on the instincts of the precogs—individuals who able to see the future. In Washington, D.C., a man haunted by the future and a cop haunted by her past race to stop the worst crimes of the year 2065 before they happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUbANT6vjAFbHvhDQ3cxCZOzPK1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63175'),
  ('31562288004387356', 'Minuscule: The Private Life of Insects', 2006, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy', 'Hélène Giraud, Thomas Szabo', null, null, null, 'Short video animations giving a bird''s eye view of insects'' day to day existence, distorted through a burlesque, yet poetic lens.', 'Short video animations giving a bird''s eye view of insects'' day to day existence, distorted through a burlesque, yet poetic lens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cH7yCS9NLVqRvOlDUCesGme2Tqy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:15886'),
  ('169216623699421872', 'Minx', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ellen Rapoport', 'Emma Gase', 'Ophelia Lovibond, Jake Johnson, Jessica Lowe, Oscar Montoya, Lennon Parham, Idara Victor', 'TV-MA', 'An earnest young feminist joins forces with a low-rent publisher to make the world''s first erotic magazine for women.', 'An earnest young feminist joins forces with a low-rent publisher to make the world''s first erotic magazine for women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8m4ExDRn3oqZJI33mxKaZBjbf1v.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:118303'),
