  ('766227731531939089', 'Miotsukushi', 1985, 'Drama, Family', 'James Miki', null, 'Yasuko Sawaguchi, Junko Sakurada, Taro Kawano, Kyôhei Shibata, Toshie Negishi, Sanma Akashiya, Mitsuko Kusabue, Mariko Kaga', null, 'In the early Showa era, the town of Choshi in Chiba Prefecture was divided by the conflicts between the worlds of "land" and "sea". Born to Kyubei Bando, the owner of a long-established soy sauce brewery, and his mistress Rui, Kaworu was taken in by her father and raised as a prim and proper lady. As she grew up, she fell in love with Sokichi, the eldest son of an established fisherman; alas, their two families were in conflict. This is a story of pure love between two people that grew beyond the boundaries of the old customs that they were brought up with. It is a drama that depicts their turbulent journey of love and the bonds of the people from an old and established family working tirelessly to protect their naturally brewed soy sauce business through the ups and downs.', 'In the early Showa era, the town of Choshi in Chiba Prefecture was divided by the conflicts between the worlds of "land" and "sea". Born to Kyubei Bando, the owner of a long-established soy sauce brewery, and his mistress Rui, Kaworu was taken in by her father and raised as a prim and proper lady. As she grew up, she fell in love with Sokichi, the eldest son of an established fisherman; alas, their two families were in conflict. This is a story of pure love between two people that grew beyond the boundaries of the old customs that they were brought up with. It is a drama that depicts their turbulent journey of love and the bonds of the people from an old and established family working tirelessly to protect their naturally brewed soy sauce business through the ups and downs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFhq7L6YI8BAWp7OsQznV0jOXPh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107261'),
  ('742068889469965460', 'Mira lo que has hecho', 2018, 'Comedy, Family', 'Berto Romero', null, 'Berto Romero, Eva Ugarte, Anna Gras-Carreño, Jordi Aguilar', null, 'It seems like the end of the world, but it''s only the beginning.', 'It seems like the end of the world, but it''s only the beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FSJNv8YN0gb1go74UEx4nJFB2h.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:77412'),
  ('32547312282682415', 'Mira, Royal Detective', 2020, 'Kids, Animation', 'Becca Topol', null, 'Leela Ladnier, Utkarsh Ambudkar, Kal Penn', 'TV-Y7', 'A brave and resourceful girl becomes a royal detective in India after solving a mystery that saved the kingdom''s young prince.', 'A brave and resourceful girl becomes a royal detective in India after solving a mystery that saved the kingdom''s young prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjZuTNfz82ogbabj8NsVkWkFmyL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100975'),
  ('1019130883870692498', 'Mira: Life After Divorce', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Nehir Erdoğan, Yiğit Özşener, Nezaket Erden', 'TV-MA', 'When her husband drops the bombshell that he wants a divorce, Mira sets out to rebuild her life on her own terms.', 'When her husband drops the bombshell that he wants a divorce, Mira sets out to rebuild her life on her own terms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPTDlNpTCJkbDxVPlQvnOItDzuf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316474'),
  ('1116676534933996066', 'Miracle', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Son Geun-joo', 'Kang Chan-hee, Kang Min-ah, Hwi Young, Kim Kwang-kyu, So Hee-jung, Lim Hyun-sung, Hwang Bo-ra, Noh Hyo Jeong', null, 'Sorin an aspiring idol whose dreams were dashed after a traffic accident. She works at COA Entertainment, global star Luice’ management company. Due to a scandal, Luice’s career goes up in smoke and commiserates with Sorin where they then fall for each other. Meanwhile, Sorin’s best friend Siwoo realises his own dream of becoming a K-pop idol and debuts as a member of a boy group under the same management company.', 'Sorin an aspiring idol whose dreams were dashed after a traffic accident. She works at COA Entertainment, global star Luice’ management company. Due to a scandal, Luice’s career goes up in smoke and commiserates with Sorin where they then fall for each other. Meanwhile, Sorin’s best friend Siwoo realises his own dream of becoming a K-pop idol and debuts as a member of a boy group under the same management company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfD2CbiXQlqPw1kdCTU441QVCJQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204444'),
  ('1088509113254268993', 'Miracle Girls', 1993, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', null, null, 'Rei Sakuma, Kaneto Shiozawa, Ken Yamaguchi, Kappei Yamaguchi, Nariko Fujieda, Noriko Hidaka, Nobuo Tobita, Wakana Yamazaki', 'NR', 'Mikage and Tomomi Matsunaga are Miracle Girls: they have a telepathic link with each other and can teleport when they link their little fingers. Tomomi is a sports star and has a boyfriend called Noda. Mikage is the smartest student in the school and is in love with her sempai. He moved to London to study but they still kept in touch, that is until a selfish princess called Marie decides that he should come with her back to Diammas. Back in Japan the twins are having various problems of their own. But they soon realise that there is a link between Marie, an ancient legend, and a girl they know called Emma.', 'Mikage and Tomomi Matsunaga are Miracle Girls: they have a telepathic link with each other and can teleport when they link their little fingers. Tomomi is a sports star and has a boyfriend called Noda. Mikage is the smartest student in the school and is in love with her sempai. He moved to London to study but they still kept in touch, that is until a selfish princess called Marie decides that he should come with her back to Diammas. Back in Japan the twins are having various problems of their own. But they soon realise that there is a link between Marie, an ancient legend, and a girl they know called Emma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BmxrWsyT55m69IX1rWpiyNt7PQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34119'),
  ('539223718518223300', 'Miracle Workers', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Simon Rich', null, 'Daniel Radcliffe, Geraldine Viswanathan, Karan Soni, Jon Bass, Steve Buscemi', 'TV-MA', 'An anthology series in which a colorful blend of outcasts and iconoclasts confront universal issues across various time periods: love, faith, societal norms, and venturing into the unknown.', 'An anthology series in which a colorful blend of outcasts and iconoclasts confront universal issues across various time periods: love, faith, societal norms, and venturing into the unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uF1xaklzom7wmnmUsR1ORU5NmEL.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:78950'),
  ('39900957967540175', 'Miracles', 2003, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Richard Hatem, Michael Petroni', null, 'Skeet Ulrich, Marisa Ramirez, Angus Macfadyen', null, 'Miracles follows Paul Callan, an investigator of modern miracles for the Catholic Church who questions his faith after repeatedly finding mundane explanations for various supposed phenomena. After he witnesses a true, supernatural miracle that saves his life, only for his findings to be dismissed on a lack of evidence, Paul leaves behind the Church and is approached by Alva Keel to join his organization Sodalitas Quaerito, investigating and cataloguing "unexplainable" phenomena. Along with former police officer Evelyn Santos, Paul and Alva attempt to battle the impending "darkness" before it''s too late.', 'Miracles follows Paul Callan, an investigator of modern miracles for the Catholic Church who questions his faith after repeatedly finding mundane explanations for various supposed phenomena. After he witnesses a true, supernatural miracle that saves his life, only for his findings to be dismissed on a lack of evidence, Paul leaves behind the Church and is approached by Alva Keel to join his organization Sodalitas Quaerito, investigating and cataloguing "unexplainable" phenomena. Along with former police officer Evelyn Santos, Paul and Alva attempt to battle the impending "darkness" before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYsqYfsCkln1zpHJUWSn2MsznIM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1866'),
  ('1089523231358587325', 'Miraculous Brothers', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Park Chan-hong', 'Kim Ji-woo', 'Jung Woo, Bae Hyeon-seong, Park Yu-rim, Oh Man-seok, Lee Ki-woo, Kang Mal-geum, Seo Jae-hee, So Hee-jung', 'TV-14', 'An aspiring writer deep in debt encounters a young man with no memories and strange abilities. Together they fight injustice and form an unlikely bond.', 'An aspiring writer deep in debt encounters a young man with no memories and strange abilities. Together they fight injustice and form an unlikely bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdFpbXZy3GzXJPqvI6DiqKYVQsp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208834'),
  ('508442903898977817', 'Miraculous: Tales of Ladybug & Cat Noir', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Kids', 'Thomas Astruc, Jeremy Zag, Nathanaël Bronn', null, 'Anouck Hautbois, Benjamin Bollen, Marie Nonnenmacher, Thierry Kazazian', 'TV-Y7', 'Marinette and Adrien, two Parisian teenagers, are entrusted with powerful jewels in order to transform into superheroes Ladybug and Cat Noir. But neither hero knows the other''s true identity — or that they''re classmates!', 'Marinette and Adrien, two Parisian teenagers, are entrusted with powerful jewels in order to transform into superheroes Ladybug and Cat Noir. But neither hero knows the other''s true identity — or that they''re classmates!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acrtAy8gmxcsEvrDP09MpMSCeDZ.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:65334'),
  ('110435554552318070', 'Mirada de mujer: El regreso', 2003, 'Drama, Soap', 'Araceli Monsell', 'Luis Felipe Ybarra Rivera', 'Angélica Aragón, Ari Telch, Héctor Bonilla, Fernando Luján, Evangelina Elizondo, Verónica Langer', null, 'Mirada de mujer: El regreso is a Mexican telenovela, which was produced by and broadcast on TV Azteca in 2003. It is the sequel of Mirada de Mujer.', 'Mirada de mujer: El regreso is a Mexican telenovela, which was produced by and broadcast on TV Azteca in 2003. It is the sequel of Mirada de Mujer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3keQAYPMrXAx1THf1LKhAjo2M5W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16338'),
  ('333416606889845315', 'Mirage', 1983, 'Mystery, Crime', null, 'Alvis Lapins', 'Mirdza Martinsone, Martins Vilsons, Ints Burans, Boris Ivanov', null, 'Tragic events in the lives of five people after they have stolen a car with one million dollars in the safe. This is the job they have all been waiting for. The job that will set them up for life. A million dollars split five ways, who wouldn''t be interested? The only catch is that it''s the very definition of impossible...or is it? Armed with a brilliant plan, the four men and one woman think they can crack it. But as tensions in the group begin to mount and things start to go wrong, the million dollars feels more out of reach than ever. Even though it is right with them...', 'Tragic events in the lives of five people after they have stolen a car with one million dollars in the safe. This is the job they have all been waiting for. The job that will set them up for life. A million dollars split five ways, who wouldn''t be interested? The only catch is that it''s the very definition of impossible...or is it? Armed with a brilliant plan, the four men and one woman think they can crack it. But as tensions in the group begin to mount and things start to go wrong, the million dollars feels more out of reach than ever. Even though it is right with them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYXylElqUiv3dbgMwSksKDfWIK8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70472'),
  ('1046710308334429886', 'Mirage', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Bénédicte Charles, Franck Philippon, Olivier Pouponneau', null, 'Marie-Josée Croze, Clive Standen, Shawn Doyle, Hannes Jaenicke, Jeanette Hain, Thomas Chomel', null, 'Claire lost her husband Gabriel during the tsunami in 2004. His body was never found. 15 years later, Claire has a new life with Lukas and her son Zack. After a decade of mourning and professional purgatory, she has just landed a dream job in Abu Dhabi. One night, Claire is having dinner and sees Gabriel''s reflection in a window.', 'Claire lost her husband Gabriel during the tsunami in 2004. His body was never found. 15 years later, Claire has a new life with Lukas and her son Zack. After a decade of mourning and professional purgatory, she has just landed a dream job in Abu Dhabi. One night, Claire is having dinner and sees Gabriel''s reflection in a window.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocXdJZ11dRiCc17TxkzhSBhcQ2J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99119'),
  ('193266140170769834', 'Mirai Sentai Timeranger', 2000, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Masaru Nagai, Mika Katsumura, Yûji Kido, Tomohide Koizumi, Masahiro Kuranuki, Shinji Kasahara, Ryuuzaburou Ootomo, Koji Tobe', 'TV-PG', 'It''s the 30th century and time travel is illegal. To help monitor and police time crimes, the Time Protection Department is founded. But when Don Dolnero and his nefarious gang manage to trick four new TPD cadets into allowing them travel to the 20th century, the four cadets are forced to pursue them for the sake of history. There, in a time foreign to them, the cadets enlist Tatsuya Asami, a young martial artist, to aid their mission. Together, these five youngsters become the Timerangers. And though they try to live as ordinary 20th-century citizens, the Timerangers dedicate their lives to stopping Dolnero and others that may follow in his footsteps, attempting to forever alter the proper timeline!', 'It''s the 30th century and time travel is illegal. To help monitor and police time crimes, the Time Protection Department is founded. But when Don Dolnero and his nefarious gang manage to trick four new TPD cadets into allowing them travel to the 20th century, the four cadets are forced to pursue them for the sake of history. There, in a time foreign to them, the cadets enlist Tatsuya Asami, a young martial artist, to aid their mission. Together, these five youngsters become the Timerangers. And though they try to live as ordinary 20th-century citizens, the Timerangers dedicate their lives to stopping Dolnero and others that may follow in his footsteps, attempting to forever alter the proper timeline!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuWkpBzauTMcHXTOYykCPY92NMR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1983'),
  ('138021629241864444', 'Miranda', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Miranda Hart', 'Miranda Hart', 'Miranda Hart, Tom Ellis, Patricia Hodge, Sarah Hadland, Bohdan Poraj, Sally Phillips, Adrian Scarborough', null, 'Socially inept Miranda always gets into awkward situations; working in her joke shop with best friend Stevie, being hounded by her pushy mother, and especially when she''s around her crush Gary.', 'Socially inept Miranda always gets into awkward situations; working in her joke shop with best friend Stevie, being hounded by her pushy mother, and especially when she''s around her crush Gary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaqKf7WehmY40HgomvWUpEzrj1s.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:31500'),
  ('948273935080299015', 'Mirror: A Tale of Twin Cities', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'Ou Si Jia', 'Li Yifeng, Chen Yuqi, Zheng Yecheng, Yang Zhiwen, Liu Haikuan, Ye Shengjia, Liu Chang, Tan Kai', null, 'In a world populated by powerful gods and warring mortals, two enchanted beings meet in a peace-filled realm: They are Su Mo, a prince of sea gods, and Bai Ying, a princess and descendant of a mighty sword deity. They are immediately attracted to one another and begin on a romance, unaware that they are effectively crossing enemy lines and sparking animosity between two warring factions. Their actions anger other deities and Su Mo is eventually expelled from the realm. Overcome with grief, Bai Ying attempts to put her existence to an end by jumping from a magnificent pagoda.', 'In a world populated by powerful gods and warring mortals, two enchanted beings meet in a peace-filled realm: They are Su Mo, a prince of sea gods, and Bai Ying, a princess and descendant of a mighty sword deity. They are immediately attracted to one another and begin on a romance, unaware that they are effectively crossing enemy lines and sparking animosity between two warring factions. Their actions anger other deities and Su Mo is eventually expelled from the realm. Overcome with grief, Bai Ying attempts to put her existence to an end by jumping from a magnificent pagoda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4fjM6KRAIokmsnokyGVYXwAtUx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130265'),
  ('947449569667895432', 'Mirti Nidoje', 2026, 'Drama, Crime', 'Raimundas Banionis', null, 'Aistė Diržiūtė, Paulius Markevičius, Karolina Elžbieta Mikalojūnaitė, Agnieška Ravdo, Sandra Navickaitė, Mykolas Vildžiūnas, Vidmantas Fijalkauskas, Dainius Svobonas', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0OzbPKmve1fVV2Dt5TibJfbTtO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318758'),
  ('126662747537140112', 'Miru Tights', 2019, 'Animation', null, 'Fumiaki Maruto', 'Yoko Hikasa, Haruka Tomatsu, Aya Suzaki, Ai Kayano, Hochu Otsuka, Natsumi Fujiwara', 'TV-PG', 'Inspired by mangaka Yomu’s fascination with women’s legwear presented in his art book “Yomu Tights”, “Miru Tights” takes us into a world of sheer tights and beautiful women’s legs. The bright Homi Moemi, the serious and ambitious Ren Aikawa, and the cheerful, albeit somewhat naïve Yua Nakabeni have been friends for a long time and of course, their tights are part of their everyday attire! While Homi likes to jump into the biggest puddles she can find on rainy days, and Yua devotes herself completely to cosplay – much to the delight of her numerous followers on Twitter – Ren is more serious and works at a small café in her free time.', 'Inspired by mangaka Yomu’s fascination with women’s legwear presented in his art book “Yomu Tights”, “Miru Tights” takes us into a world of sheer tights and beautiful women’s legs. The bright Homi Moemi, the serious and ambitious Ren Aikawa, and the cheerful, albeit somewhat naïve Yua Nakabeni have been friends for a long time and of course, their tights are part of their everyday attire! While Homi likes to jump into the biggest puddles she can find on rainy days, and Yua devotes herself completely to cosplay – much to the delight of her numerous followers on Twitter – Ren is more serious and works at a small café in her free time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvFKwK0g4FGXXMllfjZ28LWBcHA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86823'),
  ('938218853356824268', 'MIRU: Paths to My Future', 2025, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Born in a distant future, MIRU, a weaponless robot, travels across time to support people from different eras. MIRU meets individuals from different times and places, people who, despite their struggles, live their lives with determination. Through their encounters with MIRU, people take small yet meaningful steps forward. These steps, like the "Butterfly Effect," create waves of change, moving toward a brighter future.', 'Born in a distant future, MIRU, a weaponless robot, travels across time to support people from different eras. MIRU meets individuals from different times and places, people who, despite their struggles, live their lives with determination. Through their encounters with MIRU, people take small yet meaningful steps forward. These steps, like the "Butterfly Effect," create waves of change, moving toward a brighter future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKe8afK13PaXICl5Cj5D37IezzI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259466'),
  ('1142612130527536505', 'Mirzapur', 2018, 'Crime, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Karan Anshuman, Puneet Krishna, Vineet Krishnan', 'Avinash Singh Tomar, Vijay Narayan Verma, Apurva Dhar Badgaiyann', 'Ali Fazal, Pankaj Tripathi, Shweta Tripathi Sharma, Rasika Dugal, Harshita Gaur, Sheeba Chaddha, Rajesh Tailang, Anjum Sharma', 'TV-MA', 'The iron-fisted Akhandanand Tripathi is a millionaire carpet exporter and the mafia don of Mirzapur. His son, Munna, is an unworthy, power-hungry heir who will stop at nothing to inherit his father''s legacy. An incident at a wedding procession forces him to cross paths with Ramakant Pandit, an upstanding lawyer, and his sons, Guddu and Bablu. It snowballs into a game of ambition, power and greed that threatens the fabric of this lawless city.', 'The iron-fisted Akhandanand Tripathi is a millionaire carpet exporter and the mafia don of Mirzapur. His son, Munna, is an unworthy, power-hungry heir who will stop at nothing to inherit his father''s legacy. An incident at a wedding procession forces him to cross paths with Ramakant Pandit, an upstanding lawyer, and his sons, Guddu and Bablu. It snowballs into a game of ambition, power and greed that threatens the fabric of this lawless city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rxLUFVrtTo82OxhbDXJDiJVkwL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:84105'),
  ('1072117845001202371', 'Mischief of the Gods', 2014, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Saori Hayami, Miyu Irino, Daisuke Ono, Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Yuto Uemura, Hiroshi Kamiya', null, 'Yui Kusanagi is ordered by Zeus, a god and the headmaster of a school he created, to teach the meaning of love to young and handsome gods. The reason he has for doing this is to cancel the negative effects of the weakening bond between the world of the divine and the world of the humans.', 'Yui Kusanagi is ordered by Zeus, a god and the headmaster of a school he created, to teach the meaning of love to young and handsome gods. The reason he has for doing this is to cancel the negative effects of the weakening bond between the world of the divine and the world of the humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGyHddc7V6DRrnMg55RYAirIZDC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60828'),
  ('766934659557515860', 'Mischievous Kiss', 2010, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Kim Hyun-joong, Jung So-min, Lee Tae-sung, Lee Si-young, Jeong Hye-young, Oh Kyung Soo, Choi Won-hong, Kang Nam-gil', 'TV-14', 'A clumsy high-school girl - Oh Ha-ni - is at the bottom of her class, and she has had a crush on a popular genius, Baek Seung-Jo, ever since she first laid eyes on him.', 'A clumsy high-school girl - Oh Ha-ni - is at the bottom of her class, and she has had a crush on a popular genius, Baek Seung-Jo, ever since she first laid eyes on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VIAQ9nc29od35NytFiEHSlTlkZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34408'),
  ('249308601604735269', 'Mischievous Kiss: Love in Tokyo', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Koto Nagata', null, 'Honoka Yahagi, Yuki Furukawa, Yuki Yamada, Nanami Fujimoto, Sogen Tanaka, Yuga Aizawa, Yoji Tanaka, Kazumasa Koura', null, 'At a high school entrance ceremony, high school student Kotoko Aihara, who isn''t that smart, notices pretty boy Naoki Irie. She falls in love with him immediately. Kotoko initially doesn''t express her feelings to him, but finally has a chance to tell him how she feels. Unfortunately, Naoki turns Kotoko down, saying "I don''t like dumb women." One day, Kotoko Aihara''s house is severely damaged by an earthquake. Until the house is rebuilt, Kotoko Aihara and her father decide to live with her father''s friend. When Kotoko Aihara moves to her new temporary house, she is surprised to learn that Naoki Irie lives there as well.', 'At a high school entrance ceremony, high school student Kotoko Aihara, who isn''t that smart, notices pretty boy Naoki Irie. She falls in love with him immediately. Kotoko initially doesn''t express her feelings to him, but finally has a chance to tell him how she feels. Unfortunately, Naoki turns Kotoko down, saying "I don''t like dumb women." One day, Kotoko Aihara''s house is severely damaged by an earthquake. Until the house is rebuilt, Kotoko Aihara and her father decide to live with her father''s friend. When Kotoko Aihara moves to her new temporary house, she is surprised to learn that Naoki Irie lives there as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tufipY6DEzo6PoDb3Jfj6xlIDMB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64793'),
  ('860171020284772670', 'Miseducation', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Katleho Ramaphakela, Rethabile Ramaphakela', null, 'Buntu Petse, Lunga Shabalala, Prev Reddy, Micaela Jade Tucker, Mpho Sebeng, Luyanda Zwane, Sechaba Ramphele, Mamarumo Marokane', 'TV-MA', 'After a public humiliation, a wannabe influencer enrolls in a small-town university, where she aspires to regain her social status.', 'After a public humiliation, a wannabe influencer enrolls in a small-town university, where she aspires to regain her social status.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gH3qVtn45xtWk0qFPWl9ocTgYF4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233343'),
  ('326948789628139889', 'Misfits', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Howard Overman', 'Howard Overman', 'Joseph Gilgun, Karla Crome, Nathan McMullen, Matt Stokoe, Shaun Dooley, Natasha O''Keeffe', 'TV-MA', 'When five young outsiders on Community Service get caught in a strange storm, they discover that they have developed superpowers.', 'When five young outsiders on Community Service get caught in a strange storm, they discover that they have developed superpowers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yjmRIp8A92FlAw5JpouQ50ATUA.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:31295'),
  ('800566286632348067', 'Misfits of Science', 1985, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'James D. Parriott, Tim Kring', null, 'Dean Paul Martin, Kevin Peter Hall, Mark Thomas Miller, Courteney Cox, Max Wright, Jennifer Holmes', null, 'A superhero fantasy television series featuring super-powered humans and their madcap adventures.', 'A superhero fantasy television series featuring super-powered humans and their madcap adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JvcjEivcVZDQ8Bk6UH0v15rMvb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10141'),
  ('485290467820759648', 'Misha the Bearcub', 1979, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Kids', null, null, 'Keiko Yokozawa, Akiko Tsuboi, Banjo Ginga, Keiko Han, Hideyuki Tanaka, Hiroshi Masuoka, Joji Yanami, Kaneta Kimotsuki', 'TV-G', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CxdmYgfzjuGFmgLhXCJLMUPRta.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69241'),
  ('698203451045903607', 'Misión S.O.S', 2004, 'Kids, Comedy, Family, Soap, Drama', 'Rosa Salazar Arenas', 'Ricardo Fiallega', 'Maribel Guardia, Guillermo Capetillo, Manuel Ojeda, Gabriela Goldsmith, Magda Guzmán, Maribel Fernández, Diana Golden, Irma Lozano', 'NR', 'The story follows the life of Diana, a pre-teen who lives in a neighborhood called Buenaventura. Diana and Christian, who has just moved to Mexico due to his parents'' divorce, quickly become best friends, despite their families hatred for each other. However, the neighbors of Buenaventura are in danger of losing their homes, their school and much more, because the evil old Severiano plans to tear down the neighborhood and build an enormous shopping mall in its place. To accomplish his plan, Severiano is willing to resort to any means, and will provoke a series of disasters to drive the inhabitants away.', 'The story follows the life of Diana, a pre-teen who lives in a neighborhood called Buenaventura. Diana and Christian, who has just moved to Mexico due to his parents'' divorce, quickly become best friends, despite their families hatred for each other. However, the neighbors of Buenaventura are in danger of losing their homes, their school and much more, because the evil old Severiano plans to tear down the neighborhood and build an enormous shopping mall in its place. To accomplish his plan, Severiano is willing to resort to any means, and will provoke a series of disasters to drive the inhabitants away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkKbgctkm5Zr5KbkAmmK00oGOCJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12984'),
  ('660786482601471865', 'Miskina, Poor Thing', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Melha Bedia, Xavier Lacaille, Yoann Gromb', 'Melha Bedia, Xavier Lacaille, Yoann Gromb', 'Melha Bedia, Hakim Jemili, Shirine Boutella, Victor Belmondo, Xavier Lacaille, Alka Balbir, Nadia Kaci, Zorah Benali', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpphi5UlhCokmSSutY1COIIz8P4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:137207'),
  ('276668772795347717', 'Misleading Track', 2005, 'Drama', 'Wai-kin Chong', null, 'Louisa So Yuk-Wah, Bowie Lam Bo-Yee, Deric Wan, Christine Ng Wing-Mei, Savio Tsang, Cindy Au, Winnie Yeung Yuen-Yee, Liu Kai-Chi', null, 'Five years ago, Hong Kong citizen YAN TING (SO YUK WAH, LOUISA) was wrongly found guilty of murdering her husband LAU KAI CHUNG (WAN SIU LUN, DERIC) in Taiwan. TING is released and returns to Hong Kong. She still believes in justice and has faith in regaining what has been stripped from her. She is shocked when she meets a man BEN YUEN (also played by WAN SIU LUN, DERIC) who looks exactly like CHUNG. However, CHUNG was certified dead in Taiwan. TING is completely bewildered at BEN’s existence. The truth is slowly revealed. TING decides to strike back. BEN sets TING up for jail again. Fortunately, she meets a warm-hearted lawyer LEO LAW (LAM, BOWIE). LEO works hard on her case. His effort seems to have paid off when he digs further into the truth...', 'Five years ago, Hong Kong citizen YAN TING (SO YUK WAH, LOUISA) was wrongly found guilty of murdering her husband LAU KAI CHUNG (WAN SIU LUN, DERIC) in Taiwan. TING is released and returns to Hong Kong. She still believes in justice and has faith in regaining what has been stripped from her. She is shocked when she meets a man BEN YUEN (also played by WAN SIU LUN, DERIC) who looks exactly like CHUNG. However, CHUNG was certified dead in Taiwan. TING is completely bewildered at BEN’s existence. The truth is slowly revealed. TING decides to strike back. BEN sets TING up for jail again. Fortunately, she meets a warm-hearted lawyer LEO LAW (LAM, BOWIE). LEO works hard on her case. His effort seems to have paid off when he digs further into the truth...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DKmuL6zwRDlOOWM7MWnR6cAy4N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109271'),
  ('1021436723938598512', 'Mismatched', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Prajakta Koli, Rohit Saraf, Rannvijay Singha, Vidya Malvade, Muskkaan Jaferi, Abhinav Sharma, Taaruk Raina, Dipannita Sharma', 'TV-MA', 'After a disastrous set-up by their families, two teens strike up a tentative friendship at their summer program - but deeper feelings aren''t far behind.', 'After a disastrous set-up by their families, two teens strike up a tentative friendship at their summer program - but deeper feelings aren''t far behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l65kfL6qhTWd858OqGTr3RWwAUj.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:113457'),
  ('148900740661829168', 'Miss Adrenaline: A Tale of Twins', 2023, 'Drama, Soap', null, null, 'Juanita Molina, David Palacio, Zharick León, Juan Manuel Guilera, Kevin Bury, María Luisa Flores, Emmanuel Esparza, Nicolás Quiroga', null, 'A competitive biker takes the identity of her long-lost identical twin sister to bring her killers to justice and get the truth behind their separation.', 'A competitive biker takes the identity of her long-lost identical twin sister to bring her killers to justice and get the truth behind their separation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWTsxp1OAlLj9MtqXAtAsyicTny.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228051'),
  ('470317075789537568', 'Miss Austen', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Keeley Hawes, Rose Leslie, Patsy Ferran, Jessica Hynes, Mirren Mack, Phyllis Logan, Kevin McNally, Max Irons', 'TV-PG', 'Miss Austen takes a literary mystery – Cassandra Austen notoriously burning her famous sister Jane’s letters – and reimagines it as a fascinating, witty and heart-breaking story of sisterly love, while creating in Cassandra a character as captivating as any Austen heroine.', 'Miss Austen takes a literary mystery – Cassandra Austen notoriously burning her famous sister Jane’s letters – and reimagines it as a fascinating, witty and heart-breaking story of sisterly love, while creating in Cassandra a character as captivating as any Austen heroine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRzs71MV8RgL1nyswSSklQpkLkH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241114'),
  ('354482223542913905', 'Miss Bernard Said.', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Aya Suzaki, Mikako Komatsu, Mitsuhiro Ichiki, Eri Kitamura', null, '"Miss Bernard" herself, Machida Sawako, and her book-loving friends live their literary days in the library. This gag series glorifying famous literature is filled with love for books of all sorts, as well as the kinds of things that all readers experience!', '"Miss Bernard" herself, Machida Sawako, and her book-loving friends live their literary days in the library. This gag series glorifying famous literature is filled with love for books of all sorts, as well as the kinds of things that all readers experience!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e885TPsX1PnvDNK5WMTlnPiGc7D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68165'),
  ('895201380192608479', 'Miss Caretaker of Sunohara-sou', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Eri Kitamura, Yume Miyamoto, Megumi Nakajima, Ayane Sakura, Ai Kayano, Asami Seto, Juri Nagatsuma, Rina Sato', null, 'Shiina Aki is constantly being treated like a girl due to his feminine looks so he decides to move to Tokyo to attend middle school in an attempt to change himself. However what awaits him in his new home, Sunohara-sou, is the kind-hearted caretaker, Sunohara Ayaka. Along with the three female members of Aki''s new middle school''s student council, Yukimoto Yuzu, Yamanashi Sumire & Kazami Yuri. And so begins Aki''s new life in Tokyo living with 4 girls.', 'Shiina Aki is constantly being treated like a girl due to his feminine looks so he decides to move to Tokyo to attend middle school in an attempt to change himself. However what awaits him in his new home, Sunohara-sou, is the kind-hearted caretaker, Sunohara Ayaka. Along with the three female members of Aki''s new middle school''s student council, Yukimoto Yuzu, Yamanashi Sumire & Kazami Yuri. And so begins Aki''s new life in Tokyo living with 4 girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXASMbUAaUjB75efTI5zl2OyUSB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80662'),
  ('961780171060358915', 'Miss Crow with Mr. Lizard', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Liu Yichang, Liu Chang', 'Ren Jialun, Xing Fei, Liu Ruilin, Zhao Yihuan, Ge Shimin, Fan Tiantian, Xuan Lu, Guan Chang', null, 'Gu Chuan is a passion-filled, vibrant young man with his whole life ahead of him – until his life is turned upside down by a sudden traffic accident. He suffers life-threatening injuries to his heart and surgeons are able to save him by giving him an emergency heart transplant.', 'Gu Chuan is a passion-filled, vibrant young man with his whole life ahead of him – until his life is turned upside down by a sudden traffic accident. He suffers life-threatening injuries to his heart and surgeons are able to save him by giving him an emergency heart transplant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Ki5BEr3l5Rt7giibU2GI0euGgp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124268'),
  ('666037375275735868', 'Miss Devil', 2018, 'Drama', 'Masahiro Yamaura', 'Masahiro Yamaura', 'Nanao, Shori Sato, Yoshino Kimura, Eiichiro Funakoshi, Toshiyuki Nishida, Masato Wada, Sei Shiraishi, Moro Morooka', null, 'Human resources consultant Tsubaki Mako has been dubbed the "devil of human resources" for her iron-fisted ways. She struts her way into a well-established firm and tackles sexual harassment, power harassment, bitter rivalries between factions, and monstrous employees, all of which are issues that can strike any company, with her extreme methods. Mako is like a devil who solves problems with her bold tactics.', 'Human resources consultant Tsubaki Mako has been dubbed the "devil of human resources" for her iron-fisted ways. She struts her way into a well-established firm and tackles sexual harassment, power harassment, bitter rivalries between factions, and monstrous employees, all of which are issues that can strike any company, with her extreme methods. Mako is like a devil who solves problems with her bold tactics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tk03N8YYClQt6poX6MoFg1PWtks.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78684'),
  ('76126039205114554', 'Miss Fallaci', 2025, 'Drama', 'Viola Rispoli, Tom Grieves', 'Viola Rispoli, Tom Grieves, Miriam Leone', 'Miriam Leone, Maurizio Lastrico, Francesca Agostini, Francesco Colella, Rosanna Gentili, Giordano De Plano', null, 'Based on the story of Italian journalist and writer Oriana Fallaci, who started her career with cinema and lifestyle columns and ended up becoming the most influential and controversial female journalist of the 20th century.', 'Based on the story of Italian journalist and writer Oriana Fallaci, who started her career with cinema and lifestyle columns and ended up becoming the most influential and controversial female journalist of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgHnPBJiQluvoVuSKloO3ZNRQFm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:257885'),
  ('84022730154720890', 'Miss Fisher''s Murder Mysteries', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Fiona Eagger, Deb Cox', null, 'Essie Davis, Ashleigh Cummings, Nathan Page, Hugo Johnstone-Burt', null, 'Our lady sleuth sashays through the back lanes and jazz clubs of late 1920’s Melbourne, fighting injustice with her pearl handled pistol and her dagger sharp wit. Leaving a trail of admirers in her wake, our thoroughly modern heroine makes sure she enjoys every moment of her lucky life. Based on author Kerry Greenwood''s Phryne Fisher Murder Mystery novels.', 'Our lady sleuth sashays through the back lanes and jazz clubs of late 1920’s Melbourne, fighting injustice with her pearl handled pistol and her dagger sharp wit. Leaving a trail of admirers in her wake, our thoroughly modern heroine makes sure she enjoys every moment of her lucky life. Based on author Kerry Greenwood''s Phryne Fisher Murder Mystery novels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeHJVpoWWKtCyFIZ6LbLkAR52vz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:43078'),
  ('823792888116246902', 'Miss Governor', 2025, 'Comedy, War & Politics', 'Tyler Perry, Niya Palmer', null, 'Terri J. Vaughn, Jade Novah, Drew Olivia Tillman, Dyon Brooks, Jo Marie Payton, Tré Boyd, Karon Riley, Tony Robinette', 'TV-MA', 'As she tries to shine in politics, Mississippi''s first Black lieutenant governor must manage her zany family and overcome a boss who''s stuck in the past.', 'As she tries to shine in politics, Mississippi''s first Black lieutenant governor must manage her zany family and overcome a boss who''s stuck in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xI5URJDLJMfTsdn5PHoJUjeeHOz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283368'),
  ('502465400479636783', 'Miss Hammurabi', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Moon Yoo-seok', 'Go Ara, L, Sung Dong-il, Ryu Deok-hwan, Lee Elijah, Lee Tae-sung, Cha Soo-yeon, Kim Yeong-ok', null, 'Park Cha O Reum works as a rookie judge. She is in her mid-20''s and follows "an eye for an eye" principle. She does not accept prejudice or blindly follow authority. Dealing with cases, she and her colleagues, including Im Ba-Reun, grow as persons.', 'Park Cha O Reum works as a rookie judge. She is in her mid-20''s and follows "an eye for an eye" principle. She does not accept prejudice or blindly follow authority. Dealing with cases, she and her colleagues, including Im Ba-Reun, grow as persons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fa3lNbQQWIZw7zenNRuh4Nsu0ad.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79342'),
  ('413342063926683617', 'Miss King', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Non, Naohito Fujiki, Kana Kurashina, Shido Nakamura, Kaoru Okunuki, Shoot Mori, Yui Narumi, Tokuma Nishioka', 'TV-14', 'The daughter of a genius shogi player channels the pain of her father''s abandonment and her mother''s death to become an elite competitor.', 'The daughter of a genius shogi player channels the pain of her father''s abandonment and her mother''s death to become an elite competitor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6qz00DZeTnSqBlb1OdvM5R5YSt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:296064'),
  ('334566491598220416', 'Miss Kobayashi''s Dragon Maid', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mutsumi Tamura, Yuuki Kuwahara, Maria Naganawa, Yuuki Takada, Minami Takahashi, Daisuke Ono, Yuichi Nakamura, Emiri Kato', 'TV-14', 'Kobayashi lives alone in an apartment, until one day, Tohru appeared and they ended up living together. Tohru looks down on humans as inferior and foolish, but having been saved by Kobayashi-san, she does everything she can to repay the debt and help her with various things, although not everything goes according to plan. A mythical everyday life comedy about a hard working office lady living with a dragon girl.', 'Kobayashi lives alone in an apartment, until one day, Tohru appeared and they ended up living together. Tohru looks down on humans as inferior and foolish, but having been saved by Kobayashi-san, she does everything she can to repay the debt and help her with various things, although not everything goes according to plan. A mythical everyday life comedy about a hard working office lady living with a dragon girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDJC9SBNqUFoGQ6uuxs0EfBsqct.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69291'),
  ('789970965703041154', 'Miss Kuroitsu From the Monster Development Department', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kaori Maeda, Satomi Amano, Yuuichirou Umehara, Tetsu Inada, Mao Ichimichi, Takuma Terashima, Ayana Taketatsu, Shunichi Toki', 'TV-14', 'Touka Kuroitsu is a research assistant who belongs to the Monster Development Department of the evil organization Agastia. However, the enemy she has to fight right now isn''t the heroes of justice, but her boss. So long justice exists, evil too, will exist. This is the story of those who fight secretly in the shadows of justice and evil''s confrontation.', 'Touka Kuroitsu is a research assistant who belongs to the Monster Development Department of the evil organization Agastia. However, the enemy she has to fight right now isn''t the heroes of justice, but her boss. So long justice exists, evil too, will exist. This is the story of those who fight secretly in the shadows of justice and evil''s confrontation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yP0gRkxo9puHGAc9PgwUj9Ym0h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128826'),
  ('641551994824870320', 'Miss Lucky Go!', 2023, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Fan Yi Yuan, Bao Zheng Qi', 'Liu Te, Lin Qiyu, Zhang Jiongmin, Xu Muchan, Xu Mengyuan, Gu Lechen, Ma Yueye, Zeng Yaohui', null, 'Aspiring figurine designer Chen Miran enrolls in university for a fresh start but ends up in the same class as her ex, Zhong Weiqiong, who once dumped her coldly. Determined to win her back, Zhong schemes to reignite their love, unaware their past breakup was a misunderstanding. As old feelings resurface and they reconcile, a surprising rival appears, threatening to unravel their newfound happiness.', 'Aspiring figurine designer Chen Miran enrolls in university for a fresh start but ends up in the same class as her ex, Zhong Weiqiong, who once dumped her coldly. Determined to win her back, Zhong schemes to reignite their love, unaware their past breakup was a misunderstanding. As old feelings resurface and they reconcile, a surprising rival appears, threatening to unravel their newfound happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wS8VgxuuEEPJ8iw4PSatAdHtUrE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234751'),
  ('297770922467339924', 'Miss Machiko', 1981, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Rihoko Yoshida, Masako Nozawa, Noriko Tsukase, Naoki Tatsuta, Shigeru Chiba, Hiroshi Otake, Yoneko Matsukane, Kaneto Shiozawa', null, 'The mischievous students of Arama Academy meet their match in a beautiful and clever new teacher, Miss Machiko! But they''re determined to find a prank that will really humiliate her.', 'The mischievous students of Arama Academy meet their match in a beautiful and clever new teacher, Miss Machiko! But they''re determined to find a prank that will really humiliate her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZL8vWEDAlNy2v6ngxu2bhppxSy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44650'),
  ('189828347617350042', 'Miss Marple: A Murder Is Announced', 1985, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, 'Agatha Christie', 'Joan Hickson', null, 'An advertisement announcing the time and place of a forthcoming murder appears among the ads of the paper in the small village of Chipping Cleghorn.', 'An advertisement announcing the time and place of a forthcoming murder appears among the ads of the paper in the small village of Chipping Cleghorn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MzWUqYabOX6hj9Z9tXElhnF6Gc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76462'),
  ('581495140047174891', 'Miss Marple: A Pocketful of Rye', 1985, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Agatha Christie', null, 'Joan Hickson, Timothy West, Tom Wilkinson, Peter Davison, Clive Merrison, Rachel Bell, Fabia Drake, Frances Low', null, 'When a handful of grain is found in the pocket of a murdered businessman, Miss Marple seeks a murderer with a penchant for nursery rhymes.', 'When a handful of grain is found in the pocket of a murdered businessman, Miss Marple seeks a murderer with a penchant for nursery rhymes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4o4QI5cBMNlhZFIOhPpbK9fFaF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76463'),
  ('274804674995341453', 'Miss Marple: At Bertram''s Hotel', 1987, 'Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Joan Hickson, Caroline Blakiston, James Cossins, Joan Greenwood, George Baker, Preston Lockwood, Helena Michell, Peter Baldwin', null, 'There''s a murder at the elegant hotel where Miss Marple is staying and international adventurer Bess Sedgwick is the prime suspect.', 'There''s a murder at the elegant hotel where Miss Marple is staying and international adventurer Bess Sedgwick is the prime suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJfM3M0D5BO7cRoTEe5uWpHU08q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76468'),
  ('1136715284860614258', 'Miss Marple: Nemesis', 1987, 'Crime, Mystery', null, 'T.R. Bowen', 'Joan Hickson, Peter Tilbury, Frank Gatliff, Barbara Franceschi, Bruce Payne, Roger Hammond, Patrick Godfrey, Ann Queensberry', null, 'Mr. Jason Rafiel asks Miss Marple to solve a crime but, he does gives her any details. In fact, he can''t be sure that a crime was committed at all.', 'Mr. Jason Rafiel asks Miss Marple to solve a crime but, he does gives her any details. In fact, he can''t be sure that a crime was committed at all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jV9kbTaxO9tLVORhT37Qnb1D39I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47730'),
  ('195496595127436046', 'Miss Marple: Sleeping Murder', 1987, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Joan Hickson, Geraldine Alexander, John Moulder-Brown, Frederick Treves, Jean Anderson, Terrence Hardiman, John Bennett, Geraldine Newman', null, 'When a young bride moves into a country manor, long repressed childhood memories of witnessing a murder come to the surface.', 'When a young bride moves into a country manor, long repressed childhood memories of witnessing a murder come to the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zikO7vlK3r4AGLjtYt6E40QlG7S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76469'),
  ('486086867547359274', 'Miss Marple: The Body in the Library', 1984, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Agatha Christie, T.R. Bowen', 'T.R. Bowen', 'Joan Hickson, Gwen Watford, Andrew Cruickshank, Frederick Jaeger, David Horovitch, Ciaran Madden, Anthony Smee, Jess Conrad', null, 'Amateur detective Miss Jane Marple investigates the murder of a young woman whose body is found in the library at Gossington Hall, home of Colonel and Mrs. Arthur Bantry.', 'Amateur detective Miss Jane Marple investigates the murder of a young woman whose body is found in the library at Gossington Hall, home of Colonel and Mrs. Arthur Bantry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Dno08EMEqEOV2BxLp3oBKjp1fp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76459'),
  ('744618088386198921', 'Miss Marple: The Moving Finger', 1985, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Agatha Christie', 'Julia Jones', 'Joan Hickson, Michael Culver, Sandra Payne, Richard Pearson, Andrew Bicknell, Sabina Franklyn, Dilys Hamlett, Patsy Smart', null, 'The residents of a quiet English village begin to receive nasty, threatening letters. The wife of the local vicar calls in her friend Miss Marple to investigate.', 'The residents of a quiet English village begin to receive nasty, threatening letters. The wife of the local vicar calls in her friend Miss Marple to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MCHLBAuswB8uB8w6qBmnGgqQfE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76461'),
  ('511009602732499059', 'Miss Match', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Darren Star', null, 'Alicia Silverstone, Lake Bell, David Conrad, Jodi Long, James Roday Rodriguez, Ryan O''Neal', null, 'Kate Fox, a divorce lawyer who dabbles at matchmaking on the side, finds herself thrust into the spotlight and dismaying her boss/father when a socialite bride credits Kate to the press as being the secret to her romantic success.', 'Kate Fox, a divorce lawyer who dabbles at matchmaking on the side, finds herself thrust into the spotlight and dismaying her boss/father when a socialite bride credits Kate to the press as being the secret to her romantic success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8T8UwddEe3LrgwxVhkUxmv8jfeE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2084'),
  ('539842587228351976', 'Miss Monochrome - The Animation', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Miss Monochrome is an android who decides to try and become a top idol singer in the ever growing competitive market.', 'Miss Monochrome is an android who decides to try and become a top idol singer in the ever growing competitive market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnJ9kX1a3TkCMEtABoknjnHWvOv.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:76219'),
  ('865617340094043774', 'Miss Night and Day', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Mystery', 'Lee Hyung-min', null, 'Lee Jung-eun, Jung Eun-ji, Choi Jin-hyuk, Yoon Byung-hee, Jeong Seok-yong, Jeong Young-ju, Kim Ah-young, Baek Seo-hoo', null, 'A bittersweet romantic comedy about a job seeker who suddenly gets stuck in time as an old-ager one day, and an extraordinary internship with a prosecutor who is caught up in her all day and night.', 'A bittersweet romantic comedy about a job seeker who suddenly gets stuck in time as an old-ager one day, and an extraordinary internship with a prosecutor who is caught up in her all day and night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfE5kgRsgZD9lXtCS0dnfOz7Kk5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231749'),
  ('489551205210192424', 'Miss Scarlet', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Rachael New', null, 'Kate Phillips, Cathy Belton, Ansu Kabia, Tom Durant-Pritchard, Simon Ludders, Tim Chipping, Paul Bazely, Sam Buchanan', 'TV-PG', 'When Eliza Scarlet''s father dies, he leaves her penniless, but she resolves to continue his detective agency. To operate in a male-dominated world, though, she needs a partner... step forward a detective known as the Duke. Eliza and The Duke strike up a mismatched, fiery relationship as they team up to solve crime in the murkiest depths of 1880’s London.', 'When Eliza Scarlet''s father dies, he leaves her penniless, but she resolves to continue his detective agency. To operate in a male-dominated world, though, she needs a partner... step forward a detective known as the Duke. Eliza and The Duke strike up a mismatched, fiery relationship as they team up to solve crime in the murkiest depths of 1880’s London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pbxTckwvaTXMABenkcmO1VhQi8.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:96450'),
  ('371090117808904283', 'Miss Shachiku and the Little Baby Ghost', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rina Hidaka, Hisako Kanemoto, Konomi Kohara, Maaya Uchida, Kaori Ishihara', 'TV-14', 'From sunup to sundown, Fushihara-san works ’round the clock. She spends so much time there that even the ghosts worry about her well-being! One night, Fushihara-san was working late as usual when a little ghost girl whispered to her, “Leave now”—an encounter that would change her life forever. Be healed by the heartwarming daily life of the cute little ghost and Fushihara-san!', 'From sunup to sundown, Fushihara-san works ’round the clock. She spends so much time there that even the ghosts worry about her well-being! One night, Fushihara-san was working late as usual when a little ghost girl whispered to her, “Leave now”—an encounter that would change her life forever. Be healed by the heartwarming daily life of the cute little ghost and Fushihara-san!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RcqAojHIVHXfdhW3mqHBNlfEy7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127327'),
  ('565731941961057760', 'Miss Sherlock', 2018, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Yuko Takeuchi, Shihori Kanjiya, Kenichi Takitoh, Yukiyoshi Ozawa, Ran Ito, Tomoya Nakamura, Ryohei Otani, Yuki Saito', 'TV-14', 'Sherlock has a peculiar character flaw. She does not open her heart to strangers. She is Japanese, but was born in Britain. She now works as an investigation consultant for the police department. Wato Tachibana is an excellent surgeon and is guided by the principal of justice. Sherlock and Wato Tachibana get to know each other through a case and begin to rely on each other.', 'Sherlock has a peculiar character flaw. She does not open her heart to strangers. She is Japanese, but was born in Britain. She now works as an investigation consultant for the police department. Wato Tachibana is an excellent surgeon and is guided by the principal of justice. Sherlock and Wato Tachibana get to know each other through a case and begin to rely on each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ISaQjmIfFM0aQqcduFcI8B8dZ4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79347'),
  ('240364722359147473', 'Miss Spider''s Sunny Patch Friends', 2004, 'Kids, Animation', 'Nadine Van der Velde, David Kirk', null, 'Rebecca Brenner, Mitchell Eisner, Kristin Davis, Scott Beaudin, Tony Jay, Julie Lemieux', 'TV-Y', 'Miss Spider''s Sunny Patch Friends is an animated program based on the children''s books by David Kirk, which airs on Nick Jr. in the United States, on Treehouse TV in Canada, and on Discovery Kids in Brazil. Each episode follows the everyday adventures of a family of bugs, who have made their home in what is called the Hollow Tree, led by the gentle, kind-hearted Miss Spider. Our gifts, they are many: We hop, fly and crawl. But kindness is the finest of all! - Miss Spider', 'Miss Spider''s Sunny Patch Friends is an animated program based on the children''s books by David Kirk, which airs on Nick Jr. in the United States, on Treehouse TV in Canada, and on Discovery Kids in Brazil. Each episode follows the everyday adventures of a family of bugs, who have made their home in what is called the Hollow Tree, led by the gentle, kind-hearted Miss Spider. Our gifts, they are many: We hop, fly and crawl. But kindness is the finest of all! - Miss Spider', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ULrcTbiy2VjRquYMUfWSoUNTua.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:13287'),
  ('823590128730642235', 'Miss the Dragon', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Min Guohui', 'Dylan Wang, Zhu Xudan, Deng Wei, Pan Meiye, Liang Yongni, Zhu Zanjin', null, 'A young maidservant named Liu Ying saves a snake on behalf of her young mistress in a chance encounter. However, the snake turns out to be a thousand year ancient dragon named Yuchu Longyan, who now wants to marry her to repay her kindness. The two''s lives then becomes entangled with each another as their love transcends over three lifetimes.', 'A young maidservant named Liu Ying saves a snake on behalf of her young mistress in a chance encounter. However, the snake turns out to be a thousand year ancient dragon named Yuchu Longyan, who now wants to marry her to repay her kindness. The two''s lives then becomes entangled with each another as their love transcends over three lifetimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vk9zjSVonDt7MYvta6Fx6Pemdbd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125061'),
  ('205311447672124535', 'Miss Universe', 1955, 'Reality', null, null, 'Lyshanda Moyas', null, 'Miss Universe is an annual international beauty pageant that is run by the United States-based Miss Universe Organization. The contest is the largest pageant in the world in terms of live TV coverage, airing yearly in more than 190 countries worldwide to an audience of over 2.5 billion people. Along with Miss World, Miss International, and Miss Earth, Miss Universe is one of the Big Four international beauty pageants. The Miss Universe Organization and its brand, along with Miss USA and Miss Teen USA, are currently owned by the WME/IMG talent agency.', 'Miss Universe is an annual international beauty pageant that is run by the United States-based Miss Universe Organization. The contest is the largest pageant in the world in terms of live TV coverage, airing yearly in more than 190 countries worldwide to an audience of over 2.5 billion people. Along with Miss World, Miss International, and Miss Earth, Miss Universe is one of the Big Four international beauty pageants. The Miss Universe Organization and its brand, along with Miss USA and Miss Teen USA, are currently owned by the WME/IMG talent agency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzEfMwbEfdW6nMo0DmhIUh1lLS4.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:42402'),
  ('150038252173937098', 'Miss USA', 1963, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'The Miss USA Pageant is a beauty contest that has been held annually since 1952 to select the United States entrant in the Miss Universe pageant. The Miss Universe Organization operates both pageants, as well as Miss Teen USA.', 'The Miss USA Pageant is a beauty contest that has been held annually since 1952 to select the United States entrant in the Miss Universe pageant. The Miss Universe Organization operates both pageants, as well as Miss Teen USA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9FnshEyCCNzR84f1fZQghuhjV0.jpg', 64, 'tmdb:tv:23902'),
  ('1136158790953137238', 'Miss XV', 2012, 'Soap, Drama', 'Pedro Damián', 'Iván Cuevas', 'Paulina Goto, Natasha Dupeyrón, Eleazar Gómez, Yago Muñoz, Jack Duarte, Macarena Achaga, Raquel Garza, Gabriela Platas', 'NR', 'Miss XV follows the story of two teenage best friends, Valentina and Natalia, (who were born on the same day at the same hour), who dream of the perfect quinceañera birthday party, and long to become the girlfriends of their respective crushes, Niko and Eddy.', 'Miss XV follows the story of two teenage best friends, Valentina and Natalia, (who were born on the same day at the same hour), who dream of the perfect quinceañera birthday party, and long to become the girlfriends of their respective crushes, Niko and Eddy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RHi5u5bDY4j5hUIaJXN6TbNjac.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40403'),
  ('658849304257619147', 'Missing', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Glenn Davis, William Laurin', null, 'Caterina "Hiding in the closet" Scorsone, Vivica A. Fox, Mark Consuelos', 'TV-PG', 'Jess Mastriani was a normal person who only wanted to take over her parents'' restaurant in Indiana. But that changed when she was hit by lightning. After that she began seeing visions of missing people. Jess decides to use her newfound ability to be a consultant to the FBI, helping locate missing individuals. Eventually, she is hired by the bureau full-time and trained to become an agent, but her by-the-book nature sometimes clashes with the personality of her partner. Jess and her colleagues work out of the FBI''s Washington, D.C., office.', 'Jess Mastriani was a normal person who only wanted to take over her parents'' restaurant in Indiana. But that changed when she was hit by lightning. After that she began seeing visions of missing people. Jess decides to use her newfound ability to be a consultant to the FBI, helping locate missing individuals. Eventually, she is hired by the bureau full-time and trained to become an agent, but her by-the-book nature sometimes clashes with the personality of her partner. Jess and her colleagues work out of the FBI''s Washington, D.C., office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RdCx8fplh39dYh3YkwI7x3zSda.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:45388'),
  ('1137187803698329312', 'Missing', 2010, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure, Crime', null, null, 'Sonya Smith, Catherine Siachoque, Jesus Licciardello, Gabriel Porras, Jorge Luis Pila, Roberto Mateos, Ivelin Giro, Mauricio Hénao', null, 'The night Elisa’s cousins-Santiago, Flor, and Eduardo, invited her to a nightclub and after a great deal of begging her parents allowed her go. When Danna and he sister-in-law Cecilia went to pick them up, all of them started showing up except for Elisa. As the hours passed, her parent grew more and more desperate and it was then when they decided to call the police and file a missing report.', 'The night Elisa’s cousins-Santiago, Flor, and Eduardo, invited her to a nightclub and after a great deal of begging her parents allowed her go. When Danna and he sister-in-law Cecilia went to pick them up, all of them started showing up except for Elisa. As the hours passed, her parent grew more and more desperate and it was then when they decided to call the police and file a missing report.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QR6gDtbDItL2DzBnHglrh4Ip8W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31997'),
  ('497771346557221408', 'Missing', 2012, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Gregory Poirier', null, 'Ashley Judd, Cliff Curtis, Adriano Giannini, Nick Eversman', 'TV-14', 'Becca Winstone learns that her son, Michael, disappears while studying abroad, and it''s a race against time when she travels to Europe to track him down. A surprising turn of events reveals just how far one mother will go to protect her family. Exotic locations and thrilling twists will keep you riveted in "Missing."', 'Becca Winstone learns that her son, Michael, disappears while studying abroad, and it''s a race against time when she travels to Europe to track him down. A surprising turn of events reveals just how far one mother will go to protect her family. Exotic locations and thrilling twists will keep you riveted in "Missing."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6vmCXWDU5iNPxDag5Wi0nmUoU0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39553'),
  ('663928477847292519', 'Missing', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'Colin Nutley', null, 'Molly Nutley, Mattias Nordkvist, Helena Bergström, Johan Widerberg, Johan H:son Kjellgren', null, 'Police inspector Maja Silver returns to her hometown in the Swedish Bible Belt as a terrible discovery paralyzes the small community.', 'Police inspector Maja Silver returns to her hometown in the Swedish Bible Belt as a terrible discovery paralyzes the small community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kO7X8HdGUOyOKNIb9lEQ27vr1xK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:52008'),
  ('785556508338391367', 'Missing Crown Prince', 2024, 'Drama', null, 'Kim Ji-soo, Park Chul', 'Suho, Hong Ye-ji, Kim Min-kyu, Myung Se-bin, Kim Ju-hun, Yoo Se-rye, Jeon Jin-oh, Cha Kwang-soo', null, 'A political drama set in Joseon dynasty about two relationships that fate has set in a tragic path, yet they fought against all odds.', 'A political drama set in Joseon dynasty about two relationships that fate has set in a tragic path, yet they fought against all odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16mfo1CiMwKRhUK4PbWvvRt0r2A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235576'),
  ('1067192306577940589', 'Missing Nine', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Han Jung-hoon', 'Son Hwang-Won, Han Jung-hoon', 'Jung Kyung-ho, Baek Jin-hee, Choi Tae-joon, Oh Jung-se, Lee Sun-bin, Tae Hang-ho, Kim Sang-ho, Chanyeol', null, 'Story about an unexpected plane crash that causes a widespread panic in South Korea due to the disappearance of nine people, including some influential figures in the entertainment industry. Seo Joon O used to be a popular singer, but he isn''t popular anymore. Now, he works as a reporter for a TV entertainment show. He and his stylist Ra Bong-Hee land on a deserted island.', 'Story about an unexpected plane crash that causes a widespread panic in South Korea due to the disappearance of nine people, including some influential figures in the entertainment industry. Seo Joon O used to be a popular singer, but he isn''t popular anymore. Now, he works as a reporter for a TV entertainment show. He and his stylist Ra Bong-Hee land on a deserted island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e64mWY8t1WoTaab2LRQi59QN6b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68891'),
  ('373819196852530332', 'Missing Noir M', 2015, 'Crime', null, 'Moon So-san, Lee Yoo-jin', 'Kim Kang-woo, Park Hee-soon, Cho Bo-ah, Kim Kyu-chul, Park So-hyun', null, 'Gil Soo-Hyun is extremely intelligent. At the age of 10, he attended Harvard University. After graduating there, he decided to work at the FBI and worked there for 10 years. Afterwards, he decided to come back to South Korea. He now works as the leader of the Special Missing Persons Unit. The unit deals with about 1% of special missing cases involving violent crimes. His appearance borders on perfection, but he holds a secret. Detective Oh Dae-Young joins the Special Missing Persons Unit. He has worked as a detective for 20 years and he has an obsession in observing the law. He is known as a master of missing person cases.', 'Gil Soo-Hyun is extremely intelligent. At the age of 10, he attended Harvard University. After graduating there, he decided to work at the FBI and worked there for 10 years. Afterwards, he decided to come back to South Korea. He now works as the leader of the Special Missing Persons Unit. The unit deals with about 1% of special missing cases involving violent crimes. His appearance borders on perfection, but he holds a secret. Detective Oh Dae-Young joins the Special Missing Persons Unit. He has worked as a detective for 20 years and he has an obsession in observing the law. He is known as a master of missing person cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayxjb1MwPixbuFSTV2D26Ru4V8G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62449'),
  ('921713292032631126', 'Missing You', 2012, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Moon Hee-jung', 'MICKY Yoochun, Yoon Eun-hye, Yoo Seung-ho, Yeo Jin-goo, Kim So-hyun, Ahn Do-gyu, Han Jin-hee, Jang Mi-Inae', null, 'High school sweethearts Jung-woo and Soo-yeon were separated in a horrifying tragedy that continues to weigh down on them as adults. Now a guilt-ridden detective, Jung-woo has been desperately searching for Soo-yeon for years, but when he crosses paths with her again, she has already become someone else with a new identity.', 'High school sweethearts Jung-woo and Soo-yeon were separated in a horrifying tragedy that continues to weigh down on them as adults. Now a guilt-ridden detective, Jung-woo has been desperately searching for Soo-yeon for years, but when he crosses paths with her again, she has already become someone else with a new identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esXBj6VJyR7IclbWRXbjHiB0OKT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46002'),
  ('96513354270822414', 'Missing You', 2025, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Victoria Asare-Archer, Harlan Coben', null, 'Rosalind Eleazar, Jessica Kate Plummer, Richard Armitage, Lenny Henry, Steve Pemberton, Lisa Faulkner, Mary Malone, Brigid Zengeni', 'TV-MA', 'When Detective Kat Donovan matches on a dating app with the fiancé who disappeared years before, she learns that some secrets are best left in the past.', 'When Detective Kat Donovan matches on a dating app with the fiancé who disappeared years before, she learns that some secrets are best left in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEiqusZEqOrqHmRtOninChmcOG0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244243'),
  ('916987603129770137', 'Missing: Dead or Alive?', 2023, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Follow officers from a South Carolina sheriff’s department as they urgently search for individuals who''ve disappeared under troubling circumstances.', 'Follow officers from a South Carolina sheriff’s department as they urgently search for individuals who''ve disappeared under troubling circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dge3o5lvuHGpV7Y4MTksMw6Ejrc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:225351'),
  ('238581816207121242', 'Missing: The Other Side', 2020, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Min Yeon-hong', 'Ban Gi-ri, Jeong So-young', 'Go Soo, Huh Joon-ho, Lee Jung-eun, An So-hee, Ha Jun, Kim Dong-hwi, Song Geon-hee, Ji Dae-han', null, 'A village holds spirits of missing, deceased people. A search to find the missing bodies and discover the truth behind their disappearance occurs.', 'A village holds spirits of missing, deceased people. A search to find the missing bodies and discover the truth behind their disappearance occurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRlEg8sjyA73pi3ZZF3WTPotmXO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106761'),
  ('311912374260700552', 'Mission Hill', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Bill Oakley, Josh Weinstein', null, 'Wallace Langham, Scott Menville, Brian Posehn, Vicki Lewis, Nick Jameson, Tom Kenny, Bill Oakley, Josh Weinstein', 'TV-14', 'Meet overqualified, underemployed, 24-year-old Andy French. Ambition: to be a cartoonist. Occupation: salesman at Waterbed World. Hobby: Where''s the party? But responsibility soon knocks on the door of the loft apartment Andy shares with two fellow slackers when Kevin, a nerdy 17 -year-old who wears his SAT score on his shirt and his admiration for big brother Andy on his sleeve, moves in. And, for good measure, so does the French family''s dog. Friends, roomies, canines, countrymen: lend me your beers. They''re all part of the daze of Andy''s life.', 'Meet overqualified, underemployed, 24-year-old Andy French. Ambition: to be a cartoonist. Occupation: salesman at Waterbed World. Hobby: Where''s the party? But responsibility soon knocks on the door of the loft apartment Andy shares with two fellow slackers when Kevin, a nerdy 17 -year-old who wears his SAT score on his shirt and his admiration for big brother Andy on his sleeve, moves in. And, for good measure, so does the French family''s dog. Friends, roomies, canines, countrymen: lend me your beers. They''re all part of the daze of Andy''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJV2F5jR8clYnQ2jgV0eU90HbiE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2073'),
  ('863259463987303449', 'Mission Run', 2023, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Bosco Wong Chung-Chak, Ron Ng Cheuk-Hai, Vincent Wong Ho-Shun, Sisley Choi Si-Pui, Mandy Wong, Nancy Wu, Shaun Tam Chun-Yin, Rosina Lin', null, 'A group of friends who grew up together were separated after a building that collapsed changed their fates forever. When they meet again many years later, their identities have become very different that it is difficult to distinguish between friend or foe, yet they continue to struggle between justice and friendship.', 'A group of friends who grew up together were separated after a building that collapsed changed their fates forever. When they meet again many years later, their identities have become very different that it is difficult to distinguish between friend or foe, yet they continue to struggle between justice and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctBEeuZo2tUUn5SbgFm8JKxta9x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210773'),
  ('266575818759123741', 'Mission To Kill', 2009, 'War & Politics', null, null, 'Noriyuki Higashiyama, Masahiro Matsuoka, Tadayoshi Okura, Koki Tanaka, Emi Wakui, Mitsuki Tanimura, Takashi Ukaji, Yoko Nogiwa', null, 'Continuation of the popular series of films about the assassins in Edo. This show marks the return of the jidaigeki series "Hissatsu Shigotonin," which has had several seasons between the 1970s and the 1990s. The franchise came back in 2007 with a one-shot special, but this is its first full season since 1992. Makoto Fujita returns as the protagonist Nakamura Mondo, one of the "shigotonin," a team of hired assassins.', 'Continuation of the popular series of films about the assassins in Edo. This show marks the return of the jidaigeki series "Hissatsu Shigotonin," which has had several seasons between the 1970s and the 1990s. The franchise came back in 2007 with a one-shot special, but this is its first full season since 1992. Makoto Fujita returns as the protagonist Nakamura Mondo, one of the "shigotonin," a team of hired assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uF2fd5YugMR2Rp00Gu6KRsp3rE3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155163'),
  ('1014101508028977304', 'Mission: Impossible', 1966, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Bruce Geller', null, 'Peter Graves, Greg Morris, Peter Lupus, Lynda Day George, Bob Johnson', 'TV-PG', 'Mission: Impossible is an American television series that was created and initially produced by Bruce Geller. It chronicles the missions of a team of secret government agents known as the Impossible Missions Force. In the first season, the team is led by Dan Briggs, played by Steven Hill; Jim Phelps, played by Peter Graves, takes charge for the remaining seasons. A hallmark of the series shows Briggs or Phelps receiving his instructions on a recording that then self-destructs, followed by the theme music composed by Lalo Schifrin. The series aired on the CBS network from September 1966 to March 1973, then returned to television for two seasons on ABC, from 1988 to 1990, retaining only Graves in the cast. It later inspired a popular series of theatrical motion pictures starring Tom Cruise, beginning in 1996.', 'Mission: Impossible is an American television series that was created and initially produced by Bruce Geller. It chronicles the missions of a team of secret government agents known as the Impossible Missions Force. In the first season, the team is led by Dan Briggs, played by Steven Hill; Jim Phelps, played by Peter Graves, takes charge for the remaining seasons. A hallmark of the series shows Briggs or Phelps receiving his instructions on a recording that then self-destructs, followed by the theme music composed by Lalo Schifrin. The series aired on the CBS network from September 1966 to March 1973, then returned to television for two seasons on ABC, from 1988 to 1990, retaining only Graves in the cast. It later inspired a popular series of theatrical motion pictures starring Tom Cruise, beginning in 1996.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PnUBKbDR1F2w5qicblLg1QGTif.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4357'),
  ('475053489992171957', 'Mission: Impossible', 1988, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Bruce Geller', null, 'Peter Graves, Thaao Penghlis, Antony Hamilton, Phil Morris, Jane Badler, Bob Johnson', 'TV-PG', 'Mission: Impossible is an American television series that chronicles the missions of a team of secret American government agents known as the Impossible Missions Force. The show is a revival of the 1966 TV series of the same name. The only actor to return for the series as a regular cast member was Peter Graves who played Jim Phelps, although two other cast members from the original series returned as guest stars. The only other regular cast member to return for every episode was the voice of "The Tape", Bob Johnson.', 'Mission: Impossible is an American television series that chronicles the missions of a team of secret American government agents known as the Impossible Missions Force. The show is a revival of the 1966 TV series of the same name. The only actor to return for the series as a regular cast member was Peter Graves who played Jim Phelps, although two other cast members from the original series returned as guest stars. The only other regular cast member to return for every episode was the voice of "The Tape", Bob Johnson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4AZwDa0RZLIVsOgZxlgOqNUw3U6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:9894'),
  ('1064993549158528353', 'Mission: Yozakura Family', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Reiji Kawashima, Kaede Hondo, Katsuyuki Konishi, Akari Kito, Aoi Yuuki, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yumi Uchiyama', 'TV-14', 'Taiyo Asano has been on his own ever since his parents died and the only one who seems to care for him is his childhood friend and classmate, Mutsumi Yozakura. But Mutsumi has a secret—she is the head of a family of spies! And on top of that, her brother Kyoichiro is dangerously protective of her! To stop Kyoichiro from killing him, Taiyo and Mutsumi must take the ultimate leap—marriage! Because in the Yozakura family, family cannot kill family.', 'Taiyo Asano has been on his own ever since his parents died and the only one who seems to care for him is his childhood friend and classmate, Mutsumi Yozakura. But Mutsumi has a secret—she is the head of a family of spies! And on top of that, her brother Kyoichiro is dangerously protective of her! To stop Kyoichiro from killing him, Taiyo and Mutsumi must take the ultimate leap—marriage! Because in the Yozakura family, family cannot kill family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTtXbR0DenriganfBidZxFLk4Xx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:216467'),
  ('953119990165572886', 'Missions', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ami Cohen, Henri Debeurme, Julien Lacombe', null, 'Hélène Viviès, Olivia Malahieude, Lucas Englander, Mathias Mlekuz, Barbara Probst, Stefan Kollmuss, Vincent Londez, Natasha Andrews', 'TV-PG', 'The first manned mission to Mars is now approaching the red planet. The crew includes top-flight scientists and a young female psychiatrist, responsible for their mental health. But just as they are about to land, something goes wrong.', 'The first manned mission to Mars is now approaching the red planet. The crew includes top-flight scientists and a young female psychiatrist, responsible for their mental health. But just as they are about to land, something goes wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifz0pf34Y9n5vTBhVyncDo3fOKN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:71969'),
  ('219316360259086039', 'Mister Ajikko', 1987, 'Animation', null, null, 'Minami Takayama, Chieko Honda, Takkô Ishimori, Saeko Shimazu, Takaya Hashi, Kazuhiko Inoue, Shozo Iizuka, Hochu Otsuka', 'NR', 'Mister Ajikko is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Daisuke Terasawa about a young boy cook. It was later adapted into anime series, produced by TV Tokyo and Sunrise. This show was broadcast from October 8, 1987 to September 28, 1989 with a total of 99 episodes. One of the earliest cooking/battle related manga and anime of its kind, there are some indications that this series is the inspiration for the live action competitive cooking show, Iron Chef.', 'Mister Ajikko is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Daisuke Terasawa about a young boy cook. It was later adapted into anime series, produced by TV Tokyo and Sunrise. This show was broadcast from October 8, 1987 to September 28, 1989 with a total of 99 episodes. One of the earliest cooking/battle related manga and anime of its kind, there are some indications that this series is the inspiration for the live action competitive cooking show, Iron Chef.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hq1pqsWSBetq7IFONxdekzOVEpl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34131'),
  ('810551755962831642', 'Mister Ed', 1961, 'Comedy, Family', 'Walter R. Brooks', null, 'Alan Young, Connie Hines, Allan Lane', 'TV-G', 'Wilbur Post and his wife Carol move into a beautiful new home. When Wilbur takes a look in his new barn, he finds that the former owner left his horse behind. This horse is no ordinary horse . . . he can talk, but only to Wilbur, which leads to all sorts of misadventures for Wilbur and his trouble-making sidekick Mister Ed.', 'Wilbur Post and his wife Carol move into a beautiful new home. When Wilbur takes a look in his new barn, he finds that the former owner left his horse behind. This horse is no ordinary horse . . . he can talk, but only to Wilbur, which leads to all sorts of misadventures for Wilbur and his trouble-making sidekick Mister Ed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykGlIpjTiyd4wYk617X73TL5FTS.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:453'),
  ('938700901147428886', 'Mister Rogers'' Neighborhood', 1968, 'Kids', 'Fred Rogers', null, 'Fred Rogers, Betty Aberlin, David Newell, Joe Negri', 'TV-Y', 'Mister Rogers'' Neighborhood is an American children''s television series that was created and hosted by namesake Fred Rogers. The series originated in 1963 as Misterogers on CBC Television, and was later debuted in 1966 as Misterogers'' Neighborhood on the regional Eastern Educational Network, followed by its US network debut on February 19, 1968, and it aired on NET and its successor, PBS, until August 31, 2001. The series is aimed primarily at preschool ages 2 to 5, but has been stated by PBS as "appropriate for all ages". Mister Rogers'' Neighborhood was produced by Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, USA public broadcaster WQED and Rogers'' non-profit production company Family Communications, Inc.; previously known as Small World Enterprises prior to 1971, the company was renamed The Fred Rogers Company after Rogers'' death.', 'Mister Rogers'' Neighborhood is an American children''s television series that was created and hosted by namesake Fred Rogers. The series originated in 1963 as Misterogers on CBC Television, and was later debuted in 1966 as Misterogers'' Neighborhood on the regional Eastern Educational Network, followed by its US network debut on February 19, 1968, and it aired on NET and its successor, PBS, until August 31, 2001. The series is aimed primarily at preschool ages 2 to 5, but has been stated by PBS as "appropriate for all ages". Mister Rogers'' Neighborhood was produced by Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, USA public broadcaster WQED and Rogers'' non-profit production company Family Communications, Inc.; previously known as Small World Enterprises prior to 1971, the company was renamed The Fred Rogers Company after Rogers'' death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhbeRYVg120cBmc9XvGxvk6EmJF.jpg', 31, 'tmdb:tv:15'),
  ('676833091535109444', 'Mister T', 1983, 'Mystery, Animation', 'Martin Pasko, Steve Gerber', null, 'Mr. T, Amy Linker, Phil LaMarr, Takayo Fischer, Fran Ryan, Shawn Lieber, Siu Ming Carson, Teddy Field III', null, 'Mister T is an animated series that aired on NBC on Saturday morning from 1983 to 1986. A total of 30 episodes were produced during the first two seasons, with the final season consisting entirely of reruns. The series was produced by Ruby-Spears. Reruns were later seen on the USA Cartoon Express in the late 1980s, and more recently as part of Cartoon Network''s Adult Swim late-night programming block.', 'Mister T is an animated series that aired on NBC on Saturday morning from 1983 to 1986. A total of 30 episodes were produced during the first two seasons, with the final season consisting entirely of reruns. The series was produced by Ruby-Spears. Reruns were later seen on the USA Cartoon Express in the late 1980s, and more recently as part of Cartoon Network''s Adult Swim late-night programming block.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5gyRVuDJjwqJ2dpEYhyGnzLAbL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11046'),
  ('211261838687511591', 'Mister Winner', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Matt Morgan', null, 'Spencer Jones, Lucy Pearman', null, 'Mister Winner is a British sitcom created for the BBC starring Spencer Jones, Lucy Pearman and Shaun Williamson. It was written by Matt Morgan, with additional material provided by Jones. Leslie Winner is an eternally-optimistic klutz with his heart in the right place. Somehow, despite his calamitous nature, he has found love with his fiancé Jemma and they are preparing for their wedding. The pressure is on Leslie to find, and keep a job, pay for the honeymoon and keep his father-in-law happy, his mum and her new boyfriend happy and hang on to Jemma long enough to walk up the aisle together. Will Leslie be a winner or will his surname continue to be ironic?', 'Mister Winner is a British sitcom created for the BBC starring Spencer Jones, Lucy Pearman and Shaun Williamson. It was written by Matt Morgan, with additional material provided by Jones. Leslie Winner is an eternally-optimistic klutz with his heart in the right place. Somehow, despite his calamitous nature, he has found love with his fiancé Jemma and they are preparing for their wedding. The pressure is on Leslie to find, and keep a job, pay for the honeymoon and keep his father-in-law happy, his mum and her new boyfriend happy and hang on to Jemma long enough to walk up the aisle together. Will Leslie be a winner or will his surname continue to be ironic?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQNL73QGzeeyZFx3Re7mkOpKI6O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101021'),
  ('11569680279403104', 'Misterio', 2005, 'Drama, Crime', 'Aldo Miyashiro, Jorge Carmona', null, 'Pietro Sibille, Aldo Miyashiro, Gonzalo Molina, Emilram Cossío, Sergio Galliani, Nishme Súmar, Pablo Saldarriaga, Haysen Pércovich', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifQhh6zm2t1Yx3A1xXqJwklGN3x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79043'),
  ('724438263720072561', 'Mistletoe Murders', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ken Cuperus', null, 'Sarah Drew, Peter Mooney, Sierra Marilyn Riley, Kylee Evans, Jean Yoon', null, 'Emily Lane is a good-natured Christmas shop owner with a secret past. When local murders begin to pop up in Fletcher’s Grove, Emily can’t help but to use her unique talents from her past life to help solve murders that affect people in her new life. She crosses paths with Detective Sam Wilner who she starts to make a connection with, until he comes to learn there is more to Emily than meets the eye.', 'Emily Lane is a good-natured Christmas shop owner with a secret past. When local murders begin to pop up in Fletcher’s Grove, Emily can’t help but to use her unique talents from her past life to help solve murders that affect people in her new life. She crosses paths with Detective Sam Wilner who she starts to make a connection with, until he comes to learn there is more to Emily than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXepN1cocU461OTnOZlyfODxAkU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:261317'),
  ('38848309701058378', 'Mistral''s Daughter', 1984, 'Drama', 'Kevin Connor', 'Terence Feely', 'Stacy Keach, Stefanie Powers, Lee Remick, Timothy Dalton, Ian Richardson, Philippine Leroy-Beaulieu, Robert Urich, Joanna Lumley', 'NR', 'Mistral''s Daughter is a 1984 American television miniseries written by Terence Feely and Rosemary Anne Sisson, based on Judith Krantz''s eponymous 1982 novel. The eight-episode serial—starring Stacy Keach, Stefanie Powers, and Lee Remick—follows the lives of women connected to tempestuous painter Julien Mistral, across several decades in France, exploring themes of art, love, and scandal.', 'Mistral''s Daughter is a 1984 American television miniseries written by Terence Feely and Rosemary Anne Sisson, based on Judith Krantz''s eponymous 1982 novel. The eight-episode serial—starring Stacy Keach, Stefanie Powers, and Lee Remick—follows the lives of women connected to tempestuous painter Julien Mistral, across several decades in France, exploring themes of art, love, and scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuJZPKAqlHCKPLDxBEi3P4b8ZLp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36962'),
  ('905960061161260931', 'Mistress', 2018, 'Drama', null, 'Go Jung-woon', 'Jung Ga-ram, Oh Jung-se, Moon Choi, Lee Hee-jun, Goo Jae-yee, Han Ga-in, Shin Hyun-been, Park Byung-eun', null, 'A story that follows the lives of four female friends in their 30''s as they become involved in a series of murders.', 'A story that follows the lives of four female friends in their 30''s as they become involved in a series of murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpC9yoiUiI3tAl9Kig72pJHGNMy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78583'),
  ('625702521061985552', 'Mistress', 2019, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Kyoko Hasegawa, Miki Mizuno, Hyunri, Aya Omasa, Yosuke Sugino, Yumi Aso, Satoshi Hashimoto, Ippei Kanie', null, 'Shibasaki Kaori is a doctor. Her patient that she was having an affair with dies. Kaori is suspicious of the patient''s son Kido Takashi about the death. Noguchi Tomomi is a single mother. She is excited in experiencing love for the first time in 7 years. Harada Saeko is in conflict with her husband Harada Satoshi about having a child. Mizushima Juri insists on having freewheeling romance. She feels excitement with meeting a woman. These four women''s lives connect and an unexpected story begins.', 'Shibasaki Kaori is a doctor. Her patient that she was having an affair with dies. Kaori is suspicious of the patient''s son Kido Takashi about the death. Noguchi Tomomi is a single mother. She is excited in experiencing love for the first time in 7 years. Harada Saeko is in conflict with her husband Harada Satoshi about having a child. Mizushima Juri insists on having freewheeling romance. She feels excitement with meeting a woman. These four women''s lives connect and an unexpected story begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUSCs1cEoGsUClxqnH5o0kJw0LZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91827'),
  ('782139551850184505', 'Mistress Kanan Is Devilishly Easy', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Aoi Koga, Seiichiro Yamashita, Sayumi Suzushiro, Maki Kawase, Ayaka Nanase, Fuka Izumi, Hikaru Tono, Yoshino Nanjo', null, 'Kanan the “Gourmet Devil” has descended upon the human world with one goal: to gorge herself on youthful souls. Her first target is high schooler Youji Kyougi—except her plan backfires horribly! Instead of her meal, he’s now her…boyfriend?! Even though she’s lived for thousands of years, Kanan has never known love! Can a devil survive the dangers of dates, hand-holding, and her very first romance?', 'Kanan the “Gourmet Devil” has descended upon the human world with one goal: to gorge herself on youthful souls. Her first target is high schooler Youji Kyougi—except her plan backfires horribly! Instead of her meal, he’s now her…boyfriend?! Even though she’s lived for thousands of years, Kanan has never known love! Can a devil survive the dangers of dates, hand-holding, and her very first romance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtHxVfPw44U1FqODiIu3LTC2x0x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:285818'),
  ('137585634559757609', 'Mistresses', 2008, 'Drama, Family', 'Lowri Glain, S.J. Clarkson, Rachel Anthony', null, 'Sarah Parish, Sharon Small, Orla Brady, Shelley Conn, Raza Jaffrey, Patrick Baladi, Adam Rayner, Flossie Ure', 'TV-14', 'Follows the lives of four female friends and their involvement in an array of marital and extramarital relationships.', 'Follows the lives of four female friends and their involvement in an array of marital and extramarital relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diTnk44w1bZWktB3cEZ78X5XXyz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:14249'),
  ('238233519655157051', 'Mistresses', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'K.J. Steinberg', null, 'Alyssa Milano, Jes Macallan, Rochelle Aytes, Yunjin Kim, Brett Tucker, Jason George, Corinne Massiah, Tabrett Bethell', 'TV-14', 'Meet Savi, a successful career woman working toward the next phase in her life—both professional and personal—simultaneously bucking for partner at her law firm while she and her husband, Harry, try to start a family of their own. Savi''s free-spirited and capricious baby sister, Josselyn, couldn''t be more different—living single, serial dating and partying, and regularly leaning on her big sister along the way. Their common best friend, April, a recent widow and mother of two, is rebuilding her life after tragedy and learning to move forward, with the support and guidance of her closest girlfriends. And friend Karen, a successful therapist with her own practice, reconnects with the girls after her involvement in a complicated relationship with a patient goes far too deep.', 'Meet Savi, a successful career woman working toward the next phase in her life—both professional and personal—simultaneously bucking for partner at her law firm while she and her husband, Harry, try to start a family of their own. Savi''s free-spirited and capricious baby sister, Josselyn, couldn''t be more different—living single, serial dating and partying, and regularly leaning on her big sister along the way. Their common best friend, April, a recent widow and mother of two, is rebuilding her life after tragedy and learning to move forward, with the support and guidance of her closest girlfriends. And friend Karen, a successful therapist with her own practice, reconnects with the girls after her involvement in a complicated relationship with a patient goes far too deep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ayoSSIrbLYm6MrgBhzw2tTp96a.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:43856'),
  ('1083811271151837408', 'Misty', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Kang Eun-kyung, Mo Wan-il', 'Je-in, Kang Eun-kyung', 'Kim Nam-ju, Ji Jin-hee, Jeon Hye-jin, Im Tae-kyung, Go Joon, Jin Ki-joo, Ahn Nae-sang, Lee Kyung-young', null, 'When a popular anchorwoman for a prime time news show becomes the suspect in a murder case, her estranged husband - who has worked as a prosecutor in the past but now works as a public defender - decides to defend his wife.', 'When a popular anchorwoman for a prime time news show becomes the suspect in a murder case, her estranged husband - who has worked as a prosecutor in the past but now works as a public defender - decides to defend his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kqnPQJrbOiyT03OawvSAKnX1u5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76715'),
  ('456403035424900963', 'Mitsuaki Iwago''s World “Cats” Travelogue', 2012, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Mitsuaki Iwago', null, 'Prominent Japanese wildlife photographer and filmmaker Mitsuaki Iwago loves cats of all shapes and sizes. So he''s set out on a journey to film cats all over the world as they live their lives. Join him in a cat''s-eye view of many diverse cities spanning the globe in a unique program that perhaps even your own cat will enjoy as well!', 'Prominent Japanese wildlife photographer and filmmaker Mitsuaki Iwago loves cats of all shapes and sizes. So he''s set out on a journey to film cats all over the world as they live their lives. Join him in a cat''s-eye view of many diverse cities spanning the globe in a unique program that perhaps even your own cat will enjoy as well!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqHlu5KUWCEvEFBgnKQKJ2TRsZi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82203'),
  ('932694422460521084', 'Mitsuboshi Colors', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuuki Takada, Marika Kouno, Natsumi Hioka', 'TV-14', 'Residing within Tokyo’s district of Ueno are the Colors, three individuals who protect their city by performing good deeds and aiding their community. Or, at the very least, they pretend to be the city’s defenders. In reality, the Colors are just three young girls who spend their time playing make-believe and exploring the city. The Colors’ activities are facilitated by the grandfatherly Daigorou "Pops" Kujiraoka, who uses his store’s inventory of knick-knacks to entertain the rambunctious trio. Not everyone is a fan of the Colors though. The local policeman Saitou just wants to deal with his regular duties, but he often finds himself the target of the Colors’ attention, having been made the villain in most of their fantasies. But despite his personal feelings, Saitou always finds the time to go along with the three girls’ games. Even though the Colors do not actually defend Ueno, they definitely help brighten everyone’s day.', 'Residing within Tokyo’s district of Ueno are the Colors, three individuals who protect their city by performing good deeds and aiding their community. Or, at the very least, they pretend to be the city’s defenders. In reality, the Colors are just three young girls who spend their time playing make-believe and exploring the city. The Colors’ activities are facilitated by the grandfatherly Daigorou "Pops" Kujiraoka, who uses his store’s inventory of knick-knacks to entertain the rambunctious trio. Not everyone is a fan of the Colors though. The local policeman Saitou just wants to deal with his regular duties, but he often finds himself the target of the Colors’ attention, having been made the villain in most of their fantasies. But despite his personal feelings, Saitou always finds the time to go along with the three girls’ games. Even though the Colors do not actually defend Ueno, they definitely help brighten everyone’s day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiB412p9JIfTqavtfJ54Izd64TD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76134'),
  ('587978245312943437', 'Mitsudomoe', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ayahi Takagaki, Satomi Akesaka, Haruka Tomatsu, Hiro Shimono', 'TV-14', 'Mitsuba, Futaba, and Hitoha are not your typical Japanese students. Satoshi Yabe who''s a newly hired teacher will have to learn to deal with these three girls as they terroize him or it will end up getting the best of him.', 'Mitsuba, Futaba, and Hitoha are not your typical Japanese students. Satoshi Yabe who''s a newly hired teacher will have to learn to deal with these three girls as they terroize him or it will end up getting the best of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FgmEVB9DKQ865tlBRyKAko3YyX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:35532'),
  ('1122310071079686116', 'MIU404', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Akiko Nogi', null, 'Go Ayano, Gen Hoshino, Koshi Mizukami, Masaki Suda, Kumiko Aso, Tomoka Kurokawa, Ouji Suzuka, Keisuke Watanabe', 'TV-MA', 'The Mobile Investigative Unit (known as "MIU") of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department attempts to solve cases within 24 hours. Detective Kazumi Shima is selected as a new member of MIU. He is intelligent, with excellent observation and communication skills. Yet, he does not trust other people. He is unable to find a partner in MIU and is ordered to partner with Police Officer Ai Ibuki, who works at a police substation. Ibuki applied for MIU, but he failed. He is in excellent physical condition, but he lacks knowledge and experience as a detective. Shima learns about Ibuki''s background and he becomes more nervous. Finally, Shima has his first meeting with Ibuki.', 'The Mobile Investigative Unit (known as "MIU") of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department attempts to solve cases within 24 hours. Detective Kazumi Shima is selected as a new member of MIU. He is intelligent, with excellent observation and communication skills. Yet, he does not trust other people. He is unable to find a partner in MIU and is ordered to partner with Police Officer Ai Ibuki, who works at a police substation. Ibuki applied for MIU, but he failed. He is in excellent physical condition, but he lacks knowledge and experience as a detective. Shima learns about Ibuki''s background and he becomes more nervous. Finally, Shima has his first meeting with Ibuki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOdguozUF1UGtpT4j9BJ1zSR6ZX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106524'),
  ('19088778840632481', 'Mix Tape', 2025, 'Drama', 'Lucy Gaffy', null, 'Teresa Palmer, Jim Sturgess, Florence Hunt, Rory Walton-Smith, Julia Savage, Jonathan Harden, Ben Lawson, Siobhán O''Kelly', null, 'Daniel and Alison meet in 1989 Sheffield and fall in love as teenagers before life takes them in different directions. They reconnect years later through shared musical memories, wondering if they''re meant to be together.', 'Daniel and Alison meet in 1989 Sheffield and fall in love as teenagers before life takes them in different directions. They reconnect years later through shared musical memories, wondering if they''re meant to be together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaovc65Em3383rGHYUelOFE5u8p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286056'),
  ('583392002723095007', 'Mix: Meisei Story', 2019, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Yuma Uchida, Maaya Uchida, Kana Hanazawa', null, 'Because of the legend left by Tatsuya Uesugi, Meisei Academy High School was well-known for their strong baseball team. But 26 years after their glory, the team has not been able to keep their record and has since lost their fame. Two stepbrothers, Souichirou and Touma Tachibana, aim to revive of the once-strong Meisei Academy baseball team and enter the National High School Baseball Championship. Souichirou and Touma are second years in Meisei Academy Middle School. Both boys are talented baseball players. Souichirou has shown excellent skill as a catcher and batter. Though having an extraordinary skill as a pitcher, Touma no longer pitches due to a certain reason. Once the two enter high school, they pair as a battery and aim to enter the National High School Baseball Championship!', 'Because of the legend left by Tatsuya Uesugi, Meisei Academy High School was well-known for their strong baseball team. But 26 years after their glory, the team has not been able to keep their record and has since lost their fame. Two stepbrothers, Souichirou and Touma Tachibana, aim to revive of the once-strong Meisei Academy baseball team and enter the National High School Baseball Championship. Souichirou and Touma are second years in Meisei Academy Middle School. Both boys are talented baseball players. Souichirou has shown excellent skill as a catcher and batter. Though having an extraordinary skill as a pitcher, Touma no longer pitches due to a certain reason. Once the two enter high school, they pair as a battery and aim to enter the National High School Baseball Championship!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVWRCJEh4718sjSg9NSnBtjMyWc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87456'),
  ('641333549851111259', 'mixed-ish', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Peter Saji, Kenya Barris, Tracee Ellis Ross', null, 'Tracee Ellis Ross, Arica Himmel, Tika Sumpter, Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Ethan William Childress, Mykal-Michelle Harris, Gary Cole', 'TV-PG', 'Rainbow Johnson recounts her experience growing up in a mixed-race family in the ‘80s and the constant dilemmas they had to face over whether to assimilate or stay true to themselves.', 'Rainbow Johnson recounts her experience growing up in a mixed-race family in the ‘80s and the constant dilemmas they had to face over whether to assimilate or stay true to themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjb3f5119sh25BAxlo3u4GjQdca.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:89563'),
  ('18960879278380176', 'Mixels', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids', null, null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'Mixels are mischievous creatures who live in tribes of three. They have the ability to combine with other Mixels, either within a single tribe or cross-combining to gain another tribe''s abilities. All that is needed to combine are willing Mixels and a magical square known as a cubit. The colorful creatures have to look out for Nixels, who consider themselves superior and like to destroy Mixel combinations. Major Nixel, the group''s leader, throws and kicks his underlings to steal cubits.', 'Mixels are mischievous creatures who live in tribes of three. They have the ability to combine with other Mixels, either within a single tribe or cross-combining to gain another tribe''s abilities. All that is needed to combine are willing Mixels and a magical square known as a cubit. The colorful creatures have to look out for Nixels, who consider themselves superior and like to destroy Mixel combinations. Major Nixel, the group''s leader, throws and kicks his underlings to steal cubits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nORFQAKBu60VQXOQFWx3MXAYdIl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:85421'),
  ('640135238699115840', 'Mixology', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Jon Lucas, Scott Moore', null, 'Adam Campbell, Adan Canto, Alexis Carra, Craig Frank, Ginger Gonzaga, Blake Lee, Vanessa Lengies, Andrew Santino', 'TV-14', 'One bar. One night. Ten single people. Welcome to Mix, a high-end bar in Manhattan''s trendy meatpacking district. These are the exploits of singles, five guys and five girls, in search of love - all over the course of one night.', 'One bar. One night. Ten single people. Welcome to Mix, a high-end bar in Manhattan''s trendy meatpacking district. These are the exploits of singles, five guys and five girls, in search of love - all over the course of one night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqmf1BB7BiQKAr3WqYNEt9fEiWg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:51402'),
  ('299278387415350747', 'Miyuki-chan in Wonderland', 1995, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Nana Okada', null, 'Ai Orikasa, Emi Shinohara, Yuko Nagashima, Hekiru Shiina, Sakura Tange, Mariko Onodera, Mariko Kouda, Megumi Ogata', null, 'Miyuki, a cute girl, is in over her head. When late for school, she is suddenly transported to another world (Alice In Wonderland style), except that all the inhabitants of the other world are female...and they all seem to be in love with Miyuki. And the world behind her mirror is even weirder.', 'Miyuki, a cute girl, is in over her head. When late for school, she is suddenly transported to another world (Alice In Wonderland style), except that all the inhabitants of the other world are female...and they all seem to be in love with Miyuki. And the world behind her mirror is even weirder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RTC7vgIf9iueCN3oZFSyIPghEl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67042'),
  ('1146285532538919693', 'Miz & Mrs', 2018, 'Reality', null, null, 'Mike Mizanin, Maryse Mizanin', null, 'WWE Superstars The Miz and Maryse balance becoming first-time parents with their fast-paced lives.', 'WWE Superstars The Miz and Maryse balance becoming first-time parents with their fast-paced lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DIsJCsF577JvrnIjIRrk1XTEwq.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:81134'),
  ('669073662434385734', 'Mizuiro no toki', 1975, 'Family, Drama', null, 'Fumio Ishimori', 'Shinobu Otake, Kyōko Kagawa, Masakane Yonekura, Hideji Ōtaki, Mieko Harada, Saburo Shinoda, Kaneko Iwasaki, Rumi Matsumoto', null, 'The 15th NHK Asadora. Starring Shinobu Otake in a story about a young woman striving to become a doctor and her mother, who is a nurse. The first six-month Asadora. Average rating of 40.1%.', 'The 15th NHK Asadora. Starring Shinobu Otake in a story about a young woman striving to become a doctor and her mother, who is a nurse. The first six-month Asadora. Average rating of 40.1%.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2zsKjcfV9DguQcrDMkbhMpj7wg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208354'),
  ('1121180787959710080', 'MLB Central', 2015, null, null, null, null, null, 'MLB Network''s first-ever regular-season morning show features hosts Robert Flores, Mark DeRosa and Lauren Shehadi reporting from Studio 21, named in honor of Hall of Famer and humanitarian Roberto Clemente. Updates and context on the latest news, extensive on-field highlights, and long-form conversations with guests, celebrities and insiders from around baseball are presented each weekday morning. Flores joined the network in 2016 as a host/reporter, DeRosa offers a unique outlook as a former player, and Shehadi honed crisp interviewing skills during three years of hosting MLB Network''s "The Rundown."', 'MLB Network''s first-ever regular-season morning show features hosts Robert Flores, Mark DeRosa and Lauren Shehadi reporting from Studio 21, named in honor of Hall of Famer and humanitarian Roberto Clemente. Updates and context on the latest news, extensive on-field highlights, and long-form conversations with guests, celebrities and insiders from around baseball are presented each weekday morning. Flores joined the network in 2016 as a host/reporter, DeRosa offers a unique outlook as a former player, and Shehadi honed crisp interviewing skills during three years of hosting MLB Network''s "The Rundown."', null, 12, 'tmdb:tv:236263'),
  ('588336877622992970', 'MLB Now', 2013, 'Talk', null, null, 'Brian Kenny', null, 'The hourlong weekday afternoon "MLB Now" presents the day''s top stories in baseball by spanning the sport''s cultural divide. Host Brian Kenny discusses the issues and provides analysis, with a bent toward modern analytics to prove his points. The series also features interviews with personalities throughout the game, and viewer opinions are welcome as well via social media polls.', 'The hourlong weekday afternoon "MLB Now" presents the day''s top stories in baseball by spanning the sport''s cultural divide. Host Brian Kenny discusses the issues and provides analysis, with a bent toward modern analytics to prove his points. The series also features interviews with personalities throughout the game, and viewer opinions are welcome as well via social media polls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPGVxrMQXfZyCkTFKRC3tHkwixe.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:289731'),
  ('120176326430578727', 'Młode gliny', 2026, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Anna Dereszowska, Zofia Zborowska-Wrona, Aleksandra Domańska, Robert Koszucki, Dominika Kryszczyńska, Marcel Opaliński, Mayu Gralińska Sakai, Henryk Simon', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tmnm9pQGdpaVYpajjgjCtt3oOd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:294637'),
  ('991841650447127560', 'MM!', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Romance, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Akinari Matsuno', null, 'Ayana Taketatsu, Saori Hayami, Rie Tanaka, Sayuri Yahagi, Kana Asumi', 'TV-MA', 'There are twisted tales and twisted tales, but few are as twisted as poor Sado''s, who''s just realized that he actually likes being made miserable. Of course, knowing that only makes him more miserable, which in turn... well, you get the idea. Desperate to break the circle, Sado volunteers for a special club where he hopes he can work through his issues only to discover that the other members have equally... complex... issues to deal with. For example, the hyper-aggressive club president Isurugi not only has a violent fear of cats, but also believes herself to be a god! Then there''s Yuno, who''s terrified of men; the Nurse, who forces other people to perform cosplay; and Hayama, Sado''s best friend and a compulsive cross-dresser, who''s also the girl that Sado is infatuated with. (We did say it was complex, remember?)', 'There are twisted tales and twisted tales, but few are as twisted as poor Sado''s, who''s just realized that he actually likes being made miserable. Of course, knowing that only makes him more miserable, which in turn... well, you get the idea. Desperate to break the circle, Sado volunteers for a special club where he hopes he can work through his issues only to discover that the other members have equally... complex... issues to deal with. For example, the hyper-aggressive club president Isurugi not only has a violent fear of cats, but also believes herself to be a god! Then there''s Yuno, who''s terrified of men; the Nurse, who forces other people to perform cosplay; and Hayama, Sado''s best friend and a compulsive cross-dresser, who''s also the girl that Sado is infatuated with. (We did say it was complex, remember?)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xsIJYkzrMahFHrwtpp7Gr8jDoQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38084'),
  ('1100290456424276999', 'Mo', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mo Amer, Ramy Youssef', null, 'Mo Amer, Teresa Ruiz, Farah Bsieso, Omar Elba', 'TV-MA', 'In Texas, Mo straddles the line between two cultures, three languages and a pending asylum request while hustling to support his Palestinian family.', 'In Texas, Mo straddles the line between two cultures, three languages and a pending asylum request while hustling to support his Palestinian family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3ojdK36AKestQaL2nAE6A7JYWO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:201124'),
  ('717142539893749077', 'Mob City', 2013, 'Drama', 'Frank Darabont', null, 'Jon Bernthal, Alexa Davalos, Milo Ventimiglia, Neal McDonough, Edward Burns, Robert Knepper, Jeremy Luke, Jeffrey DeMunn', null, 'Based on the real-life accounts of the cops and gangsters of 1940''s Los Angeles, this is the seductive story of the violent crime underbelly of America''s most glamorous city and those who wanted to control it.', 'Based on the real-life accounts of the cops and gangsters of 1940''s Los Angeles, this is the seductive story of the violent crime underbelly of America''s most glamorous city and those who wanted to control it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8JV85MCJQTHnbX6a7W0h2hepAK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44840'),
  ('417443121340567293', 'Mob Psycho 100', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Setsuo Ito, Takahiro Sakurai, Miyu Irino, Akio Otsuka', 'TV-14', 'Shigeo Kageyama, a.k.a. "Mob," is a boy who has trouble expressing himself, but who happens to be a powerful esper. Mob is determined to live a normal life and keeps his ESP suppressed, but when his emotions surge to a level of 100%, something terrible happens to him! As he''s surrounded by false espers, evil spirits, and mysterious organizations, what will Mob think? What choices will he make?', 'Shigeo Kageyama, a.k.a. "Mob," is a boy who has trouble expressing himself, but who happens to be a powerful esper. Mob is determined to live a normal life and keeps his ESP suppressed, but when his emotions surge to a level of 100%, something terrible happens to him! As he''s surrounded by false espers, evil spirits, and mysterious organizations, what will Mob think? What choices will he make?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vR7hwaGQ0ySRoq1WobiNRaPs4WO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67075'),
  ('411218411999430767', 'Mob Psycho 100', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Mystery', null, null, 'Tatsuomi Hamada, Kazuki Namioka, Yuki Yoda, Ayumu Mochizuki, Atsushi Arai, Kasumi Yamaya, Shin Nagahama, Tatsuya Shirato', 'TV-14', 'An inconspicuous middle school psychic confronts an organization plotting to use other psychics to rule the world. Based on the hit manga.', 'An inconspicuous middle school psychic confronts an organization plotting to use other psychics to rule the world. Based on the hit manga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKsuVX1jnxJDEIg7x0gEeIT0diA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75867'),
  ('1040609002990098314', 'Mob War: Philadelphia vs. the Mafia', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'John Alite', 'TV-MA', 'Philadelphia is the City of Brotherly Love, but in the ''90s, it was a bloodbath. Two warring mob factions battle for control in this true-crime series.', 'Philadelphia is the City of Brotherly Love, but in the ''90s, it was a bloodbath. Two warring mob factions battle for control in this true-crime series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vtAydTEQuOVj144b3ob80KUryg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:301498'),
  ('340553765061396078', 'Mob Wives', 2011, 'Reality', 'Jennifer Graziano', null, 'Drita D''Avanzo, Carla Facciolo, Karen Gravano, Renee Graziano, Angela Raiola', null, 'Mob Wives is an American reality television series on VH1 that made its debut April 17, 2011. It follows six Staten Island women after their husbands or fathers are arrested and imprisoned for crimes connected to the Mafia.', 'Mob Wives is an American reality television series on VH1 that made its debut April 17, 2011. It follows six Staten Island women after their husbands or fathers are arrested and imprisoned for crimes connected to the Mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDD9MRW0N9kXoCNaoqAVHIuHs2R.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:39513'),
  ('213292603459600687', 'Mobile 101: The Nokia Story', 2022, 'Drama', 'Maarit Lalli', null, 'Sampo Sarkola, Satu Tuuli Karhu, Emil Kihlström, Aku Sipola, Oona Airola, Niina Nurminen, Pelle Heikkilä', null, 'Made in Finland is a reality-based drama about telecommunication company Nokia''s first steps towards global success. Who were the young and resourceful lawyers, the brilliant engineers and the and the forward-thinking director whose courage saved the whole company?', 'Made in Finland is a reality-based drama about telecommunication company Nokia''s first steps towards global success. Who were the young and resourceful lawyers, the brilliant engineers and the and the forward-thinking director whose courage saved the whole company?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brZe9jyx0sILrRvSCpttzT2aKHK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201083'),
  ('360262181887043631', 'Mobile Cop Jiban', 1989, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shouhei Kusaka, Konomi Mashita, Michiko Enokida, Kunio Konishi, Akira Ishihama, Leo Meneghetti, Ami Kawai, Akemi Kogawa', null, 'Naoto detective Jiban fights for justice against Bioron and his evil plans to conquer the world.', 'Naoto detective Jiban fights for justice against Bioron and his evil plans to conquer the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1c2dJkUI3KV1Vk59KJDvjpcHXpu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:530'),
  ('22189359052252236', 'Mobile Fighter G Gundam', 1994, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, War & Politics', null, null, 'Tomokazu Seki, Yuri Amano, Hochu Otsuka, Kappei Yamaguchi, Takumi Yamazaki, Hidenari Ugaki, Yosuke Akimoto, Hideyuki Hori', 'TV-PG', 'In the Year F.C. (Future Century) 60, much of mankind inhabits space colonies which orbit the Earth. Dominance over the colonies is decided once every four years by a large tournament in which each nation sends a single representative to fight the others with a giant robot called a Gundam. Domon Kashuu is selected to represent Neo-Japan in one of these tournaments, but he fights less to ensure his nation''s victory than to find his brother, who has been blamed for the deaths of Domon''s parents and the disappearance of a very dangerous weapon, the Devil Gundam (Dark Gundam).', 'In the Year F.C. (Future Century) 60, much of mankind inhabits space colonies which orbit the Earth. Dominance over the colonies is decided once every four years by a large tournament in which each nation sends a single representative to fight the others with a giant robot called a Gundam. Domon Kashuu is selected to represent Neo-Japan in one of these tournaments, but he fights less to ensure his nation''s victory than to find his brother, who has been blamed for the deaths of Domon''s parents and the disappearance of a very dangerous weapon, the Devil Gundam (Dark Gundam).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuA29rs5TCFED8qVcEjJdn9YJKr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30093'),
  ('947077623261605615', 'Mobile Suit Gundam', 1979, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino', 'Toru Furuya, Shuichi Ikeda, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Fuyumi Shiraishi, Kiyonobu Suzuki, Toshio Furukawa, Rumiko Ukai, Yo Inoue', 'TV-14', 'What would you do if you suddenly found yourself in the middle of a war? Teenager Amuro Ray sees his life shattered when war comes to his home. During the chaos, Amuro finds himself inside the mobile suit Gundam, the Earth Federation''s new secret weapon, and he somehow gets it to work. Amuro and the other refugees flee their homeland on the warship White Base. This group of children and inexperienced soldiers will change the outcome of the war.', 'What would you do if you suddenly found yourself in the middle of a war? Teenager Amuro Ray sees his life shattered when war comes to his home. During the chaos, Amuro finds himself inside the mobile suit Gundam, the Earth Federation''s new secret weapon, and he somehow gets it to work. Amuro and the other refugees flee their homeland on the warship White Base. This group of children and inexperienced soldiers will change the outcome of the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BMqben5yxK5bBdHALi9jfyp517.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21731'),
  ('1064095243241687702', 'Mobile Suit Gundam 00', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Mamoru Miyano, Shin-ichiro Miki, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Hiroshi Kamiya, Yoko Honna, Hiroki Touchi, Ayahi Takagaki, Hideyuki Umezu', 'TV-MA', 'The year is 2307 A.D. Although fossil fuels have been depleted, humanity has obtained a new source of energy to replace them, in the form of a large-scale solar power generation system based on three huge orbital elevators. However, the benefits of this system are available only to a handful of major powers and their allies. In this world of never-ending conflict, a private armed organization appears, dedicated to the elimination of war through armed force. Its name is Celestial Being, and it is in possession of "Gundam" mobile suits.', 'The year is 2307 A.D. Although fossil fuels have been depleted, humanity has obtained a new source of energy to replace them, in the form of a large-scale solar power generation system based on three huge orbital elevators. However, the benefits of this system are available only to a handful of major powers and their allies. In this world of never-ending conflict, a private armed organization appears, dedicated to the elimination of war through armed force. Its name is Celestial Being, and it is in possession of "Gundam" mobile suits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1uEgsZ47dtBCoKLlL9edQ0QMrRF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:21732'),
  ('771176215616647532', 'Mobile Suit Gundam 0080: War in the Pocket', 1989, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics, Drama', null, null, 'Daisuke Namikawa, Megumi Hayashibara, Koji Tsujitani, Minoru Inaba, Konami Yoshida, Bin Shimada, Yosuke Akimoto, Ai Orikasa', null, 'In the final days of the One Year War, a Zeon special forces group infiltrates a colony to gather information on a new Gundam unit. Alfred Izuhara, a 10-year-old student, befriends Zeon rookie pilot Bernie Wiseman during a brief mobile suit combat. Meanwhile, Al meets up with Christina MacKenzie, his former neighbor and babysitter. Little does he know that not only is Christina a member of the Earth Federation, she''s the test pilot of the new Gundam NT-4 prototype.', 'In the final days of the One Year War, a Zeon special forces group infiltrates a colony to gather information on a new Gundam unit. Alfred Izuhara, a 10-year-old student, befriends Zeon rookie pilot Bernie Wiseman during a brief mobile suit combat. Meanwhile, Al meets up with Christina MacKenzie, his former neighbor and babysitter. Little does he know that not only is Christina a member of the Earth Federation, she''s the test pilot of the new Gundam NT-4 prototype.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ju1llP8kQROLHQ2xqOscSUrEHb4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46512'),
  ('731276014750766411', 'Mobile Suit Gundam 0083: Stardust Memory', 1991, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', 'Atsuko Kase, Takashi Imanishi', null, 'Ryo Horikawa, Akio Otsuka, Rei Sakuma, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Mari Mashiba', null, 'It is the year 0083 of the Universal Century. The rebellious Principality of Zeon has been defeated in the One Year War by the Earth Federation. However, a faction of Zeon remnants led by Aguille Delaz fled from the final battle, hiding themselves away. After three long years, they attempt to rise up once more, sending Delaz’s ace pilot, Anavel Gato, to infiltrate a Federation research base to steal one of two secretly developed prototype Gundams along with its deadly nuclear warhead. Threatened by the rogue Gundam suit and seeking to retain peace, the Earth Federation mobilizes the newly developed Albion carrier to recover the stolen unit. Manned by the remaining test pilots, with rookie pilot Kou Uraki piloting the remaining prototype Gundam, the Albion and her crew are determined to stop Gato, retake the stolen Gundam, and prevent the Zeon remnants from starting another war.', 'It is the year 0083 of the Universal Century. The rebellious Principality of Zeon has been defeated in the One Year War by the Earth Federation. However, a faction of Zeon remnants led by Aguille Delaz fled from the final battle, hiding themselves away. After three long years, they attempt to rise up once more, sending Delaz’s ace pilot, Anavel Gato, to infiltrate a Federation research base to steal one of two secretly developed prototype Gundams along with its deadly nuclear warhead. Threatened by the rogue Gundam suit and seeking to retain peace, the Earth Federation mobilizes the newly developed Albion carrier to recover the stolen unit. Manned by the remaining test pilots, with rookie pilot Kou Uraki piloting the remaining prototype Gundam, the Albion and her crew are determined to stop Gato, retake the stolen Gundam, and prevent the Zeon remnants from starting another war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLO8bidHA5S26kxI5DufYscgMsU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72677'),
  ('511817961834337752', 'Mobile Suit Gundam AGE', 2011, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Takuya Eguchi, Hiroshi Kamiya, Kana Hanazawa, Kazutomi Yamamoto, Aya Endo, Daisuke Ono, Hiroki Touchi', null, 'Advanced Generation (A.G.) 101. The space colony Angel is attacked and destroyed by a mysterious "Unknown Enemy" with overwhelming strength. As this "UE" continues its attacks, a boy named Flit Asuno loses his mother when she is caught in the crossfire. Now in A.G. 115, Flit must fight using a new Gundam of his own creation, which evolves itself through battle. The curtain rises on an epic Gundam saga spanning 100 years and three generations.', 'Advanced Generation (A.G.) 101. The space colony Angel is attacked and destroyed by a mysterious "Unknown Enemy" with overwhelming strength. As this "UE" continues its attacks, a boy named Flit Asuno loses his mother when she is caught in the crossfire. Now in A.G. 115, Flit must fight using a new Gundam of his own creation, which evolves itself through battle. The curtain rises on an epic Gundam saga spanning 100 years and three generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApcwLXh9JOf3B5gl4i2Gna9ssc1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45835'),
  ('62443198006253587', 'Mobile Suit Gundam GQuuuuuuX', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Tomoyo Kurosawa, Yui Ishikawa, Shimba Tsuchiya, Shinji Kawada, Seiichiro Yamashita, Akane Fujita, Saya Hirose, Genta Nakamura', null, 'High-school student Amate Yuzuriha lives peacefully in a space colony floating in outer space. But when she meets a war refugee named Nyaan, Amate is drawn into the illegal mobile suit dueling sport known as Clan Battle.', 'High-school student Amate Yuzuriha lives peacefully in a space colony floating in outer space. But when she meets a war refugee named Nyaan, Amate is drawn into the illegal mobile suit dueling sport known as Clan Battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jb5d4vqHmKSQh9rB2T394e3z5To.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278704'),
  ('499324784012912168', 'Mobile Suit Gundam MS IGLOO', 2004, 'Animation, War & Politics, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tamio Ohki, Hideo Ishikawa, Miki Nagasawa, Dai Matsumoto, Jun Fukuyama, Mikako Takahashi, Katsuya Shiga, Katsuhisa Houki', null, 'The year is Universal Century 0079. Oliver May is a technical officer in the Zeon 603rd Technical Evaluation Unit , in charge of testing new military technology. Stationed in the Jotunheim, a civilian transport ship that was converted into military use, Oliver must head into battle and experience the One Year War, only this time from the perspective of a weapon tester who struggles to make an impact on an evolving war during changing times.', 'The year is Universal Century 0079. Oliver May is a technical officer in the Zeon 603rd Technical Evaluation Unit , in charge of testing new military technology. Stationed in the Jotunheim, a civilian transport ship that was converted into military use, Oliver must head into battle and experience the One Year War, only this time from the perspective of a weapon tester who struggles to make an impact on an evolving war during changing times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nV8FNnM8HxU8bjQjlVS0wTgo1z.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:44919'),
  ('503307202941701546', 'Mobile Suit Gundam SEED', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Kenichi Suzumura, Maaya Sakamoto, Toshihiko Seki, Fumiko Orikasa, Mami Koyama, Hiroki Takahashi, Akira Ishida, Soichiro Hoshi', 'TV-PG', 'Cosmic Era 71. Mankind has developed into two subspecies: Naturals, who reside on Earth, and Coordinators, genetically enhanced humans capable of withstanding the rigors of space who inhabit orbital colonies known as PLANTs. The story revolves around a young Coordinator named Kira Yamato, who becomes involved in the war between the two races after a neutral space colony secretly developing mobile suits for the Earth Alliance is attacked by the PLANTs'' military force, ZAFT.', 'Cosmic Era 71. Mankind has developed into two subspecies: Naturals, who reside on Earth, and Coordinators, genetically enhanced humans capable of withstanding the rigors of space who inhabit orbital colonies known as PLANTs. The story revolves around a young Coordinator named Kira Yamato, who becomes involved in the war between the two races after a neutral space colony secretly developing mobile suits for the Earth Alliance is attacked by the PLANTs'' military force, ZAFT.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWgdDIq4JeaI36KdmLPkYcQjBQ3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:20111'),
  ('590329838413889394', 'Mobile Suit Gundam SEED C.E. 73: Stargazer', 2006, 'Drama, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', null, null, 'Daisuke Ono, Sayaka Ohara, Hiroshi Kamiya, Jun Fukuyama, Rina Sato, Jouji Nakata', null, 'Mobile Suit Gundam SEED C.E.73 -STARGAZER- is a side story to the anime TV series, Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Destiny. As of July 2006, it is being streamed on Bandai Channel as an original net animation. The show is directed by Susumu Nishizawa and written by Shigeru Morita, both staff members of Gundam SEED Destiny. The series consists of three episodes, each running at 15-minutes long. The web broadcast began in July 2006, with a new episode showing monthly. A DVD containing all three episodes as well as the two 5-minute long Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Astray animated shorts was released on November 24, 2006. This DVD also contained a different ending for Stage 3 in which several scenes after the Phantom Pain attack are shown. A manga adaptation of the series has been released in 2007. Authored by Naoki Moriya, it features an epilogue reveals the previously uncertain fate of Selene and Sven as they are shown to be alive and mostly unharmed from their ordeal. Sven joins the DSSD.', 'Mobile Suit Gundam SEED C.E.73 -STARGAZER- is a side story to the anime TV series, Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Destiny. As of July 2006, it is being streamed on Bandai Channel as an original net animation. The show is directed by Susumu Nishizawa and written by Shigeru Morita, both staff members of Gundam SEED Destiny. The series consists of three episodes, each running at 15-minutes long. The web broadcast began in July 2006, with a new episode showing monthly. A DVD containing all three episodes as well as the two 5-minute long Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Astray animated shorts was released on November 24, 2006. This DVD also contained a different ending for Stage 3 in which several scenes after the Phantom Pain attack are shown. A manga adaptation of the series has been released in 2007. Authored by Naoki Moriya, it features an epilogue reveals the previously uncertain fate of Selene and Sven as they are shown to be alive and mostly unharmed from their ordeal. Sven joins the DSSD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSgCjcw6tOMQy1Sghj3A7YV3LIi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43142'),
  ('730883442525929329', 'Mobile Suit Gundam Thunderbolt', 2015, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama, Animation', null, null, 'Yuichi Nakamura, Ryohei Kimura, Hiroshi Tsuchida, Toa Yukinari, Sayaka Ohara, Shunsuke Sakuya, Daisuke Hirakawa, Mutsumi Sasaki', null, 'Federation troops and Zeon forces carry out a fierce battle in the Thunderbolt Sector in what was once Side 4 "Mua". The Thunderbolt Sector is a shoal zone composed of the debris of destroyed space colonies, named for the electrical discharges from the metal debris. MS pilot Io Flemming is among the Federation soldiers who are dispatched to the area, where Zeon sniper Daryl Lorenz awaits them on the battlefield.', 'Federation troops and Zeon forces carry out a fierce battle in the Thunderbolt Sector in what was once Side 4 "Mua". The Thunderbolt Sector is a shoal zone composed of the debris of destroyed space colonies, named for the electrical discharges from the metal debris. MS pilot Io Flemming is among the Federation soldiers who are dispatched to the area, where Zeon sniper Daryl Lorenz awaits them on the battlefield.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4A0nZjf5A0Eu2quCpbXOaDPcC9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64809'),
  ('54847653504159099', 'Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn', 2010, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Daisuke Namikawa, Rikiya Koyama, Hiroki Touchi, Hiroki Yasumoto, Tetsuya Kakihara, Shinji Ogawa, Hiro Shimono', 'TV-14', 'When Banagher Links meets the mysterious Audrey Burne, he inherits the Unicorn Gundam and is swept up into the battle for space colony independence.', 'When Banagher Links meets the mysterious Audrey Burne, he inherits the Unicorn Gundam and is swept up into the battle for space colony independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/221Lo3L1iTg76hWhyzg62C5OYOK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45500'),
  ('927052185190092627', 'Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn RE:0096', 2016, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Ayumi Fujimura, Takayuki Sugo, Tetsuya Kakihara, Haruka Tomatsu, Shuichi Ikeda, Yuhko Kaida', 'TV-14', 'U.C. 0096. Three years after Char''s rebellion, Banagher Links, a boy living at the manufacturing colony Industrial 7, meets a mysterious girl who calls herself Audrey Burne. Audrey claims that she is trying to stop the Vist Foundation from handing over Laplace''s Box to the Neo Zeon remnants known as the Sleeves, an act which could spark another war, and Banagher decides to help her. But the colony becomes a battlefield as fighting breaks out between the Sleeves and the Earth Federation Forces, who have also come to stop the handover... The seven-episode OVA series, re-edited into a TV series with new opening and ending sequences.', 'U.C. 0096. Three years after Char''s rebellion, Banagher Links, a boy living at the manufacturing colony Industrial 7, meets a mysterious girl who calls herself Audrey Burne. Audrey claims that she is trying to stop the Vist Foundation from handing over Laplace''s Box to the Neo Zeon remnants known as the Sleeves, an act which could spark another war, and Banagher decides to help her. But the colony becomes a battlefield as fighting breaks out between the Sleeves and the Earth Federation Forces, who have also come to stop the handover... The seven-episode OVA series, re-edited into a TV series with new opening and ending sequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unGyvP0EGK1LMkDOJRHFUOHKO3p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67524'),
  ('371403533004112304', 'Mobile Suit Gundam Wing', 1995, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Hikaru Midorikawa, Akiko Yajima, Toshihiko Seki, Shigeru Nakahara, Ai Orikasa, Ryuzou Ishino, Takehito Koyasu, Ryotaro Okiayu', null, 'After Colony (A.C.) 195. Mankind has moved into space. Thousands of people live on giant orbiting space colonies called "Sides." However, the Earth Government, which rules the colonies, is unjust and cruel. A group of revolutionaries builds five robotic weapons called Gundams and plans to send them to Earth to begin their fight for independence. Piloted by five young men, these Gundams carry the hopes and dreams of freedom of the colonists with them as they descend to Earth to begin Operation Meteor!', 'After Colony (A.C.) 195. Mankind has moved into space. Thousands of people live on giant orbiting space colonies called "Sides." However, the Earth Government, which rules the colonies, is unjust and cruel. A group of revolutionaries builds five robotic weapons called Gundams and plans to send them to Earth to begin their fight for independence. Piloted by five young men, these Gundams carry the hopes and dreams of freedom of the colonists with them as they descend to Earth to begin Operation Meteor!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggHmrZpipHfdEqaGQbv4JrWv0f6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21730'),
  ('649819599052271568', 'Mobile Suit Gundam ZZ', 1986, 'Animation, War & Politics, Action & Adventure, Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kazuki Yao, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Masami Kikuchi, Naoko Matsui, Eriko Hara, Shin Mori, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Chieko Honda', null, 'The year is Universal Century 0088. Directly after the end of the Gryps War, Haman Karn and her army of Zeon remnants on the asteroid Axis begin their quest of reviving the lost empire of the Zabi''s, and proclaim themselves as the Neo-Zeon. With the Earth Federation as hapless as ever, only the Anti-Earth Union Group (AEUG) is able oppose the plans of Neo-Zeon. In need of all the help it can get after being decimated in the previous war and losing many of its key members, the AEUG ship Argama enlists the aid of a young junk collector from the Side 1 colony of Shangri-La named Judau Ashta to pilot its newest mobile suit, the ZZ Gundam.', 'The year is Universal Century 0088. Directly after the end of the Gryps War, Haman Karn and her army of Zeon remnants on the asteroid Axis begin their quest of reviving the lost empire of the Zabi''s, and proclaim themselves as the Neo-Zeon. With the Earth Federation as hapless as ever, only the Anti-Earth Union Group (AEUG) is able oppose the plans of Neo-Zeon. In need of all the help it can get after being decimated in the previous war and losing many of its key members, the AEUG ship Argama enlists the aid of a young junk collector from the Side 1 colony of Shangri-La named Judau Ashta to pilot its newest mobile suit, the ZZ Gundam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7GMUFdfljplCbySERldRUReP6P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5660'),
  ('248364556815237473', 'Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans', 2015, 'Animation, War & Politics, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kengo Kawanishi, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Yuka Terasaki, Hisako Kanemoto, Yuuichirou Umehara, Kohei Amasaki, Taishi Murata', 'TV-MA', 'On a terraformed post-disaster Mars, a group of child security agents rebel against the adults who betrayed them and the oppressive Earth government.', 'On a terraformed post-disaster Mars, a group of child security agents rebel against the adults who betrayed them and the oppressive Earth government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5M9yxvBhrUP4rsKSl3d9VzK7O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64375'),
  ('597832424561279744', 'Mobile Suit Gundam: The 08th MS Team', 1996, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Nobuyuki Hiyama, Mami Koyama, Osamu Ichikawa, Kikuko Inoue, Keiji Fujiwara, Hiro Yuuki, Tessyo Genda, Show Hayami', 'TV-MA', 'Ensign Shiro Amada is transferred to Southeast Asia to take command of the 08th MS Team. In their first guerilla operation, Shiro''s team is tasked with distracting the Zeon forces while Federation ground troops locate a mysterious new Zeon weapon.', 'Ensign Shiro Amada is transferred to Southeast Asia to take command of the 08th MS Team. In their first guerilla operation, Shiro''s team is tasked with distracting the Zeon forces while Federation ground troops locate a mysterious new Zeon weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzr1YdnPSIWMMgyb6Uzi3f9I8p3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43887'),
  ('510970582006915881', 'Mobile Suit Gundam: The Origin - Advent of the Red Comet', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics, Drama', null, null, 'Shuichi Ikeda, Toru Furuya, Megumi Han, Jin Urayama, Banjo Ginga, Kenta Miyake, Akeno Watanabe, Tetsuya Kakihara', 'TV-14', 'This is the story of how Char Aznable, the Red Comet, came to be. Zeon Zum Deikun suddenly dies, in the middle of declaring the Autonomous Republic of Munzo’s independence, and the republic falls into turmoil. His children, Casval and Artesia, escape to Earth while the House of Zabi rises to power. Living in secret, the siblings must find their place in a world preparing for war.', 'This is the story of how Char Aznable, the Red Comet, came to be. Zeon Zum Deikun suddenly dies, in the middle of declaring the Autonomous Republic of Munzo’s independence, and the republic falls into turmoil. His children, Casval and Artesia, escape to Earth while the House of Zabi rises to power. Living in secret, the siblings must find their place in a world preparing for war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdt4G11wKDJBI8UFIFSxsm2PNb6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88865'),
  ('417650851862880025', 'Mobile Suit Gundam: The Witch from Mercury', 2022, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kana Ichinose, Lynn, Yohei Azakami, Natsuki Hanae, Makoto Furukawa, Miyu Tomita, Junya Enoki, Tasuku Hatanaka', 'TV-14', 'A. S. (Ad Stella) 122 ― An era when a multitude of corporations have entered space and built a huge economic system. Suletta Mercury, a lone girl from the remote planet Mercury, transfers to the Asticassia School of Technology, run by the Beneritt Group which dominates the mobile suit industry.', 'A. S. (Ad Stella) 122 ― An era when a multitude of corporations have entered space and built a huge economic system. Suletta Mercury, a lone girl from the remote planet Mercury, transfers to the Asticassia School of Technology, run by the Beneritt Group which dominates the mobile suit industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBkDlMaAVOVMRWWlRUHhkLAhNE3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196400'),
  ('512680318626189406', 'Mobile Suit Victory Gundam', 1993, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Daisuke Sakaguchi, Yumi Ichihara, Tomoyuki Dan, Kumiko Watanabe, Ayako Shiraishi, Keiichi Sonobe, Masayuki Nakata, Rica Matsumoto', 'TV-14', 'It is the Universal Century, year 0153. The Zanscare Empire, which rules almost all of Side 2, has declared its independence from the old government, the hollow and corrupt Earth Federation. Under the justification of creating a new, space-based order, it has begun an invasion of Earth; and Point Kasarelia, the illegal residence area in Eastern Europe where Üso Ewin and Shahkti Kareen live, is no exception. As they are caught in the fighting between Zanscare and the opposing resistance organization, the League Militaire, fate draws Üso and his friends into the midst of battle.', 'It is the Universal Century, year 0153. The Zanscare Empire, which rules almost all of Side 2, has declared its independence from the old government, the hollow and corrupt Earth Federation. Under the justification of creating a new, space-based order, it has begun an invasion of Earth; and Point Kasarelia, the illegal residence area in Eastern Europe where Üso Ewin and Shahkti Kareen live, is no exception. As they are caught in the fighting between Zanscare and the opposing resistance organization, the League Militaire, fate draws Üso and his friends into the midst of battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1adT1zljkHVqPnuQl3G8h6ecx0y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:25797'),
  ('1120274584945544257', 'Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam', 1985, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, War & Politics, Drama', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino', null, 'Nobuo Tobita, Shuichi Ikeda, Miyuki Matsuoka, Maya Okamoto, Kazuhiko Inoue, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Masako Katsuki', null, 'Universal Century 0087, 7 years have passed since the end of the One Year War between the Earth Federation and the Principality of Zeon. The Earth Federation has created an elite task force, known as the Titans, who are responsible for hunting the remaining Zeon forces. However, the power-hungry Titans have spurred the creation of a rebellious faction called the Anti-Earth Union Group (AEUG).', 'Universal Century 0087, 7 years have passed since the end of the One Year War between the Earth Federation and the Principality of Zeon. The Earth Federation has created an elite task force, known as the Titans, who are responsible for hunting the remaining Zeon forces. However, the power-hungry Titans have spurred the creation of a rebellious faction called the Anti-Earth Union Group (AEUG).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGH9LyV1UMgvbkv1WUEobcTqK5W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13674'),
  ('349084371491605799', 'Mobilni mechanicy', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8UpETAySuYMxLTXKVFpQCONUip.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:237223'),
  ('1047776496889007905', 'Mobius', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Zhang Xiaomao', 'Bi Qiang', 'Bai Jingting, Janice Man Wing-San, Song Yang, Zhang Bojia, Cao Yangmingzhu, Han Li, Song Jiateng, Tian Lei', null, 'In Hua''ao City, a brilliant detective with a flawless track record faces his toughest case yet when a string of seemingly perfect murders shakes the city. With no evidence, no witnesses, and a killer who vanishes without a trace, he must race against time to uncover the truth. As hidden dangers lurk in every corner, the line between hunter and hunted begins to blur.', 'In Hua''ao City, a brilliant detective with a flawless track record faces his toughest case yet when a string of seemingly perfect murders shakes the city. With no evidence, no witnesses, and a killer who vanishes without a trace, he must race against time to uncover the truth. As hidden dangers lurk in every corner, the line between hunter and hunted begins to blur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ebIeyHZ9Er3qKqzrLPxrLP4ERZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279322'),
  ('118414156289345088', 'MobLand', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ronan Bennett', null, 'Tom Hardy, Pierce Brosnan, Paddy Considine, Joanne Froggatt, Lara Pulver, Anson Boon, Geoff Bell, Jasmine Jobson', 'TV-MA', 'Two mob families clash in a war that threatens to topple empires and lives.', 'Two mob families clash in a war that threatens to topple empires and lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abeH7n5pcuQcwYcTxG6DTZvXLP1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247718'),
  ('1034018283120194120', 'Moby Dick', 1998, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Franc Roddam', null, 'Henry Thomas, Bruce Spence, Hugh Keays-Byrne, Robin Cuming, Shane Connor, Patrick Stewart, Piripi Waretini, Vivianne Benton', 'TV-PG', 'The sole survivor of a lost whaling ship relates the tale of his captain''s self-destructive obsession to hunt the white whale, Moby Dick.', 'The sole survivor of a lost whaling ship relates the tale of his captain''s self-destructive obsession to hunt the white whale, Moby Dick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOiEbZuo7KZQhcCbn5EQ4wPsdTN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31010'),
  ('459000441565811060', 'Moby Dick', 2011, 'Drama', 'Mike Barker', 'Nigel Williams', 'William Hurt, Ethan Hawke, Charlie Cox, Eddie Marsan, Gillian Anderson, Billy Boyd, Raoul Max Trujillo, Donald Sutherland', 'TV-PG', 'The sole survivor of a lost whaling ship relates the tale of his captain''s self-destructive obsession to hunt the white whale, Moby Dick.', 'The sole survivor of a lost whaling ship relates the tale of his captain''s self-destructive obsession to hunt the white whale, Moby Dick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGnBI8o5Wbd7ZsXJb1emZtqeNtW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39803'),
  ('97247993253399670', 'Moby Dick and Mighty Mightor', 1967, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Don Messick, John Stephenson, Bobby Diamond, Patsy Garrett, Norma MacMillan, Paul Stewart', 'TV-Y7', 'Moby Dick and Mighty Mightor is a science fiction animated series created by Alex Toth for Hanna-Barbera Productions, which ran on CBS from 1967 to 1969. Despite Moby''s name coming first, he had only one short per half-hour episode, sandwiched between two with Mightor; the same structure was used the previous season for H-B''s Frankenstein, Jr. and The Impossibles.', 'Moby Dick and Mighty Mightor is a science fiction animated series created by Alex Toth for Hanna-Barbera Productions, which ran on CBS from 1967 to 1969. Despite Moby''s name coming first, he had only one short per half-hour episode, sandwiched between two with Mightor; the same structure was used the previous season for H-B''s Frankenstein, Jr. and The Impossibles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecQVy8xjaOFT5atDbkvAnrG3XJP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10644'),
  ('618933762566956842', 'Mock the Week', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Dan Patterson', null, 'Hugh Dennis, Dara Ó Briain', 'NR', 'Mock the Week is a British topical celebrity panel game hosted by Dara Ó Briain. The game is influenced by improvised topical stand-up comedy, with several rounds requiring players to deliver answers on unexpected subjects on the spur of the moment.', 'Mock the Week is a British topical celebrity panel game hosted by Dara Ó Briain. The game is influenced by improvised topical stand-up comedy, with several rounds requiring players to deliver answers on unexpected subjects on the spur of the moment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gewfnFndT4mgtgR3zPrGLsBTdZE.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:11089'),
  ('564860174220813280', 'Mocro Maffia', 2018, 'Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Achmed Akkabi, Thijs Römer', 'Thijs Römer, Achmed Akkabi', 'Robert de Hoog, Zineb Fallouk, Walid Benmbarek, Saïd Boumazoughe, Khalid Alterch', 'TV-MA', 'Best friends Romano, Potlood and De Paus rise in the rank of the criminal world. Before they know it, they run Amsterdam''s entire coke market. Because of jealousy, their relation becomes complicated and ends up hostile.', 'Best friends Romano, Potlood and De Paus rise in the rank of the criminal world. Before they know it, they run Amsterdam''s entire coke market. Because of jealousy, their relation becomes complicated and ends up hostile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iM6tRt7VQ6p6yqnpBkwb8zZmprC.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:83062'),
  ('795946624322420394', 'Models Inc.', 1994, 'Drama, Soap', 'Charles Pratt, Jr., Frank South', null, 'Linda Gray, Cameron Daddo, David ''Goldy'' Goldsmith, Teresa Hill, Carrie-Anne Moss, Cassidy Rae, Kylie Travis, Stephanie Romanov', null, 'Models Inc. is an American prime time soap opera that aired on the Fox television network during the 1994-1995 television season. It is the third series in the Beverly Hills, 90210 franchise. The series was created by Charles Pratt, Jr. and Frank South, and executive produced by Aaron Spelling, Charles Pratt, Jr., Frank South, and E. Duke Vincent.', 'Models Inc. is an American prime time soap opera that aired on the Fox television network during the 1994-1995 television season. It is the third series in the Beverly Hills, 90210 franchise. The series was created by Charles Pratt, Jr. and Frank South, and executive produced by Aaron Spelling, Charles Pratt, Jr., Frank South, and E. Duke Vincent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PEsHQiJ5xFdpyMrnoV7hqblrR2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4487'),
  ('1008592735748245781', 'Modern Family', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Steven Levitan, Christopher Lloyd', null, 'Ed O''Neill, Sofía Vergara, Julie Bowen, Ty Burrell, Jesse Tyler Ferguson, Eric Stonestreet, Sarah Hyland, Ariel Winter', 'TV-PG', 'The Pritchett-Dunphy-Tucker clan is a wonderfully large and blended family. They give us an honest and often hilarious look into the sometimes warm, sometimes twisted, embrace of the modern family.', 'The Pritchett-Dunphy-Tucker clan is a wonderfully large and blended family. They give us an honest and often hilarious look into the sometimes warm, sometimes twisted, embrace of the modern family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5Qg5rgPoKdh3yTJJrLtyoyYGwC.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:1421'),
  ('363930358626018495', 'Modern Farmer', 2014, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Oh Jin-seok', 'Oh Jin-seok', 'Lee Hong-gi, Park Min-woo, Lee Si-eon, Kwak Dong-yeon, Lee Hanee, Lee Han-wi, Lee Il-hwa, Kim Bu-seon', 'NR', 'Excellent Souls was once really successful. Seven years later, one of its members, Min Ki struggles in life.', 'Excellent Souls was once really successful. Seven years later, one of its members, Min Ki struggles in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqM1kx1n8pY5cHXLN2X0V2pYDA8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61613'),
  ('313135120053091358', 'Modern Korea', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The documentary series were made to look back on Korea’s modern history. It tells stories of specific moments in time weaving together relevant video clips from news broadcasts, dramas, shows and other documentaries', 'The documentary series were made to look back on Korea’s modern history. It tells stories of specific moments in time weaving together relevant video clips from news broadcasts, dramas, shows and other documentaries', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZSoPHQu9SHOMw9Is6mqGJI2Ub1.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:99503'),
  ('1041128594791883956', 'Modern Love', 2019, 'Comedy', 'John Carney', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'An unlikely friendship. A lost love resurfaced. A marriage at its turning point. A date that might not have been a date. An unconventional new family. These are unique stories about the joys and tribulations of love, each inspired by true events.', 'An unlikely friendship. A lost love resurfaced. A marriage at its turning point. A date that might not have been a date. An unconventional new family. These are unique stories about the joys and tribulations of love, each inspired by true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cP9CJ9nvPT3cnnBSlGFgwq7odIR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91602'),
  ('901151669376619454', 'Modern Love Chennai', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Thiagarajan Kumararaja', null, 'Sri Gouri Priya Reddy, Vasundhara Kashyap, Arun Ajikumar', null, 'An eclectic bouquet of love stories – funny, quirky, deep and puzzling. While the stories converse with your heart, you also catch a glimpse into the soul of Chennai with its unique terrains and diverse inhabitants.', 'An eclectic bouquet of love stories – funny, quirky, deep and puzzling. While the stories converse with your heart, you also catch a glimpse into the soul of Chennai with its unique terrains and diverse inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuKtpbcL1OS2S7kIFRkHXvjcBr7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200874'),
  ('523539569597610233', 'Modern Love Mumbai', 2022, 'Drama', 'Ishita Pritish Nandy, Rangita Pritish Nandy', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Explore 6 unique yet universal stories of human connection and love in its varied forms – romantic, platonic, parental, sexual, familial, marital, self-love.', 'Explore 6 unique yet universal stories of human connection and love in its varied forms – romantic, platonic, parental, sexual, familial, marital, self-love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fXl2UkUVF7jTw0tSMXhr13FHr7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200941'),
  ('774059398961848766', 'Modern Love Tokyo', 2022, 'Drama', 'Atsuko Hirayanagi', null, null, null, 'This seven-episode anthology features a cast of leading actors and depicts various forms of "love," such as love almost forgotten, love between sons and mothers, and love that transcends borders.', 'This seven-episode anthology features a cast of leading actors and depicts various forms of "love," such as love almost forgotten, love between sons and mothers, and love that transcends borders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hRXZ57tykJs4NXjmub7u1PQuB6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208596'),
  ('305496598041076432', 'Modern Marvels', 1993, 'Documentary', 'Bruce Nash', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'HISTORY’s longest-running series moves to H2. Modern Marvels celebrates the ingenuity, invention and imagination found in the world around us. From commonplace items like ink and coffee to architectural masterpieces and engineering disasters, the hit series goes beyond the basics to provide insight and history into things we wonder about and that impact our lives. This series tells fascinating stories of the doers, the dreamers and sometime-schemers that create everyday items, technological breakthroughs and manmade wonders. The hit series goes deep to explore the leading edge of human inspiration and ambition.', 'HISTORY’s longest-running series moves to H2. Modern Marvels celebrates the ingenuity, invention and imagination found in the world around us. From commonplace items like ink and coffee to architectural masterpieces and engineering disasters, the hit series goes beyond the basics to provide insight and history into things we wonder about and that impact our lives. This series tells fascinating stories of the doers, the dreamers and sometime-schemers that create everyday items, technological breakthroughs and manmade wonders. The hit series goes deep to explore the leading edge of human inspiration and ambition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRMi6q4mazNTZ2HKdiY6RP5noDW.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:6145'),
  ('725743462370664066', 'Modus', 2015, 'Crime', 'Peter Thorsboe, Mai Brostrøm', null, 'Melinda Kinnaman, Henrik Norlén, Simon J. Berger, Annika Hallin, Kim Cattrall, Esmeralda Struwe, Lily Wahlsteen, Greg Wise', null, 'During a snowy Christmas season in Sweden, psychologist and profiler Inger Johanne Vik finds not only herself but also her autistic daughter drawn into the investigation of a number of disturbing deaths, through which she meets detective Ingvar Nyman of “Rikskrim,” a Swedish national police force.', 'During a snowy Christmas season in Sweden, psychologist and profiler Inger Johanne Vik finds not only herself but also her autistic daughter drawn into the investigation of a number of disturbing deaths, through which she meets detective Ingvar Nyman of “Rikskrim,” a Swedish national police force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egIu3O7hDG2ErPOKMIUdNuQrZxs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64023'),
  ('225320310866250548', 'Moebius Project 2012: The Veil', 2021, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Park Seok-ho', null, 'Park Ha-seon, Jung Moon-sung, Jang Young-nam, Jun Suk-ho, Kim Jong-tae, Choi Deok-moon, Hwang Hee', null, 'The story of a huge incident faced by Seo Soo-yeon from the support management team that supports and manages NIS field agents in China, Jang Cheon-woo, a hidden NIS black agent and Do Jin-sook, deputy director of overseas parts.', 'The story of a huge incident faced by Seo Soo-yeon from the support management team that supports and manages NIS field agents in China, Jang Cheon-woo, a hidden NIS black agent and Do Jin-sook, deputy director of overseas parts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFTUHOqC0WGNwo32MDKdPJyxpXw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137149'),
  ('496856095298126802', 'Moesha', 1996, 'Comedy, Family', 'Sara V. Finney, Ralph Farquhar, Vida Spears', null, 'Brandy Norwood, William Allen Young, Marcus T. Paulk, Lamont Bentley, Shar Jackson, Ray J', 'TV-14', 'The everyday life of Moesha Mitchell, a vivacious young woman juggling romance, school, ever-changing family dynamics, and friendships.', 'The everyday life of Moesha Mitchell, a vivacious young woman juggling romance, school, ever-changing family dynamics, and friendships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6I3VCk8GCscaPM3aKOTJlzIaqhc.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:3497'),
  ('12446248888766411', 'Moeyo Ken TV', 2005, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Chisa Yokoyama, Mayumi Tanaka, Ai Orikasa, Naoko Matsui, Haruna Ikezawa', 'TV-14', 'Since the era changed from Edo to Meiji, Japan has been changing rapidly with the current government''s policy of modernization. Kyoto where Expo was being held. The government issued licenses to monsters that lived with humans. There was a company that arrested unregistered monsters to keep the peace. The name of the company is "Kido Shinsengumi Co. Ltd." Meanwhile, a young guy came back to Kyoto from Shanghai with his monster buddy, Nekomaru. He was Sakamoto Ryunosuke, the son of Sakamoto Ryoma.', 'Since the era changed from Edo to Meiji, Japan has been changing rapidly with the current government''s policy of modernization. Kyoto where Expo was being held. The government issued licenses to monsters that lived with humans. There was a company that arrested unregistered monsters to keep the peace. The name of the company is "Kido Shinsengumi Co. Ltd." Meanwhile, a young guy came back to Kyoto from Shanghai with his monster buddy, Nekomaru. He was Sakamoto Ryunosuke, the son of Sakamoto Ryoma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ji5VljH6sRQ8pqZmDPpauwNMpV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43290'),
  ('95277987329557444', 'Mohanagar', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ashfaque Nipun', null, 'Mosharraf Karim, Shamol Mawla, Fazlur Rahman Babu, Tanzika Amin', null, 'One fateful night, a police station in Bangladesh, and a motley crowd consisting of criminals, an eminent industrialist, media, general public. What does this night have in store for them?', 'One fateful night, a police station in Bangladesh, and a motley crowd consisting of criminals, an eminent industrialist, media, general public. What does this night have in store for them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhmI8l62JIc0AuURN4ZL7i6t82K.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:128073'),
  ('875894463028409765', 'Molang', 2015, 'Animation, Family', 'Marie-Caroline Villand', null, 'Bruno Gueraçague', 'TV-Y', 'Molang is an affectionate and humorous perspective on the relationship between an eccentric, joyful, and enthusiastic rabbit and a shy, discreet, and emotional little chick. Despite their many differences, these two enjoy a unique friendship. They have great times together ranging from the mundane to the extraordinary. Whether they''re flying to the moon or merely watering the vegetable patch, Molang and Piu Piu experience unexpected, even unsettling situations. Tricky incidents and misunderstandings are soon transformed into opportunities for fun moments and humor, which Molang''s friends are happy to come and share in.', 'Molang is an affectionate and humorous perspective on the relationship between an eccentric, joyful, and enthusiastic rabbit and a shy, discreet, and emotional little chick. Despite their many differences, these two enjoy a unique friendship. They have great times together ranging from the mundane to the extraordinary. Whether they''re flying to the moon or merely watering the vegetable patch, Molang and Piu Piu experience unexpected, even unsettling situations. Tricky incidents and misunderstandings are soon transformed into opportunities for fun moments and humor, which Molang''s friends are happy to come and share in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyWlMB2cHKJZmjuhPKStFh8LM1F.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:84508'),
  ('479895558956640688', 'MoleTalk', 2016, 'Talk', 'Arjen Lubach', null, 'Marlijn Weerdenburg, Splinter Chabot, Stijn de Vries, Thomas van Luyn', null, 'Immediately after The Mole you can watch MolTalk, live from VondelCS in Amsterdam. In these commentary''s, Marlijn Weerdenburg and Splinter Chabot discuss hints, tasks and theory''s with former candidates and other guests.', 'Immediately after The Mole you can watch MolTalk, live from VondelCS in Amsterdam. In these commentary''s, Marlijn Weerdenburg and Splinter Chabot discuss hints, tasks and theory''s with former candidates and other guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCTNNjypLsZ6bvcmkM0D9neGJVV.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:115714'),
  ('993945588047575404', 'Moloch', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Arnaud Malherbe', 'Marion Festraëts, Arnaud Malherbe', 'Marine Vacth, Olivier Gourmet, Arnaud Valois, Marc Zinga, Babetida Sadjo, Laurent Capelluto, Alice Verset, Soufiane Guerrab', 'TV-MA', 'In an industrial and labyrinthine seaside town, people ignite suddenly with no reason. Suicides? Murders? Supernatural phenomena? To find out, Louise, a young journalist, and Gabriel, a psychiatrist, will investigate.', 'In an industrial and labyrinthine seaside town, people ignite suddenly with no reason. Suicides? Murders? Supernatural phenomena? To find out, Louise, a young journalist, and Gabriel, a psychiatrist, will investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQBpYwCV3A86B17qwhNA5nqop1A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111133'),
  ('562405053479139995', 'Mom', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eddie Gorodetsky, Gemma Baker, Chuck Lorre', null, 'Allison Janney, Jaime Pressly, Mimi Kennedy, Kristen Johnston, Beth Hall, William Fichtner', 'TV-14', 'Aan irreverent and outrageous take on true family love‐and dysfunction. Newly sober single mom Christy struggles to raise two children in a world full of temptations and pitfalls. Testing her sobriety is her formerly estranged mother, now back in Christy''s life and eager to share passive-aggressive insights into her daughter''s many mistakes.', 'Aan irreverent and outrageous take on true family love‐and dysfunction. Newly sober single mom Christy struggles to raise two children in a world full of temptations and pitfalls. Testing her sobriety is her formerly estranged mother, now back in Christy''s life and eager to share passive-aggressive insights into her daughter''s many mistakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIi3T7X0kmiV9vGDme146P2d979.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:49011'),
  ('434321922083949563', 'Mom for rent', 2023, 'Family, Comedy', 'Matúš Libovič, Miloslav Volný', null, 'Adam Bardy, Martina Zábranská, Larisa Mižigar, Vladimír Kobielský, Maroš Kramár, Martin Klinčúch', null, 'Abandoned by his wife, Martin is lying to his daughter not to be upset. But as Hanka grows, these lies become unbearable. Martin meets Nada unexpectedly, asked her to be a rent-a-mother and all lives are completely changed.', 'Abandoned by his wife, Martin is lying to his daughter not to be upset. But as Hanka grows, these lies become unbearable. Martin meets Nada unexpectedly, asked her to be a rent-a-mother and all lives are completely changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fH7PP2Rkdlo414IHvZABBHhtoqd.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:218145'),
  ('1109193727933918074', 'Mom of Number 10', 2018, 'Soap, Drama', null, null, 'Sergio Herrera, Karent Hinestroza, Marcela Benjumea, Diego Vásquez, Julio Pachón, Carolina López, Yesenia Valencia, Victor Hugo Morant', 'NR', '“Mom of Number 10” tells the story of Tina Manotas, a beautiful and humble woman forced to leave her hometown because of problems his husband Edwin gets involved in. Already in the big city, Edwin abandons her with their two sons, and she must overcome difficulties and lack of money. She’ll sacrifice everything to make her son Victor’s dream of becoming a professional football player come true. Although the financial situation gets more complicated each day, Victor makes his mother a promise: “With my football I will buy you a palace, dear mother, I will take you to the sky”. Several years later, her son manages to buy her an apartment at the Sky Building. However, problems will start with elitist neighbors that feel envious of Tina Manotas’ new and luxurious life.', '“Mom of Number 10” tells the story of Tina Manotas, a beautiful and humble woman forced to leave her hometown because of problems his husband Edwin gets involved in. Already in the big city, Edwin abandons her with their two sons, and she must overcome difficulties and lack of money. She’ll sacrifice everything to make her son Victor’s dream of becoming a professional football player come true. Although the financial situation gets more complicated each day, Victor makes his mother a promise: “With my football I will buy you a palace, dear mother, I will take you to the sky”. Several years later, her son manages to buy her an apartment at the Sky Building. However, problems will start with elitist neighbors that feel envious of Tina Manotas’ new and luxurious life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqAmMS1uVAcJqXc3pUFBf331nXF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77717'),
  ('370926219602096505', 'Mom Wow', 2022, 'Family, Drama', null, null, 'Zhang Yuqi, Li Zefeng, Wu Yue, Dong Jie, Yuan Wenkang, Hai Lu, Pan Zhilin, Victor Huang', null, 'A single mother believes that she can give her son a happy life just on her own. However, at the critical juncture of getting her son into a primary school, she realises that all the mums in the kindergarten have their own troubles.', 'A single mother believes that she can give her son a happy life just on her own. However, at the critical juncture of getting her son into a primary school, she realises that all the mums in the kindergarten have their own troubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xo3qq1vYAhD2qBS2fLcpEIiCoEY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203512'),
