  ('359459965871542932', 'Moriarty the Patriot', 2020, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Soma Saito, Takuya Sato, Chiaki Kobayashi, Makoto Furukawa, Yuki Ono, Satoshi Hino, Yuto Uemura', 'TV-14', 'In the late 19th century, the British Empire nobility reigns while its working class suffers at their hands. Sympathetic to their plight, William James Moriarty wants to topple it all. Frustrated by the systemic inequity, Moriarty strategizes to fix the entire nation. Not even consulting detective Sherlock Holmes can stand in his way. It’s time for crime to revolutionize the world!', 'In the late 19th century, the British Empire nobility reigns while its working class suffers at their hands. Sympathetic to their plight, William James Moriarty wants to topple it all. Frustrated by the systemic inequity, Moriarty strategizes to fix the entire nation. Not even consulting detective Sherlock Holmes can stand in his way. It’s time for crime to revolutionize the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLcmshfrLg7JUMwMCnp5fuNqtoQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100281'),
  ('933543466828695527', 'Moribito: Guardian of the Spirit', 2007, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nahoko Uehashi', 'Kenji Kamiyama, Shoutarou Suga', 'Mabuki Ando, Naoto Adachi, Koji Tsujitani, Ako Mayama, Mayumi Asano, Yoshinari Kobayashi, Takkô Ishimori, Hirofumi Nojima', 'TV-PG', 'Balsa the spearwoman is a wandering warrior, who takes on the task of saving lives, in atonement for a past sin. On her journey, she happens to save a prince, and is tasked with becoming his bodyguard. And he is going to need one, for his own father, the emperor, wants him dead. Throughout the story, Balsa''s past will come to light and they will uncover mysteries about Chagum''s condition while developing a family-like relationship with each other and others.', 'Balsa the spearwoman is a wandering warrior, who takes on the task of saving lives, in atonement for a past sin. On her journey, she happens to save a prince, and is tasked with becoming his bodyguard. And he is going to need one, for his own father, the emperor, wants him dead. Throughout the story, Balsa''s past will come to light and they will uncover mysteries about Chagum''s condition while developing a family-like relationship with each other and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pJJbeDPqQ0XcOO3wLJr2ioXCln.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42830'),
  ('1003663480666511475', 'Moribito: Guardian of the Spirit', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Haruka Ayase, Mizuki Itagaki, Masahiro Higashide, Fumino Kimura, Kento Hayashi, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Reiko Takashima, Tatsuya Fujiwara', null, 'The heroine Balsa is a skilled bodyguard and a masterful spear-wielder. One day she rescues Prince Chagum who has fallen into a river. The prince is carrying a mysterious spirit egg in his body, and is in danger of being assassinated by his father, the Mikado, who fears this will damage his imperial prestige. Balsa embarks upon a perilous journey when she accepts the queen’s plead to protect her son from her husband.', 'The heroine Balsa is a skilled bodyguard and a masterful spear-wielder. One day she rescues Prince Chagum who has fallen into a river. The prince is carrying a mysterious spirit egg in his body, and is in danger of being assassinated by his father, the Mikado, who fears this will damage his imperial prestige. Balsa embarks upon a perilous journey when she accepts the queen’s plead to protect her son from her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hKwuo8NhBwIvDyYRfFH09OMeJP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70934'),
  ('592865735104851128', 'Mork & Mindy', 1978, 'Comedy, Family', 'Garry Marshall', null, 'Robin Williams, Pam Dawber, Conrad Janis, Ralph James', 'TV-PG', 'A wacky alien comes to Earth to study its residents and the life of the human woman he boards with is never the same.', 'A wacky alien comes to Earth to study its residents and the life of the human woman he boards with is never the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzWJikslTFFeRloUNQmbAWbdU28.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2552'),
  ('493510463813005366', 'Morning Report', 1998, null, null, null, 'Millie Clode', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 13, 'tmdb:tv:35822'),
  ('489466726723674607', 'Morocco: Love in Times of War', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Amaia Salamanca, Álex García, Verónica Sánchez, Álex Gadea, Vicente Romero Sánchez, Alicia Rubio, Anna Moliner, Cristóbal Suárez', 'TV-MA', 'Oblivious to the strife that awaits them, a group of young nurses from Spain''s upper class head to war-torn Marocco in 1921 to help where help is needed. Many lessons in love and life are learned before they overcome deepest conflicts, grow as human beings and find out what they really want from life and whom they truly love.', 'Oblivious to the strife that awaits them, a group of young nurses from Spain''s upper class head to war-torn Marocco in 1921 to help where help is needed. Many lessons in love and life are learned before they overcome deepest conflicts, grow as human beings and find out what they really want from life and whom they truly love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oXwd9gm6126tawe0Rqz4cDTQL0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74013'),
  ('412043690728069666', 'Morran and Tobias', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Johan Rheborg, Robert Gustafsson', null, 'Johan Rheborg, Robert Gustafsson', null, 'Morran and her son Tobias is two people at the fringes of society. For 34 years, croft 9: 4 had been their home and security, but now the property expropriated by the municipality of Trosa and stands gaping empty. When we meet Morran and Tobias again, they have sold a small piece of land to the municipality and had the opportunity to move back in a month''s time. There are many emotions that torn up when the household goods will be extracted to the meeting with the old life in the house. Yet we encounter a profound warmth and love of these two unusual that have chosen to survive. With Johan Rheborg and Robert Gustafsson.', 'Morran and her son Tobias is two people at the fringes of society. For 34 years, croft 9: 4 had been their home and security, but now the property expropriated by the municipality of Trosa and stands gaping empty. When we meet Morran and Tobias again, they have sold a small piece of land to the municipality and had the opportunity to move back in a month''s time. There are many emotions that torn up when the household goods will be extracted to the meeting with the old life in the house. Yet we encounter a profound warmth and love of these two unusual that have chosen to survive. With Johan Rheborg and Robert Gustafsson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0mzgxumtdMAC4pN6Ga3MbvRvPK.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62735'),
