  ('505029271604119021', 'Mr. Heart', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Cheon Seung-ho, Han Se-jin, Lara, Yoo Jang-young, Park Geon-Rak', null, 'Jin-won cares about one thing only: running. When he finds himself in a slump, his coach suggests Sang-ha as a pacemaker. Though Sang-ha''s efforts are initially ignored, they find themselves growing closer and closer over time.', 'Jin-won cares about one thing only: running. When he finds himself in a slump, his coach suggests Sang-ha as a pacemaker. Though Sang-ha''s efforts are initially ignored, they find themselves growing closer and closer over time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQGWjLclOYq6L1Gp1UNkMBT0DoW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107692'),
  ('824062746460236941', 'Mr. Hiiragi''s Homeroom', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Masaki Suda, Mei Nagano, Mio Imada, Ryota Katayose, Moka Kamishiraishi, Nana Mori, Seiichi Tanabe, Rina Kawaei', null, 'With graduation 10 days away, homeroom teacher Hiiragi gathered all 29 students of class 3-A and proclaims them his hostages. His last lesson regards the death of a student that passed away a few months before. Nobody will be able to graduate until the truth is known.', 'With graduation 10 days away, homeroom teacher Hiiragi gathered all 29 students of class 3-A and proclaims them his hostages. His last lesson regards the death of a student that passed away a few months before. Nobody will be able to graduate until the truth is known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzEJMNAWj1HO8yM62tlZD5pmeiV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85529'),
  ('254384424164873113', 'Mr. Housework', 2019, 'Comedy, Family, Reality', null, null, 'Wei Daxun, Li Dan, Du Chun, Li Wenhan, Tang Jiuzhou, Wu Dajing, Ba Tu, 魏绍林', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dF6H1FmvxEcuUdgJ2QKSd3nWCh9.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:108897'),
  ('1006289407706185190', 'Mr. Iglesias', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Kevin Hench', null, 'Gabriel Iglesias, Jacob Vargas, Sherri Shepherd, Richard Gant, Cree Cicchino, Maggie Geha, Gloria Aung, Tucker Albrizzi', 'TV-14', 'Hilarious high school teacher Gabriel Iglesias tries to make a difference in the lives of some smart but underperforming students at his alma mater.', 'Hilarious high school teacher Gabriel Iglesias tries to make a difference in the lives of some smart but underperforming students at his alma mater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRLuPKk3hKD5fiZGi5WGNdssox8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:88378'),
  ('27634757635348234', 'Mr. Kinpachi in Class 3B', 1979, 'Drama', null, null, 'Tetsuya Takeda, Mari Hoshino, Yasuomi Sano, Masayuki Suzuki, Junpei Morita, Akio Kaneda, Atsuko Takahata, Ginnojo Yamazaki', null, 'A legendary television series and cultural asset, Mr. Kinpachi in Class 3B is famous for putting many social issues on the front burner of the public conscious over its long run, as filtered through the emotionally volatile lives of third year middle school students. The heartfelt relations between a devoted schoolteacher, Kinpachi Sakamoto, and his unique students have won the show high praise for several decades. Whether due to the pressures of exams, family relations, teachers and friends, graduating middle school students navigate a turbulent hormonal sea of “hope” and “frustration”, constantly shaped by the social environment of the times. Standing as a beacon in the storm and emitting messages of hope for each generation is one Japanese teacher, Kinpachi Sakamoto, who has come to be adored and admired by a nation through the adventures of Class 3B.', 'A legendary television series and cultural asset, Mr. Kinpachi in Class 3B is famous for putting many social issues on the front burner of the public conscious over its long run, as filtered through the emotionally volatile lives of third year middle school students. The heartfelt relations between a devoted schoolteacher, Kinpachi Sakamoto, and his unique students have won the show high praise for several decades. Whether due to the pressures of exams, family relations, teachers and friends, graduating middle school students navigate a turbulent hormonal sea of “hope” and “frustration”, constantly shaped by the social environment of the times. Standing as a beacon in the storm and emitting messages of hope for each generation is one Japanese teacher, Kinpachi Sakamoto, who has come to be adored and admired by a nation through the adventures of Class 3B.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llq3XNHOtNrv5QbBsCVRRLncwWf.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:13285'),
  ('1058542457358087124', 'Mr. Lucky', 1959, 'Drama', 'Blake Edwards', null, 'Ross Martin, John Vivyan, Tom Brown', null, 'Mr. Lucky is a CBS adventure/drama television series that aired from October 24, 1959, to June 18, 1960, with repeats until September 3. Blake Edwards developed the program as a retooling of his Willie Dante character from Four Star Playhouse, where the role was played by studio boss Dick Powell. In the 1960–1961 season, Howard Duff assumed the role of Willie Dante in the NBC adventure/drama series Dante. Mr. Edwards directed and co-wrote the first episode of Mr. Lucky, and the credits of the first eighteen episodes included "Entire production supervised by Blake Edwards." Jack Arnold produced the show and directed fifteen of the thirty-four episodes. Henry Mancini''s smooth theme music for the show reached Number 21 in the US singles charts. He released two successful LP''s based on the show, Mr. Lucky and Mr. Lucky Goes Latin.', 'Mr. Lucky is a CBS adventure/drama television series that aired from October 24, 1959, to June 18, 1960, with repeats until September 3. Blake Edwards developed the program as a retooling of his Willie Dante character from Four Star Playhouse, where the role was played by studio boss Dick Powell. In the 1960–1961 season, Howard Duff assumed the role of Willie Dante in the NBC adventure/drama series Dante. Mr. Edwards directed and co-wrote the first episode of Mr. Lucky, and the credits of the first eighteen episodes included "Entire production supervised by Blake Edwards." Jack Arnold produced the show and directed fifteen of the thirty-four episodes. Henry Mancini''s smooth theme music for the show reached Number 21 in the US singles charts. He released two successful LP''s based on the show, Mr. Lucky and Mr. Lucky Goes Latin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JkOtbbap3wFsX7l4GEjeOlJiXW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1829'),
  ('738863551086242281', 'Mr. Mayor', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Tina Fey, Robert Carlock', null, 'Ted Danson, Holly Hunter, Vella Lovell, Mike Cabellon, Kyla Kenedy, Bobby Moynihan', 'TV-14', 'A retired businessman runs for mayor of Los Angeles to prove he''s "still got it." Once he wins, he has to figure out what he stands for, gain the respect of his biggest critic and connect with his teenage daughter, all while trying to get anything right for America''s second weirdest city.', 'A retired businessman runs for mayor of Los Angeles to prove he''s "still got it." Once he wins, he has to figure out what he stands for, gain the respect of his biggest critic and connect with his teenage daughter, all while trying to get anything right for America''s second weirdest city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPAaoNJWbRkF7s0f3tPbVehiBgT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:113477'),
  ('97422174411877542', 'Mr. McMahon', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Chris Smith', null, 'Vince McMahon, Dwayne Johnson, John Cena, Hulk Hogan, Steve Austin, Paul Levesque, Eric Bischoff, Bret Hart', 'TV-MA', 'WWE experienced record-breaking highs and crushing lows under Vince McMahon''s leadership. This docuseries delves into the mogul''s controversial reign.', 'WWE experienced record-breaking highs and crushing lows under Vince McMahon''s leadership. This docuseries delves into the mogul''s controversial reign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtLYsALvuHlnw7PHg0frCCwSRVy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:263089'),
  ('4530438989687167', 'Mr. Meaty', 2006, 'Kids, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jamie Shannon, Jason Hopley', null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'Mr. Meaty is an American/Canadian television series, airing on CBC Television in Canada and the Nicktoons Network in the United States. It originally began in 2004, as a series of interstitial shorts that aired on Nickelodeon. It features the voices of Jamie Shannon, Jason Hopley, Marty Stelnick, and Todd Doldersum. The show is about two lazy teenage boys named Josh and Parker working at a fast food restaurant called Mr. Meaty located inside the Scaunchboro Mall. The program ran from September 22, 2006 until May 23, 2009 when production was subsequently cancelled due to poor reviews and low ratings and is now officially out of sydnication.', 'Mr. Meaty is an American/Canadian television series, airing on CBC Television in Canada and the Nicktoons Network in the United States. It originally began in 2004, as a series of interstitial shorts that aired on Nickelodeon. It features the voices of Jamie Shannon, Jason Hopley, Marty Stelnick, and Todd Doldersum. The show is about two lazy teenage boys named Josh and Parker working at a fast food restaurant called Mr. Meaty located inside the Scaunchboro Mall. The program ran from September 22, 2006 until May 23, 2009 when production was subsequently cancelled due to poor reviews and low ratings and is now officially out of sydnication.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZnEvkwmcFBxStWVnpzp764RVox.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:682'),
  ('467140015833275298', 'Mr. Mercedes', 2017, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'David E. Kelley', null, 'Brendan Gleeson, Jharrel Jerome, Holland Taylor, Breeda Wool, Justine Lupe, Maximiliano Hernández, Gabriel Ebert, Rarmian Newton', 'TV-MA', 'A demented serial killer taunts a retired police detective with a series of lurid letters and emails, forcing the ex-cop to undertake a private, and potentially felonious, crusade to bring the killer to justice before he can strike again.', 'A demented serial killer taunts a retired police detective with a series of lurid letters and emails, forcing the ex-cop to undertake a private, and potentially felonious, crusade to bring the killer to justice before he can strike again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZm3LidCf6Edv6yX3WMKo6KwICg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70485'),
  ('1078443483268428203', 'Mr. Midnight: Beware the Monsters', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Idan Aedan, Chen Yixin, Caleb Monk, Nikki Dekker, Lim Yu-Beng, Maxime Bouttier', 'TV-PG', 'A once-average teen and his friends become paranormal detective and document their adventures in an online blog under the pseudonym “Mr. Midnight.”', 'A once-average teen and his friends become paranormal detective and document their adventures in an online blog under the pseudonym “Mr. Midnight.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88Qguo88OKruv5REalqQAyf0jLS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212284'),
  ('409446827316314444', 'Mr. Mikami''s Classroom', 2025, 'Drama', 'Yohei Miyazaki, Sakura Komaki', null, 'Tori Matsuzaka, Riho Yoshioka, Masaki Okada, Aju Makita, Daiken Okudaira, Airu Kubozuka, Sakura Kiryu, Yudai Toyoda', null, 'Takashi Mikami, a University of Tokyo graduate, joins the Ministry of Education to reform Japan''s education but is disillusioned by its reality. Transferred to a private high school, he takes a stand against the authorities, using his role as a teacher to push for change.', 'Takashi Mikami, a University of Tokyo graduate, joins the Ministry of Education to reform Japan''s education but is disillusioned by its reality. Transferred to a private high school, he takes a stand against the authorities, using his role as a teacher to push for change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4DL1npho9wGUQV2EsISW7GufaN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279044'),
  ('93691084228244225', 'Mr. Nobunaga''s Young Bride', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Koudai Sakai, Akari Uehara, Ari Ozawa, Konomi Yuzaki, Marika Tanaka, Moe Toyota, Suzuna Kinoshita', 'TV-MA', 'Nobunaga was a teacher who was waiting for that kind of dating sim event to happen in real life. One day, a 14 year old girl named Kicho appears in front of him, saying that she''s his wife?! Apparently she came from the Warring States era and seems to have mistaken Nobunaga for the Oda Nobunaga and tells him that she wants to have his children. An age-gap love comedy featuring a teacher with a dating sims brain and a princess with a warring states era brain!!', 'Nobunaga was a teacher who was waiting for that kind of dating sim event to happen in real life. One day, a 14 year old girl named Kicho appears in front of him, saying that she''s his wife?! Apparently she came from the Warring States era and seems to have mistaken Nobunaga for the Oda Nobunaga and tells him that she wants to have his children. An age-gap love comedy featuring a teacher with a dating sims brain and a princess with a warring states era brain!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOLj9HLvk11RZ80tHIB8XHkWnXX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87476'),
  ('907547029986563438', 'Mr. Novak', 1963, 'Drama', 'E. Jack Neuman, Boris Sagal', null, 'James Franciscus, Dean Jagger, Bill Zuckert, Peter Hansen, Sandy Millar, Phyllis Avery, Vince Howard', null, 'Mr. Novak is an American dramatic series starring James Franciscus in the title role, which aired on NBC for two seasons, from 1963 to 1965.', 'Mr. Novak is an American dramatic series starring James Franciscus in the title role, which aired on NBC for two seasons, from 1963 to 1965.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70JM7KslaQEuR82eAbiykGgtjDH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:14086'),
  ('1060093261474108028', 'Mr. Osomatsu', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Takahiro Sakurai, Jun Fukuyama, Aya Endo, Yuichi Nakamura, Kazuhiko Inoue, Miyu Irino, Hiroshi Kamiya, Sachi Kokuryu', 'TV-14', 'The lives of the now 20-something NEET Matsuno sextuplets and the bizarre adventures they find themselves into in the modern day.', 'The lives of the now 20-something NEET Matsuno sextuplets and the bizarre adventures they find themselves into in the modern day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEsmh6m9fUhJzGfLxUpliT3vqdh.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71785'),
  ('961666936338800019', 'Mr. Pickles', 2014, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Will Carsola, Dave Stewart', null, 'Dave Stewart, Kaitlyn Robrock, Brooke Shields, Jay Johnston, Will Carsola, Frank Collison', 'TV-MA', 'The Goodman family lives with their lovable pet dog, Mr. Pickles, a deviant border collie with a secret satanic streak.', 'The Goodman family lives with their lovable pet dog, Mr. Pickles, a deviant border collie with a secret satanic streak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSWmZnvXIOoqZ7eLderyInsouiF.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61593'),
  ('548109228996214525', 'Mr. Plankton', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hong Jong-chan, Jo Yong', null, 'Woo Do-hwan, Lee You-mi, Oh Jung-se, Kim Hae-sook', 'TV-MA', 'A man plagued by misfortune and his ex, the unluckiest bride-to-be, are forced to accompany one another on the final journey of his life.', 'A man plagued by misfortune and his ex, the unluckiest bride-to-be, are forced to accompany one another on the final journey of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsnE5TY4NaYHGJXYxiVaA57nCqo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230448'),
  ('164109411090204816', 'Mr. Queen', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Park Kye-ok, Choi A-il', 'Park Kye-ok, Choi A-il', 'Shin Hye-sun, Kim Jung-hyun, Bae Jong-ok, Kim Tae-woo, Seol In-a, Na In-woo, Cha Chung-hwa, Chae Seo-eun', 'TV-14', 'A modern chef suddenly becomes trapped inside the body of a queen from the Joseon era, which causes chaos for everyone involved.', 'A modern chef suddenly becomes trapped inside the body of a queen from the Joseon era, which causes chaos for everyone involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozuyMnOO5pekDklyPpUL1Htkuzy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108261'),
  ('528040738706125992', 'Mr. Right', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Li Xiao', null, 'Jin Dong, Maggie Jiang, Li Naiwen, Li Zonghan, Cecilia Boey, Xin Zhilei, Ni Dahong, Tian Yu', null, 'Cheng Hao is a dentist who spends his free time helping others devise ways to get the girl of their dreams, despite the fact that he has never been in love. He meets Luo Yue who deals with jerks and heartbreakers.', 'Cheng Hao is a dentist who spends his free time helping others devise ways to get the girl of their dreams, despite the fact that he has never been in love. He meets Luo Yue who deals with jerks and heartbreakers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkYbcJtm95nonOF8pvszZ4CngtJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76754'),
  ('1145017597717943536', 'Mr. Robinson', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Owen Ellickson', null, 'Craig Robinson, Benjamin Koldyke, Brandon T. Jackson, Spencer Grammer, Amandla Stenberg, Peri Gilpin', 'TV-PG', 'Centers on a rough-edged musician Craig, who''s adjusting to his new life as a music teacher in a big-city middle school where he encounters teacher politics and the temptations of single moms.', 'Centers on a rough-edged musician Craig, who''s adjusting to his new life as a music teacher in a big-city middle school where he encounters teacher politics and the temptations of single moms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/no3mOvCfuyLrEEWLi16pbHCIqQZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63354'),
  ('240202010158388308', 'Mr. Robot', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sam Esmail', null, 'Rami Malek, Christian Slater, Carly Chaikin', 'TV-MA', 'A young programmer, Elliot, suffers from a debilitating anti-social disorder and decides that he can only connect to people by hacking them. He wields his skills as a weapon to protect the people that he cares about. Elliot finds himself in the intersection between a cybersecurity firm he works for and the underworld organizations that are recruiting him to bring down corporate America.', 'A young programmer, Elliot, suffers from a debilitating anti-social disorder and decides that he can only connect to people by hacking them. He wields his skills as a weapon to protect the people that he cares about. Elliot finds himself in the intersection between a cybersecurity firm he works for and the underworld organizations that are recruiting him to bring down corporate America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kv1nRqgebSsREnd7vdC2pSGjpLo.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:62560'),
  ('1120374207242439075', 'Mr. Sahara & Toki-kun', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Uiko Miura', 'Rintaro Hachimura, Takumi Kizu, Shunta Sono, Hiroki Matsumoto, Takumi Momose, Kaito Hori', null, 'Toki Kaneda, a tough yet kind-hearted delinquent, falls for his dashing teacher Ichiro Sahara, sparking an earnest one-sided romance and newfound motivation.', 'Toki Kaneda, a tough yet kind-hearted delinquent, falls for his dashing teacher Ichiro Sahara, sparking an earnest one-sided romance and newfound motivation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1uZXt6peeotgDltOC7sIfdmpa6P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237982'),
  ('586589293586305494', 'Mr. Scorsese', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Martin Scorsese, Rebecca Miller', 'TV-MA', 'Explore the many lives of Martin Scorsese through intimate interviews with the man himself, access to his private archives, plus conversations with Robert De Niro, Leonardo DiCaprio, Margot Robbie, Daniel Day-Lewis, Steven Spielberg, and more.', 'Explore the many lives of Martin Scorsese through intimate interviews with the man himself, access to his private archives, plus conversations with Robert De Niro, Leonardo DiCaprio, Margot Robbie, Daniel Day-Lewis, Steven Spielberg, and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atok9lbfro3hZxGTlaJZWN0BWRM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:292130'),
  ('1119575231659421990', 'Mr. Show with Bob and David', 1995, 'Comedy', 'David Cross, Bob Odenkirk', null, 'Bob Odenkirk, David Cross, Jill Talley, Brian Posehn, Tom Kenny, Jay Johnston, John Ennis, Scott Adsit', 'TV-MA', 'A sketch comedy series starring and hosted by Bob Odenkirk and David Cross. The pair introduce most episodes as heightened versions of themselves before transitioning to a mixture of live sketches and pre-taped segments.', 'A sketch comedy series starring and hosted by Bob Odenkirk and David Cross. The pair introduce most episodes as heightened versions of themselves before transitioning to a mixture of live sketches and pre-taped segments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNPF7Zad87aXa7bQt4W4AYmnwL4.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:610'),
  ('896244788060440501', 'Mr. Sloane', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert B. Weide', null, 'Nick Frost, Olivia Colman, Peter Serafinowicz, Lawry Lewin, Ophelia Lovibond, Brendan Patricks', null, 'Mr. Sloane''s titular character is a buttoned-down 1960''s man in crisis. Between his failed attempts at marriage, career success and even suicide, it''s fair to say that 1969 isn''t shaping up to be Watford-dweller Mr. Sloane''s year. But with a potential job opportunity on the horizon and the phone number of a prospective new love interest following a chance encounter in his local hardware store, could Mr Sloane''s luck be about to change?', 'Mr. Sloane''s titular character is a buttoned-down 1960''s man in crisis. Between his failed attempts at marriage, career success and even suicide, it''s fair to say that 1969 isn''t shaping up to be Watford-dweller Mr. Sloane''s year. But with a potential job opportunity on the horizon and the phone number of a prospective new love interest following a chance encounter in his local hardware store, could Mr Sloane''s luck be about to change?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qL7dx4TiIsbrT8AQIk4eTSc6t8f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63864'),
  ('904910113225028456', 'Mr. Sunshine', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Matthew Perry, Marc Firek, Alex Barnow', null, 'Matthew Perry, Andrea Anders, James Lesure, Nate Torrence, Allison Janney', 'TV-PG', 'Ben Donovan is a self-involved manager of a second-rate San Diego sports arena who begins to re-evaluate his life on his 40th birthday. Working alongside him is his boss and arena owner, Crystal--attractive, powerful and highly erratic; Alice--the cute, tomboyish marketing director and Ben''s friend with benefits; Alonzo--a former basketball player, handsome and unbelievably happy; Ben''s assistant, Heather--pretty, sweet, but terrifying because she once lit a boyfriend on fire; Crystal''s son, Roman--sweet-faced, clueless and Ben''s newest employee; and a hapless operations crew whom Ben refers to collectively as the "Steves."', 'Ben Donovan is a self-involved manager of a second-rate San Diego sports arena who begins to re-evaluate his life on his 40th birthday. Working alongside him is his boss and arena owner, Crystal--attractive, powerful and highly erratic; Alice--the cute, tomboyish marketing director and Ben''s friend with benefits; Alonzo--a former basketball player, handsome and unbelievably happy; Ben''s assistant, Heather--pretty, sweet, but terrifying because she once lit a boyfriend on fire; Crystal''s son, Roman--sweet-faced, clueless and Ben''s newest employee; and a hapless operations crew whom Ben refers to collectively as the "Steves."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGhKW250g40wsHp60GQJxa65Mg1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32710'),
  ('1059448353965851147', 'Mr. Sunshine', 2018, 'Drama', 'Lee Eung-bok, Kim Eun-sook', 'Kim Eun-sook', 'Lee Byung-hun, Kim Tae-ri, Yoo Yeon-seok, Kim Min-joung, Byun Yo-han, Kim Kap-soo, Choi Moo-seong, Lee Ho-jae', null, 'Set in the early 1900s, this drama tells the story of a young man from Korea who grows up in the United States. When he returns to Korea as a US Marine Corps officer, he meets and falls in love with a noblewoman who is fighting for Korean independence. Their romance is complicated by social class and political ideology.', 'Set in the early 1900s, this drama tells the story of a young man from Korea who grows up in the United States. When he returns to Korea as a US Marine Corps officer, he meets and falls in love with a noblewoman who is fighting for Korean independence. Their romance is complicated by social class and political ideology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7ljjykSsiyWstGVAwIkbdfPzRV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75820'),
  ('437001104451127174', 'Mr. Throwback', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Matthew Libman, Daniel Libman, David Caspe', null, 'Stephen Curry, Adam Pally, Ego Nwodim, Ayden Mayeri', 'TV-MA', 'A down-on-his-luck memorabilia dealer looks for redemption by reuniting with his sixth-grade teammate, NBA legend Steph Curry.', 'A down-on-his-luck memorabilia dealer looks for redemption by reuniting with his sixth-grade teammate, NBA legend Steph Curry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfCktBzGQ0OrOU0TS4GmjBMCot.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246410'),
  ('838765905101633601', 'Mr. TONEGAWA Middle Management Blues', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Toshiyuki Morikawa, Masane Tsukayama, Chiharu Sawashiro, Takaya Aoyagi, Takuya Eguchi, Kengo Kawanishi, Akira Ishida, Koutaro Nishiyama', 'TV-MA', 'Nobody knows what it''s like to be the bad man… except the bad man''s right-hand man, who has to take the boss'' deranged ideas and turn them into functioning plans. So, when the sadistic president of the Teiai Group decides he''s bored with the routine leg breaking and widow/orphan evicting, he assigns the task of coming up with something "special" to his ruthless Number Two, Yukio Tonegawa. But how do you amuse someone who destroys a dozen lives before breakfast? There''s a huge pool of potential victims in the form of TFO''s swollen roster of defaulting borrowers, but if Tonegawa and his team of nearly identical men in black look-alikes can''t create a "game of death" that tickles the boss'' demented funny bones, they may end up playing the game themselves!', 'Nobody knows what it''s like to be the bad man… except the bad man''s right-hand man, who has to take the boss'' deranged ideas and turn them into functioning plans. So, when the sadistic president of the Teiai Group decides he''s bored with the routine leg breaking and widow/orphan evicting, he assigns the task of coming up with something "special" to his ruthless Number Two, Yukio Tonegawa. But how do you amuse someone who destroys a dozen lives before breakfast? There''s a huge pool of potential victims in the form of TFO''s swollen roster of defaulting borrowers, but if Tonegawa and his team of nearly identical men in black look-alikes can''t create a "game of death" that tickles the boss'' demented funny bones, they may end up playing the game themselves!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wSWVBPK6SYnUMjKjXPKN79aFFJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80463'),
  ('918140060902653789', 'Mr. Unlucky Has No Choice but to Kiss!', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Tsuyu Gamoko', null, 'Ryosuke Sota, Yusuke Sato, Satsuki Nakayama, Gaku Oshida, Mei Hata, Asuka Hanamura, Yoji Matsuda, Kensuke Takahashi', null, 'Tensions sizzle when a student with horrible luck joins forces with another boy with chronic good luck in this charming romance based on a hit manga', 'Tensions sizzle when a student with horrible luck joins forces with another boy with chronic good luck in this charming romance based on a hit manga', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xscrSVn21drKbYESngnSRWuX2BP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:169561'),
  ('979081657125646417', 'Mr. Villain''s Day Off', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shintaro Asanuma, Soma Saito, Yuichi Nakamura, Hiiro Ishibashi, Takuya Eguchi, Ai Kakuma, Hibiku Yamamura, Yuuichirou Umehara', 'TV-14', 'As a member of a malevolent organization, the General is tasked with invading Earth and wiping out humanity. Even an extraterrestrial being like him, however, needs a chance to rest. Not even the Rangers—a team solely dedicated to defeating the General and his colleagues—will stand in the way of him visiting pandas at the zoo, buying ice cream at the convenience store, and enjoying his well-deserved day off from committing evil deeds.', 'As a member of a malevolent organization, the General is tasked with invading Earth and wiping out humanity. Even an extraterrestrial being like him, however, needs a chance to rest. Not even the Rangers—a team solely dedicated to defeating the General and his colleagues—will stand in the way of him visiting pandas at the zoo, buying ice cream at the convenience store, and enjoying his well-deserved day off from committing evil deeds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHxmVSEjuvf7hJf7ds2edmPldYD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222784'),
  ('584546085702820983', 'Mr. Wrong', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Deniz Yorulmazer', 'Aslı Zengin, Banu Zengin', 'Can Yaman, Özge Gürel, Gürgen Öz, Fatma Toptaş, Sarp Can Köroğlu, Cemre Gümeli, Serkay Tütüncü, Lale Başar', null, 'Özgür is a very wealthy restaurant owner and living a sloppy but happy go lucky life, and does not believe in love. Ezgi is now tired of wrong relationships and is determined to have a proper relationship and get married. Seeing that Ezgi is not successful in the relationship matters, Özgür begins to mentor her about relationships and gives her tactics to get the man she likes. Özgür and Ezgi also turns out to be neighbors.', 'Özgür is a very wealthy restaurant owner and living a sloppy but happy go lucky life, and does not believe in love. Ezgi is now tired of wrong relationships and is determined to have a proper relationship and get married. Seeing that Ezgi is not successful in the relationship matters, Özgür begins to mentor her about relationships and gives her tactics to get the man she likes. Özgür and Ezgi also turns out to be neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLIgB9hWc14ffEnH7MLV9V2E1OP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105052'),
  ('1010094066968108627', 'Mr. Young', 2011, 'Comedy, Kids, Drama', 'Dan Signer', null, 'Brendan Meyer, Gig Morton, Matreya Fedor, Paula Shaw, Raugi Yu, Anna Galvin, Emily Tennant', 'TV-Y7', 'Mr. Young is a Canadian comedy series that premiered on March 1, 2011 on YTV. The series is shot in front of a live audience in Burnaby, British Columbia. The series was created by Dan Signer, and stars Brendan Meyer, Matreya Fedor and Gig Morton as attendants of Finnegan High School. Further main cast includes Kurt Ostlund, Emily Tennant, and Milo Shandel.', 'Mr. Young is a Canadian comedy series that premiered on March 1, 2011 on YTV. The series is shot in front of a live audience in Burnaby, British Columbia. The series was created by Dan Signer, and stars Brendan Meyer, Matreya Fedor and Gig Morton as attendants of Finnegan High School. Further main cast includes Kurt Ostlund, Emily Tennant, and Milo Shandel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1K4xB1FoExSQiPC92Euosa1trz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:37731'),
  ('610357309544005049', 'MR.BRAIN', 2009, 'Mystery, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Takuya Kimura, Teruyuki Kagawa, Haruka Ayase, Hiro Mizushima, Ichikawa Ebizo XI, Mao Daichi, Sei Hiraizumi, Osamu Shitara', null, 'Ryusuke Tsukumo is a quirky, yet brilliant neuroscientist working for the National Research Institute of Police Science. Wielding a unique perspective and psychology, Tsukumo tackles the nation''s most baffling crimes and scandals, going head-to-head with the most brilliant and twisted criminal minds. But his eccentricities and poor social timing can also aggravate people and circumstances, further complicating matters.', 'Ryusuke Tsukumo is a quirky, yet brilliant neuroscientist working for the National Research Institute of Police Science. Wielding a unique perspective and psychology, Tsukumo tackles the nation''s most baffling crimes and scandals, going head-to-head with the most brilliant and twisted criminal minds. But his eccentricities and poor social timing can also aggravate people and circumstances, further complicating matters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsD0OrS3E0GYYdZTCH8m8lIgPzA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33417'),
  ('1139178487340180409', 'Mrkomir the First', 2021, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Goran Navojec, Ozren Grabarić', null, 'The plot of the series takes place in the early Middle Ages. Prince Mrkomir rules in Klis, along with the conspirator Slavomir, the head of the KOA, which is an abbreviation for the Rector''s Intelligence Agency.', 'The plot of the series takes place in the early Middle Ages. Prince Mrkomir rules in Klis, along with the conspirator Slavomir, the head of the KOA, which is an abbreviation for the Rector''s Intelligence Agency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6ZPk0itgZu1i8CgVQwpYxapwTJ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:116074'),
  ('101727668696442978', 'Mrs Brown''s Boys', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Brendan O''Carroll', null, 'Brendan O''Carroll, Jennifer Gibney, Paddy Houlihan, Danny O''Carroll, Dermot O''Neill, Fiona O''Carroll, Pat Shields, Amanda Woods', null, 'Mrs. Brown''s Boys is a British-Irish award winning sitcom created by and starring writer and performer Brendan O''Carroll. The show is based on O''Carroll''s stage plays about the character Agnes Browne, which were developed from books and straight-to-DVD films. The sitcom continues the stories of Agnes, now with the shortened surname "Brown", and her family who are played by real life close friends and family of O''Carroll''s. After being slated by critics, the show has become a ratings success in both Ireland, where it is set, and the United Kingdom, where it is recorded. On 29 December 2012 the show began its third series. Mrs Brown''s Boys is a co-production among BBC Scotland, BocPix and RTÉ.', 'Mrs. Brown''s Boys is a British-Irish award winning sitcom created by and starring writer and performer Brendan O''Carroll. The show is based on O''Carroll''s stage plays about the character Agnes Browne, which were developed from books and straight-to-DVD films. The sitcom continues the stories of Agnes, now with the shortened surname "Brown", and her family who are played by real life close friends and family of O''Carroll''s. After being slated by critics, the show has become a ratings success in both Ireland, where it is set, and the United Kingdom, where it is recorded. On 29 December 2012 the show began its third series. Mrs Brown''s Boys is a co-production among BBC Scotland, BocPix and RTÉ.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtralJyoicwsclBrFrN1ks8DHuS.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:34965'),
  ('661121614120600249', 'Mrs Playmen', 2025, 'Drama', 'Mario Ruggeri, Eleonora Cimpanelli, Chiara Laudani', null, 'Carolina Crescentini, Filippo Nigro, Giuseppe Maggio, Francesca Colucci, Domenico Diele, Francesco Colella, Lidia Vitale, Giampiero Judica', 'TV-MA', 'Betrayed by her husband, a woman must step up and run an erotic magazine that becomes a symbol of empowerment in ''70s Rome. Inspired by true events.', 'Betrayed by her husband, a woman must step up and run an erotic magazine that becomes a symbol of empowerment in ''70s Rome. Inspired by true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLwRvsuKhMjrCrAUUuw61cSuiOi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:301001'),
  ('551739373999301811', 'Mrs Sidhu Investigates', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Suk Pannu', null, 'Meera Syal, Craig Parkinson, Naana Agyei-Ampadu, Gurjeet Singh, Gordon Kennedy', null, 'Mrs. Sidhu is a high-end caterer with a taste for crime. Recently widowed, she juggles her new catering business with encouraging her wayward son Tez to find his passion, all while serving up justice to those who believe they are above the law. Her forays into sleuthing see her form an unofficial partnership with long-suffering divorcee DCI Burton who reluctantly accepts that together they''re an unbeatable crime-fighting duo, much to the bemusement of his partner, DS Mint.', 'Mrs. Sidhu is a high-end caterer with a taste for crime. Recently widowed, she juggles her new catering business with encouraging her wayward son Tez to find his passion, all while serving up justice to those who believe they are above the law. Her forays into sleuthing see her form an unofficial partnership with long-suffering divorcee DCI Burton who reluctantly accepts that together they''re an unbeatable crime-fighting duo, much to the bemusement of his partner, DS Mint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HVutWuThMmq1TkrYMv48KS3heB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235111'),
  ('411364494423310375', 'Mrs Wilson', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ruth Wilson, Iain Glen, Fiona Shaw, Anupam Kher, Calam Lynch, Ian McElhinney, Joy Richardson, Keeley Hawes', 'TV-14', 'After the sudden death of ex-Secret Intelligence Service man Alexander, his wife Alison investigates when mysteries from her husband''s past come knocking.', 'After the sudden death of ex-Secret Intelligence Service man Alexander, his wife Alison investigates when mysteries from her husband''s past come knocking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vD8SzDX7mUbMM3wxqw5okaiwFOh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78969'),
  ('2093792732444980', 'Mrs. America', 2020, 'Drama', 'Dahvi Waller', 'Joshua Allen Griffith', 'Cate Blanchett, Rose Byrne, Uzo Aduba, Margo Martindale, Tracey Ullman, Elizabeth Banks, Sarah Paulson, John Slattery', 'TV-MA', 'The true story of the movement to ratify the Equal Rights Amendment, and the unexpected backlash led by a conservative woman named Phyllis Schlafly, aka “the sweetheart of the silent majority.”', 'The true story of the movement to ratify the Equal Rights Amendment, and the unexpected backlash led by a conservative woman named Phyllis Schlafly, aka “the sweetheart of the silent majority.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82OxxE93DG0ArPj7JvOeNEBW8iT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83605'),
  ('443884875249310884', 'Mrs. Davis', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tara Hernandez, Damon Lindelof', null, 'Betty Gilpin, Jake McDorman, Andy McQueen', 'TV-MA', 'Sister Simone partners with her ex-boyfriend on a globe-spanning journey to destroy Mrs. Davis, a powerful artificial intelligence.', 'Sister Simone partners with her ex-boyfriend on a globe-spanning journey to destroy Mrs. Davis, a powerful artificial intelligence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMr3mFACLuL4J7AEj8yDwcf5rnr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197548'),
  ('814160472133784524', 'Mrs. Fazilet and Her Daughters', 2017, 'Drama, Family', 'Gökçen Usta, Günay Günaydın', 'Sırma Yanık', 'Nazan Kesal, Deniz Baysal, Çağlar Ertuğrul, Mahir Günşiray, Tolga Güleç, Hazal Türesan, Afra Saraçoğlu, İdris Nebi Taşkan', 'NR', 'The story of Fazilet, mother of Hazan and Ece, eager to make money using the modeling skills of her younger daughter, Ece. While Hazan pursues a career as a coach in sports, far from her mother''s wishes and falls in love with a rich spoiled man.', 'The story of Fazilet, mother of Hazan and Ece, eager to make money using the modeling skills of her younger daughter, Ece. While Hazan pursues a career as a coach in sports, far from her mother''s wishes and falls in love with a rich spoiled man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJe1m8eKqb14xE0ers6dAZm1QrS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76560'),
  ('444935062763432858', 'Mrs. Fletcher', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tom Perrotta', null, 'Kathryn Hahn, Jackson White, Owen Teague, Cameron Boyce, Domenick Lombardozzi, Casey Wilson, Jen Richards, April Schutte', 'TV-MA', 'Empty nest divorcée Eve Fletcher reinvents her life to find the happiness and sexual fulfillment that’s eluded her, and her college freshman son Brendan.', 'Empty nest divorcée Eve Fletcher reinvents her life to find the happiness and sexual fulfillment that’s eluded her, and her college freshman son Brendan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FVRHydZgQ09S4ANvhy1dQyI7A4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81879'),
  ('74569033631175502', 'Mrs. Pepper Pot', 1983, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Alf Prøysen', 'Reiko Seno, Sumi Shimamoto, Yo Inoue, Joji Yanami, Daisuke Gori, Eiko Taira, Hiroko Maruyama, Kazuhiko Inoue', null, 'Mrs. Pepper Pot lives in a small village with her husband, and enjoys a unique life because she has a small magic spoon that helps her reduce her size, and during that, Mrs. Pepper Pot embarks on a series of adventures during which she communicates with animals easily.', 'Mrs. Pepper Pot lives in a small village with her husband, and enjoys a unique life because she has a small magic spoon that helps her reduce her size, and during that, Mrs. Pepper Pot embarks on a series of adventures during which she communicates with animals easily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNriQC7e0MPUjwlBRjkQ1nOubNk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37798'),
  ('904752313113199009', 'Ms Fisher''s Modern Murder Mysteries', 2019, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Deb Cox, Fiona Eagger', null, 'Geraldine Hakewill, Joel Jackson, Catherine McClements, Toby Truslove, Louisa Mignone, Greg Stone, Katie Robertson', null, 'In swinging 60’s Melbourne, gorgeously reckless Peregrine Fisher inherits a windfall when the famous aunt she never knew goes missing over the highlands of New Guinea. Peregrine must prove herself brilliant enough to become a world class private detective in her own right.', 'In swinging 60’s Melbourne, gorgeously reckless Peregrine Fisher inherits a windfall when the famous aunt she never knew goes missing over the highlands of New Guinea. Peregrine must prove herself brilliant enough to become a world class private detective in her own right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7iLddzdaTdCjTRz72qSvVQ5Djj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86847'),
  ('84255748010956045', 'Ms. Incognito', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Park Yoo-young, Hyun Gyu-ri', 'Hyun Gyu-ri', 'Jeon Yeo-been, Jung Jin-young, Seo Hyun-woo, Jang Yoon-ju, Joo Hyun-young, Moon Sung-keun, Seo Jae-hee, Kim Jae-hwa', null, 'A bodyguard hides in a village as a kindergarten teacher to avoid her boss'' enemies – but faces a new challenge in a skeptical strawberry farmer!', 'A bodyguard hides in a village as a kindergarten teacher to avoid her boss'' enemies – but faces a new challenge in a skeptical strawberry farmer!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jG0hr4bvJM1iOEcScgav7zmMF5P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275593'),
  ('748981730417779373', 'Ms. Koizumi Loves Ramen Noodles', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ayana Taketatsu, Ayane Sakura, Akari Kito, Yumi Hara', null, 'Koizumi is a mysterious and attractive high school student. But what most people don''t know about her is that she''s a ramen master who is always on the lookout for great ramen restaurants. Everyday, she goes hunting for real-life places serving the best ramen dishes and delightfully eats the delicious noodles. The way Koizumi downs a giant bowl of ramen–more adeptly than any large man–will amaze and delight you!', 'Koizumi is a mysterious and attractive high school student. But what most people don''t know about her is that she''s a ramen master who is always on the lookout for great ramen restaurants. Everyday, she goes hunting for real-life places serving the best ramen dishes and delightfully eats the delicious noodles. The way Koizumi downs a giant bowl of ramen–more adeptly than any large man–will amaze and delight you!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sg1vYwdCLBrBrcwwQIWwFD52qlX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75793'),
  ('461262710882691171', 'Ms. Marvel', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Bisha K. Ali', 'Aisha Bhoori, Kate Gritmon', 'Iman Vellani, Matt Lintz, Yasmeen Fletcher, Zenobia Shroff, Mohan Kapur, Saagar Shaikh, Rish Shah', 'TV-14', 'A great student, avid gamer, and voracious fan-fic scribe, Kamala Khan has a special affinity for superheroes, particularly Captain Marvel. However, she struggles to fit in at home and at school — that is, until she gets superpowers like the heroes she’s always looked up to. Life is easier with superpowers, right?', 'A great student, avid gamer, and voracious fan-fic scribe, Kamala Khan has a special affinity for superheroes, particularly Captain Marvel. However, she struggles to fit in at home and at school — that is, until she gets superpowers like the heroes she’s always looked up to. Life is easier with superpowers, right?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HWWh92kZbD7odwJX7nKmXNZsYo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92782'),
  ('503679123918491339', 'Ms. Sweet', 2019, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Elena Podkaminskaya, Vasilina Yuskovets, Aleksandr Pankratov-Chyornyy, Dmitry Lysenkov, Kseniya Teplova, Danila Dunaev, Aleksandr Konstantinov, Elena Valyushkina', null, 'Vera''s life was like a fairy tale with a loving husband, smart and beautiful daughter, caring father, and her favorite hobby, baking desserts. When her husband cheats on her with her young neighbor, she decides to leave him and turn her baking hobby into a business.', 'Vera''s life was like a fairy tale with a loving husband, smart and beautiful daughter, caring father, and her favorite hobby, baking desserts. When her husband cheats on her with her young neighbor, she decides to leave him and turn her baking hobby into a business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBqlrehZmfmR2imjoYXGYBtKnou.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:86936'),
  ('239224534637127787', 'Ms. Temper & Nam Jung Gi', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kang Eun-kyung', 'Joo Hyun, Lim Hye-min', 'Lee Yo-won, Yoon Sang-hyun, Hwang Chan-sung, Im Ha-ryong, Son Jong-hak, Song Jae-hee, You Chea-myung, Kim Sun-young', null, 'Ok Da-Jung is the youngest team leader in the cosmetics industry. She has divorced three times so far. She doesn''t care what others think about her and she also has quite a temper. Nam Jung-Gi works as a section chief at the same cosmetics company as Ok Da-Jung. Unlike her, Nam Jung-Gi has a timid and nice personality. He can''t say anything that makes others uncomfortable. He is able to make Ok Da-Jung''s blood boil.', 'Ok Da-Jung is the youngest team leader in the cosmetics industry. She has divorced three times so far. She doesn''t care what others think about her and she also has quite a temper. Nam Jung-Gi works as a section chief at the same cosmetics company as Ok Da-Jung. Unlike her, Nam Jung-Gi has a timid and nice personality. He can''t say anything that makes others uncomfortable. He is able to make Ok Da-Jung''s blood boil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muBaNgGA4UpYB7c7kf3mMOd4PHB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65831'),
  ('1086564013963484332', 'Ms. Vampire Who Lives in My Neighborhood.', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Miyu Tomita, Rina Hidaka, Yu Sasahara, Lynn, Aya Uchida', 'TV-14', 'The modern-day vampire comedy centers on high school girl Amano, who was saved from a strange incident by a vampire girl named Sophie Twilight, and has been interested in her ever since. Akari arrives at her house uninvited and the two start to live together. Although a vampire, Sophie never attacks humans, but purchases blood and anime goods via mail and lives a modern life.', 'The modern-day vampire comedy centers on high school girl Amano, who was saved from a strange incident by a vampire girl named Sophie Twilight, and has been interested in her ever since. Akari arrives at her house uninvited and the two start to live together. Although a vampire, Sophie never attacks humans, but purchases blood and anime goods via mail and lives a modern life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/An76xFiqgurA6rYDU5j0bvQZxyH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82736'),
