  ('353690366277835817', 'Muamma', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Shaqielle Khan', 'Imran Nazir', 'Saba Qamar, Usman Mukhtar, Ali Ansari, Shehzad Sheikh, Nimra Shahid, Syed Jibran, Anoushay Abbasi, Nabeel Zuberi', null, 'Set inside an old, imposing house owned by Jahan Ara, the story unfolds as different tenants enter her world each burdened with personal trauma, marital conflicts, and unspoken desires. What appears to be a calm domestic setting slowly transforms into a psychological battlefield, where kindness carries hidden motives and relationships begin to fracture under silent pressure.', 'Set inside an old, imposing house owned by Jahan Ara, the story unfolds as different tenants enter her world each burdened with personal trauma, marital conflicts, and unspoken desires. What appears to be a calm domestic setting slowly transforms into a psychological battlefield, where kindness carries hidden motives and relationships begin to fracture under silent pressure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEzi8mM9hnPMpGhDnzNRMfmCBwO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:309105'),
  ('479436809062724790', 'Muchachada Nui', 2007, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Joaquín Reyes', null, 'Joaquín Reyes', null, 'Muchachada Nui is a Spanish TV show, consisting of unrelated sketches that use absurd and surrealistic humor. It is broadcast on "La 2 de Televisión Española". It is the sequel of La hora Chanante, that first aired on Paramount Comedy.', 'Muchachada Nui is a Spanish TV show, consisting of unrelated sketches that use absurd and surrealistic humor. It is broadcast on "La 2 de Televisión Española". It is the sequel of La hora Chanante, that first aired on Paramount Comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gI12Ylugd2XXYje5g7jsef4zEUs.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:7664'),
