  ('861954117884474731', 'My Husband is a Cartoonist', 2010, 'Drama', null, 'Mutsumi Yamamoto', 'Nao Matsushita, Osamu Mukai, Yoko Nogiwa, Ren Osugi, Yuko Kotegawa, Yui Aoya, Mari Hoshino, Rika Adachi', null, 'The 82nd NHK Asadora is Gegege no Nyobo. The story is based on a 2008 autobiography by Mura Nunoe, the wife of Gegege no Kitaro mangaka Mizuki Shigeru. The story revolves around the life of the married couple, told from the perspective of Mura. --Tokyograph', 'The 82nd NHK Asadora is Gegege no Nyobo. The story is based on a 2008 autobiography by Mura Nunoe, the wife of Gegege no Kitaro mangaka Mizuki Shigeru. The story revolves around the life of the married couple, told from the perspective of Mura. --Tokyograph', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2f95ckWlSNV6yga4bIJRNsy3NtH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46222'),
  ('84080560238644703', 'My Husband Is A Mafia Boss', 2026, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Joseph Marco, Rhen Escaño, Ara Mina, Priscilla Meirelles, Simon Ibarra, Roberta Angela Tamondong, Hazel Calawod, Kelley Day', null, 'Join the sweet and naïve Aemie as she navigates married life with mafia boss husband Zeke, and the dangerous world she’s about to enter.', 'Join the sweet and naïve Aemie as she navigates married life with mafia boss husband Zeke, and the dangerous world she’s about to enter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijwWZukI5z03nMFqeh9hL4zirIl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316278'),
  ('1125753802469644886', 'My Husband Won''t Fit', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Natsumi Ishibashi, Aoi Nakamura, Machiko Ono, Satoru Matsuo, Motoki Ochiai, Mariko Tsutsui, Harumi Shikata, Tomiyuki Kunihiro', null, 'Kumiko and Kenichi meet in college and build a happy marriage together. But over time, an unusual problem threatens to destroy their relationship.', 'Kumiko and Kenichi meet in college and build a happy marriage together. But over time, an unusual problem threatens to destroy their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flN89AS1bvNCruuxCUceZGoEwOM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87815'),
  ('468728954214395562', 'My Husband, Mr. Oh!', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Yoo Yoon-kyung', 'Kim Kang-woo, Uee, Jung Sang-hoon, Han Seon-hwa, Park Jung-soo, Seol Jung-hwan, Park Min-ji, Han Sang-jin', null, 'Han Seung-Joo is a single woman in her mid 30''s and she works as a PD at a broadcasting station. She does well at her job, but she is not nearly as good when it comes to housework. Han Seung-Joo has a hard time dealing with social prejudices about single women. To get the position of a "married woman," Han Seung-Joo marries Oh Jak-Doo who lives in the mountain. Their marriage is not based on love, but their relationship develops romantically.', 'Han Seung-Joo is a single woman in her mid 30''s and she works as a PD at a broadcasting station. She does well at her job, but she is not nearly as good when it comes to housework. Han Seung-Joo has a hard time dealing with social prejudices about single women. To get the position of a "married woman," Han Seung-Joo marries Oh Jak-Doo who lives in the mountain. Their marriage is not based on love, but their relationship develops romantically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7F8D7ls0HBzIaGSbmO4WbPhWdtx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77286'),
  ('369841827140849426', 'My ID is Gangnam Beauty', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Choi Soo-young', 'Im Soo-hyang, Cha Eun-woo, Shin Jun-seop, Jo Woo-ri, Kwak Dong-yeon, Park Joo-mi, Kim Ji-min, Lee Tae-seon', null, 'Bullied for her looks, Mi-rae gets plastic surgery hoping for a better kind of life but faces new challenges in college. Based on a hit Korean webtoon.', 'Bullied for her looks, Mi-rae gets plastic surgery hoping for a better kind of life but faces new challenges in college. Based on a hit Korean webtoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lj40cE1DhW9jBe07fOI18MDQDK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80737'),
  ('776820377775116083', 'My Instant Death Ability Is Overpowered', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Miyu Tomita, Tomoko Kaneda, Yui Horie, Sayaka Kikuchi, Kiyono Yasuno, Aina Suzuki, Shohei Komatsu', 'TV-14', 'Yogiri Takatou missed a few things during his nap. When he wakes up, he finds out that he and his entire class are in another word and must now team up with Tomochika and fend off danger with his Instant Death ability. If he can keep his eyes open, that is...', 'Yogiri Takatou missed a few things during his nap. When he wakes up, he finds out that he and his entire class are in another word and must now team up with Tomochika and fend off danger with his Instant Death ability. If he can keep his eyes open, that is...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqklWX3bDMrFx5bmV1kuGuMuo27.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236144'),
  ('733582054286162997', 'My Isekai Life: I Gained a Second Character Class and Became the Strongest Sage in the World!', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chiaki Kobayashi, Azumi Waki, Wataru Takagi, Hikaru Tono, Mai Kanno, Haruna Mikawa, Erisa Kuon, Nichika Omori', 'TV-14', 'Whether at the office or at home, corporate drone Yuji Sano works all the time. So when his home PC flashes a message about him being summoned to another world, Yuji restarts his machine…only to find that he’s inadvertently accepted the summons! Now in a fantasy world far removed from paperwork and computers, Yuji has just one thing on his mind: waking up from what he thinks is a dream and getting back to the mountain of work he left behind! But this other world has other plans for Yuji, who quickly discovers his Monster Tamer character class allows him to befriend slimes! And thanks to their number, those slimes help him absorb so much magical knowledge that he gains a second character class in the blink of an eye! How will Yuji wield his power now that he’s the greatest sage the realm has ever known?! And what about all that paperwork?!', 'Whether at the office or at home, corporate drone Yuji Sano works all the time. So when his home PC flashes a message about him being summoned to another world, Yuji restarts his machine…only to find that he’s inadvertently accepted the summons! Now in a fantasy world far removed from paperwork and computers, Yuji has just one thing on his mind: waking up from what he thinks is a dream and getting back to the mountain of work he left behind! But this other world has other plans for Yuji, who quickly discovers his Monster Tamer character class allows him to befriend slimes! And thanks to their number, those slimes help him absorb so much magical knowledge that he gains a second character class in the blink of an eye! How will Yuji wield his power now that he’s the greatest sage the realm has ever known?! And what about all that paperwork?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2frM5EXhvwPLnD0eY7RaGCktPTv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117889'),
  ('707361107368148697', 'My Journey To You', 2023, 'Drama', null, 'Alice.L, Wu Lizhu, Edward Guo', 'Yu Shuxin, Zhang Linghe, Ryan Cheng, Lu Yuxiao, Jolin Jin, Sun Chenjun, Tian Jiarui', null, 'Yun Wei Shan, a spy longing for freedom, infiltrates the palace to complete a mission. Within the eerie and mysterious palace, she encounters love and friendship, embarks on a journey of self-discovery, and finds the determination to move forward. Together with the rebellious nobleman Gong Ziyu, they grow and mature through their shared experiences.', 'Yun Wei Shan, a spy longing for freedom, infiltrates the palace to complete a mission. Within the eerie and mysterious palace, she encounters love and friendship, embarks on a journey of self-discovery, and finds the determination to move forward. Together with the rebellious nobleman Gong Ziyu, they grow and mature through their shared experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkhWfnBNf6oVEmiLzccZTvafWA6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226186'),
  ('198514954556194648', 'My Kitchen Rules', 2010, 'Reality', null, null, 'Colin Fassnidge, Manu Feildel', 'TV-G', 'My Kitchen Rules is an Australian competitive cooking game show broadcast on the Seven Network since 2010. The series is produced by the team who created the Seven reality show My Restaurant Rules, and was put into production based on the success of Network Ten''s MasterChef Australia. My Kitchen Rules has just been renewed by the Seven Network for a fifth series.', 'My Kitchen Rules is an Australian competitive cooking game show broadcast on the Seven Network since 2010. The series is produced by the team who created the Seven reality show My Restaurant Rules, and was put into production based on the success of Network Ten''s MasterChef Australia. My Kitchen Rules has just been renewed by the Seven Network for a fifth series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puMIggVFjjziprH6Deq4jqz67PL.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:30745'),
  ('923926133913710900', 'My Lady Jane', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Gemma Burgess', null, 'Emily Bader, Edward Bluemel, Anna Chancellor, Rob Brydon, Kate O''Flynn, Henry Ashton, Oliver Chris, Dominic Cooper', 'TV-14', 'Gird your loins for the tragic tale of Lady Jane Grey, the young Tudor noblewoman who was Queen of England for nine days and then beheaded, back in good ol’ 1553. Actually... f*ck that. We’re retelling history the way it should have happened: the damsel in distress saves herself. This is an epic tale of true love and high adventure set in an alt-universe of action, history, fantasy, comedy, romance, and rompy-pompy. Buckle up.', 'Gird your loins for the tragic tale of Lady Jane Grey, the young Tudor noblewoman who was Queen of England for nine days and then beheaded, back in good ol’ 1553. Actually... f*ck that. We’re retelling history the way it should have happened: the damsel in distress saves herself. This is an epic tale of true love and high adventure set in an alt-universe of action, history, fantasy, comedy, romance, and rompy-pompy. Buckle up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qX68uGVJwxQ0B0sPZBEGikWRmA6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203413'),
  ('477688185789880258', 'My Lawyer, Mr. Jo', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'Choi Wan-gyu', 'Park Shin-yang, Ko Hyun-jung, Lee Min-ji, Byun Hee-bong, Jo Dal-hwan, Lee Mi-do, Jung Jun-won, Moon Soo-bin', null, 'Jo Deul-Ho, who came from a poor family background, is a promising prosecutor, but he can''t ignore the corruption at his workplace. He becomes a whistle-blower and loses everything. Jo Deul-Ho then works to become a lawyer.', 'Jo Deul-Ho, who came from a poor family background, is a promising prosecutor, but he can''t ignore the corruption at his workplace. He becomes a whistle-blower and loses everything. Jo Deul-Ho then works to become a lawyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dg9oQ7evGEAZEiB6uqeTaZgEY9o.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65895'),
  ('42482898732645385', 'My Lethal Man', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Li Mozhi, Fan Zhixin, Li Yizhen, Chang Zhekuan, Li Xinran, Wang Xudong, Li Bin, Qiu Dingjie', null, 'Due to an unexpected kidnapping case, Shen Manning crosses paths with Zhuang Xinyan. After Zhuang Xinyan''s death, the powerful and mysterious Yan Xingcheng forces Shen Manning into a new life as his fiancée. Despite starting off as adversaries, they gradually come to trust and rely on one another as they face various challenges together. Along the way, they uncover the truth behind a long-unsolved case from 17 years ago.', 'Due to an unexpected kidnapping case, Shen Manning crosses paths with Zhuang Xinyan. After Zhuang Xinyan''s death, the powerful and mysterious Yan Xingcheng forces Shen Manning into a new life as his fiancée. Despite starting off as adversaries, they gradually come to trust and rely on one another as they face various challenges together. Along the way, they uncover the truth behind a long-unsolved case from 17 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykKbuBoY3pf1lvjpfhWfrS1NTxY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218238'),
  ('5497650506817308', 'My Liberation Notes', 2022, 'Drama', 'Park Hae-young, Kim Sok-yun', 'Park Hae-young', 'Lee Min-ki, Kim Ji-won, Son Suk-ku, Lee El, Cheon Ho-jin, Lee Ki-woo, Jeon Hye-jin, Park Soo-young', null, 'Three siblings, exhausted by the monotony of day-to-day adulthood, seek to find fulfillment and freedom from their unremarkable lives.', 'Three siblings, exhausted by the monotony of day-to-day adulthood, seek to find fulfillment and freedom from their unremarkable lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olmfFeKZyQoTwj9Zo3Y5IUaioPB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154887'),
  ('739822714406301064', 'My Life as a Rolling Stone', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Mick Jagger, Keith Richards, Ronnie Wood, Charlie Watts', null, 'One by one the extraordinary, exhilarating stories of each of The Rolling Stones are vividly told with exclusive interviews from the band and a stellar cast of rock stars.', 'One by one the extraordinary, exhilarating stories of each of The Rolling Stones are vividly told with exclusive interviews from the band and a stellar cast of rock stars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o982ok3ptXbRnRapkciV38OA19d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205259'),
  ('195607223297042766', 'My Life as a Teenage Robot', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Rob Renzetti', null, 'Janice Kawaye, Candi Milo, Chad Doreck, Audrey Wasilewski, Quinton Flynn', 'TV-Y7', 'Jenny, aka XJ-9, is a super-powered robot with a super-sensitive teenage heart. Her primary function is protecting the planet from disaster, but – like all teenagers – she has her own ideas about how she would like to live her life. Bored with being a superhero, Jenny wants to do something really exciting – like go to high school!', 'Jenny, aka XJ-9, is a super-powered robot with a super-sensitive teenage heart. Her primary function is protecting the planet from disaster, but – like all teenagers – she has her own ideas about how she would like to live her life. Bored with being a superhero, Jenny wants to do something really exciting – like go to high school!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHucEYE9gZDCqQA1tZeCJe9x0JN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:178'),
  ('586061887348863323', 'My Life as Inukai-san''s Dog.', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shuichiro Umeda, Saya Aizawa, Mayu Sagara, Yurie Kozakai', 'TV-MA', 'The story follows the protagonist who wakes up one day transformed as Pochita, a pet dog of his cool and beautiful classmate Karen Inukai.', 'The story follows the protagonist who wakes up one day transformed as Pochita, a pet dog of his cool and beautiful classmate Karen Inukai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1rMliOKZXpsY9SP6ZgCfSmhaxC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195081'),
  ('703609114293379384', 'My Life in Film', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Mark Chappell', null, 'Kris Marshall, Alice Lowe, Andrew Scott', null, 'Art is an independent film-maker with big ideas... sadly nobody will listen to these ideas, with the exception of his best friend Jones. The series follows Art as his overactive imagination turns every day into a cinematic classic, with homages to ''Top Gun'' and ''The Shining'' to name but a few.', 'Art is an independent film-maker with big ideas... sadly nobody will listen to these ideas, with the exception of his best friend Jones. The series follows Art as his overactive imagination turns every day into a cinematic classic, with homages to ''Top Gun'' and ''The Shining'' to name but a few.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYZL29Y2eTSFrCyxbpnrH1v3vSn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6271'),
  ('1131715857809004127', 'My Life Is Murder', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Comedy', 'Claire Tonkin, Rick Maier', null, 'Lucy Lawless, Ebony Vagulans', null, 'Investigator Alexa Crowe, cannot help fighting the good fight – whether it is solving murders or combatting the small frustrations of everyday life. Fearless and unapologetic, Alexa''s unique skills and insights into the darker quirks of human nature, allows her to provoke, comfort and push the right buttons as she unravels the truth behind the most baffling of crimes.', 'Investigator Alexa Crowe, cannot help fighting the good fight – whether it is solving murders or combatting the small frustrations of everyday life. Fearless and unapologetic, Alexa''s unique skills and insights into the darker quirks of human nature, allows her to provoke, comfort and push the right buttons as she unravels the truth behind the most baffling of crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRdSW7Jg4e2RLABpliOKlu181.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:91267'),
  ('980286368034864174', 'My Life with the Walter Boys', 2023, 'Drama', 'Melanie Halsall', null, 'Nikki Rodriguez, Noah LaLonde, Ashby Gentry, Johnny Link, Corey Fogelmanis, Connor Stanhope, Jaylan Evans, Sarah Rafferty', 'TV-14', 'When a tragedy disrupts her life, a teen moves in with her guardian''s big family in a small town and learns new lessons about love, hope and friendship.', 'When a tragedy disrupts her life, a teen moves in with her guardian''s big family in a small town and learns new lessons about love, hope and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jg3YdxDNlxay0NWTxgAPif647Hj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:199001'),
  ('6995672356362256', 'My Little Baby', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Oh Ji-ho, Kim Min-jae, Nam Ji-hyun, Lee Soo-kyung, Jeong Soo-young, Koh Soo-hee, Tae Hang-ho', null, 'Cha Jung Han is a detective for a special investigation team. He is busy with investigating violent cases including drugs and gangs, but one day he takes in his niece, Eun Ae and struggles to raise her. Meanwhile, Han Ye Seul is a single mother who raises her 5-years-old son alone. She is Cha Jung-Han’s first love.', 'Cha Jung Han is a detective for a special investigation team. He is busy with investigating violent cases including drugs and gangs, but one day he takes in his niece, Eun Ae and struggles to raise her. Meanwhile, Han Ye Seul is a single mother who raises her 5-years-old son alone. She is Cha Jung-Han’s first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teh4a6VOo7nZWeojl8eEfQsOMQG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65791'),
  ('259131462940219415', 'My Little Girl', 2018, 'Drama', 'Gökçen Usta, Merve Girgin, Fatih Aksoy', null, 'Beren Gökyıldız, Buğra Gülsoy, Leyla Lydia Tuğutlu, Sinem Ünsal, Suna Selen, Tugay Mercan, Serhat Teoman', 'TV-PG', 'Eight-year-old Öykü is an exceptional little girl, who unlike her peers is very empathetic and perceptive of the world around her. When her aunt, who has been her caregiver since birth, abandons her, Öykü will have to find her father, Demir. Unfortunately Demir, an irresponsible adult and a swindler who grew up in an orphanage, gets arrested the day Öykü comes to find him. Demir is released by the court on the condition that he takes care of his daughter, but Demir does not want to live with Öykü, whom he has just met - Demir and his partner-in-crime Ugur try to get rid of Öykü as they prepare for a big job. Their target, Candan has a seemingly quiet life, which only conceals her painful past. Fate will bring these people together, but none know that Öykü has a secret she cannot tell anyone.', 'Eight-year-old Öykü is an exceptional little girl, who unlike her peers is very empathetic and perceptive of the world around her. When her aunt, who has been her caregiver since birth, abandons her, Öykü will have to find her father, Demir. Unfortunately Demir, an irresponsible adult and a swindler who grew up in an orphanage, gets arrested the day Öykü comes to find him. Demir is released by the court on the condition that he takes care of his daughter, but Demir does not want to live with Öykü, whom he has just met - Demir and his partner-in-crime Ugur try to get rid of Öykü as they prepare for a big job. Their target, Candan has a seemingly quiet life, which only conceals her painful past. Fate will bring these people together, but none know that Öykü has a secret she cannot tell anyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YfCSLOOQ8Me6y5CnTQfNsdz0ax.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82369'),
  ('663301253825257802', 'My Little Happiness', 2021, 'Drama', 'Yang Long', null, 'Xing Fei, Tang Xiaotian, Huang Yilin, Li Chuan, Fu Weilun, Wang Mohan, Yang Anqi, Liu Chang', 'TV-14', 'A story of urban workplace romance follows a legal intern and a surgeon who reunite as adults. They become colleagues and neighbors. As evenly matched as they are, a relationship starts to blossom.', 'A story of urban workplace romance follows a legal intern and a surgeon who reunite as adults. They become colleagues and neighbors. As evenly matched as they are, a relationship starts to blossom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVYSsIcltMoUiADQOissOjX3Xus.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116328'),
  ('1115076077860098207', 'My Little Lover - Minami Kun no Koibito', 2015, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Taishi Nakagawa, Maika Yamamoto, Mirai Suzuki, Erina Nakayama, Moe Sasaki, Ai Yoshikawa, Naomi Akimoto, Koichi Ohori', null, 'Shun''ichi Minami possesses good looks and does well academically in high school. Chiyomi Horikiri is a bright girl who likes dancing. They were childhood friends and also their first loves, but after Shun''ichi Minami''s father disappeared they hardly talk. On a storming night, Chiyomi Horikiri has an argument with her parents over her future course and leaves home. While trying to avoid the rain, Chiyomi Horikiri wishes that she go back to her childhood. Suddenly, Chiyomi becomes 15 cm tall. Shun''ichi Minami happens to see tiny Chiyomi Horikiri. She tells him that she doesn''t want anyone else to see her, and Shun''ichi Minami takes her his home.', 'Shun''ichi Minami possesses good looks and does well academically in high school. Chiyomi Horikiri is a bright girl who likes dancing. They were childhood friends and also their first loves, but after Shun''ichi Minami''s father disappeared they hardly talk. On a storming night, Chiyomi Horikiri has an argument with her parents over her future course and leaves home. While trying to avoid the rain, Chiyomi Horikiri wishes that she go back to her childhood. Suddenly, Chiyomi becomes 15 cm tall. Shun''ichi Minami happens to see tiny Chiyomi Horikiri. She tells him that she doesn''t want anyone else to see her, and Shun''ichi Minami takes her his home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjDTfkyZbeIZBVljC2bDVkqubSu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65778'),
  ('295965891585492573', 'My Little Monster', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Haruka Tomatsu, Takuma Terashima, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Kana Hanazawa, Atsumi Tanezaki, Yuichi Nakamura, Ryota Osaka, Tomoyuki Higuchi', 'TV-14', 'Mizutani Shizuku finds peace in her studies. Working hard to stay at the top of the class, alone but focused. When she is tasked with delivering class materials to Yoshida Haru, her world starts to rapidly expand. With some new friends and feelings, will she be able to stay focused on her studies?', 'Mizutani Shizuku finds peace in her studies. Working hard to stay at the top of the class, alone but focused. When she is tasked with delivering class materials to Yoshida Haru, her world starts to rapidly expand. With some new friends and feelings, will she be able to stay focused on her studies?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKCY7dUsEDdWvdftQJQoWkV3lFT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46041'),
  ('973471969501779984', 'My Little Old Boy', 2016, 'Reality, Talk', 'Kwak Seung-young', 'Im Chae-yoon', 'Shin Dong-yup, Seo Jang-hoon', null, 'How much do you know about your grown up son? In Mom’s Diary, the daily lives of the grown up celebrity sons are closely observed by their mothers. Do you know why your son drinks so much these days? How much do you know about your son’s philosophy in his life style? Heart-warming moments of observational communication between a mother and a son can be seen on Mom’s Diary.', 'How much do you know about your grown up son? In Mom’s Diary, the daily lives of the grown up celebrity sons are closely observed by their mothers. Do you know why your son drinks so much these days? How much do you know about your son’s philosophy in his life style? Heart-warming moments of observational communication between a mother and a son can be seen on Mom’s Diary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgeWRIiigNHLxy3qEzM0HqNcFHT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72896'),
  ('759277686165197260', 'My Little One', 2018, 'Reality', '陈歆宇, 王鹏飞', null, 'Qi Sijun, Xiao Lu, Jin Mengjia, Songwei Li', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6a1c0PzVrJZwVWIWIoM2qMgHKFG.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:196747'),
  ('217068234417674756', 'My Little Pony', 1986, 'Animation, Kids, Family', null, null, 'Jennifer Darling, David Mendenhall, Mona Marshall, Russi Taylor, Nancy Cartwright, Bettina Bush, Katie Leigh, Tress MacNeille', 'TV-Y', 'Ponyland is the home of all your favorite classic Little Ponies. Together, they live a life of games, songs and harmony with allies like the Bushwoolies and Furbobs. But, occasionally, there are problems in Ponyland and the Little Ponies of Paradise Estate must face evil witches, goblins, Stone Backs, Grundles and more!', 'Ponyland is the home of all your favorite classic Little Ponies. Together, they live a life of games, songs and harmony with allies like the Bushwoolies and Furbobs. But, occasionally, there are problems in Ponyland and the Little Ponies of Paradise Estate must face evil witches, goblins, Stone Backs, Grundles and more!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkVztC8YKR8JSIHgwRWD5boViBJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:345'),
  ('303616279637636658', 'My Little Pony Tales', 1992, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Laura Harris, Willow Johnson, Lalainia Lindbjerg, Maggie O''Hara, Kelly Sheridan, Chiara Zanni', 'TV-Y', 'Ponyland is full of excitement, if you know where to find it! Join the 7 Pony Friends—Starlight, Sweetheart, Melody, Bright Eyes, Patch, Clover and Bon Bon — for games, picnics, ice cream shops, roller derbies and even UFOs… nothing is off-limits when it comes to grand Pony adventures!', 'Ponyland is full of excitement, if you know where to find it! Join the 7 Pony Friends—Starlight, Sweetheart, Melody, Bright Eyes, Patch, Clover and Bon Bon — for games, picnics, ice cream shops, roller derbies and even UFOs… nothing is off-limits when it comes to grand Pony adventures!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOfpfMHh4MCND77D3e6kMG634oR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:588'),
  ('1117820680350924129', 'My Little Pony: Equestria Girls', 2017, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Andrea Libman, Ashleigh Ball, Tara Strong, Tabitha St. Germain, Rebecca Shoichet', 'TV-Y', 'Full-time students and part-time magical pony-girls, the Equestria Girls are always ready to save the day with the Magic of Friendship!', 'Full-time students and part-time magical pony-girls, the Equestria Girls are always ready to save the day with the Magic of Friendship!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8AOYp9H2m18Ft8vcKJz0G3o5lE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72499'),
  ('238261399864791404', 'My Little Pony: Equestria Girls - Better Together', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Tabitha St. Germain, Ashleigh Ball, Tara Strong, Rebecca Shoichet, Andrea Libman, Cathy Weseluck', 'TV-Y', 'The magic of Equestria cannot be contained! It’s found its way into the world of the all new My Little Pony Equestria Girls Digital Series and it’s turning everything on its head. From after-school clubs to beach days, music festivals to theme parks, and a rockin’ Spring Break on a yacht, magic is sure making things interesting. Join Sunset Shimmer, Twilight Sparkle, Applejack, Fluttershy, Pinkie Pie, Rainbow Dash and Rarity as they learn what it means to be superheroes while they take on their biggest challenge yet: high school.', 'The magic of Equestria cannot be contained! It’s found its way into the world of the all new My Little Pony Equestria Girls Digital Series and it’s turning everything on its head. From after-school clubs to beach days, music festivals to theme parks, and a rockin’ Spring Break on a yacht, magic is sure making things interesting. Join Sunset Shimmer, Twilight Sparkle, Applejack, Fluttershy, Pinkie Pie, Rainbow Dash and Rarity as they learn what it means to be superheroes while they take on their biggest challenge yet: high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbp1U4GPjq39Mci6snHHrzQIhRh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86673'),
  ('751086726237654576', 'My Little Pony: Friendship Is Magic', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Lauren Faust', null, 'Tara Strong, Andrea Libman, Ashleigh Ball, Tabitha St. Germain, Cathy Weseluck, Michelle Creber, Claire Margaret Corlett, Madeleine Peters', 'TV-Y', 'Journey to the enchanted land of Equestria, where unicorn Twilight Sparkle and her pals have adventures and learn valuable lessons about friendship.', 'Journey to the enchanted land of Equestria, where unicorn Twilight Sparkle and her pals have adventures and learn valuable lessons about friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwW7WgJIjhBsnzk87Gyh6g9187m.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:33765'),
  ('1021606907963568056', 'My Little Pony: Make Your Mark', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Gillian M. Berrow', null, 'Jenna Warren, Ana Sani, Aj Bridel, Maitreyi Ramakrishnan, J.J. Gerber, Bahia Watson, Rob Tinkler, Athena Karkanis', 'TV-Y', 'Welcome back to Equestria, where pony magic is everywhere. With friends Zipp, Sunny, Izzy, Pipp and Hitch leading the way, adventure is sure to follow!', 'Welcome back to Equestria, where pony magic is everywhere. With friends Zipp, Sunny, Izzy, Pipp and Hitch leading the way, adventure is sure to follow!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMfq9hY6xaZO3N7tATL4maCiYh4.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:158691'),
  ('586243454911079347', 'My Little Pony: Pony Life', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', null, 'Katie Chilson, Whitney Ralls, Taneka Stotts', 'Tara Strong, Tabitha St. Germain, Ashleigh Ball, Andrea Libman', 'TV-Y', 'A look at the funny side of friendship. The new center of the world is Sugarcube Corner – just like going to a friend’s house after school, this is our ponies’ home away from home. Here, Pinkie Pie serves up frosted cupcakes to the best customers in the world— her friends!', 'A look at the funny side of friendship. The new center of the world is Sugarcube Corner – just like going to a friend’s house after school, this is our ponies’ home away from home. Here, Pinkie Pie serves up frosted cupcakes to the best customers in the world— her friends!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frfhYtzM5wVo0MfmEh7PaBlYPcR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:105313'),
  ('141525610444731252', 'My Little Princess', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yu Chung-chung', 'Xu Pengpeng', 'Zhang Yuxi, Mike Angelo, Kenji Chen, Du Yan, Lei Ko, William Liao, Deyn Li, Genie Chen', null, 'When you''re trying to win over your Prince Charming, can you find him in an unexpected place? Lin Xing Chen is an heiress of a wealthy family but faces pressure to marry well because of her illegitimate status. Her target? The wealthy Zheng Chu Yao, a fellow student at the elite arts school known as Four Leaf College. But due to a number of misunderstandings, Xing Chen at first mistakes the brooding Jiang Nian Yu as Chu Yao and tries to get his attention.', 'When you''re trying to win over your Prince Charming, can you find him in an unexpected place? Lin Xing Chen is an heiress of a wealthy family but faces pressure to marry well because of her illegitimate status. Her target? The wealthy Zheng Chu Yao, a fellow student at the elite arts school known as Four Leaf College. But due to a number of misunderstandings, Xing Chen at first mistakes the brooding Jiang Nian Yu as Chu Yao and tries to get his attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dF50P7UDtfMSw2J9WwbBmFgPANj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67477'),
  ('383740068764521865', 'My Lottery Dream Home', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, 'David Bromstad', 'TV-G', 'David Bromstad takes recent lottery winners on over-the-top house hunts for their new dream homes. Whether they win hundreds of thousands or hundreds of millions, lucky lottery winners everywhere are jumping headfirst into the real estate market. Will they spend all their winnings on an extravagant mansion or settle for a humble sound investment? Find out what happens when average Americans set out to find their Lottery Dream Homes.', 'David Bromstad takes recent lottery winners on over-the-top house hunts for their new dream homes. Whether they win hundreds of thousands or hundreds of millions, lucky lottery winners everywhere are jumping headfirst into the real estate market. Will they spend all their winnings on an extravagant mansion or settle for a humble sound investment? Find out what happens when average Americans set out to find their Lottery Dream Homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3jdkOvdg1HUCVElfOJfmpEuK3x.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:77684'),
  ('972483978249760994', 'My Love Eun Dong', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', null, 'Baek Mi-kyoung', 'Ju Jin-mo, Kim Sa-rang, Kim Tae-hun, Kim Yoo-ri, Baek Sung-hyun, Yoon So-hee, Jinyoung, Lee Ja-in', null, 'A renowned actor who is still pining over the loss of his first real love writes an autobiography about his memories of her, hoping to reconnect.', 'A renowned actor who is still pining over the loss of his first real love writes an autobiography about his memories of her, hoping to reconnect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1g7DQDoPgguyJC41NMweMtQsHly.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62838'),
  ('993110522193429402', 'My Love from the Star', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Park Ji-eun, Jang Tae-yoo', 'Park Ji-eun', 'Gianna Jun, Kim Soo-hyun, Park Hae-jin, Yoo In-na, Shin Sung-rok, Lee Jeong-kil, Kim Chang-wan, Na Young-hee', 'TV-14', 'An alien who came to Earth 400 years ago is almost able to return to his own planet, but when he meets a famous actress, he doesn''t want to go home.', 'An alien who came to Earth 400 years ago is almost able to return to his own planet, but when he meets a famous actress, he doesn''t want to go home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5EYVYCVtDUdajP4rWfv6q0BTmm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60957'),
  ('763424735446107857', 'My Love Mix-Up!', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Wataru Hinekure', null, 'Shunsuke Michieda, Ren Meguro, Riko Fukumoto, Jin Suzuki, Seiichi Tanabe, Ayumu Mochizuki, Zinpei Watanabe, Kosuke Hasebe', null, 'Aoki has a crush on Hashimoto, the girl in the seat next to him in class. But he despairs when he borrows her eraser and sees she''s written the name of another boy—Ida—on it. To make matters more confusing, Ida sees Aoki holding that very eraser and thinks Aoki has a crush on him!', 'Aoki has a crush on Hashimoto, the girl in the seat next to him in class. But he despairs when he borrows her eraser and sees she''s written the name of another boy—Ida—on it. To make matters more confusing, Ida sees Aoki holding that very eraser and thinks Aoki has a crush on him!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqLj1zL9ZFcL0znHmrJA6tTMejl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135929'),
  ('463817952597717422', 'My Love Mix-Up!', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Wataru Hinekure', null, 'Nattawat Jirochtikul, Norawit Titicharoenrak, Pathitta Pornchumroenrut, Puttipong Jitbut, Ochiris Suwanacheep', null, 'Atom has a crush on Matmee, but a mix-up over an eraser makes Kongthap think Atom likes him instead—leading to unexpected feelings and confusion.', 'Atom has a crush on Matmee, but a mix-up over an eraser makes Kongthap think Atom likes him instead—leading to unexpected feelings and confusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BpgAUwHWOOPv4tvKmY9MouKt9d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237339'),
  ('1062703134559115859', 'My Love Story with Yamada-kun at Lv999', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Inori Minase, Koki Uchiyama, Natsuki Hanae, Ai Kakuma, Saori Onishi, Nobuo Tobita, Rio Tsuchiya', 'TV-14', 'Recently dumped, Akane is just about to quit the game she used to play with her boyfriend, when she meets Yamada in the same RPG. Yamada in real life turns out to be somewhat of a legend. The only problem is - he is ONLY interested in the game. As Akane''s feelings grow, will Yamada''s focus stay on the game?', 'Recently dumped, Akane is just about to quit the game she used to play with her boyfriend, when she meets Yamada in the same RPG. Yamada in real life turns out to be somewhat of a legend. The only problem is - he is ONLY interested in the game. As Akane''s feelings grow, will Yamada''s focus stay on the game?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RTMDyXZpzACsSg5AcRSUHMO8m2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208067'),
  ('496571894064075425', 'My Love Story!!', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Takuya Eguchi, Megumi Han, Nobunaga Shimazaki', 'TV-14', 'Takeo Goda is a giant guy with a giant heart. Too bad the girls don''t want him! (They always go for his good-looking best friend, Makoto Sunakawa.) Used to being on the sidelines, Takeo simply stands tall and accepts his fate. But one day when he saves a girl named Rinko Yamato from a harasser on the train, his (love!) life suddenly takes an incredible turn! Takeo can hardly believe it when he crosses paths with Rinko again, and he finds himself falling in love with her... But with handsome Suna around, does Takeo even stand a chance?', 'Takeo Goda is a giant guy with a giant heart. Too bad the girls don''t want him! (They always go for his good-looking best friend, Makoto Sunakawa.) Used to being on the sidelines, Takeo simply stands tall and accepts his fate. But one day when he saves a girl named Rinko Yamato from a harasser on the train, his (love!) life suddenly takes an incredible turn! Takeo can hardly believe it when he crosses paths with Rinko again, and he finds himself falling in love with her... But with handsome Suna around, does Takeo even stand a chance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKvrM8WVOGcSSwIKFfsAxIuk6Nx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62565'),
  ('1000374526803740241', 'My Love, My Sin', 2004, 'Drama', 'Liliana Abud', null, 'Yadhira Carrillo, Sergio Sendel, Alessandra Rosaldo, Sylvia Pasquel, Tiaré Scanda, Erika Buenfil, Gabriela Goldsmith, Roberto Ballesteros', null, 'Amarte es mi Pecado'' is a Mexican telenovela that was transmitted in the year 2004. It is a production of Ernesto Alonso and the protagonists are Yadhira Carrillo, Alessandra Rosaldo and Sergio Sendel.', 'Amarte es mi Pecado'' is a Mexican telenovela that was transmitted in the year 2004. It is a production of Ernesto Alonso and the protagonists are Yadhira Carrillo, Alessandra Rosaldo and Sergio Sendel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qz0qAST2GGUljbyfTK8u0S4RxvB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16188'),
  ('250837759200423234', 'My Lovely Boxer', 2023, 'Drama', 'Choi Sang-yeol, Hong Eun-mi', null, 'Lee Sang-yeob, Kim So-hye, Kim Jin-woo, Park Ji-hwan, Kim Hyeong-mook, Yoon In-Jo, Ha Seung-lee, Chae Won-been', null, 'Vanished genius boxer Kwon-sook and cold-hearted agent Tae-young risk all to defy match-fixing''s clutches.', 'Vanished genius boxer Kwon-sook and cold-hearted agent Tae-young risk all to defy match-fixing''s clutches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WPAcBUKwmWllPh83XJfycToPxS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210705'),
  ('477354554978212008', 'My Lovely Girl', 2014, 'Drama', 'Park Hyung-ki', 'Seol Ji-No', 'Krystal Jung, Rain, Cha Ye-ryun, L, Gong Seung-yeon, Jo Hee-bong, Baek Seung-Heon, Kim Jin-woo', null, 'A man is tormented by the death of his girlfriend in an accident that occurred before his eyes, he decides to secretly help her sister fulfill her dream of becoming a songwriter.', 'A man is tormented by the death of his girlfriend in an accident that occurred before his eyes, he decides to secretly help her sister fulfill her dream of becoming a songwriter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMX9F8NRFkHupWrmCZ9yhkYv4Kj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61487'),
  ('814599753529745165', 'My Lovely Liar', 2023, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nam Sung-woo', 'Seo Jeong-eun', 'Kim So-hyun, Minhyun, Seo Ji-hoon, Lee Si-woo, Yun Ji-on, Nam Hyeon-woo, Ha Jong-woo, Park Kyung-hye', null, 'A woman who can''t trust people because of her ability to hear lies and a mystic composer who hid his indescribable identity, become involved in each other''s lives to uncover the truth.', 'A woman who can''t trust people because of her ability to hear lies and a mystic composer who hid his indescribable identity, become involved in each other''s lives to uncover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msYlN0cIpuTKlWYnEStdoBuHmvX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210781'),
  ('1054726715663495387', 'My Lovely Sam Soon', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Yun-cheol', 'Kim Do-woo', 'Kim Seon-a, Hyun Bin, Jung Ryeo-won, Daniel Henney, Kim Ja-ok, Lee Ah-hyeon, Na Moon-hee, Lee Kyu-han', null, 'Sam Soon is an average woman who dreams of falling in love with a perfect man. It''s a story of encouragement.', 'Sam Soon is an average woman who dreams of falling in love with a perfect man. It''s a story of encouragement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqam3HaYUdZH1uXB9BqwJ7UBeij.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5381'),
  ('869038834889980668', 'My Lucky Star', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Yi-Chun Pan, Dian-Run Liu, Yi-Ting Wang', 'Jimmy Lin Chih-Ying, Yoo Ha-na, Leon Jay Williams, Jennifer Hong, Peggy Fu, Cheng Bo-Ren, Lee Wei', null, 'Like the boy who cried wolf, Xia Zhi Xing had lied one too many times. So when she did tell the truth, nobody believed her except for the most unlikely person, Zhong Tian Qi, a runaway young master of a jewelry empire. His belief in her inspired her to become a real jewelry designer instead of a lying, scheming jewelry con artist. In the process, she taught him the real value of jewels that he is destined to inherit.', 'Like the boy who cried wolf, Xia Zhi Xing had lied one too many times. So when she did tell the truth, nobody believed her except for the most unlikely person, Zhong Tian Qi, a runaway young master of a jewelry empire. His belief in her inspired her to become a real jewelry designer instead of a lying, scheming jewelry con artist. In the process, she taught him the real value of jewels that he is destined to inherit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33Rmf3eSY3xCF4TBHxcYwmbqMXf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6710'),
  ('679459348263594327', 'My Mad Fat Diary', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rae Earl', 'Tom Bidwell', 'Sharon Rooney, Nico Mirallegro, Jodie Comer, Dan Cohen, Ciara Baxendale, Jordan Murphy, Darren Evans, Ian Hart', null, 'Set in 1996 in Lincolnshire, the show tells the tragic and humorous story of a very troubled young girl Rae, who has just left a psychiatric hospital, where she has spent four months after attempting suicide, begins to reconnect with her best friend Chloe and her group, who are unaware of Rae''s mental health and body image problems, believing she was in France for the past four months.', 'Set in 1996 in Lincolnshire, the show tells the tragic and humorous story of a very troubled young girl Rae, who has just left a psychiatric hospital, where she has spent four months after attempting suicide, begins to reconnect with her best friend Chloe and her group, who are unaware of Rae''s mental health and body image problems, believing she was in France for the past four months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxAaKVzxnGeXSrMjHMtzo523DaC.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:60616'),
  ('353564862085971295', 'My Magic Closet', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Sharon Cho, Kim Woojin, Lee Min Wook, Jae chan, Kim Jin-kwon, Pyong Lee, Júlia Rabello, Gabriel Coppola', 'TV-PG', 'Carol is a 17-year-old teenager, the daughter of a Brazilian dancer and a South Korean, who lives a challenging journey of overcoming, acceptance and self-knowledge after the death of her mother and the abandonment of her father, who decides to return to South Korea. In a conflicting relationship with her ancestry, she denies knowing any topic better than South Korean culture, but her life changes after a unique discovery: her wardrobe is actually a magic portal that connects her room to a group of k-pop of great success at the moment, ACT.', 'Carol is a 17-year-old teenager, the daughter of a Brazilian dancer and a South Korean, who lives a challenging journey of overcoming, acceptance and self-knowledge after the death of her mother and the abandonment of her father, who decides to return to South Korea. In a conflicting relationship with her ancestry, she denies knowing any topic better than South Korean culture, but her life changes after a unique discovery: her wardrobe is actually a magic portal that connects her room to a group of k-pop of great success at the moment, ACT.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWjxpuHyQSN54DuTxE6Yotpftds.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228277'),
  ('1057033182319560461', 'My Magic Prophecy', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Dawin', null, 'Jitaraphol Potiwihok, Tawinan Anukoolprasert, Save Saisawat, Naruth Prateeppravameta, Chompoopuntip Temtanamongkol, Kanaphan Puitrakul, Panachai Sriariyarungruang, Paythai Ploymeeka', null, 'A skeptical doctor and a fortune teller must hide from a shadowy threat in a remote village, where danger and romance intertwine.', 'A skeptical doctor and a fortune teller must hide from a shadowy threat in a remote village, where danger and romance intertwine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJXLfURFsU1Ga67QLMQbk8TBmHv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278162'),
  ('616122654709917841', 'My Man Is Cupid', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Heo Seong-hee', 'Heo Seong-hee', 'Jang Dong-yoon, Nana, Park Ki-woong, Moon Ji-hoo, Park Myung-hoon, Eom Se-ung, Gong Min-jeung, Lim Jae-myung', null, 'Star-crossed love story between a love fairy and a human girl. For humans and fairies aren’t meant to be, when he accidentally shoots himself and falls in love, their fate takes a wrong turn. The two reconnect after centuries of reincarnation. Where will this story lead?', 'Star-crossed love story between a love fairy and a human girl. For humans and fairies aren’t meant to be, when he accidentally shoots himself and falls in love, their fate takes a wrong turn. The two reconnect after centuries of reincarnation. Where will this story lead?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ij2dlIzdEJa09Am7nxEoJbEjYcN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155040'),
  ('167322884692508668', 'My Marriage', 2001, null, null, null, 'Vivian Hsu, Shunsuke Nakamura, Shima Iwashita, Saki Takaoka, Norito Yashima, Judy Ongg', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQh60gm77pdMLqdh9ht4dJGinwz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:289450'),
  ('263153946749823060', 'My Marriage Partner Is My Student, a Cocky Troublemaker', 2017, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Rina Honnizumi, Tetsuto Furuwaka, Tarusuke Shingaki', null, 'Teacher Nano Saikawa hasn''t given much thought to marriage, but her father''s friend wants her to have a marriage interview with his son, Souichirou Takamiya. After the interview, they spend the day together. As they gradually become more comfortable with one another, Souichirou asks for her hand in marriage. Things quickly heat up between them, and the two wind up in bed together. However, when she removes his glasses, she discovers he is not Souichirou; he is actually one of her problem students, Souji Kuga! Souji''s explanation is watertight: when he realized his brother was to be Nano''s intended, Souji posed as him in order to be with her. And what''s more, he is even confident that his family will approve of their marriage. However, an illicit relationship with a student is the last thing Nano wants. But will she be able to resist his charms, especially when her body begins to ache for his?.', 'Teacher Nano Saikawa hasn''t given much thought to marriage, but her father''s friend wants her to have a marriage interview with his son, Souichirou Takamiya. After the interview, they spend the day together. As they gradually become more comfortable with one another, Souichirou asks for her hand in marriage. Things quickly heat up between them, and the two wind up in bed together. However, when she removes his glasses, she discovers he is not Souichirou; he is actually one of her problem students, Souji Kuga! Souji''s explanation is watertight: when he realized his brother was to be Nano''s intended, Souji posed as him in order to be with her. And what''s more, he is even confident that his family will approve of their marriage. However, an illicit relationship with a student is the last thing Nano wants. But will she be able to resist his charms, especially when her body begins to ache for his?.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hK2xyIPdTD3cGgjxnebjRiueqCQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74180'),
  ('306596447022000102', 'My Marvellous Dream Is You', 2024, 'Drama', 'Chao Planoy', null, 'Kanyaphat Na Nakhon, Yada Watcharamusik, Prompatcha Sanitwong Na Ayutthaya, Neilinyah Taweearayapat, Rawintera Phanpatthana, Sarochini Phetamphai, Orntara Poolsak, Asavarid Pinitkanjanapun', null, 'I''m Dawan. Since I can remember, I have always had strange dreams about a quiet girl who often played with me in my dreams. One day, a new neighbor moved in, and that led to my family falling apart. My father ran away with the man next door, who turned out to be the father of Khimhan the quiet and small girl from next door. Initially, we were not close at all, but circumstances brought us closer and made us understand each other. However, Khimhan was unaware that while in the real world we were just friends, in my dreams, she and I did things that went far beyond that. So, I kept my feelings concealed because I couldn''t let her know. I never realized that in those dreams, I was not the only one dreaming.', 'I''m Dawan. Since I can remember, I have always had strange dreams about a quiet girl who often played with me in my dreams. One day, a new neighbor moved in, and that led to my family falling apart. My father ran away with the man next door, who turned out to be the father of Khimhan the quiet and small girl from next door. Initially, we were not close at all, but circumstances brought us closer and made us understand each other. However, Khimhan was unaware that while in the real world we were just friends, in my dreams, she and I did things that went far beyond that. So, I kept my feelings concealed because I couldn''t let her know. I never realized that in those dreams, I was not the only one dreaming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ry8hTSyaLqHFlylSoYsItxhtV25.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250957'),
  ('668432888106522260', 'My Master Has No Tail', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mao Ichimichi, Hibiku Yamamura, Lynn, Takuya Eguchi, Ayumu Murase, Natsuki Aikawa, Ikumi Hasegawa, Yuuichirou Umehara', 'TV-14', 'Mameda is a tanuki who was born in the wrong era - all she wants is to trick humans, but that age of tanuki shenanigans is over. But one woman, a rakugo master named Bunko, shows Mameda it''s still possible to cast magic on humans...only with words, not illusions. Mameda is determined to become Bunko''s apprentice, but can she convince the stoic master to take her on...?', 'Mameda is a tanuki who was born in the wrong era - all she wants is to trick humans, but that age of tanuki shenanigans is over. But one woman, a rakugo master named Bunko, shows Mameda it''s still possible to cast magic on humans...only with words, not illusions. Mameda is determined to become Bunko''s apprentice, but can she convince the stoic master to take her on...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88ccdyBEYrel6rMQyAR9EbxFk06.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130456'),
  ('231619670216007670', 'My Melody & Kuromi', 2025, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Rei Sakuma, Junko Takeuchi, Megumi Han, Kenji Nojima, Gakuto Kajiwara, Noboru Maeda', 'TV-PG', 'When My Melody''s visit to the Cloud Kingdom leads to a whirlwind of trouble, can she, Kuromi and their friends save their home before it''s too late?', 'When My Melody''s visit to the Cloud Kingdom leads to a whirlwind of trouble, can she, Kuromi and their friends save their home before it''s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKFFgGD9JCX7cXZerg2jXh1dMI7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281512'),
  ('180219103679924501', 'My Mental Choices Are Completely Interfering with my School Romantic Comedy', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kaori Sadohara, Yui Kondo, Ayumi Tsuji, Toshiyuki Toyonaga', 'TV-14', 'High school student Kanade Amakusa suffers from a curse called "Absolute Choice,” which requires him to select an action from a list of options that appear before him at random. Unfortunately, Amakusa’s choices are limited to the weird and perverse, causing him to become something of a social outcast at school. But when a sudden choice on the way home from school causes a beautiful girl to fall out of the sky, Amakusa might’ve found the key to break his curse for good!', 'High school student Kanade Amakusa suffers from a curse called "Absolute Choice,” which requires him to select an action from a list of options that appear before him at random. Unfortunately, Amakusa’s choices are limited to the weird and perverse, causing him to become something of a social outcast at school. But when a sudden choice on the way home from school causes a beautiful girl to fall out of the sky, Amakusa might’ve found the key to break his curse for good!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jdxPOVdqE0GhEv2jdqAgqdXIcm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72798'),
