  ('786151279525957801', 'My Next Life as a Villainess: All Routes Lead to Doom!', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Maaya Uchida, Shouta Aoi, Tetsuya Kakihara, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Saori Hayami, Toshiki Masuda, Takehito Koyasu', 'TV-14', 'Wealthy heiress Catarina Claes is hit in the head with a rock and recovers the memories of her past life. It turns out the world she lives in is the world of the game Fortune Lover, an otome game she was obsessed with in her past life... but she''s been cast as the villain character who tries to foil the protagonist''s romances!', 'Wealthy heiress Catarina Claes is hit in the head with a rock and recovers the memories of her past life. It turns out the world she lives in is the world of the game Fortune Lover, an otome game she was obsessed with in her past life... but she''s been cast as the villain character who tries to foil the protagonist''s romances!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUnzZYwjnd8rOSRXo6u9k8HikWW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:94904'),
  ('199184982165741032', 'My One-Hit Kill Sister', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Sakakihara, Haruka Shiraishi, Ami Koshimizu, Azumi Waki, Rio Tsuchiya, Sora Tokui, Konomi Kohara, Yuma Uchida', null, 'Asahi, a boy who loves video games is killed in a traffic accident and ends up in another world. He tries to enjoy the otherworldly adventuring life he''s always dreamed of, but his stats are on the level of an NPC''s. He is in big trouble and is being chased by a monster when he hears, "Fear not, little brother!" and the monster is killed in one hit by Asahi''s older sister, Maya, who followed Asahi to this world. So Maya has acquired some seriously OP skills, but she takes her adoration of her younger brother to extremes. Thus begins their story about an overpowered older sister with a brother complex and a younger brother with the weakest of stats in another world.', 'Asahi, a boy who loves video games is killed in a traffic accident and ends up in another world. He tries to enjoy the otherworldly adventuring life he''s always dreamed of, but his stats are on the level of an NPC''s. He is in big trouble and is being chased by a monster when he hears, "Fear not, little brother!" and the monster is killed in one hit by Asahi''s older sister, Maya, who followed Asahi to this world. So Maya has acquired some seriously OP skills, but she takes her adoration of her younger brother to extremes. Thus begins their story about an overpowered older sister with a brother complex and a younger brother with the weakest of stats in another world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQEgYVrTUxV0yXqLxdwdXIaofGt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194829'),
  ('857578291520859410', 'My Only 12%', 2022, 'Drama', 'Pitchaya Sukphat', null, 'Katsamonnat Namwirote, Pongsapak Udomphoch, Warut Chawalitrujiwong, Pitchaya Sukphat, Kirana Pipityakorn, Peemapol Panichtamrong, Panupun Vongjorn, Puwanai Sangwan', null, 'Cake and Seeiw have been friends for as long as they can remember. Cake is outgoing and has many friends, while Seeiw is shy and barely speaks to people he''s not used to being with. Despite their different personalities, they are very close. By being next-door neighbors since they were born, they became an essential aspect of each other''s lives. However, as they get older, a lot of things change, and so does the way they see each other.', 'Cake and Seeiw have been friends for as long as they can remember. Cake is outgoing and has many friends, while Seeiw is shy and barely speaks to people he''s not used to being with. Despite their different personalities, they are very close. By being next-door neighbors since they were born, they became an essential aspect of each other''s lives. However, as they get older, a lot of things change, and so does the way they see each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyy5tiC01u63V0od4ItyWIpxGxD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206118'),
  ('688493715184043562', 'My Only Love Song', 2017, 'Drama', 'Min Doo-sik, Kim Soo-jin', 'Kim Soo-jin', 'Gong Seung-yeon, Lee Jong-hyun, Jin Ye-ju, Lee Jae-jin, Kim Jung-pal, Kim Chae-eun, Ahn Bo-hyun, Park Joo-Hyung', 'TV-MA', 'Song Soo-Jung is an arrogant pop star who believes not only that status and money can get you anywhere, but that it defines your worth. She accidentally falls into a time-slip portal and travels back in time to the Joseon era where she meets On-Dal, a man who loves money yet is generous to those without.', 'Song Soo-Jung is an arrogant pop star who believes not only that status and money can get you anywhere, but that it defines your worth. She accidentally falls into a time-slip portal and travels back in time to the Joseon era where she meets On-Dal, a man who loves money yet is generous to those without.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0PoVWnILHMtGr3F1ZWbSNbReeH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70372'),
  ('123136399053554006', 'My Only Sunshine', 2026, 'Drama', 'Flower of Memory', null, 'Aphichaya Kamnoetsirikun, Siripath Sarakune, Danita Choktadaporn, Deviyabha Uddhachandra, Pataravadee Thitivoodtikul, Dangtawan Ho, Supatsorn Suriyakul, Parima Peamkaroonrath', null, 'When Sun’s love, Rafah, falls for a famous actress, she dives into the entertainment world, where ambition, romance, and rivalry blur the lines between dreams and desire.', 'When Sun’s love, Rafah, falls for a famous actress, she dives into the entertainment world, where ambition, romance, and rivalry blur the lines between dreams and desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKvkzMcMyJqwfXJ1Yf8htggdOtE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:276608'),
