  ('272145358347418599', 'My Perfect Stranger', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Lee Woong-hee, Kang Soo-yeon, Baek So-yeon', 'Baek So-yeon', 'Kim Dong-wook, Jin Ki-joo, Seo Ji-hye, Lee Won-jeong, Kim Jong-soo, Park Soo-young, Lee Gyu-hoe, Kim Jung-young', null, 'Yun Hae Jun is the youngest anchor to ever work at his broadcasting station. He is calm and straightforward as a journalist and kind in his personal life. On the other hand, Baek Yun Yeong dreamed of becoming a writer but wound up working at a publishing company. The two somehow travel back in time to the year 1987. There, Yun Hae Jun tries to find the truth behind a serial murder case, while Baek Yun Yeong attempts to prevent her parents from marrying. They soon realize that their objectives are connected.', 'Yun Hae Jun is the youngest anchor to ever work at his broadcasting station. He is calm and straightforward as a journalist and kind in his personal life. On the other hand, Baek Yun Yeong dreamed of becoming a writer but wound up working at a publishing company. The two somehow travel back in time to the year 1987. There, Yun Hae Jun tries to find the truth behind a serial murder case, while Baek Yun Yeong attempts to prevent her parents from marrying. They soon realize that their objectives are connected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuPXMIH0BJSn2Bzy84Gm3HGkTHE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204589'),
  ('1056606920897378341', 'My Personal Weatherman', 2023, 'Drama', 'Taino Nikke', null, 'Kouhei Higuchi, Atsuki Mashiko, Sayuri Matsumura, Atomu Mizuishi', null, 'To the world, he''s an amiable, fresh-faced weather forecaster. But secretly, he lives with an erotic manga artist — who must obey his every word.', 'To the world, he''s an amiable, fresh-faced weather forecaster. But secretly, he lives with an erotic manga artist — who must obey his every word.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/km6bva8NnyVEUP9rpsEZGPU0FZ1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230735'),
  ('263836223274800047', 'My Pet Ate What!?', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Pets will devour anything. But wild, wacky and weird meals can quickly turn into an emergency. That’s when the call goes out to Dr. G, a master of non-surgical ‘seek and recover’.', 'Pets will devour anything. But wild, wacky and weird meals can quickly turn into an emergency. That’s when the call goes out to Dr. G, a master of non-surgical ‘seek and recover’.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4uxjGagYoJNvuJ7PiHZKZhCgKc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:283152'),
  ('388461020234292146', 'My Physical Education Teacher', 2017, 'Drama, Family', 'Lin Yan', null, 'Zhang Jiayi, Wang Xiaochen, Zhang Zijian, Weiwei Wang, Zhao Jinmai, Hu Xianxu, Gu Yan, Xu Ge', null, 'Wang Xiaomi marries middle-aged Ma Ke, expecting a life of love and pampering. However, she soon realizes that his habits are set in stone, and being a young stepmother comes with challenges. Between a rebellious teen, a mischievous child, an elderly mother-in-law, and a lingering ex-wife, she must navigate the chaos and win over her new family to find the love she dreams of.', 'Wang Xiaomi marries middle-aged Ma Ke, expecting a life of love and pampering. However, she soon realizes that his habits are set in stone, and being a young stepmother comes with challenges. Between a rebellious teen, a mischievous child, an elderly mother-in-law, and a lingering ex-wife, she must navigate the chaos and win over her new family to find the love she dreams of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24T1vM9PRFzzrC7rKJyq0Wa2DJi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75517'),
  ('386745866770678515', 'My Precious', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Cao Xiaotian', 'Huang Zitao, Wang Herun, Liu Yichang, Shen Yao, Shi An, Ni Hongjie, Li Jiulin, Tan Yanyan', null, 'Tian Tian, a veterinarian unexpectedly takes over her family''s struggling pet hospital and meets the compassionate CEO, Shen Mi. Together, they rescue animals, overcome challenges, and establish a shelter, inspiring others to care for stray animals.', 'Tian Tian, a veterinarian unexpectedly takes over her family''s struggling pet hospital and meets the compassionate CEO, Shen Mi. Together, they rescue animals, overcome challenges, and establish a shelter, inspiring others to care for stray animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PEdT20OsmAhKD6i5lzarofd4aX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235730'),
  ('380674400297966785', 'My Princess', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', null, 'Eun Sun-woo, 장영실', 'Kim Tae-hee, Song Seung-heon, Park Ye-jin, Ryu Soo-young, Lee Soon-jae, Lee Gi-kwang, Im Ye-jin, Jeong Jong-yeol', 'TV-14', 'Seol is an ordinary college student who was adopted but is living a happy life on her own. Working part time, she happens to have an unpleasant first encounter with Hae Young, a diplomat and the only heir of the biggest conglomerate in Korea. One day, he hears shocking news from his grandfather. The Blue House announces that they will carry out a vote on rebuilding the royal house, and his grandfather asks him to find someone urgently, who later turns out to be Seol. Against his grandfather’s wishes to donate their family’s wealth to the country, Hae Young tries to stop Seol, but she ends up moving into the palace to become a princess of the royal house.', 'Seol is an ordinary college student who was adopted but is living a happy life on her own. Working part time, she happens to have an unpleasant first encounter with Hae Young, a diplomat and the only heir of the biggest conglomerate in Korea. One day, he hears shocking news from his grandfather. The Blue House announces that they will carry out a vote on rebuilding the royal house, and his grandfather asks him to find someone urgently, who later turns out to be Seol. Against his grandfather’s wishes to donate their family’s wealth to the country, Hae Young tries to stop Seol, but she ends up moving into the palace to become a princess of the royal house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/le1U5CbfKkOpuk4IIL0jREydXRf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35359'),
  ('516415603939824138', 'My Ribdiculous Reincarnation', 2026, 'Comedy, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Atsushi Abe, Mao Ichimichi, Daisuke Namikawa, Toshihiko Seki, Show Hayami, Kana Asumi, Yuka Iguchi, Marina Inoue', null, 'A man stuck in endless reincarnation avoids long waits for heroic roles by rebirthing into absurd forms—from a hermit crab to a vegetable and even an explosive.', 'A man stuck in endless reincarnation avoids long waits for heroic roles by rebirthing into absurd forms—from a hermit crab to a vegetable and even an explosive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXGD7HbBtqdTpfSbi5Dq2Qo6tCN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:312522'),
  ('490283174424779327', 'My Romance Scammer', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jiruntanin Trairattanayon, Panachai Sriariyarungruang, Thitiwat Ritprasert, Poon Mitpakdee, Ploynira Hiruntaveesin, Thanawin Teeraphosukarn, Weerayut Chansook, Kirati Puangmalee', null, 'After marrying a con artist for love, a billionaire heir must navigate a messy prenuptial trap while his cousin falls for another scammer.', 'After marrying a con artist for love, a billionaire heir must navigate a messy prenuptial trap while his cousin falls for another scammer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOXqyyyNaGnnCkucCnP5RHcjwho.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278157'),
  ('744844110474345780', 'My Romantic Some Recipe', 2016, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Ahn Ji-hoon, Joo Ah-reum, Cha Eun-woo, Lee Soo-bin', null, 'A 21-years-old college student who as one-sided love for a customer at a shop and she meets an Idol star.', 'A 21-years-old college student who as one-sided love for a customer at a shop and she meets an Idol star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1SZ5tpfjh2IGWUKhXnQhrmhAgF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83345'),
  ('380633161759208640', 'My Roommate is a Cat', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Haruka Yamazaki, Kensho Ono, Ayumu Murase, Chika Anzai, Hiro Shimono, Hiromichi Kogami, Kenjiro Tsuda, Sayaka Ohara', 'TV-14', 'Getting a roommate is the last thing an eccentric author like Mikazuki would do, until a stray cat sparks an idea for his next novel. After plucking the little killer off the streets, Mikazuki is inspired in ways he would have never expected', 'Getting a roommate is the last thing an eccentric author like Mikazuki would do, until a stray cat sparks an idea for his next novel. After plucking the little killer off the streets, Mikazuki is inspired in ways he would have never expected', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LCpZRIzPEDnr0kBBayavqjMYo5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84660'),
  ('498069228971352394', 'My Roommate is a Detective', 2020, 'Comedy, Mystery', null, null, 'Hu Yitian, Leon Zhang, Xiao Yan, Zeng Yongti, Xiang Yunlong, Qiao Junda, Zhang Xiang, Wang Xiao', null, 'In 1920s Shanghai, an infamous police officer, a genius consultant, and a resourceful journalist work together, specializing in strange and unsettling murder mysteries.', 'In 1920s Shanghai, an infamous police officer, a genius consultant, and a resourceful journalist work together, specializing in strange and unsettling murder mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boaMHpyQBHqtTvElDzTwloVnk7X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101007'),
  ('783011561568129376', 'My Roommate Is a Gumiho', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Park Joon-hwa', 'Choi Bo-rim, Paek Sun-woo', 'Jang Ki-yong, Lee Hye-ri, Bae In-hyuk, Kang Hanna, Kim Do-wan, Park Kyung-hye, Choi Woo-sung, Kim Do-yeon', null, 'To become a human, a 999-year-old Gumiho, Shin Woo-yeo needs to fill his fox bead with human energy before he turns 1,000 years old. One day, a college girl, Lee Dam accidentally swallows Woo-yeo''s fox bead.', 'To become a human, a 999-year-old Gumiho, Shin Woo-yeo needs to fill his fox bead with human energy before he turns 1,000 years old. One day, a college girl, Lee Dam accidentally swallows Woo-yeo''s fox bead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ep3TFArcl7jYipJymsKp2zuGv1m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114118'),
  ('688799019957461556', 'My Runway', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Park Ji-yeon, Kim Dong-ho, Kisum, Ahn Bo-hyun, Yang Hak-jin', null, 'An egotistic top male model and a pretty model wannabe are forced to live each other''s lives until they figure out a way to undo their body switch.', 'An egotistic top male model and a pretty model wannabe are forced to live each other''s lives until they figure out a way to undo their body switch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKfGJCqOeo3j2E2oBufntzGNeV8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69850'),
  ('323742469909251078', 'My Safe Zone', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lorena Schuett, Natsha Taechamongkalapiwat, Anada Prakobkit, Pareena Busayasiri, Peerakrit Phacharaboonyakiat, Supranee Charoenpol, Arisara Wongchalee, Janjira Janpitakchai', null, 'Alin leaves her best friend Jane to study abroad. Years later, a broken engagement brings her home, where they face feelings long unspoken.', 'Alin leaves her best friend Jane to study abroad. Years later, a broken engagement brings her home, where they face feelings long unspoken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vJMTObP0s8ijwwDu1TJaoK18nd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283543'),
  ('442712939615116982', 'My Sassy Girl', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Kwak Jae-yong', 'Joo Won, Oh Yeon-seo, Lee Jung-shin, Kim Yoon-hye, Kwak Hee-Sung, Shim Hyung-tak, Jung Da-bin, Jung Woong-in', null, 'Set in the Joseon Dynasty period, a romance takes place between cold-hearted Gyun-Woo and Princess Hyemyung who causes troubles.', 'Set in the Joseon Dynasty period, a romance takes place between cold-hearted Gyun-Woo and Princess Hyemyung who causes troubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llSHPKnZWaFvvTKqslvUVeyrK4O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71347'),
  ('1062536518442355511', 'My School President', 2022, 'Comedy', null, 'Pratchaya Thavornthummarut', 'Nattawat Jirochtikul, Norawit Titicharoenrak, Kittiphop Sereevichayasawat, Thanawin Pholcharoenrat, Allan Asawasuebsakul, Theepakorn Kwanboon, Pheerawit Koolkang, Pakin Kuna-anuwit', null, 'The school music club is on the verge of closure. In order for the club to continue to exist, the new club leader has to take a desperate step - to become a servant of the school president. How will this tangled story end?', 'The school music club is on the verge of closure. In order for the club to continue to exist, the new club leader has to take a desperate step - to become a servant of the school president. How will this tangled story end?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GeVGlTSwK2DyW5oIGJcxc4c91f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214873'),
  ('106449631494195336', 'My Secret Identity', 1988, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Chuck Lorre, Brian Levant', null, 'Wanda Cannon, Marsha Moreau, Jerry O''Connell, Derek McGrath, Christopher Bolton', null, 'My Secret Identity was a Canadian television series starring Jerry O''Connell and Derek McGrath. Originally broadcast from October 9, 1988 – May 25, 1991 on CTV in Canada, the series also aired in syndication in the United States. The series won the 1989 International Emmy Award for Outstanding Achievement in Programming for Children and Young People.', 'My Secret Identity was a Canadian television series starring Jerry O''Connell and Derek McGrath. Originally broadcast from October 9, 1988 – May 25, 1991 on CTV in Canada, the series also aired in syndication in the United States. The series won the 1989 International Emmy Award for Outstanding Achievement in Programming for Children and Young People.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yjDqSqb9zdD7TZzuXpytOgtqNA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2344'),
  ('407549284728836714', 'My Secret Romance', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Kim Young-yoon, Kim Ha-na', 'Sung Hoon, Song Ji-eun, Kim Jae-young, Kim Si-young, Im Do-yoon, Lee Hae-in, Baek Seung-Heon, Nam Kee-ae', 'TV-14', 'A partying chaebol has a one-night stand with a beautiful girl. When she joins his company years later, it is difficult to hide their secret romance.', 'A partying chaebol has a one-night stand with a beautiful girl. When she joins his company years later, it is difficult to hide their secret romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7AM5lQS18jQUtrfWsKzOqDy1VQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70744'),
  ('1095668436370414154', 'My Secret Vampire', 2025, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Park Ji Su', null, 'Lee Dong-yeol, Yu Sin, Park Dong-ju, Lee Tae-hyung, Lee Ju-young', null, 'A naïve student rents a cheap mansion in Seoul, only to learn his generous roommates are vampires—and his blood is the price of admission.', 'A naïve student rents a cheap mansion in Seoul, only to learn his generous roommates are vampires—and his blood is the price of admission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KzUjzi6x2iWXjcGa7AiCVOXRBn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:300208'),
  ('4141867922444801', 'My Secret, Terrius', 2018, 'Mystery, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Kang Dae-sun', 'Oh Ji-young', 'So Ji-sub, Jung In-sun, Son Ho-jun, Lim Se-mi, Jung Si-a, Seo Yi-sook, Lee Doo-seok, Kim Myung-soo', null, 'A woman named Go Ae-Rin loses her husband. Along with her neighbour Kim Bon, who is a NIS agent, they discover the truth behind her husband''s involvement in a huge conspiracy.', 'A woman named Go Ae-Rin loses her husband. Along with her neighbour Kim Bon, who is a NIS agent, they discover the truth behind her husband''s involvement in a huge conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GIT4P7pVXTmVGWS90hGFCa1HDY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81211'),
  ('864196821960338228', 'My Senior Brother is Too Steady', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yang Chaoran, Bingtian Wang', null, 'After being reborn in the ancient times before the Great God-Conferment War, Li Changshou becomes a minor cultivator. His only dream is to live a long life as a cultivator. In order to survive in the cruel Primordial Times, Li Changshou tries hard not to accumulate any karma—killing inevitably leads to feuds. Thus, he always plans thoroughly before doing anything and never allows himself to walk into dangerous situations. He hides his trump cards well, trains himself in escape techniques, refines poisonous pills, and masters his mystical abilities. Li Changshou originally plans to remain hidden and safe in the mountain. There, he is supposed to cultivate until he ascends to immortality. However, everything changed one year when his master seems to think that their lives are too peaceful. He takes in a junior sister…', 'After being reborn in the ancient times before the Great God-Conferment War, Li Changshou becomes a minor cultivator. His only dream is to live a long life as a cultivator. In order to survive in the cruel Primordial Times, Li Changshou tries hard not to accumulate any karma—killing inevitably leads to feuds. Thus, he always plans thoroughly before doing anything and never allows himself to walk into dangerous situations. He hides his trump cards well, trains himself in escape techniques, refines poisonous pills, and masters his mystical abilities. Li Changshou originally plans to remain hidden and safe in the mountain. There, he is supposed to cultivate until he ascends to immortality. However, everything changed one year when his master seems to think that their lives are too peaceful. He takes in a junior sister…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9564HLHhjVIhDYJpKupzpTdzun.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218642'),
  ('68806677661873368', 'My Senpai Is Annoying', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Tomori Kusunoki, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Saori Hayami, Reiou Tsuchida, Reina Aoyama, Yui Horie, Aoi Koga, Akio Otsuka', 'TV-14', 'Futuba Igarashi''s new job would be great if her senpai, Harumi Takeda, wasn''t so incredibly annoying! Futuba hates his laugh, she hates how big he is, and she really hates that he treats her like a little kid. Just because Futuba is short and looks young doesn''t make her a kid, and just because she spends so much time with Takeda doesn''t mean she sees him as anything but an annoying senpai...or does she?!', 'Futuba Igarashi''s new job would be great if her senpai, Harumi Takeda, wasn''t so incredibly annoying! Futuba hates his laugh, she hates how big he is, and she really hates that he treats her like a little kid. Just because Futuba is short and looks young doesn''t make her a kid, and just because she spends so much time with Takeda doesn''t mean she sees him as anything but an annoying senpai...or does she?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53cIDRA1JIzMSm9W0LrOPQkGuFg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105511'),
  ('1127663808732024985', 'My Shy Boss', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joo Hwa-mi', 'Joo Hwa-mi', 'Yeon Woo-jin, Park Hye-su, Yoon Park, Gong Seung-yeon, Ye Ji-won, Heo Jung-min, Lee Kyu-han, Jun Hyo-seong', 'TV-14', 'The isolated life of an extreme introvert is thrown out of order when his company hires a new employee: a cheery extrovert who''s not all she seems.', 'The isolated life of an extreme introvert is thrown out of order when his company hires a new employee: a cheery extrovert who''s not all she seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYVvEsoS9Cbfxau8AW9GJNUmGNG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69205'),
  ('973224756170729210', 'My Sibling''s Romance', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Dunhao Jiang, Cecilia Boey, Wu Chun, Xiao Lu, Yang Gen, Zhu Dan, Mu Chun, Su Ziyi', null, 'South Korea''s popular model was introduced, and the original creator participated in the production. Five pairs of native siblings/siblings stayed in the cabin and each looked for the other half under the gaze and participation of their brothers and sisters. Break the traditional comprehensive love model and parallel love and family love. Hiding the identity of brothers and sisters at the beginning and looking at the influence of the native family on feelings is no longer a journey of seeking love alone, but a mystery of "true and false Cupid" with constant laughter. It is also a new journey of heart-warming and warmth intertwined with brothers and sisters.', 'South Korea''s popular model was introduced, and the original creator participated in the production. Five pairs of native siblings/siblings stayed in the cabin and each looked for the other half under the gaze and participation of their brothers and sisters. Break the traditional comprehensive love model and parallel love and family love. Hiding the identity of brothers and sisters at the beginning and looking at the influence of the native family on feelings is no longer a journey of seeking love alone, but a mystery of "true and false Cupid" with constant laughter. It is also a new journey of heart-warming and warmth intertwined with brothers and sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6o2FXGqnq7k6STunC4pybo3dn8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280058'),
  ('1135267159948581936', 'My Siblings', 2021, 'Family, Drama', 'Gül Abus Semerci', 'Gül Abus Semerci', 'Su Burcu Yazgı Coşkun, Bilal Yiğit Koçak, Melis Minkari, Recep Usta, Fadik Sevin Atasoy, Cüneyt Mete, Celil Nalçakan, Ahu Yağtu', null, 'Four siblings have to struggle with life after their parents'' death.', 'Four siblings have to struggle with life after their parents'' death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2wOxI0GAlckcgoGF14r31dYiPr.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:119267'),
  ('406419032902907539', 'My Sister, My Writer', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yua Nagae, Yui Ogura, Eri Kitamura, Tasuku Hatanaka, Chinatsu Akasaki, Kazusa Aranami, Reina Kondo, Ayumi Mano', 'TV-MA', 'Suzuka Nagami is a beautiful third-year middle school student who has excellent grades and is the student council president. She wrote a novel about a little sister who dotes on her older brother, and the novel wins a light novel award. After they discuss the matter, Yuu is the one who debuts as a proxy light novel author instead of Suzuka, under the pen name Chikai Towano.', 'Suzuka Nagami is a beautiful third-year middle school student who has excellent grades and is the student council president. She wrote a novel about a little sister who dotes on her older brother, and the novel wins a light novel award. After they discuss the matter, Yuu is the one who debuts as a proxy light novel author instead of Suzuka, under the pen name Chikai Towano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GjPwaeQ7vnABC69OQPJPcZ27F2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83019'),
  ('29534284931428841', 'My So-Called Life', 1994, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Winnie Holzman', null, 'Claire Danes, Bess Armstrong, Tom Irwin, Wilson Cruz, Devon Gummersall, A. J. Langer, Jared Leto, Devon Odessa', 'TV-14', 'The life of a 15 year-old high school student, whose angst-ridden journey through adolescence, friendship, parents, and life teaches her what it means to grow up.', 'The life of a 15 year-old high school student, whose angst-ridden journey through adolescence, friendship, parents, and life teaches her what it means to grow up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuyxEBpuAYdfHqfzip2Y6UYRI2C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1101'),
  ('963438757007345414', 'My Stand-In', 2024, 'Drama', 'Shui Qian Cheng', null, 'Phuripan Sapsangsawat, Poompat Iam-samang, Jirakit Thawornwong, Tanathorn Charoenratanaporn, Possathorn Wittanyaprechapol, Chaiyut Panchukiat', null, 'Joe, a stuntman reincarnated into another''s body after an accident, reconnects with Ming, who seeks answers about Joe''s mysterious second chance at life.', 'Joe, a stuntman reincarnated into another''s body after an accident, reconnects with Ming, who seeks answers about Joe''s mysterious second chance at life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjmpJWoSX0vOJGFwUS27pEpbMW5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239053'),
  ('604727001997485170', 'My Status as an Assassin Obviously Exceeds the Hero''s', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takeo Otsuka, Saku Mizuno, Junichi Suwabe, Sanae Kobayashi, Konomi Tamura', 'TV-14', 'Akira Oda and his high school classmates are summoned to another world! While the other students are granted cheat abilities through the summoning, Akira merely gains the abilities of a mediocre "assassin." However, his status soon surpasses "hero," the strongest profession. After Akira becomes suspicious of the King behind the summoning, he is falsely framed for a crime and forced to flee.', 'Akira Oda and his high school classmates are summoned to another world! While the other students are granted cheat abilities through the summoning, Akira merely gains the abilities of a mediocre "assassin." However, his status soon surpasses "hero," the strongest profession. After Akira becomes suspicious of the King behind the summoning, he is falsely framed for a crime and forced to flee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQk3aXYEa4TMd9rAYgzDpAYTU8P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284644'),
  ('648813981450138294', 'My Stepmom''s Daughter Is My Ex', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiro Shimono, Rina Hidaka, Ikumi Hasegawa, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Miyu Tomita', 'TV-14', 'Ah, high school. Is there any better place to start fresh after a horrible middle school relationship? Nope! Not unless your ex ends up at the same school as you and is now your stepsibling. What was supposed to be a sanctuary of peace where I could avoid ever seeing her again has become a living nightmare! Everywhere I look, I see her—in my house, in my school, in my class. There''s no escape! She even claims that she''s the older sibling. Like hell she is! But I won''t lose to her. After all, I''m the older brother in this new family situation. That''s right, we''re family now. No matter how much we may have thought we loved each other before, we saw one another''s true colors and realized we weren''t meant for each other. That''s why even though we may keep up a buddy-buddy sibling act for the sake of our parents, things will never go back to the way they used to be.', 'Ah, high school. Is there any better place to start fresh after a horrible middle school relationship? Nope! Not unless your ex ends up at the same school as you and is now your stepsibling. What was supposed to be a sanctuary of peace where I could avoid ever seeing her again has become a living nightmare! Everywhere I look, I see her—in my house, in my school, in my class. There''s no escape! She even claims that she''s the older sibling. Like hell she is! But I won''t lose to her. After all, I''m the older brother in this new family situation. That''s right, we''re family now. No matter how much we may have thought we loved each other before, we saw one another''s true colors and realized we weren''t meant for each other. That''s why even though we may keep up a buddy-buddy sibling act for the sake of our parents, things will never go back to the way they used to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQMIfN5L2eIwOeFep6Dt6H7X4kg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129516'),
  ('544403855919607643', 'My Story Is Long', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Shigeki Kaneko', 'Toma Ikuta, Ken Yasuda, Eiko Koike, Kaya Kiyohara, Mieko Harada, Yosuke Sugino, Masahiko Nishimura, Rintaro Mizusawa', null, 'A young man has college and a failed business behind him. Unemployed and planning his next steps he is lodging with is mother, a small business owner. His sister and her family also move in with the two, albeit temporarily. She sees him as a loser and a lush and wants him out. She also whispers in their mother''s ear to ask him to leave the house in order to find his own way and begin the rest of his life. She probably has noble intentions, but is she right and will she succeed?', 'A young man has college and a failed business behind him. Unemployed and planning his next steps he is lodging with is mother, a small business owner. His sister and her family also move in with the two, albeit temporarily. She sees him as a loser and a lush and wants him out. She also whispers in their mother''s ear to ask him to leave the house in order to find his own way and begin the rest of his life. She probably has noble intentions, but is she right and will she succeed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNCAvwsjC65WvvQTcfowHJiHxyg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95838'),
  ('575630009793370483', 'My Strange Addiction', 2010, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'My Strange Addiction is an American documentary television series that premiered on TLC on December 29, 2010. The series focuses on people with unusual compulsive behaviors. These range from eating specific non-food items to ritualistic daily activities to bizarre personal fixations or beliefs.', 'My Strange Addiction is an American documentary television series that premiered on TLC on December 29, 2010. The series focuses on people with unusual compulsive behaviors. These range from eating specific non-food items to ritualistic daily activities to bizarre personal fixations or beliefs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgMjmFtS27KO7vaAgvPGYHGrfQM.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:35308'),
  ('32352765519136529', 'My Strange Hero', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery', null, null, 'Yoo Seung-ho, Cho Bo-ah, Kwak Dong-yeon, Kim Dong-young, Park Ah-in, Cheon Ho-jin, Kim Mi-kyeong, Lee Kang-min', null, 'When Kang Bok-Soo was a high school student, he was falsely accused of committing violence and kicked out of school. This was caused by his first love Son Soo-Jung and a male student Oh Se-Ho. Kang Bok-Soo is a now an adult, but his life has not gone smoothly. To get revenge on Son Soo-Jung and Oh Se-Ho, he returns to the same high school as a student. The environment at the school has changed and Kang Bok-Soo gets involved in unexpected cases.', 'When Kang Bok-Soo was a high school student, he was falsely accused of committing violence and kicked out of school. This was caused by his first love Son Soo-Jung and a male student Oh Se-Ho. Kang Bok-Soo is a now an adult, but his life has not gone smoothly. To get revenge on Son Soo-Jung and Oh Se-Ho, he returns to the same high school as a student. The environment at the school has changed and Kang Bok-Soo gets involved in unexpected cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8Uzpksp6TRKwyn6L6EtZd4fJcx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84464'),
  ('554768173618544768', 'My Stubborn', 2025, 'Drama', 'Waranluck Phonpawiworakun', null, 'Yongyut Termtuo, Pasakorn Sanrattana, Phusanu Wongsavanischakorn, Punn Chirathanaphat, Michelle Behrmann, Cherlyn Kraiarayapat, Thanakrid Suteepakornchai, Chachana Thirakod', 'TV-MA', 'Jun loves to annoy Sorn. Sorn can''t stand Jun. But fate has plans—and maybe feelings—they didn’t see coming.', 'Jun loves to annoy Sorn. Sorn can''t stand Jun. But fate has plans—and maybe feelings—they didn’t see coming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhd7n7Khq8NvclYAgZmJ4uAJifW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272711'),
  ('313146589679797416', 'My Sunshine', 2015, 'Drama', 'Gu Man', 'Mobao Feibao', 'Wallace Chung, Tang Yan, Tan Kai, Yang Le, Mi Lu, Janice Wu, Luo Yunxi, Lin Peng', null, 'Years after two college sweethearts went their separate ways, Mosheng and Yichen rekindle their romance despite a barrage of challenges to their love.', 'Years after two college sweethearts went their separate ways, Mosheng and Yichen rekindle their romance despite a barrage of challenges to their love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5uqxze2HsYt7HYUv6Vb6sEiNGj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62152'),
  ('865833352670271269', 'My Super Sweet 16', 2005, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'My Super Sweet 16 is a MTV reality series documenting the lives of teenagers, usually in the United States, Canada and UK, who usually have wealthy parents who throw huge coming of age celebrations. Parties include the quinceañera, the sweet 16, and other birthdays including a My Super Sweet 21 and My Super Swag 18.', 'My Super Sweet 16 is a MTV reality series documenting the lives of teenagers, usually in the United States, Canada and UK, who usually have wealthy parents who throw huge coming of age celebrations. Parties include the quinceañera, the sweet 16, and other birthdays including a My Super Sweet 21 and My Super Swag 18.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPluoOPMIGJz1E5JUfMVlmQDaDh.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:10390'),
  ('293493665918920909', 'My Superhero', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Zidan Yuan', 'Huang Xuan, Bai Baihe, Zhu Yuchen, Bai Yufan, Chai Biyun, Xue Haojing, Ding Jiali, Yang Kun', null, 'Zhang Guang Zheng is a nerdy couch potato who just takes what life gives him and doesn''t aspire for more. However, he decides that it''s time for a change after falling for flight attendant Zhang You En. Joining Zheng You En''s mother Liu Meili''s group of dancing grannies at the public square becomes an eye opening experience for him. The ladies'' courage and passion for life inspires him to do the same. At this time, his seemingly strict hotel manager has initiated a program on employee development. With the encouragement of friends, Zhang Guang Zheng works hard to pass the assessment in order to obtain opportunities for further studies. He forges ahead, constantly narrowing the distance between Zheng You En and him. In turn, he also makes an impact in the lives of the people around him such as the Zhang You En who used to keep to herself, Wang Niulang who''s afraid to fall for someone and Chen Jing Dian who gave up on his postgraduate entrance examination for fear of failing.', 'Zhang Guang Zheng is a nerdy couch potato who just takes what life gives him and doesn''t aspire for more. However, he decides that it''s time for a change after falling for flight attendant Zhang You En. Joining Zheng You En''s mother Liu Meili''s group of dancing grannies at the public square becomes an eye opening experience for him. The ladies'' courage and passion for life inspires him to do the same. At this time, his seemingly strict hotel manager has initiated a program on employee development. With the encouragement of friends, Zhang Guang Zheng works hard to pass the assessment in order to obtain opportunities for further studies. He forges ahead, constantly narrowing the distance between Zheng You En and him. In turn, he also makes an impact in the lives of the people around him such as the Zhang You En who used to keep to herself, Wang Niulang who''s afraid to fall for someone and Chen Jing Dian who gave up on his postgraduate entrance examination for fear of failing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wiCoxOyOx5ffCR82EX9TKAsp0t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202290'),
  ('306178093642384903', 'My Sweet Dear', 2021, 'Drama', null, 'Jang Joo-yeon, Jang Mi', 'Lee Chan-hyeong, Jang Eui-soo, Oh Seung-jun, Jang Do-yun, Cho Seo-hoo', null, 'A youthful romance set in a restaurant between an extraordinary genius chef, Choi Jung Woo and Laura Dining''s head chef, Yoon Do Geon.', 'A youthful romance set in a restaurant between an extraordinary genius chef, Choi Jung Woo and Laura Dining''s head chef, Yoon Do Geon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqKNvuJ3Pyw17HmzGlY31f2vFt3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133091'),
  ('583812301261597680', 'My Sweet Fat Valentina', 2002, 'Soap, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Belén Marrero, Natalia Streignard, Manuel Sosa, Juan Pablo Raba, Flavio Caballero, Emma Rabbe, Norkys Batista, Marianela González', 'NR', 'A loving overweight woman must overcome the obstacles in the way between her and her true love.', 'A loving overweight woman must overcome the obstacles in the way between her and her true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cduGmrNnER1r5bVvi6NpUgKLD3n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73964'),
  ('1128422350157750170', 'My Sweet Mobster', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Park Soo-jung', 'Na Kyung', 'Um Tae-goo, Han Seon-hwa, Kwon Yul, Kim Hyun-jin, Park Jae-chan, Moon Dong-hyeok, Yang Hyun-min, Lee Yoo-jun', null, 'Once a convict, Ji-hwan is now a successful, albeit overly cautious CEO, who has yet to experience any of life’s more enjoyable pleasures: namely falling in love. But all that changes when fate brings beloved children’s content creator Eun-ha into his life. The unlikely pair find love most unexpectedly but Eun-ha’s longtime fan, Prosecutor Hyun-woo isn’t ready to let her go without a fight.', 'Once a convict, Ji-hwan is now a successful, albeit overly cautious CEO, who has yet to experience any of life’s more enjoyable pleasures: namely falling in love. But all that changes when fate brings beloved children’s content creator Eun-ha into his life. The unlikely pair find love most unexpectedly but Eun-ha’s longtime fan, Prosecutor Hyun-woo isn’t ready to let her go without a fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlSvVgzBcVPx7cus93c3Amdb4py.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215000'),
  ('13813353267499060', 'My Sweet Tyrant', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Waka Kakitsubata', null, 'Arisa Kori, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Ayaka Suwa, Keisuke Ueda, Wataru Hatano, Hikaru Kayou', null, 'The romantic comedy follows the everyday life of an extremely tsundere boy named Atsuhiro "Akkun" Kagari and his girlfriend Non "Nontan" Katagiri. Akkun''s behavior is harsh towards Nontan with verbal abuse and neglect, but he actually is head-over-heels for her and habitually acts like a stalker by tailing her or eavesdropping. Nontan is oblivious to Akkun''s stalker ways, and thinks his actions are cute.', 'The romantic comedy follows the everyday life of an extremely tsundere boy named Atsuhiro "Akkun" Kagari and his girlfriend Non "Nontan" Katagiri. Akkun''s behavior is harsh towards Nontan with verbal abuse and neglect, but he actually is head-over-heels for her and habitually acts like a stalker by tailing her or eavesdropping. Nontan is oblivious to Akkun''s stalker ways, and thinks his actions are cute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eG8r71D9CfRvHCVick2HObofIxn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77723'),
  ('711784398399060942', 'My Teen Romantic Comedy SNAFU', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Takuya Eguchi, Saori Hayami, Nao Toyama, Ayane Sakura, Aoi Yuuki, Mikako Komatsu, Takashi Kondo, Nobuyuki Hiyama', 'TV-14', 'So exactly what’s going to happen when Hachiman Hikigaya, an isolated high school student with no friends, no interest in making any and a belief that everyone else’s supposedly great high school experiences are either delusions or outright lies, is coerced by a well meaning faculty member into joining the one member “Volunteer Services Club” run by Yukino Yukinoshita, who’s smart, attractive and generally considers everyone in her school to be her complete inferior?', 'So exactly what’s going to happen when Hachiman Hikigaya, an isolated high school student with no friends, no interest in making any and a belief that everyone else’s supposedly great high school experiences are either delusions or outright lies, is coerced by a well meaning faculty member into joining the one member “Volunteer Services Club” run by Yukino Yukinoshita, who’s smart, attractive and generally considers everyone in her school to be her complete inferior?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sb5MNoeZGHX21qvtwhmizUsJJqq.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65676'),
  ('347438849872979911', 'My Three Sons', 1960, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Fred MacMurray, Don Grady, Barry Livingston, Stanley Livingston, William Demarest, Beverly Garland, Tina Cole, Dawn Lyn', 'TV-PG', 'A widower and aeronautical engineer named Steven Douglas raises three sons with the help of his father-in-law, and later the boys'' great-uncle. An adopted son, a stepdaughter, wives, and another generation of sons join the loving family in later seasons.', 'A widower and aeronautical engineer named Steven Douglas raises three sons with the help of his father-in-law, and later the boys'' great-uncle. An adopted son, a stepdaughter, wives, and another generation of sons join the loving family in later seasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jOnSZ87XrV04mu5ZKgr8TUVVVz4.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:1530'),
  ('1117896994104599449', 'My Tiny Senpai', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hina Tachibana, Yuuki Shin, Yumiri Hanamori, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Mikako Komatsu', 'TV-14', 'When Shinozaki started his new job, he didn’t expect his superior to be so…cute!? He struggled to learn the ropes until Katase, his tiny and kind senpai, took him under her wing. But as they grow closer, he hopes her attention might mean something more.', 'When Shinozaki started his new job, he didn’t expect his superior to be so…cute!? He struggled to learn the ropes until Katase, his tiny and kind senpai, took him under her wing. But as they grow closer, he hopes her attention might mean something more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zSPXGCvXjkVCR7797UbRDPfV2B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217390'),
  ('179003712667622388', 'My Tooth Your Love', 2022, 'Drama', 'Sammi Pan', null, 'Andy Wu, Snoopy Yu, Michael Chang, Alex Chou, Esther Huang, Jae-Hoon Kim, Hung Chien, Tim Cheng', null, 'A lifelong fear of dentists fades when Bai Lang meets Dr. Jin, whose care might mean more than just fixing teeth.', 'A lifelong fear of dentists fades when Bai Lang meets Dr. Jin, whose care might mean more than just fixing teeth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5jZBaUxMGOvfWOXYiBbeMACuFd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201256'),
  ('966761010311325364', 'My Troublesome Star', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', null, 'Park Ji-ha', 'Uhm Jung-hwa, Song Seung-heon, Lee El, Oh Dae-hwan, Jang Da-a, Lee Min-jae, Cha Chung-hwa, Hyun Bong-sik', null, 'A romantic comedy that follows the story of a top actress who, after reaching the peak of her career and even winning the youngest-ever Best Actress award, suffers an accident and finds herself transported 25 years into the future.', 'A romantic comedy that follows the story of a top actress who, after reaching the peak of her career and even winning the youngest-ever Best Actress award, suffers an accident and finds herself transported 25 years into the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbhOvMQXXGnaaPP1cpUVfZm0CcR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281966'),
  ('564458526913626461', 'My True Friend', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'AngelaBaby, Deng Lun, Zhu Yilong, Xu Di, Tan Kai, Tian Xiwei, Zhang Wanyi, Li Xiaofeng', null, 'A modern drama focusing on the relationship between real estate agents and customers wanting to find the perfect home in a growing property market.', 'A modern drama focusing on the relationship between real estate agents and customers wanting to find the perfect home in a growing property market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhyycu15EmIjhtFGhySAQHkHV7x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89542'),
  ('353958134602200717', 'My Two Dads', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Michael Jacobs, Danielle Alexandra', null, 'Paul Reiser, Staci Keanan, Greg Evigan, Florence Stanley, Giovanni Ribisi, Amy Hathaway, Chad Allen', null, 'Joey and Michael, who fought over the same woman 13 years ago now have, upon her death, been awarded joint custody of her daughter - who might be either of theirs. So how do the men settle their problems? With a paternity test? No way. Instead, they all move in together to raise Nicole as a two-dad nuclear family. Under the watchful eye of the family court judge, dads and daughter adjust to their new situation.', 'Joey and Michael, who fought over the same woman 13 years ago now have, upon her death, been awarded joint custody of her daughter - who might be either of theirs. So how do the men settle their problems? With a paternity test? No way. Instead, they all move in together to raise Nicole as a two-dad nuclear family. Under the watchful eye of the family court judge, dads and daughter adjust to their new situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2WYpwOczP3sQjmDpx91CrRjm5r.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1862'),
  ('803434901029507339', 'My Uncle', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Javier Colinas', null, 'José Eduardo Derbez, Santiago Beltrán Ulrich, Ariadne Díaz, Michelle Gonzalez, Gema Garoa, Eduardo Yáñez, Alejandra Toussaint, Alfonso Borbolla', null, 'The journey of an unemployed amateur musician who reluctantly agrees to take care of his young nephew.', 'The journey of an unemployed amateur musician who reluctantly agrees to take care of his young nephew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDPNwSe63WACVlHap7un6AgbqgO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195623'),
  ('143659213049220547', 'My Undead Yokai Girlfriend', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yalun Tu, Zach Hines', null, 'Hayato Sano, Ai Yoshikawa, Takashi Sorimachi, Dori Sakurada', null, 'College student Tadashi ''Hachi'' Inukai is tired of feeling like a loser. But that all changes one day when he accidentally conducts a mysterious ritual he finds online, summoning a demonic yokai to the mortal plane, nicknamed Izzy. Bonded by magic, Hachi and Izzy must figure out how to navigate life, love and murder.', 'College student Tadashi ''Hachi'' Inukai is tired of feeling like a loser. But that all changes one day when he accidentally conducts a mysterious ritual he finds online, summoning a demonic yokai to the mortal plane, nicknamed Izzy. Bonded by magic, Hachi and Izzy must figure out how to navigate life, love and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSqqG8WsOYpsCLOqhKW19Xn9Lhh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248395'),
  ('623614819731138259', 'My Unfamiliar Family', 2020, 'Drama', 'Kwon Young-il', 'Kim Eun-jeong', 'Shin Jae-ha, Han Ye-ri, Kim Ji-seok, Choo Ja-hyun, Jung Jin-young, Won Mi-kyung, Shin Dong-wook, Shin Hye-jeong', 'TV-14', 'A family must deal with the unresolved emotions and misunderstandings that deeply affect their relationships with each other. From the mother that wants to graduate from her marriage, to the daughter who discovers her husband''s well-hidden secret, the family must learn to rely on and communicate with each other.', 'A family must deal with the unresolved emotions and misunderstandings that deeply affect their relationships with each other. From the mother that wants to graduate from her marriage, to the daughter who discovers her husband''s well-hidden secret, the family must learn to rely on and communicate with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTjFEnn8Uh7kP4HLfsEcdkIsmec.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100941'),
  ('491705624619767771', 'My Unicorn Girl', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Fan Kan, Fang Qiangqiang, Chen Xiao Chen', 'Darren Chen, Chen Yao, Li Jiulin, Ao Ziyi, Ma Zehan, Dai Yaqi, Rui Weihang, Jason Hsu', null, 'Sang Tian is an aspiring figure skater. On the day she turns 18, she vows to her family that she will be accepted to the same university that her mother once attended. To get in, she must pass a test, which she – an exceptionally competent skater and student – expects to ace.', 'Sang Tian is an aspiring figure skater. On the day she turns 18, she vows to her family that she will be accepted to the same university that her mother once attended. To get in, she must pass a test, which she – an exceptionally competent skater and student – expects to ace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ezScOwKaCgW5O8zms2DVpUQbBA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108123'),
  ('384844663109546435', 'My Unique Skill Makes Me OP Even at Level 1', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kaito Ishikawa, Rin Kusumi, Marika Kouno, Saori Onishi, Kanon Takao, Mai Fuchigami', 'TV-14', 'Ryota Sato gets the surprise of his life when he''s suddenly transported into another world and nearly clobbered at the hands of the young, pretty adventurer Emily Brown. This new world revolves around defeating monsters and profiting on whatever they drop—food, money, items, etc. Unfortunately for Ryota, he has no skills to speak of...until he learns he has the ability to get rare drops! Suddenly his luck turns around...or does it?', 'Ryota Sato gets the surprise of his life when he''s suddenly transported into another world and nearly clobbered at the hands of the young, pretty adventurer Emily Brown. This new world revolves around defeating monsters and profiting on whatever they drop—food, money, items, etc. Unfortunately for Ryota, he has no skills to speak of...until he learns he has the ability to get rare drops! Suddenly his luck turns around...or does it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIrptxkpf3SNcPty3JaywvWRJ5w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201363'),
  ('625374381540477433', 'My Unorthodox Life', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'The personal and professional life of fashion mogul Julia Haart - former member of an ultra-Orthodox Jewish community turned CEO of Elite World Group.', 'The personal and professional life of fashion mogul Julia Haart - former member of an ultra-Orthodox Jewish community turned CEO of Elite World Group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6VhvmTqvzvooQaAMcCM8ZvpGsG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:128246'),
  ('145048940015922490', 'My Wife and Kids', 2001, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Damon Wayans, Don Reo', null, 'Damon Wayans, Tisha Campbell, George O. Gore II, Jennifer Freeman, Parker McKenna Posey, Noah Gray-Cabey, Brooklyn Sudano, Andrew McFarlane', 'TV-PG', 'Michael Kyle is a loving husband and modern-day patriarch who rules his household with a unique and distinct parenting style. As he teaches his three children some of life''s lessons, he does so with his own brand of humor.', 'Michael Kyle is a loving husband and modern-day patriarch who rules his household with a unique and distinct parenting style. As he teaches his three children some of life''s lessons, he does so with his own brand of humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyQsN8bU27fdIs2D66gFmcIo0dM.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2692'),
  ('876177891844697879', 'My Wife Has No Emotion', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Konomi Inagaki, Yoshino Aoyama, Yu Serizawa, Risae Matsuda, Yuuki Wakai', 'TV-14', 'Takuma isn’t the most exciting guy. He’s awkward, single, and does nothing but go to work and come home. Tired of doing chores, he decides to buy a housekeeping robot named Mina. She can cook and clean perfectly, and the two get to know each other better over time. Soon, Takuma starts to fall for Mina! But could a robot ever love him back?', 'Takuma isn’t the most exciting guy. He’s awkward, single, and does nothing but go to work and come home. Tired of doing chores, he decides to buy a housekeeping robot named Mina. She can cook and clean perfectly, and the two get to know each other better over time. Soon, Takuma starts to fall for Mina! But could a robot ever love him back?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttaknfJP0qjg7kMKwH0w29fcE6d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250596'),
  ('537599341781567248', 'My Wife is a High School Girl', 2005, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Ayako Kawasumi, Shiho Kawaragi, Aya Endo, Naoya Uchida, Daisuke Namikawa, Mayumi Yanagisawa, Mayumi Asano, Mitsuaki Madono', null, 'The 17-year-old Onohara Asami is a cute, second-year high school student. Nobody knows that she is actually already married to her 25-year-old physics teacher, Ichimaru Kyousuke (Danna-sama). Besides her responsibility as a student, she now has to take care of the household and keep the marriage a secret at school. Juggling these things on a daily basis is all but easy for Asami, especially with the complications introduced by her well-meaning but nosy best female friends; an overprotective very intrusive father Iwao; the kind teacher Iwasaki who of all men falls for Asami''s husband; or the quite alluring next-door neighbour Sakura Mizunosaki. Against all these odds Asami tries to nurture her young love with Danna-sama.', 'The 17-year-old Onohara Asami is a cute, second-year high school student. Nobody knows that she is actually already married to her 25-year-old physics teacher, Ichimaru Kyousuke (Danna-sama). Besides her responsibility as a student, she now has to take care of the household and keep the marriage a secret at school. Juggling these things on a daily basis is all but easy for Asami, especially with the complications introduced by her well-meaning but nosy best female friends; an overprotective very intrusive father Iwao; the kind teacher Iwasaki who of all men falls for Asami''s husband; or the quite alluring next-door neighbour Sakura Mizunosaki. Against all these odds Asami tries to nurture her young love with Danna-sama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crjGXARJBVXnQzoKo9V90JXEBA6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:27245'),
  ('532034915489000848', 'My Wife is the Student Council President', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Aoi Fujimoto, Yoshie Sugiyama, Ayana Taketatsu, Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'TV-MA', 'The story begins with Izumi Hayato running to be student body president. But when a beautiful girl swings in promising the liberalization of love while flinging condoms into the audience, he ends up losing to her and becoming the vice president. At the student council meeting, the newly-elected president invites herself over to Izumi''s house, where she promptly announces she is to become Izumi''s wife thanks to an agreement that their parents had made, a drunken promise decades ago that their children would one day become husband and wife. Naturally Hayato is against this, but Ui has the complete opposite reaction, and even wants to live with him! Will the upset Hayato and the overenthusiastic Ui be able to manage their school and marital life while keeping it a secret from the other students? Or will the two never come to understand each other''s feelings?', 'The story begins with Izumi Hayato running to be student body president. But when a beautiful girl swings in promising the liberalization of love while flinging condoms into the audience, he ends up losing to her and becoming the vice president. At the student council meeting, the newly-elected president invites herself over to Izumi''s house, where she promptly announces she is to become Izumi''s wife thanks to an agreement that their parents had made, a drunken promise decades ago that their children would one day become husband and wife. Naturally Hayato is against this, but Ui has the complete opposite reaction, and even wants to live with him! Will the upset Hayato and the overenthusiastic Ui be able to manage their school and marital life while keeping it a secret from the other students? Or will the two never come to understand each other''s feelings?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcd7hgNMeK8Fv8TWvtb9uHks4lh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63330'),
  ('839536109415975854', 'My Wife''s Having an Affair This Week', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Lee Nam-kyu, Im Yeon-su', 'Lee Sun-kyun, Song Ji-hyo, Kwon BoA, Lee Sang-yeob, Kim Hie-won, Ye Ji-won, Lee Do-yeon, Kim Kang-hoon', null, 'Suspecting his seemingly perfect wife is cheating on him, a troubled man seeks anonymous advice from an internet community to save his marriage.', 'Suspecting his seemingly perfect wife is cheating on him, a troubled man seeks anonymous advice from an internet community to save his marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lU5ahFaalMxBkT2cVKBgQZG8pSN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67858'),
  ('997144998177861283', 'My Youth', 2025, 'Drama', 'Lee Sang-yeob', null, 'Song Joong-ki, Chun Woo-hee, Lee Ju-myoung, Seo Ji-hoon, Jin Kyung, Cho Han-cheul, Yoon Byung-hee, Lee Bong-ryeon', null, 'The story of Sun Woo-hae and Sung Je-yun, who reunite after 15 years, struggling and living fiercely in their respective stages.', 'The story of Sun Woo-hae and Sung Je-yun, who reunite after 15 years, struggling and living fiercely in their respective stages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Z9Ebm6GXTONARr2aASsTPrAEvh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262237'),
  ('538273287246971400', 'My-Hime', 2004, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mai Nakahara, Saeko Chiba, Ai Shimizu, Toshihiko Seki, Naomi Shindo, Kiyomi Asai, Akiko Kimura, Akira Ishida', 'TV-14', 'Schoolgirls discover that they have been given the ability to materialize weapons and control robotic beasts called "Children" to stop an evil organization from their plans of domination.', 'Schoolgirls discover that they have been given the ability to materialize weapons and control robotic beasts called "Children" to stop an evil organization from their plans of domination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWZhtbCNHGtivsebbbxxnw8mczE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12599'),
  ('197667112212500667', 'My-Otome', 2005, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mika Kikuchi', null, 'In the distant future on the planet Earl, colonized by immigrants from Earth centuries ago. "Old technology" has survived in the form of nanomachines that allow female virgins wield Highly-advanced Materializing Equipment (HiME) and become Meister Otomes - bodyguards and warriors that serve the royalty of various kingdoms. Arika Yumemiya has come to Windbloom Kingdom in search of her mother, whom Arika knows was an Otome. On her arrival she meets the top Coral Otome student, Nina Wáng, and Windbloom''s heir to the throne, Mashiro Blan de Windbloom. The series follows Arika''s progress as a student at Garderobe Academy and the machinations of those desiring the destructive power of the old technology for themselves.', 'In the distant future on the planet Earl, colonized by immigrants from Earth centuries ago. "Old technology" has survived in the form of nanomachines that allow female virgins wield Highly-advanced Materializing Equipment (HiME) and become Meister Otomes - bodyguards and warriors that serve the royalty of various kingdoms. Arika Yumemiya has come to Windbloom Kingdom in search of her mother, whom Arika knows was an Otome. On her arrival she meets the top Coral Otome student, Nina Wáng, and Windbloom''s heir to the throne, Mashiro Blan de Windbloom. The series follows Arika''s progress as a student at Garderobe Academy and the machinations of those desiring the destructive power of the old technology for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSAZrDrR8sySebreeK4FPfjyL0i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42716'),
  ('1100984390565987684', 'Mylodrama', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Ilya Kulikov', null, 'Sergey Burunov, Rostislav Bershauer, Grigory Kalinin, Yuriy Grubnik, Marusya Klimova, Alina Chernobrovkina, Alexander Taranzhin, Anna Mironova', null, 'In order to bring down the shares of the TV channel, the board of directors decides to put a gas station attendant in the CEO''s chair and entrust him with the filming of the series. In a short time, the would-be boss manages to create chaos on the air and establish his own rules in the media business. But suddenly, the series, which was supposed to be the greatest failure, begins to have a tremendous success…', 'In order to bring down the shares of the TV channel, the board of directors decides to put a gas station attendant in the CEO''s chair and entrust him with the filming of the series. In a short time, the would-be boss manages to create chaos on the air and establish his own rules in the media business. But suddenly, the series, which was supposed to be the greatest failure, begins to have a tremendous success…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWGbQmnUPbPIq8JlvWaBo9H6xUm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87126'),
  ('895079792227204976', 'Myriad Colors Phantom World', 2016, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiro Shimono, Sumire Uesaka, Saori Hayami, Azusa Tadokoro, Maaya Uchida, Misaki Kuno, Kikuko Inoue, Daisuke Sakaguchi', 'TV-14', 'In the near future, in a world born of human imagination, what humans would call ghosts or monsters appear, and they come to be called "phantoms." Haruhiko Ichijō, is a first year at Hosea Academy along with his upperclassman Mai Kawakami, who fights phantoms with the ability "Spirit of Five Elements," Reina Izumi, who has the ability "Phantom Eater," and Koito Minase, who fights phantoms in solitude. They experience the ups and downs of high school life before a certain incident leads them to the truth of this world.', 'In the near future, in a world born of human imagination, what humans would call ghosts or monsters appear, and they come to be called "phantoms." Haruhiko Ichijō, is a first year at Hosea Academy along with his upperclassman Mai Kawakami, who fights phantoms with the ability "Spirit of Five Elements," Reina Izumi, who has the ability "Phantom Eater," and Koito Minase, who fights phantoms in solitude. They experience the ups and downs of high school life before a certain incident leads them to the truth of this world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHeXtLAshmzGVx759rnCWRW2iz7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65333'),
  ('676309408818543320', 'Myself; Yourself', 2007, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Shinnosuke Tachibana, Ami Koshimizu, Tomoko Kaneda, Takehito Koyasu, Yukari Tamura, Megumi Toyoguchi, Mai Nakahara, Ayumi Murata', null, 'Hikada Sana returns to his home town after living away in Tokyo for five years. Although some time has passed the town has not changed much. On a detour to his apartment, he notices that a shrine maiden is watching him as he visits the shrine. The following day at school, Sana is surprised to find out that this girl is actually Yatsushiro Nanaka, a good childhood friend, whom he gave a bracelet before he left so many years ago. And even to this day, she is still wearing it...', 'Hikada Sana returns to his home town after living away in Tokyo for five years. Although some time has passed the town has not changed much. On a detour to his apartment, he notices that a shrine maiden is watching him as he visits the shrine. The following day at school, Sana is surprised to find out that this girl is actually Yatsushiro Nanaka, a good childhood friend, whom he gave a bracelet before he left so many years ago. And even to this day, she is still wearing it...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0o3pHbrE0iJnDXotoWeVvul5EQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42885'),
  ('865551115648858953', 'Mysteria Friends', 2019, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yoko Hikasa, Ayaka Fukuhara, Nana Mizuki, Kimiko Koyama, Kikuko Inoue, Lynn, Wataru Hatano, Hiroshi Naka', 'TV-14', 'Anne, the honor student princess, and Grea, a princess born from a dragon and a human are students at the Mysteria Academy, a prestigious magic school that teaches magic without discrimination to the three factions (men, gods, demons), who usually are engaged in battle with each other.', 'Anne, the honor student princess, and Grea, a princess born from a dragon and a human are students at the Mysteria Academy, a prestigious magic school that teaches magic without discrimination to the three factions (men, gods, demons), who usually are engaged in battle with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmiwfWF2Vc5ALcibb7G09VIBe8d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84869'),
  ('276335850942067018', 'Mysteries at the Museum', 2010, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Don Wildman', 'TV-PG', 'Don Wildman unearths relics from the world''s greatest institutions to reveal secrets from the past. He examines each artifact to illuminate history''s most incredible triumphs, sensational crimes and bizarre encounters.', 'Don Wildman unearths relics from the world''s greatest institutions to reveal secrets from the past. He examines each artifact to illuminate history''s most incredible triumphs, sensational crimes and bizarre encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJsBQRZoEehX8biph7XkkFjtoM2.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:38122'),
  ('446982210754223412', 'Mysteries of Lisbon', 2011, 'Drama', 'Raúl Ruiz', null, 'Adriano Luz, Maria João Bastos, Ricardo Pereira, Clotilde Hesme, Afonso Pimentel, João Arrais, Albano Jerónimo, João Baptista', null, 'The tragic story of the many lives of Father Dinis, his dark origins and his pious works, and the different fates of all those who, trapped in a sinister web of love, hate and crime, cross paths with him through years of adventure and misfortune in the convulsed Europe of the late 18th and early 19th centuries. (A longer television version of the film of the same name, released in 2010.)', 'The tragic story of the many lives of Father Dinis, his dark origins and his pious works, and the different fates of all those who, trapped in a sinister web of love, hate and crime, cross paths with him through years of adventure and misfortune in the convulsed Europe of the late 18th and early 19th centuries. (A longer television version of the film of the same name, released in 2010.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a61pbEy4XyPuLDOQ8yWsJijUD9Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40195'),
  ('463060104559348176', 'Mysteries of the Abandoned', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Philip Grossman', null, 'Kasper Michaels', 'TV-PG', 'Documentary series investigating why some of the world''s most advanced architectural achievements were abandoned.', 'Documentary series investigating why some of the world''s most advanced architectural achievements were abandoned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49P6ieIlzKyfmx2rvT5TkI8Sn1v.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:71356'),
  ('438154904788995749', 'Mysteries of the Faith', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Harewood', 'TV-PG', 'Believed to hold miraculous powers, sacred treasures are kept under lock and key. Uncover the history — and mystery — behind these Catholic relics.', 'Believed to hold miraculous powers, sacred treasures are kept under lock and key. Uncover the history — and mystery — behind these Catholic relics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2xweHIeyI93135viegLJQOSda0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236505'),
  ('1064485194427353807', 'Mysteries Unearthed with Danny Trejo', 2024, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Danny Trejo', null, 'From dangerous explosives and deadly curses that put everyday people at risk, to treasures found in the unlikeliest of ways, each episode digs into the people, the places and historical significance of these discoveries. And sometimes just being in the right place at the right time can make history…because nothing stays hidden forever.', 'From dangerous explosives and deadly curses that put everyday people at risk, to treasures found in the unlikeliest of ways, each episode digs into the people, the places and historical significance of these discoveries. And sometimes just being in the right place at the right time can make history…because nothing stays hidden forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1750IyM9T78eMnnqdyISIcIoYP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:277573'),
  ('158853386033018796', 'Mysterious Disappearances', 2024, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Fairouz Ai, Daiki Yamashita, Eri Yukimura, Yui Horie, Rie Takahashi, Saya Aizawa, Yuuya Uchida, Naomi Ohzora', null, 'Sumireko Ogawa’s dream of becoming a novelist is reinvigorated with new rumors of mystical incidents. Now a clerk at a bookstore, she enlists her young coworker, Ren Adashino, to investigate urban legends, black magic, and ghost stories across the city. Sumireko has a knack for triggering magical events, and Ren has a dark secret of his own. Will they survive their investigation unscathed?', 'Sumireko Ogawa’s dream of becoming a novelist is reinvigorated with new rumors of mystical incidents. Now a clerk at a bookstore, she enlists her young coworker, Ren Adashino, to investigate urban legends, black magic, and ghost stories across the city. Sumireko has a knack for triggering magical events, and Ren has a dark secret of his own. Will they survive their investigation unscathed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2S5ZCNmmio6wfXhmO9cZLEtzLL3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218146'),
  ('541959542229559796', 'Mysterious Girlfriend X', 2012, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Deko Akao', 'Miyu Irino, Yuki Kaji, Ayako Yoshitani, Yu Shimamura, Ryo Hirohashi, Misato Fukuen', 'TV-MA', 'Akira is a normal high school boy, but he nevertheless impulsively licks some drool left by the mysterious transfer student Mikoto. The next day he falls asleep with an inexplicable fever. After five days Mikoto suddenly comes to visit, and makes him consume her drool. The fever instantly vanishes, and Mikoto explains that he''s suffering from "love sickness." She can transmit emotions through her drool, and the two of them are now bound together.', 'Akira is a normal high school boy, but he nevertheless impulsively licks some drool left by the mysterious transfer student Mikoto. The next day he falls asleep with an inexplicable fever. After five days Mikoto suddenly comes to visit, and makes him consume her drool. The fever instantly vanishes, and Mikoto explains that he''s suffering from "love sickness." She can transmit emotions through her drool, and the two of them are now bound together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyYqsl7iG1bC8NEaeEVbkB34mhJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42556'),
  ('573337137408437079', 'Mysterious Island', 1973, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', null, 'Jacques Champreux, Juan Antonio Bardem', 'Omar Sharif, Gérard Tichy, Jess Hahn, Ambroise Mbia, Rafael Bardem Jr., Philippe Nicaud', 'NR', 'During the American Civil War, five prisoners of war manage to escape in a balloon. They are driven far across the sea to an unknown island, far from civilization. The legendary captain Nemo (world star Omar Sharif), who is trapped in a huge underground cave with his submarine Nautilus, watches the group. When the stranded people are discovered by pirates, Nemo helps them with a host of his super technology...', 'During the American Civil War, five prisoners of war manage to escape in a balloon. They are driven far across the sea to an unknown island, far from civilization. The legendary captain Nemo (world star Omar Sharif), who is trapped in a huge underground cave with his submarine Nautilus, watches the group. When the stranded people are discovered by pirates, Nemo helps them with a host of his super technology...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kyx1PBXqL7Z8F2YyseZVqC5kSb7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70162'),
  ('399276143231046117', 'Mysterious Lotus Casebook', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Teng Ping', 'Liu Fang, Wang Wei, Li Huimin', 'Cheng Yi, Joseph Zeng, Xiao Shunyao, Chen Duling, Wang Herun, Estelle Chen, Xu Baihui, Liu Mengrui', null, 'Li Lian Hua is a countryside doctor who travels dragging around a lotus tower. He accidentally becomes "famous" and gets pulled into the pugilistic world that he no longer wants to have any connections with.', 'Li Lian Hua is a countryside doctor who travels dragging around a lotus tower. He accidentally becomes "famous" and gets pulled into the pugilistic world that he no longer wants to have any connections with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpMyCVieu5JlGT52KzBTOOh9VFo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230835'),
  ('440206892558553398', 'Mysterious Love', 2021, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Zhong Zu Yao', 'Yilia Yu, Tsao Yu-ning, Leslie Ma, Wu Haoze, Sky Li, Wu Xingjian, Sun Xizhi, Xu Qin', null, 'Quirky and adorable theater actress Ruan Nian Chu meets Li Teng, a cold and arrogant guy who possess both high EQ and IQ. Li Teng saves Ruan Nian Chu from a dangerous situation. The two develop feelings for each other, but separated due to different life tracks. Five years later, the two reunite and their feelings for each other rekindled. However the two are faced with a new danger as they work together to unravel the antagonist''s schemes.', 'Quirky and adorable theater actress Ruan Nian Chu meets Li Teng, a cold and arrogant guy who possess both high EQ and IQ. Li Teng saves Ruan Nian Chu from a dangerous situation. The two develop feelings for each other, but separated due to different life tracks. Five years later, the two reunite and their feelings for each other rekindled. However the two are faced with a new danger as they work together to unravel the antagonist''s schemes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBA0uOwNrIeAbovPLYVcXBLiIGH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123358'),
  ('1137962889508077150', 'Mysterious Personal Shopper', 2018, 'Drama, Family, Mystery, Soap', 'Kim Sang-hwi', 'Lee Jeong-dae', 'Choi Myung-gil, Park Ha-na, Wang Bit-na, Han Sang-jin, Lee Eun-hyung, Lee Han-wi, Jeong Soo-young, Lee Ho-jae', null, 'Hong Se Yeon works as a personal shopper. She is outgoing and a positive person, but she is betrayed by people whom she loved. She begins to take revenge on those who betrayed her. Meanwhile, Eun Kyung Hye is the only child of a CEO. Her life looks perfect, but she has a fear that she will get abandoned. Because of her fear, she has an impulse control disorder and gets compulsive.', 'Hong Se Yeon works as a personal shopper. She is outgoing and a positive person, but she is betrayed by people whom she loved. She begins to take revenge on those who betrayed her. Meanwhile, Eun Kyung Hye is the only child of a CEO. Her life looks perfect, but she has a fear that she will get abandoned. Because of her fear, she has an impulse control disorder and gets compulsive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0Vja79H9rOcSmmtzOaAT7fsytV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76995'),
  ('390316977624248143', 'Mysterious Ways', 2000, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Peter O''Fallon', null, 'Alisen Down, Adrian Pasdar, Rae Dawn Chong', null, 'Declan Dunn has a fascination with mystical phenomena that began when he was buried under an avalanche and given up for dead. After he miraculously survived, he committed his life to investigating miracles and the absolute proof of their existence. Now a professor of Anthropology at a leading Oregon university, Declan has the training, support staff and the opportunity to study the uncanny, inexplicable phenomena people call "miracles". With the help of Peggy, a skeptical psychiatrist, and Miranda, a research student, the three embark on a quest to explain what science cannot.', 'Declan Dunn has a fascination with mystical phenomena that began when he was buried under an avalanche and given up for dead. After he miraculously survived, he committed his life to investigating miracles and the absolute proof of their existence. Now a professor of Anthropology at a leading Oregon university, Declan has the training, support staff and the opportunity to study the uncanny, inexplicable phenomena people call "miracles". With the help of Peggy, a skeptical psychiatrist, and Miranda, a research student, the three embark on a quest to explain what science cannot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyt3CECCEmCyyY42ZmEzasMXyfL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2027'),
  ('829434704860341229', 'Mystery and Imagination', 1966, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Raymond Collier, Jonathan Alwyn', null, null, null, 'Mystery and Imagination is a British television anthology of classic horror and supernatural dramas. Five series were broadcast from 1966 to 1970 on ITV and produced by ABC and Thames Television.', 'Mystery and Imagination is a British television anthology of classic horror and supernatural dramas. Five series were broadcast from 1966 to 1970 on ITV and produced by ABC and Thames Television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qiRlEuJOtkUi5nFm6G7OQIA9How.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:19463'),
  ('465213099256960750', 'Mystery at Blind Frog Ranch', 2021, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Duane Ollinger, Chad Ollinger, Charlie Snider, Eric Drummond', 'TV-PG', 'There are some places on earth where the land just seems different, and Blind Frog Ranch in eastern Utah is one of those places. Locals say the land is cursed. That it''s trying to hold on to something.', 'There are some places on earth where the land just seems different, and Blind Frog Ranch in eastern Utah is one of those places. Locals say the land is cursed. That it''s trying to hold on to something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zSAWZ8LVD3oOmWV8d9PtM6931Y.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:115773'),
  ('1033823408841341375', 'Mystery Diners', 2012, 'Reality', null, null, 'Charles Stiles', 'TV-G', 'What happens in the food world when a bad employee starts to take down an otherwise thriving establishment or when restaurant owners suspect someone of not doing their job appropriately? They call in the Mystery Diners. These undercover operatives go into restaurants, bars and food service establishments with hidden cameras to find out what''s really going on when the boss isn''t around.', 'What happens in the food world when a bad employee starts to take down an otherwise thriving establishment or when restaurant owners suspect someone of not doing their job appropriately? They call in the Mystery Diners. These undercover operatives go into restaurants, bars and food service establishments with hidden cameras to find out what''s really going on when the boss isn''t around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdijAnoda5Zc7Jb37wL1EfifJPj.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:58936'),
  ('1082901760455795767', 'Mystery Files', 2023, 'Crime, Documentary, Mystery, Comedy, Reality', 'Ryan Bergara, Shane Madej', null, 'Ryan Bergara, Shane Madej', null, 'Have you ever found yourself on a Wikipedia deep dive on the weird side of the internet? In this show, weird thing enthusiasts Ryan and Shane take turns presenting their latest fascinations to each other covering everything unusual, unexplained, and unhinged.', 'Have you ever found yourself on a Wikipedia deep dive on the weird side of the internet? In this show, weird thing enthusiasts Ryan and Shane take turns presenting their latest fascinations to each other covering everything unusual, unexplained, and unhinged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Qi6n3n1eLV0hB7tBRHIgzXGRp1.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:223722'),
  ('413811302646030151', 'Mystery in the Box', 2024, 'Reality', 'Huang Lei', null, 'Chen He, Wang Xun, Lars Huang, Mark Chao You-Ting, Lin Gengxin, Xu Zhisheng, Wu Bi', null, '"Mystery in the Box" is an all-star immersive drama suspense variety show. Huang Lei serves as a variety show producer for the first time, creating a variety show version of Truman''s world. He will customize their own "Spiritual Healing Journey" for each of the 10 groups of friends in the circle. One box space, 100 characters, 10 mystery tourists, all stories are closely related to his/her life experiences. Visitors need to interact with the characters in the box, promote the plot, and uncover the truth of the story step by step in various bizarre, hilarious and reversal in order to get out of the box.', '"Mystery in the Box" is an all-star immersive drama suspense variety show. Huang Lei serves as a variety show producer for the first time, creating a variety show version of Truman''s world. He will customize their own "Spiritual Healing Journey" for each of the 10 groups of friends in the circle. One box space, 100 characters, 10 mystery tourists, all stories are closely related to his/her life experiences. Visitors need to interact with the characters in the box, promote the plot, and uncover the truth of the story step by step in various bizarre, hilarious and reversal in order to get out of the box.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4P5fPLuSh4c9yAB11v4KWiP0EOj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:250061'),
  ('312682326509424931', 'Mystery Lab', 2020, 'Documentary, Comedy, Family', 'Felipe Castanhari', null, 'Felipe Castanhari, Guilherme Briggs, Bruno Miranda, Lilian Regina', null, 'Host Felipe Castanhari explores science, history, mysteries and marvels, uncovering mind-blowing facts with help from his lab buddies.', 'Host Felipe Castanhari explores science, history, mysteries and marvels, uncovering mind-blowing facts with help from his lab buddies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihc15uMbjI6kzIy14CWGvOCZ39d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106173'),
  ('387703486991538117', 'Mystery Music Show: King of Mask Singer', 2015, 'Reality', null, 'Park Won-woo', 'Kim Sung-joo, Kim Gu-ra', null, 'Competitors are given elaborate masks to wear in order to conceal their identity, thus removing factors such as popularity, career and age that could lead to prejudiced voting. In the first round, a pair of competitors sing the same song, while in the second and third rounds they each sing a solo song. After the First Generation, the winner of the Third Round goes on to challenge the Mask King, and is either eliminated or replaces the previous Mask King through live voting. The identities of the singers are not revealed unless they have been eliminated.', 'Competitors are given elaborate masks to wear in order to conceal their identity, thus removing factors such as popularity, career and age that could lead to prejudiced voting. In the first round, a pair of competitors sing the same song, while in the second and third rounds they each sing a solo song. After the First Generation, the winner of the Third Round goes on to challenge the Mask King, and is either eliminated or replaces the previous Mask King through live voting. The identities of the singers are not revealed unless they have been eliminated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlnAfmirzYx1TSxXuaPhHjkPPmK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66046'),
  ('178546990904759248', 'Mystery of Antiques', 2018, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Yuan Lu, 刘英剑', 'Xia Yu, Qiao Zhenyu, Cai Wenjing, Chie Tanaka, Wang Gang, Kenneth Tsang, Lü Zhong, Huang Haibing', null, 'An antique shop is at the core of a mystery as its owner who hails from a family that has long been dabbling in the trade becomes embroiled with old secrets from jianghu. An unexpected visitor pays a visit to Xu Yuan and takes him into a dream where a conspiracy is brewing. He finds that a treasured artefact that can only be heard in legends may have personal connections to him and that a scheme from decades ago has everything to do with his fate. Even at the cost of his life, Xu Yuan uses his skills to pit wits and will against the powers from a long time ago.', 'An antique shop is at the core of a mystery as its owner who hails from a family that has long been dabbling in the trade becomes embroiled with old secrets from jianghu. An unexpected visitor pays a visit to Xu Yuan and takes him into a dream where a conspiracy is brewing. He finds that a treasured artefact that can only be heard in legends may have personal connections to him and that a scheme from decades ago has everything to do with his fate. Even at the cost of his life, Xu Yuan uses his skills to pit wits and will against the powers from a long time ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXapJN2a00dOroJ0bztZKz2vAvo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85247'),
  ('628585808292198443', 'Mystery of the Twin Swords', 1991, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery', null, null, 'Roger Kwok Chun-On, Dicky Cheung Wai-Kin, Homer Cheung, Law Lok-Lam, Chu Tit-Wo, Yeung Ling, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Rain Lau Yuk-Chui', null, 'Brother Ah Yat and Ah Yuet are destined to face each other in the next battle of the century between the immortals and devils, and only only one is expected to survive.', 'Brother Ah Yat and Ah Yuet are destined to face each other in the next battle of the century between the immortals and devils, and only only one is expected to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVFw1wA3cHGiHTDwRzVViD7NAej.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:85603'),
  ('712233170946594276', 'Mystery Road', 2018, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Aaron Pedersen, Tasia Zalar, Jada Alberts, Tasma Walton, Sofia Helin, Ursula Yovich, Ngaire Pigram, Mark Mitchinson', 'TV-14', 'When there is a mysterious disappearance on an outback cattle station, Detective Jay Swan is assigned to investigate. Working with local cop Emma James, Jay’s investigation uncovers a past injustice that threatens the fabric of the whole community.', 'When there is a mysterious disappearance on an outback cattle station, Detective Jay Swan is assigned to investigate. Working with local cop Emma James, Jay’s investigation uncovers a past injustice that threatens the fabric of the whole community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEQMiMIQg1xqlXlr06TbtoSMwrD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79243'),
  ('361497399371307785', 'Mystery Road: Origin', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, null, null, 'Jay Swan, a young officer, takes up his first posting in an outback mining town. A tragic death, an epic love, and the brutal reality of life as a police officer straddling two worlds will change his life forever.', 'Jay Swan, a young officer, takes up his first posting in an outback mining town. A tragic death, an epic love, and the brutal reality of life as a police officer straddling two worlds will change his life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3Xk7HRbGysWM66BTahIZN663RT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:205242'),
  ('346229745891900688', 'Mystery Science Theater 3000', 1989, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Joel Hodgson', 'Michael J. Nelson, David Sussman, Mary Jo Pehl', 'Michael J. Nelson, Kevin Murphy, Bill Corbett, Mary Jo Pehl, Patrick Brantseg', 'TV-PG', 'A stranded spaceship pilot captured by mad scientists survives a blitz of cheesy B movies by riffing on them with his funny robot pals.', 'A stranded spaceship pilot captured by mad scientists survives a blitz of cheesy B movies by riffing on them with his funny robot pals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNeb35RFoeLwxu0CFzZ9NAI5UTA.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:1952'),
  ('337904204190776209', 'Mystery Science Theater 3000', 2017, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Joel Hodgson', null, 'Felicia Day, Patton Oswalt, Jonah Ray Rodrigues, Baron Vaughn, Hampton Yount, Grant Baciocco, Rebecca Hanson, Joel Hodgson', 'TV-14', 'The cult hit returns! Captured by mad scientists, new host Jonah survives a blitz of cheesy B movies by riffing on them with his funny robot pals.', 'The cult hit returns! Captured by mad scientists, new host Jonah survives a blitz of cheesy B movies by riffing on them with his funny robot pals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGkGqvxzrH3TK1ElA1C7uNxicDZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:75907'),
  ('356675525576427304', 'Mystery Wrestling', 2023, null, 'Nicolas Dansereau', null, 'Nicolas Dansereau', null, 'Mystery Wrestling is a professional wrestling show where every participant is a mystery! Hosted by AEW pro wrestler Evil Uno and a special guest commentator, you never truly know what will happen. It''s a mystery!', 'Mystery Wrestling is a professional wrestling show where every participant is a mystery! Hosted by AEW pro wrestler Evil Uno and a special guest commentator, you never truly know what will happen. It''s a mystery!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucZjFp802lgj1DX53n80p81hz6q.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:301657'),
  ('275972333193083886', 'Mystic', 2020, 'Family, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Amy Shindler', null, 'Macey Chipping', null, 'A group of horse-mad teenagers who are regulars at their local stables on the fictional NZ peninsula of Kauri Point. Worrying incidents surrounding a new industrial development prove the catalyst for a series of events that means the group have to risk everything in order to save their horses.', 'A group of horse-mad teenagers who are regulars at their local stables on the fictional NZ peninsula of Kauri Point. Worrying incidents surrounding a new industrial development prove the catalyst for a series of events that means the group have to risk everything in order to save their horses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vL5gaFnc6c6TGKnctpqheMThVNQ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:115101'),
  ('345337746653087141', 'Mystic Pop-up Bar', 2020, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Bae Hye-Soo', null, 'Hwang Jung-eum, Yook Sung-jae, Choi Won-young, Lee Jun-hyeok, Jeong Da-eun, Sieun, Ahn Tae-hwan, Na In-woo', null, 'At this mysterious late-night food cart run by an equally mysterious woman and her part-timer, customers are provided a space for respite and counseling through their dreams. But most importantly, everyone here is treated equally—living or dead.', 'At this mysterious late-night food cart run by an equally mysterious woman and her part-timer, customers are provided a space for respite and counseling through their dreams. But most importantly, everyone here is treated equally—living or dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ol3UYd3EfHmz5jz777jpAPwGxwp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99491'),
  ('1041073376936274574', 'Myth & Mogul: John DeLorean', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'John Z. DeLorean', null, 'In the automotive world, John DeLorean rose from engineer to executive to icon. But under the hood of his self-created legend lies darkness and deceit.', 'In the automotive world, John DeLorean rose from engineer to executive to icon. But under the hood of his self-created legend lies darkness and deceit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlECyoV9XINpkunjOOoJDtOD8ew.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128500'),
  ('255984505028798706', 'MythBusters', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Peter Rees', null, 'Brian Louden, Jonathan Lung, Robert Lee', 'TV-PG', 'MythBusters is a science entertainment television program created and produced by Australia''s Beyond Television Productions for the Discovery Channel. The show''s hosts, special effects experts Adam Savage and Jamie Hyneman, use elements of the scientific method to test the validity of rumors, myths, movie scenes, adages, Internet videos, and news stories.', 'MythBusters is a science entertainment television program created and produced by Australia''s Beyond Television Productions for the Discovery Channel. The show''s hosts, special effects experts Adam Savage and Jamie Hyneman, use elements of the scientific method to test the validity of rumors, myths, movie scenes, adages, Internet videos, and news stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvRnMu00NLGiTPijGZg9CRF3nuY.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:1428'),
  ('424018986346962298', 'Mythbusters Jr.', 2019, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Adam Savage', 'TV-PG', 'Six of America’s most talented kids get a chance to show off their amazing ingenuity and STEAM (Science, Technology, Engineering, Arts, and Math) skills as they tackle myths similar to those seen in MythBusters, ranging from driving, explosions, chemistry, physics, popular culture and more.', 'Six of America’s most talented kids get a chance to show off their amazing ingenuity and STEAM (Science, Technology, Engineering, Arts, and Math) skills as they tackle myths similar to those seen in MythBusters, ranging from driving, explosions, chemistry, physics, popular culture and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPiIZaXLvmhPmTaAZO3CRZBpFL5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85200'),
  ('697012105087428558', 'MythBusters: The Search', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kyle Hill', 'TV-PG', 'The search for an all-new generation of myth-busting science superstars with mind-blowing build skills and nerves of steel. Using social media and spectacular stunts, a cast of fearless hopefuls are judged on their skills as they compete in never-before-seen myth-busting challenges.', 'The search for an all-new generation of myth-busting science superstars with mind-blowing build skills and nerves of steel. Using social media and spectacular stunts, a cast of fearless hopefuls are judged on their skills as they compete in never-before-seen myth-busting challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usYmB5a78tdiohfbuaWp84VwzRx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69144'),
  ('1002103948572972965', 'Mythic Quest', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Rob Mac, Charlie Day, Megan Ganz', null, 'Rob Mac, Charlotte Nicdao, Ashly Burch, Naomi Ekperigin, Jessie Ennis, Imani Hakim, Danny Pudi, David Hornsby', 'TV-MA', 'Meet the team behind the biggest multiplayer video game of all time. But in a workplace focused on building worlds, molding heroes, and creating legends, the most hard-fought battles don’t occur in the game—they happen in the office.', 'Meet the team behind the biggest multiplayer video game of all time. But in a workplace focused on building worlds, molding heroes, and creating legends, the most hard-fought battles don’t occur in the game—they happen in the office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QxQlpqEjx3vRpEtuh6Y0R6eY9O.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:94951'),
  ('981910018369169240', 'Mythomaniac', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Anne Berest', null, 'Marina Hands, Mathieu Demy, Marie Drion, Jéremy Gillet, Zélie Rixhon, Luca Terracciano, Fadily Camara, Yves Jacques', 'TV-MA', 'Burned out and taken for granted, a working mom suspects her partner is cheating, so to win back his attentions, she feigns a medical diagnosis.', 'Burned out and taken for granted, a working mom suspects her partner is cheating, so to win back his attentions, she feigns a medical diagnosis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLTYhndA8cFTRcEyNRSrY1GexmE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87778'),
  ('87571744430293236', 'MythQuest', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Christopher Jacot, Meredith Henderson, Bill Switzer, Wendy Anderson, Matthew Walker, Shaun Johnston, Joseph Kell, Leslie Malton', null, 'While searching for their missing father, Alex & Cleo Bellows are drawn into the actual myths when entering the Cyber Museum. They encounter Gorgos, a trickster god, who wants to destroy the world by constantly changing the famous myths.', 'While searching for their missing father, Alex & Cleo Bellows are drawn into the actual myths when entering the Cyber Museum. They encounter Gorgos, a trickster god, who wants to destroy the world by constantly changing the famous myths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BIUmF7HXkrVOhRVUCa2hL3hqBy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3100'),
  ('1061766804548414431', 'Na lovu', 2021, 'Reality, Family', null, null, 'Dagmar Jandová, Jakub Kvašovský, Václav Slabyhoudek, Ondřej Sokol, Jiří Martínek', null, 'Na Lovu is a Czech game-show, based on the license of the popular global format The Chase. A heart-racing quiz show where four competitors must pit their wits and face off against Lovec (the Chaser), a ruthless quiz genius determined to stop them from winning cash prizes.', 'Na Lovu is a Czech game-show, based on the license of the popular global format The Chase. A heart-racing quiz show where four competitors must pit their wits and face off against Lovec (the Chaser), a ruthless quiz genius determined to stop them from winning cash prizes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udJ1wVuOwFg1q6UBcQGwcpcdIYF.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:206679'),
  ('339090106818281026', 'Na Wspólnej', 2003, 'Soap', null, null, 'Sylwia Gliwa, Bożena Dykiel, Mieczysław Hryniewicz, Anna Korcz, Robert Kudelski, Grażyna Wolszczak, Michał Tomala, Waldemar Obłoza', null, 'Na Wspólnej is a Polish soap opera. It has been running since 2003 on the TVN channel as its flagship primetime weekday soap opera. It is loosely based on the German production Unter Uns and it follows the lives of the inhabitants of an apartment block in Wspólna Street, Warsaw. Episodes tend to last around 20 minutes. It is a Polish version of the Hungarian "Barátok közt". The series is shot almost entirely in Warsaw and produced by the Polish branch of Freemantle Media. On 9 September 2008 it celebrated its 1000th episode; "Na Wspólnej" was the fourth Polish television series ever to achieve such status. A special episode was broadcast in which characters from some other of TVN''s most popular shows visited Wspólna Street.', 'Na Wspólnej is a Polish soap opera. It has been running since 2003 on the TVN channel as its flagship primetime weekday soap opera. It is loosely based on the German production Unter Uns and it follows the lives of the inhabitants of an apartment block in Wspólna Street, Warsaw. Episodes tend to last around 20 minutes. It is a Polish version of the Hungarian "Barátok közt". The series is shot almost entirely in Warsaw and produced by the Polish branch of Freemantle Media. On 9 September 2008 it celebrated its 1000th episode; "Na Wspólnej" was the fourth Polish television series ever to achieve such status. A special episode was broadcast in which characters from some other of TVN''s most popular shows visited Wspólna Street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uksRhdaOn64bO5d33d7rcTbrhJI.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:14750'),
  ('1075057086668182774', 'Naagin', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ekta Kapoor', null, 'Priyanka Chahar, Alice Kaushik, Ribbhu Mehra, Namik Paul', null, 'A miraculous shape-shifting snake has the power to become a human. She can be anybody she wants: a wife, a seductress, a mistress, a damsel in distress: all in the name of revenge.', 'A miraculous shape-shifting snake has the power to become a human. She can be anybody she wants: a wife, a seductress, a mistress, a damsel in distress: all in the name of revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r76GlGdzE5OCq3LRx1niR8IEli0.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:76791'),
  ('1070288837029383567', 'Nabari no Ou', 2008, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yuuki Kamatani', null, 'Satoshi Hino, Ayumi Fujimura, Mitsuki Saiga, Rie Kugimiya, Daisuke Namikawa, Ryotaro Okiayu, Akeno Watanabe, Kimiko Koyama', null, 'In the shadows of society, rival ninja clans fight to control an ancient technique which holds untold strength. This coveted power dwells within apathetic Miharu, a fact the guy really couldn’t care less about—until the clans bring their war to him.', 'In the shadows of society, rival ninja clans fight to control an ancient technique which holds untold strength. This coveted power dwells within apathetic Miharu, a fact the guy really couldn’t care less about—until the clans bring their war to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1uBxNCC17W2OMrHChCR4uQJ3UQM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37529'),
  ('133915987924009236', 'Nacho', 2023, 'Drama', 'Diego Sotelo, Gema R. Neira, Teresa Fernández-Valdés', null, 'Martiño Rivas, María de Nati, Andrés Velencoso, Edu Soto, Miriam Giovanelli, Carmen Conesa, Montse Guallar, Nancho Novo', 'TV-MA', 'Valencia, 1993. For Ignacio Jordá, sex is his greatest obsession. But Nacho is done with being the black sheep of his family and wants to show he can do more than drift through life, even if that means "fucking" everyone.', 'Valencia, 1993. For Ignacio Jordá, sex is his greatest obsession. But Nacho is done with being the black sheep of his family and wants to show he can do more than drift through life, even if that means "fucking" everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcfpovydjIs6PnIPrc04A1SVCcx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206285'),
