  ('781632980126114454', 'Naked City', 1958, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Stirling Silliphant', null, 'Harry Bellaver, Paul Burke, Horace McMahon, Lawrence Dobkin, Nancy Malone', 'TV-MA', 'Naked City is a police drama series which aired from 1958 to 1963 on the ABC television network. It was inspired by the 1948 motion picture of the same name, and mimics its dramatic “semi-documentary” format. In 1997, the episode “Sweet Prince of Delancey Street” was ranked #93 on TV Guide’s “100 Greatest Episodes of All Time”.', 'Naked City is a police drama series which aired from 1958 to 1963 on the ABC television network. It was inspired by the 1948 motion picture of the same name, and mimics its dramatic “semi-documentary” format. In 1997, the episode “Sweet Prince of Delancey Street” was ranked #93 on TV Guide’s “100 Greatest Episodes of All Time”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56pxzIXS9dEwtUHsQc4ggDMkSX2.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3782'),
  ('813786922506340131', 'Naked Dining', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ayaka Kato', null, 'Yutaro, Shori Kondo, Yuki Katayama, So Yamanaka, Figaro Tseng, Hiroaki Oka, Judy Ongg', null, 'Office worker by day, naked diner by night. Souta''s secret gets out when a local boy stumbles upon him mid-meal.', 'Office worker by day, naked diner by night. Souta''s secret gets out when a local boy stumbles upon him mid-meal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e90Xpvo1HNRXysNYu0HxJ1BHtfW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222370'),
  ('712510941559797897', 'Naked Fireman', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, 'Yoo Jung-hee', 'Lee Jun-hyuk, Jung In-sun, Jo Hee-bong, Seo Jeong-yeon, Lee Won-jong, Lee Do-gyeom, Lee Doo-seok', null, 'Kang Chul Soo is an enthusiastic fireman. He poses as a nude model to make money for his sick friend. He is then targeted as the criminal of an arson-murder case that took place 10 years. Kang Chul Soo and mysterious heiress Han Jin Ah try to find the real culprit.', 'Kang Chul Soo is an enthusiastic fireman. He poses as a nude model to make money for his sick friend. He is then targeted as the criminal of an arson-murder case that took place 10 years. Kang Chul Soo and mysterious heiress Han Jin Ah try to find the real culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2ws270tc8XdtDwz3zVsb9F5PuR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69610'),
  ('33563995996946279', 'Naked News', 2005, 'Comedy, News', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A real television newscast, the show is prepared in Toronto and runs daily, with 25-minute episodes 6 days per week. The female anchors read the news fully nude or strip as they present their news segments.', 'A real television newscast, the show is prepared in Toronto and runs daily, with 25-minute episodes 6 days per week. The female anchors read the news fully nude or strip as they present their news segments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9NSon8AFCWT6RXickFSgmdY5hS.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:12301'),
  ('49862540033173354', 'Naked SNCTM', 2017, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Osa Grekov, Camille January Straughn, Natalya Nemchinova, Damon Lawner, Alina Ratuska', 'TV-MA', 'SNCTM is the most exclusive, high-end erotic club ever. Its wealthy members enjoy black tie masquerades, private dinners, and erotic theater. Get to know SNCTM, its creator and its employees in this eye-opening documentary series.', 'SNCTM is the most exclusive, high-end erotic club ever. Its wealthy members enjoy black tie masquerades, private dinners, and erotic theater. Get to know SNCTM, its creator and its employees in this eye-opening documentary series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OjkvNsrhAh9ur2dIYgpwQXiaoa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73473'),
  ('348729975756391180', 'NAMUAMIDABUTSU! -UTENA-', 2019, 'Animation', null, null, 'Masaaki Mizunaka, Tomoaki Maeno, Tetsuya Kakihara, Yusuke Kobayashi, Daisuke Hirakawa, Showtaro Morikubo, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Ryuichi Kijima', null, 'The pain that everyone cannot escape when living: the living, old, sick, and death. The way to save it is through Buddhist enlightenment. At the end of a war, a prince who obtained the Buddhist enlightenment became the Shaka Nyorai and saved the world. Long time has passed since that, currently the latter age of decadence. Mara, the worry that once tried to destroy Shaka''s enlightenment, has made a contract with the devil in order to seek revenge against Shaka. He begins to control people with worries. Meanwhile, a team centering around Shaka, called the Thirteen Buddhas, and the two benevolent deities who protect the dharma, Taishakuten and Bonten, have stood up to fight against Mara to protect people from worries. A battle between Mara and the Buddhist gods that involves people begins now!', 'The pain that everyone cannot escape when living: the living, old, sick, and death. The way to save it is through Buddhist enlightenment. At the end of a war, a prince who obtained the Buddhist enlightenment became the Shaka Nyorai and saved the world. Long time has passed since that, currently the latter age of decadence. Mara, the worry that once tried to destroy Shaka''s enlightenment, has made a contract with the devil in order to seek revenge against Shaka. He begins to control people with worries. Meanwhile, a team centering around Shaka, called the Thirteen Buddhas, and the two benevolent deities who protect the dharma, Taishakuten and Bonten, have stood up to fight against Mara to protect people from worries. A battle between Mara and the Buddhist gods that involves people begins now!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zoCLMTA1t1dMXbC26RLfvEp24If.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87474'),
  ('900208267983103537', 'NANA', 2006, 'Animation, Drama', 'Ai Yazawa', null, 'Romi Park, KAORI, Akira Ishida, Megumi Kojima, Anna Tsuchiya, Aya Hirano, Tomokazu Seki, Hiroki Takahashi', 'TV-MA', 'Nana Osaki and Nana Komatsu meet while traveling to Tokyo in pursuit of their respective dreams, and decide to be roommates. Although drastically different people, the two become very close and together they find out if their biggest dreams have room for their best friend.', 'Nana Osaki and Nana Komatsu meet while traveling to Tokyo in pursuit of their respective dreams, and decide to be roommates. Although drastically different people, the two become very close and together they find out if their biggest dreams have room for their best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egEROVWFVUupRhK03Bj5IVGAEGu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56568'),
  ('545247430467482724', 'Nanana''s Buried Treasure', 2014, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yuki Ono, Rui Tanabe, Kana Hanazawa, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Kana Asumi', 'TV-14', 'Disowned by his father, Jugo Yama has run away from home to the island of Nanae. He begins to live by himself, only to discover his room is haunted by the ghost of Nanana Ryugajo. She was murdered ten years ago, and her killer must be found before she can rest in peace. Before her death, Nanana collected things from all over the world and hid them throughout the island. Using the mysterious powers of these hidden items, they should be able to find the culprit. As Jugo begins his hunt for her collection, however, he discovers he''s not the only person searching.', 'Disowned by his father, Jugo Yama has run away from home to the island of Nanae. He begins to live by himself, only to discover his room is haunted by the ghost of Nanana Ryugajo. She was murdered ten years ago, and her killer must be found before she can rest in peace. Before her death, Nanana collected things from all over the world and hid them throughout the island. Using the mysterious powers of these hidden items, they should be able to find the culprit. As Jugo begins his hunt for her collection, however, he discovers he''s not the only person searching.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGYn9NrX7176XT5ll2fmJWFI6qZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60832'),
  ('315598331463327259', 'Nancy Drew', 2019, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Noga Landau, Stephanie Savage', null, 'Kennedy McMann, Leah Lewis, Maddison Jaizani, Tunji Kasim, Alex Saxon, Riley Smith, Scott Wolf', 'TV-14', 'Nancy Drew makes plans to leave her hometown for college, but finds herself drawn into a supernatural murder mystery instead.', 'Nancy Drew makes plans to leave her hometown for college, but finds herself drawn into a supernatural murder mystery instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBXeSqUE4reXkGvs3lUls8M9J72.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:89572'),
  ('149143175761514557', 'Naomi', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jill Blankenship, Ava DuVernay', null, 'Kaci Walfall, Cranston Johnson, Alexander Wraith, Mary-Charles Jones, Mouzam Makkar, Daniel Puig, Camila Moreno, Will Meyers', 'TV-PG', 'Follow a teen girl’s journey from her small northwestern town to the heights of the multiverse. When a supernatural event shakes her hometown to the core, Naomi sets out to uncover its origins, and what she discovers will challenge everything we believe about our heroes', 'Follow a teen girl’s journey from her small northwestern town to the heights of the multiverse. When a supernatural event shakes her hometown to the core, Naomi sets out to uncover its origins, and what she discovers will challenge everything we believe about our heroes', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwS6ggTI8hTkVTz1I4U6BZ48pgZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125474'),
  ('964648273283036917', 'Naomi Osaka', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Garrett Bradley', null, 'Naomi Osaka', 'TV-14', 'What does it feel like to be one of the best tennis players in the world? An intimate look inside the life of one of the most gifted and complex athletes of her generation offers insight into the tough decisions and ecstatic triumphs that shape Naomi Osaka as both an elite global superstar and a young woman navigating a pressure-filled world.', 'What does it feel like to be one of the best tennis players in the world? An intimate look inside the life of one of the most gifted and complex athletes of her generation offers insight into the tough decisions and ecstatic triumphs that shape Naomi Osaka as both an elite global superstar and a young woman navigating a pressure-filled world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DxZG6UyFB6EYDBqV8fJAs30Zn8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126387'),
  ('823334131653245782', 'Napoleon', 2002, 'Drama, War & Politics, Action & Adventure', 'Max Gallo, Yves Simoneau', 'Didier Decoin', 'Christian Clavier, Isabella Rossellini, John Malkovich, Gérard Depardieu, Heino Ferch, Claudio Amendola, Anouk Aimée, Alain Doutey', 'NR', 'A masterful soldier, tactician and statesmen, Napoleon Bonaparte''s courage and love for his country sees him rise from an unpaid general consumed with ambition to the most powerful man in Europe, then his fall, and exile.', 'A masterful soldier, tactician and statesmen, Napoleon Bonaparte''s courage and love for his country sees him rise from an unpaid general consumed with ambition to the most powerful man in Europe, then his fall, and exile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Mw5fkDwm1Pg4JLeUgP3SgoOsTJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2701'),
  ('358393395811254875', 'Napoleon Dynamite', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Mike Scully, Jared Hess, Jerusha Hess', null, 'Jon Heder, Haylie Duff, Jon Gries, Tina Majorino, Efren Ramirez, Sandy Martin, Diedrich Bader, Aaron Ruell', 'TV-PG', 'Napoleon Dynamite is an American animated sitcom based on the 2004 cult film of the same name. The series was created by Jared and Jerusha Hess and developed by the Hesses and Mike Scully. The series follows the adventures of Napoleon Dynamite in the small town of Preston, Idaho. The Hesses came up with the idea for the series after filming Napoleon Dynamite. It originally ran on Fox from January 15, 2012, to March 4, 2012, before being cancelled.', 'Napoleon Dynamite is an American animated sitcom based on the 2004 cult film of the same name. The series was created by Jared and Jerusha Hess and developed by the Hesses and Mike Scully. The series follows the adventures of Napoleon Dynamite in the small town of Preston, Idaho. The Hesses came up with the idea for the series after filming Napoleon Dynamite. It originally ran on Fox from January 15, 2012, to March 4, 2012, before being cancelled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ysrqA6uBDNExVOrKOI7UMFjQ8W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39715'),
