  ('766075686466214565', 'Narco-Saints', 2022, 'Crime', 'Yoon Jong-bin', 'Yoon Jong-bin, Kwon Sung-hui', 'Ha Jung-woo, Hwang Jung-min, Park Hae-soo, Jo Woo-jin, Yoo Yeon-seok, Choo Ja-hyun, Hyun Bong-sik, Lee Bong-ryeon', 'TV-MA', 'An ordinary entrepreneur joins a secret government mission to capture a Korean drug lord operating in South America.', 'An ordinary entrepreneur joins a secret government mission to capture a Korean drug lord operating in South America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ivM3YptVuFgumcZMjCMi28k2EF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97970'),
