  ('924084827742192472', 'Natural High', 2023, 'Reality, Comedy', 'Teng Shen', null, 'Teng Shen, Adam Fan, Wang Anyu, Johnny Huang', null, 'Come and join Shen Teng and his friends as they step away from the bustling crowded cities and reconnect with the beautiful wild nature.', 'Come and join Shen Teng and his friends as they step away from the bustling crowded cities and reconnect with the beautiful wild nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmvlxQ5AXuHLfKvyqkgCDZfVzxM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:231620'),
  ('808501490798398496', 'Natural Six', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Harry McEntire, Aoife Wilson, Alex Jordan, Doug Cockle, Hollie Bennett, Ben Starr', null, 'In the world of Reliquiae, a group of five heroes, bound by fate and The Web''s influence, embarks on a mission that unravels hidden truths about the world and ancient powers.', 'In the world of Reliquiae, a group of five heroes, bound by fate and The Web''s influence, embarks on a mission that unravels hidden truths about the world and ancient powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iyRiRNXQszMdWYERRpP2g64JBc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:305947'),
  ('461379356260904420', 'Natural World', 1983, 'Documentary', null, 'Brian Jackman', 'David Attenborough, John Hannah, Juliet Stevenson', 'TV-PG', 'Natural World is a nature documentary television series broadcast annually on BBC Two and regarded by the BBC as its flagship natural history brand. It is currently the longest-running series in its genre on British television, with more than 400 episodes broadcast since its inception in 1983. Natural World is produced by the BBC Natural History Unit in Bristol, but individual programmes can be in-house productions, collaborative productions with other broadcasters or films made and distributed by independent production companies and purchased by the BBC. Natural World programmes are often broadcast as PBS Nature episodes in the USA. Since 2008, most Natural World programmes have been shot and broadcast in high definition.', 'Natural World is a nature documentary television series broadcast annually on BBC Two and regarded by the BBC as its flagship natural history brand. It is currently the longest-running series in its genre on British television, with more than 400 episodes broadcast since its inception in 1983. Natural World is produced by the BBC Natural History Unit in Bristol, but individual programmes can be in-house productions, collaborative productions with other broadcasters or films made and distributed by independent production companies and purchased by the BBC. Natural World programmes are often broadcast as PBS Nature episodes in the USA. Since 2008, most Natural World programmes have been shot and broadcast in high definition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lM2O6k77POzauRNR6iAcOFZKwqY.jpg', 39, 'tmdb:tv:21145'),
  ('488211225093056693', 'Nature', 1982, 'Documentary, Family', 'Thomas Lovejoy, George Page', null, null, 'TV-G', 'Consistently stunning documentaries transport viewers to far-flung locations ranging from the torrid African plains to the chilly splendours of icy Antarctica. The show''s primary focus is on animals and ecosystems around the world. A comic book based on the show, meant to be used an as educational tool for kids, was briefly distributed to museums and schools at no cost in the mid-2000s.', 'Consistently stunning documentaries transport viewers to far-flung locations ranging from the torrid African plains to the chilly splendours of icy Antarctica. The show''s primary focus is on animals and ecosystems around the world. A comic book based on the show, meant to be used an as educational tool for kids, was briefly distributed to museums and schools at no cost in the mid-2000s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRg5boKJdJhJKoGJdchVqPGQTEl.jpg', 44, 'tmdb:tv:14951'),
  ('850280253581362531', 'Nature''s Great Events', 2009, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', 'TV-G', 'Documentary series looking at the most dramatic wildlife spectacles on our planet, showing how life responds to natural events which can dramatically transform entire landscapes.', 'Documentary series looking at the most dramatic wildlife spectacles on our planet, showing how life responds to natural events which can dramatically transform entire landscapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbzbvNe8ht9jSHKsNPXfx5I9BWi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19744'),
  ('835321014296208687', 'Naughty Babe', 2023, 'Drama', null, 'Piangpaitoon Satrawaha, Preechaya Prayongsap', 'Natasit Uareksit, Kornthas Rujeerattanavorapan, Chawarin Perdpiriyawong, Pruk Panich, Supha Sangaworawong, Penpetch Benyakul, Teerapong Liaorakwong', null, 'Left alone before the wedding, Khondiao flees—only for Yi to chase him, crash, and wake up blaming Khondiao for everything.', 'Left alone before the wedding, Khondiao flees—only for Yi to chase him, crash, and wake up blaming Khondiao for everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20c4ZGTF8nL3JmxyCASW8W5EgvG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223906'),
  ('329305749319669953', 'Nautilus', 2024, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'James Dormer', null, 'Shazad Latif, Georgia Flood, Céline Menville, Thierry Frémont, Luke Arnold, Jacob Collins-Levy, Damien Garvey, Cameron Cuffe', 'TV-PG', 'The origin story of the iconic Captain Nemo: an Indian Prince robbed of his birthright and family, a prisoner of the East India Mercantile Company and a man bent on revenge against the forces that have taken everything from him.', 'The origin story of the iconic Captain Nemo: an Indian Prince robbed of his birthright and family, a prisoner of the East India Mercantile Company and a man bent on revenge against the forces that have taken everything from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBHzItKQNfPdt2GL4LcHJy8P1sH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131835'),
