  ('127329156149901815', 'Néboa', 2020, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Alberto Guntín, Xosé Morais, Víctor Sierra', null, 'Emma Suárez, Nacho Nugo, Jorge Varandela, Santi Cuquejo, Isabel Naveira, Nancho Novo, Alba Galocha, Denisse Peña', null, 'As it had happened before, a body appears on the first night of the Carnival. The locals are sure this the work of "Urco", and that more murders will follow until the festival is over.', 'As it had happened before, a body appears on the first night of the Carnival. The locals are sure this the work of "Urco", and that more murders will follow until the festival is over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQYCzpxoUNzq5ekiygAUqanw63H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95881'),
  ('6991470296158173', 'Necessary Roughness', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Callie Thorne, Scott Cohen, Mehcad Brooks, John Stamos, Karissa Lee Staples', 'TV-PG', 'A tough, sexy Long Island divorcee, Callie Thorne, gets a job as therapist for a professional football team in order to make ends meet. Underestimated at every turn, she succeeds beyond all expectations and soon finds herself as the sought-after therapist to high-profile clients. As a newly single mom raising two teenagers, she is determined to make her new career work by striking a balance between her personal and professional worlds.', 'A tough, sexy Long Island divorcee, Callie Thorne, gets a job as therapist for a professional football team in order to make ends meet. Underestimated at every turn, she succeeds beyond all expectations and soon finds herself as the sought-after therapist to high-profile clients. As a newly single mom raising two teenagers, she is determined to make her new career work by striking a balance between her personal and professional worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ch0k5IfqOan8YkVEnVebbK0Sk0n.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:35348'),
  ('292766484149097232', 'Ned & Stacey', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Michael J. Weithorn', null, 'Thomas Haden Church, Debra Messing, Greg Germann, Nadia Dajani, Marcia Cross', null, 'A self-centered ad exec and a liberal journalist enter into a marriage of convenience. He''s trying to boost his business image; she likes his apartment.', 'A self-centered ad exec and a liberal journalist enter into a marriage of convenience. He''s trying to boost his business image; she likes his apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPU99QHFS6P7sgAfYcIKgDcr04l.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2624'),
  ('800210607781811214', 'Ned''s Declassified School Survival Guide', 2004, 'Comedy, Kids', 'Scott Fellows', null, 'Devon Werkheiser, Lindsey Shaw, Daniel Curtis Lee, Daran Norris', 'TV-Y7', 'The whacky adventures of Ned Bigby and his best pals Moze and Cookie at James K. Polk Middle School, as "every-kid" Ned shatters the fourth wall to share tips and tricks on navigating middle school or junior high hurdles. Ned''s not super cool, and he has no superpowers. He is, however, witty, well-groomed, upbeat and self-aware. Moreover, with more than a little help from his two best friends, he''s equipped to conquer middle school minefields. From crushing bullies to crushes, from off- the-wall, mean and cool teachers to pop quizzes, elections and detentions, Ned knows that nothing, including the seventh grade, is as bad as it seems, and friendship matters most.', 'The whacky adventures of Ned Bigby and his best pals Moze and Cookie at James K. Polk Middle School, as "every-kid" Ned shatters the fourth wall to share tips and tricks on navigating middle school or junior high hurdles. Ned''s not super cool, and he has no superpowers. He is, however, witty, well-groomed, upbeat and self-aware. Moreover, with more than a little help from his two best friends, he''s equipped to conquer middle school minefields. From crushing bullies to crushes, from off- the-wall, mean and cool teachers to pop quizzes, elections and detentions, Ned knows that nothing, including the seventh grade, is as bad as it seems, and friendship matters most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kUXoJFmj6vOdmqMMoiYZj0eY2F.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1600'),
  ('347164840208616961', 'Ned''s Newt', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Andy Knight, Mike Burgess, Andrew Nicholls', null, 'Harland Williams, Tracey Moore, Peter Keleghan, Carolyn Scott, Colin O''Meara', 'TV-Y', 'When nine-year-old Ned Flemkin feeds his pet newt a can of Zippo, he ends up turning into a 6-foot shapeshifting pal for life.', 'When nine-year-old Ned Flemkin feeds his pet newt a can of Zippo, he ends up turning into a 6-foot shapeshifting pal for life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YeBFL4MMHeRaHH1rs0P2nOl5JT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:6361'),
  ('1142703799497210810', 'Needless', 2009, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Eri Kitamura, Takehito Koyasu, Aya Endo, Kenji Utsumi, Kentaro Ito, Hiroki Touchi', 'TV-14', 'Adam Blade is a "Needless", a person possessing amazing mutant abilities. To restore peace to a war ravaged Japan, he and his friends fight against a evil research group called Simeon.', 'Adam Blade is a "Needless", a person possessing amazing mutant abilities. To restore peace to a war ravaged Japan, he and his friends fight against a evil research group called Simeon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZzH3D46034BJ7n2lfhN4jDn4FV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34806'),
  ('750963153628213988', 'NEEDY GIRL OVERDOSE', 2026, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Rina Kawaguchi, Satsuki Shiina, Seena Hoshiki', null, 'In a world where likes are currency and every viewer is a judge, OMGkawaiiAngel—also known as KAngel—is determined to become the ultimate "Internet Angel." Yet beneath her pastel smile and lively streams, there''s more than meets the eye.', 'In a world where likes are currency and every viewer is a judge, OMGkawaiiAngel—also known as KAngel—is determined to become the ultimate "Internet Angel." Yet beneath her pastel smile and lively streams, there''s more than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQdd6noINdUk1uvxqGnhlESYX3S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:305329'),
  ('718613420723226984', 'Neeya Naana', 2006, 'Family, Talk', null, null, 'Gobinath Chandran', 'TV-14', 'A talk show where two polarised groups of society are given the platform to share their views and see a different perspective on socially-relevant topics.', 'A talk show where two polarised groups of society are given the platform to share their views and see a different perspective on socially-relevant topics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJswvJkie98HCbZuxbO3nM96tOG.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:120224'),
  ('151026989292667732', 'Negative Positive Angler', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Mutsuki Iwanaka, Fairouz Ai, Kaito Ishikawa', null, 'Tsunehiro’s life isn’t easy. After a doctor gives him two years to live and debt collectors come knocking, he falls from a bridge. In the knick of time, Hana and her crew spot Tsunehiro and pull him to safety. Before returning, they anchor offshore to fish and Tsunehiro catches a huge sea bass in a bout of beginner’s luck. As his apartment building crumbles, Tsunehiro’s new life begins to unfold!', 'Tsunehiro’s life isn’t easy. After a doctor gives him two years to live and debt collectors come knocking, he falls from a bridge. In the knick of time, Hana and her crew spot Tsunehiro and pull him to safety. Before returning, they anchor offshore to fish and Tsunehiro catches a huge sea bass in a bout of beginner’s luck. As his apartment building crumbles, Tsunehiro’s new life begins to unfold!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTa90snCvIgN4pFRB6op5MLLLCv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:260689'),
  ('966795605467126852', 'Negima!', 2005, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ken Akamatsu', null, 'Shizuka Hasegawa, Hiroshi, Arisa Miyazawa, Natsuko Aso, Nao Oikawa, Daisuke Ono, Mari Kanou', 'TV-PG', 'Vampires, robots, sorcery… And that’s all before Gym Class! Welcome to Mahora Academy, an all-girls school where the impossible and the enchanting are a part of the curriculum. It’s the start of the new school year and emotions run rampant as the girls of Class 2-A meet the newest staff addition – Negi Springfield. A ten-year-old Welsh born prodigy, Negi has more problems than he has students. As a wizard-in-training, this academic appointment is the final requirement in his quest to become a Magister Magorum. But if he messes things up and the girls find out, existence as an exotic ermine will be his fate!', 'Vampires, robots, sorcery… And that’s all before Gym Class! Welcome to Mahora Academy, an all-girls school where the impossible and the enchanting are a part of the curriculum. It’s the start of the new school year and emotions run rampant as the girls of Class 2-A meet the newest staff addition – Negi Springfield. A ten-year-old Welsh born prodigy, Negi has more problems than he has students. As a wizard-in-training, this academic appointment is the final requirement in his quest to become a Magister Magorum. But if he messes things up and the girls find out, existence as an exotic ermine will be his fate!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfEiIQQ1n3LgSRznpoDWpniCnfo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8859'),
  ('1003333878801437085', 'Negima!? Magister Negi Magi', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Rina Sato, Masahito Yabe, Akemi Kanda, Ai Nonaka, Mamiko Noto, Yuki Matsuoka, Akeno Watanabe, Misa Kobayashi', 'TV-MA', 'Wizard Negi Springfield may be a boy, but he has a man-sized job to do! Fresh from the Academy of Magic, Negi continues his training as an instructor at Mahora Academy in Japan. But before he can get his Master’s in magic, the 31 schoolgirls of Class 3-A are gonna keep him up all night cramming for a final exam in will power. Temptation aside, Negi has more on his syllabus than flirting and spells. Darkness is closing in, and Negi is gonna need help from his student bodies to drive the ghouls from their school. These girls want to prove that they’re best in class, and extra credit is available to the cuties that aren’t afraid of after hours phantom fighting – especially if it means more time with their favorite professor.', 'Wizard Negi Springfield may be a boy, but he has a man-sized job to do! Fresh from the Academy of Magic, Negi continues his training as an instructor at Mahora Academy in Japan. But before he can get his Master’s in magic, the 31 schoolgirls of Class 3-A are gonna keep him up all night cramming for a final exam in will power. Temptation aside, Negi has more on his syllabus than flirting and spells. Darkness is closing in, and Negi is gonna need help from his student bodies to drive the ghouls from their school. These girls want to prove that they’re best in class, and extra credit is available to the cuties that aren’t afraid of after hours phantom fighting – especially if it means more time with their favorite professor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9S2i3Ocbb7WGt94N2m64re5Sh8Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16950'),
  ('750570678379458462', 'Negociador', 2023, 'Drama', 'Gustavo Mello, Thomas Stavros, Thiago Faelli', 'Thomas Stavros, José Guertzenstein, Gabriela Giffoni', 'Malvino Salvador, Barbara Reis, César Mello, Emílio de Mello, Rodrigo dos Santos, Lee Taylor', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ho6HlykHPNc2YmpDRkzLzojEHF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194756'),
  ('503618375920206021', 'Negotiator', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yang Mi, Huang Zitao, Dylan Kuo, Nikita Mao, Zhu Xudan, Lai Yi, Li Dongheng, Li Tingting', null, 'Dou Qiao is a genius negotiator who is the star of the US-China Business Council. Male lead Xie Xiaofei also works as a negotiator, but is actually the sole heir of a wealthy Chinese-American corporation who wants nothing to do with the family business. He vents his frustrations on Dou Qiao, though their bickering relationship soon takes a romantic turn. The couple separates after Dou Qiao discovers the Xie Family had a hand in her parents’ deaths, only to meet several years later as negotiators of rival firms.', 'Dou Qiao is a genius negotiator who is the star of the US-China Business Council. Male lead Xie Xiaofei also works as a negotiator, but is actually the sole heir of a wealthy Chinese-American corporation who wants nothing to do with the family business. He vents his frustrations on Dou Qiao, though their bickering relationship soon takes a romantic turn. The couple separates after Dou Qiao discovers the Xie Family had a hand in her parents’ deaths, only to meet several years later as negotiators of rival firms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJ7WeCVDBlSsijx0UBtI0vyd8fc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72977'),
  ('1058098097505499519', 'Neighborhood’s Hero', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Jang Minsuk', 'Park Si-hoo, Cho Seong-ha, Lee Soo-hyuk, Kwon Yu-ri, Yoon Tae-young, Jeong Man-sik, Song Jae-ho, Lee Han-wi', null, 'Baek Shi-Yoon is an ex-secret agent. He is a well-trained human weapon. Hiding his past, he buys the bar "Neighborhood" and runs it is as the owner. He gets close to the neighborhood regulars at his bar and sympathizes with their pain. Baek Shi-Yoon meets a young man who works as a temporary employee. The young wants to become a police officer. Baek Shi-Yoon trains the young man as a secret agent and they fight together against evil.', 'Baek Shi-Yoon is an ex-secret agent. He is a well-trained human weapon. Hiding his past, he buys the bar "Neighborhood" and runs it is as the owner. He gets close to the neighborhood regulars at his bar and sympathizes with their pain. Baek Shi-Yoon meets a young man who works as a temporary employee. The young wants to become a police officer. Baek Shi-Yoon trains the young man as a secret agent and they fight together against evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoyrRV2QJWNtwGLF7ggL2hLPqMo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64801'),
  ('610528638908464993', 'Neighbors from Hell', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Pam Brady', null, 'Will Sasso, Patton Oswalt, Steve Coogan, Molly Shannon, Kyle McCulloch, David Soren, Kurtwood Smith, Tracey Fairaway', 'TV-14', 'The Hellmans are a typical, all-American suburban family in every way except one: they''re from hell. They''ve been sent to Earth by Satan, on a mission to stop humans from drilling into their underworld home.', 'The Hellmans are a typical, all-American suburban family in every way except one: they''re from hell. They''ve been sent to Earth by Satan, on a mission to stop humans from drilling into their underworld home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kf6IRph1CFdGc4UKVn7ji5tWhz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32858'),
  ('1009103343112662920', 'Neighbours', 1985, 'Soap, Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Reg Watson', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Neighbours is an Australian television soap opera. The show''s storylines concern the domestic and professional lives of the people who live and work in Erinsborough, a fictional suburb of Melbourne, Victoria. The series primarily centres around the residents of Ramsay Street, a short cul-de-sac, and its neighbouring areas, the Lassiters complex, which includes a bar, hotel, cafe, news office and park. Neighbours began with three families created by Watson – the Ramsays, the Robinsons and the Clarkes. Watson said that he wanted to show three families who are friends living in a small street. The Robinsons and the Ramsays had a long history and were involved in an ongoing rivalry.', 'Neighbours is an Australian television soap opera. The show''s storylines concern the domestic and professional lives of the people who live and work in Erinsborough, a fictional suburb of Melbourne, Victoria. The series primarily centres around the residents of Ramsay Street, a short cul-de-sac, and its neighbouring areas, the Lassiters complex, which includes a bar, hotel, cafe, news office and park. Neighbours began with three families created by Watson – the Ramsays, the Robinsons and the Clarkes. Watson said that he wanted to show three families who are friends living in a small street. The Robinsons and the Ramsays had a long history and were involved in an ongoing rivalry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXY78bQsKCIiD17Sr6yO4wLIXqS.jpg', 41, 'tmdb:tv:2674'),
  ('291403253167128754', 'Neil Gaiman''s Likely Stories', 2016, 'Drama', 'Neil Gaiman', null, null, null, 'A unique collection of extraordinary fantastical short stories from the pen of Neil Gaiman, directed by Iain Forsyth & Jane Pollard. With a score by Jarvis Cocker and starring a host of British acting talent led by Tom Hughes, Johnny Vegas, George MacKay, Rita Tushingham and Kenneth Cranham.', 'A unique collection of extraordinary fantastical short stories from the pen of Neil Gaiman, directed by Iain Forsyth & Jane Pollard. With a score by Jarvis Cocker and starring a host of British acting talent led by Tom Hughes, Johnny Vegas, George MacKay, Rita Tushingham and Kenneth Cranham.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrLEwBRGF14VwUn9MEOuahj2jMk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66612'),
  ('333300127460352613', 'Nekopara', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuki Yagi, Iori Saeki, Shiori Izawa, Miku Ito, Yuri Noguchi, Marin Mizutani, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Mao Ichimichi', 'TV-14', 'Kashou Minaduki is an aspiring chef who moves away from home to open his own confection shop. While he is unpacking in his new shop, he discovers that two of his family''s Nekos, Chocola and Vanilla, came along with him by hiding in cardboard boxes. After the two Nekos convince Kashou to let them stay and live with him, the three of them work together to run his shop, La Soleil. During the story, Kashou receives a couple of visits from his younger sister Shigure and the other four Nekos owned by their family.', 'Kashou Minaduki is an aspiring chef who moves away from home to open his own confection shop. While he is unpacking in his new shop, he discovers that two of his family''s Nekos, Chocola and Vanilla, came along with him by hiding in cardboard boxes. After the two Nekos convince Kashou to let them stay and live with him, the three of them work together to run his shop, La Soleil. During the story, Kashou receives a couple of visits from his younger sister Shigure and the other four Nekos owned by their family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42r41IMXpMhMtTKyJIJORf6L994.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95317'),
  ('203758025045490245', 'Nelly & Ashanti: We Belong Together', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'A couple rekindles their romance while handling marriage, parenthood, and careers. They face challenges together, showing how love gets a second chance.', 'A couple rekindles their romance while handling marriage, parenthood, and careers. They face challenges together, showing how love gets a second chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mu0EJ27Wecrcw0AJUoiZr2aXxaA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:293313'),
  ('782925093707739358', 'Nemesis', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Willem Bosch, Pieter Kuijpers', null, 'Lies Visschedijk, Romana Vrede, Peter Blok, Florian Regtien, Jade Olieberg, Bram Suijker, Chris Peters, Emma Buysse', 'TV-MA', 'A public prosecutor in The Hague, and a detective at the Dutch Revenue Service FIOD, follow money trails and investigate hit jobs in search of criminals.', 'A public prosecutor in The Hague, and a detective at the Dutch Revenue Service FIOD, follow money trails and investigate hit jobs in search of criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q05ZmLKnxz4HT4UbTm09uzGS3l9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158902'),
