  ('756323654813940711', 'Nemocnice na kraji města', 1978, 'Drama', 'Jaroslav Dietl', null, null, null, 'Hospital at the End of the City is a popular television series first released in Czechoslovakia in 1977, it featured an ensemble cast and received much viewer praise in central Europe. The series ran from 1977 to 1981 for a total of twenty episodes. The success of the series inspired the German television series The Black Forest Clinic.', 'Hospital at the End of the City is a popular television series first released in Czechoslovakia in 1977, it featured an ensemble cast and received much viewer praise in central Europe. The series ran from 1977 to 1981 for a total of twenty episodes. The success of the series inspired the German television series The Black Forest Clinic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aE3n9DnqlrMvB5tOZU8gIw20Aer.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:16088'),
  ('747932760663239509', 'Neo Magazin Royale', 2013, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Jan Böhmermann, Philipp Kässbohrer, J. Patrick Arbeiter', 'Ralf Kabelka, Kai Tiegelkamp, Stefan Titze', 'Jan Böhmermann', null, 'Neo Magazin Royale is a satirical late night show hosted by Jan Böhmermann.', 'Neo Magazin Royale is a satirical late night show hosted by Jan Böhmermann.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyGd40QPEzDyqW4hkErOzCRBPa7.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:60742'),
  ('402244371181690538', 'Neo Ranga', 1998, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Eri Sendai, Megumi Ogata, Yuko Miyamura, Yuko Sumitomo, Yukiko Mannaka, Ginzo Matsuo, Kouki Miyata, Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'TV-PG', 'Across the ocean on the tiny island kingdom of Barou the ancient god Neo Ranga awakens from his slumber. He is mysteriously drawn to Tokyo, and the three beautiful sisters - Minami, Ushio, and Yuuhi - who are unwittingly linked to the monster. But instead of rolling out the red carpet, the military rolls out the weaponry, and things start to get nasty. The plot thickens: Why is Neo Ranga driven to Tokyo? Is he a messenger with a warning for humankind, or just a big boy out for a good time? And what''s behind Ranga''s mysterious eyes?', 'Across the ocean on the tiny island kingdom of Barou the ancient god Neo Ranga awakens from his slumber. He is mysteriously drawn to Tokyo, and the three beautiful sisters - Minami, Ushio, and Yuuhi - who are unwittingly linked to the monster. But instead of rolling out the red carpet, the military rolls out the weaponry, and things start to get nasty. The plot thickens: Why is Neo Ranga driven to Tokyo? Is he a messenger with a warning for humankind, or just a big boy out for a good time? And what''s behind Ranga''s mysterious eyes?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZ4eKxmh7y0n1so7qUdP3gfTdiM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:8922'),
  ('534007450301801492', 'Neo Yokio', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Ezra Koenig', null, 'Jaden Smith, Jude Law, Tavi Gevinson, Susan Sarandon, The Kid Mero, Desus Nice, Jason Schwartzman, Alexa Chung', 'TV-MA', 'Joined by his faithful mecha-butler, Kaz Kaan pursues love, fashion and supernatural forces amid Neo Yokio''s sinister high society.', 'Joined by his faithful mecha-butler, Kaz Kaan pursues love, fashion and supernatural forces amid Neo Yokio''s sinister high society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPC7se2Vi9vc9BSiCvSeV0pO9J2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74044'),
  ('508222941620249271', 'Neon', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Shea Serrano, Max Searle', null, 'Tyler Dean Flores, Emma Ferreira, Jordan Mendoza, Alycia Pascual-Peña, Jordana Brewster, Genesis Rodriguez, Santiago Cabrera, Courtney Taylor', 'TV-MA', 'Three friends move from a small town in Florida to Miami with the hopes of making it big in reggaeton music.', 'Three friends move from a small town in Florida to Miami with the hopes of making it big in reggaeton music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyRYoy12Lhf5tDHMbVvM32KHtRM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214128'),
  ('837627336882390431', 'Neon Genesis Evangelion', 1995, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Megumi Ogata, Kotono Mitsuishi, Megumi Hayashibara, Yuko Miyamura, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Fumihiko Tachiki, Motomu Kiyokawa, Miki Nagasawa', 'TV-14', 'At the turn of the century, the Angels returned to Earth, seeking to wipe out humanity in an apocalyptic fury. Devastated, mankind''s last remnants moved underground to wait for the day when the Angels would come back to finish the job. Fifteen years later, that day has come... but this time, humanity is ready to fight back with terrifying bio-mechanical weapons known as the Evangelions. Watch as Shinji, Rei, Asuka and the rest of the mysterious shadow agency Nerv battle to save earth from total annihilation.', 'At the turn of the century, the Angels returned to Earth, seeking to wipe out humanity in an apocalyptic fury. Devastated, mankind''s last remnants moved underground to wait for the day when the Angels would come back to finish the job. Fifteen years later, that day has come... but this time, humanity is ready to fight back with terrifying bio-mechanical weapons known as the Evangelions. Watch as Shinji, Rei, Asuka and the rest of the mysterious shadow agency Nerv battle to save earth from total annihilation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2ah9t0navXyIvoHg1uIbIHO3tt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:890'),
  ('503298582107757685', 'Neon Joe, Werewolf Hunter', 2015, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jon Glaser', 'Jon Glaser', 'Jon Glaser', 'TV-PG', 'Set in the pretend sleepy enclave of Garrity, Vermont, Neon Joe, Werewolf Hunter is the story of a neon-clad man with a mysterious past and a highly specialized skill set - hunting werewolves.', 'Set in the pretend sleepy enclave of Garrity, Vermont, Neon Joe, Werewolf Hunter is the story of a neon-clad man with a mysterious past and a highly specialized skill set - hunting werewolves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9EGkmKn5gh20UdMA4yKiybk2hk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64643'),
