  ('298487848836083944', 'Néro the Assassin', 2025, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Allan Mauduit, Jean-Patrick Benes, Martin Douaire', null, 'Pio Marmaï, Alice Isaaz, Olivier Gourmet, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Lili-Rose Carlier Taboury, Camille Razat, Yann Gael, Max Baissette de Malglaive', 'TV-MA', 'France, 1504. A ruthless assassin goes on the run with his estranged daughter in his quest to protect her from deadly enemies and evil forces.', 'France, 1504. A ruthless assassin goes on the run with his estranged daughter in his quest to protect her from deadly enemies and evil forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgzHLXOEILDwvj19tggt3ZLsfTF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249551'),
