  ('363158710387277816', 'Newsreaders', 2013, 'News, Comedy', 'David Wain, Rob Corddry', null, 'Alan Tudyk, David Wain, Ray Wise', 'TV-14', 'Newsreaders is a quarter-hour format American television comedy that lampoons the news magazine genre. The series is a spinoff of the Adult Swim show Childrens Hospital and stars Mather Zickel as Louis LaFonda, the host of the fictional news magazine Newsreaders.', 'Newsreaders is a quarter-hour format American television comedy that lampoons the news magazine genre. The series is a spinoff of the Adult Swim show Childrens Hospital and stars Mather Zickel as Louis LaFonda, the host of the fictional news magazine Newsreaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGwdkncdJp1OGmmrKShCqaYzcKL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:51658'),
  ('838094420730676021', 'Newswipe with Charlie Brooker', 2009, 'News, Documentary', 'Charlie Brooker', null, 'Charlie Brooker', null, 'Newswipe with Charlie Brooker was a British news review programme broadcast on BBC Four written and presented by Charlie Brooker. It is similar to Brooker''s Screenwipe series which is also shown on BBC Four. A first series of six episodes ran between 25 March 2009 and 29 April 2009. A second series began on 19 January 2010 and concluded on 23 February 2010.', 'Newswipe with Charlie Brooker was a British news review programme broadcast on BBC Four written and presented by Charlie Brooker. It is similar to Brooker''s Screenwipe series which is also shown on BBC Four. A first series of six episodes ran between 25 March 2009 and 29 April 2009. A second series began on 19 January 2010 and concluded on 23 February 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXZLaXTUHn4468Itu5yA6KtcbT6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:17968'),
  ('360584366617174364', 'Newton''s Cradle', 2021, 'Drama', 'Tamer Mohsen', 'Samar Abdel Nasser, Mohamed El Shekhiby, Maha El Wazir', 'Mona Zaki, Mohamed Mamdouh, Mohamed Farag, Sayed Ragab, Aïcha Ben Ahmed, Adam El Sharkawy, Mayan ElSayed, Alaa Sinan', 'TV-14', 'The two lovers, Hazem and Hana, decide to have their baby in America to get the nationality. However, they come across many obstacles that threaten their marriage, especially when Hana stays in America and does not come back.', 'The two lovers, Hazem and Hana, decide to have their baby in America to get the nationality. However, they come across many obstacles that threaten their marriage, especially when Hana stays in America and does not come back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFpFQNmiT9MK0fMvGBPLvx5W0BC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121487'),
  ('1116542455647873487', 'Newtopia', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Han Jin-won, Ji Ho-jin', 'Han Jin-won', 'Park Jeong-min, Lee Hak-ju, JISOO, Im Sung-jae, Hong Seo-hui, Kang Young-suk, Lee Ju-won, Kim Sang-heun', null, 'Jae-yoon, a late military enlistee, and his girlfriend, Young-joo, break up over the phone over growing misunderstandings. But a zombie outbreak rocks the world. A national emergency is declared, a plane crashes in the city center, and Jae-yoon and his unit get trapped on top of a Seoul skyscraper. Young-joo risks the zombie-filled streets to find him. Can their love survive the apocalypse?', 'Jae-yoon, a late military enlistee, and his girlfriend, Young-joo, break up over the phone over growing misunderstandings. But a zombie outbreak rocks the world. A national emergency is declared, a plane crashes in the city center, and Jae-yoon and his unit get trapped on top of a Seoul skyscraper. Young-joo risks the zombie-filled streets to find him. Can their love survive the apocalypse?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIC36RA59lg9ruYtPc7UA3f72yy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233742'),
  ('934042500453457784', 'NEXT', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Crime', 'Manny Coto', null, 'John Slattery, Fernanda Andrade, Michael Mosley, Gerardo Celasco, Eve Harlow, Evan Whitten, Aaron Moten, Elizabeth Cappuccino', 'TV-14', 'A Silicon Valley pioneer discovers that one of his own creations – a powerful A.I. – might spell global catastrophe, and teams up with a cybercrime agent to fight a villain unlike anything we’ve ever seen – one whose greatest weapon against us is ourselves.', 'A Silicon Valley pioneer discovers that one of his own creations – a powerful A.I. – might spell global catastrophe, and teams up with a cybercrime agent to fight a villain unlike anything we’ve ever seen – one whose greatest weapon against us is ourselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9bJd2cx2I3xfJqHKVVSAOCmdyL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89571'),
