  ('248934298488146325', 'Ni Hao, Kai-Lan', 2007, 'Animation, Kids, Family', 'Karen Chau', null, 'Khamani Griffin, Clem Cheung, Angie Wu, Jade-Lianna Peters', 'TV-Y', 'Six-year-old Kai-Lan and her animal pals face kid-sized hurdles, learn about getting along and teach young viewers a few words of Chinese along the way.', 'Six-year-old Kai-Lan and her animal pals face kid-sized hurdles, learn about getting along and teach young viewers a few words of Chinese along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqg9C1IDHKemsvir12cqXpIB5gM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:14826'),
  ('230115946601345983', 'Nice to Not Meet You', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Ga Ram', null, 'Lee Jung-jae, Lim Ji-yeon, Kim Ji-hoon, Seo Ji-hye, Choi Gwi-hwa, Kim Hyun-jin, Jin Ho-eun, Jeon Seong-woo', null, 'A hateful romance between a professional detective actor who wants to become a melodrama master and a female reporter who was demoted from a political reporter who won the Reporter of the Year award to the entertainment department.', 'A hateful romance between a professional detective actor who wants to become a melodrama master and a female reporter who was demoted from a political reporter who won the Reporter of the Year award to the entertainment department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h14bGZcVxYQzLoxC8KYqUVWvYfU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:285770'),
  ('275248573490816272', 'Nichijou: My Ordinary Life', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', null, 'Keiichi Arawi', 'Mariko Honda, Mai Aizawa, Misuzu Togashi, Shizuka Furuya, Hiromi Konno, Minoru Shiraishi', 'TV-14', 'Follow the adventures of three ordinary girls as they make life’s awkward moments a thousand times worse. Along with a colorful bunch of classmates, they learn their most important lessons the hard way. Meanwhile down the street, a pocket-sized professor makes life difficult for a robot who just wants to be normal. But normal is the last thing you can expect in a town where salmon falls from the sky. In fact, the only thing you can count on is your friends, but even they are totally weird.', 'Follow the adventures of three ordinary girls as they make life’s awkward moments a thousand times worse. Along with a colorful bunch of classmates, they learn their most important lessons the hard way. Meanwhile down the street, a pocket-sized professor makes life difficult for a robot who just wants to be normal. But normal is the last thing you can expect in a town where salmon falls from the sky. In fact, the only thing you can count on is your friends, but even they are totally weird.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tseISx2XcDj1fqqqlBq58yOKmpm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44684'),
  ('414812538570276336', 'Nichols', 1971, 'Western', 'Frank Pierson', null, 'Margot Kidder, James Garner, John Beck, Stuart Margolin, Neva Patterson', 'TV-PG', 'Nichols is an American Western television series starring James Garner broadcast in the United States on NBC during the 1971-72 season. Set the fictional town of Nichols, Arizona, in 1914, Nichols differed from traditional Western series of the era. The main character, a sheriff, rode on a motorcycle and in an automobile rather than on the traditional horse. The hero did not carry a firearm and was generally opposed to the use of violence to solve problems, preferring other means. Margot Kidder portrayed Ruth, the love interest/barmaid of Nichols.', 'Nichols is an American Western television series starring James Garner broadcast in the United States on NBC during the 1971-72 season. Set the fictional town of Nichols, Arizona, in 1914, Nichols differed from traditional Western series of the era. The main character, a sheriff, rode on a motorcycle and in an automobile rather than on the traditional horse. The hero did not carry a firearm and was generally opposed to the use of violence to solve problems, preferring other means. Margot Kidder portrayed Ruth, the love interest/barmaid of Nichols.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51LLIlKmbqEYCAClLdEORqkFeff.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11548'),
