  ('971823612468070730', 'No Activity', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Trent O''Donnell, Patrick Brammall', null, 'Patrick Brammall, Darren Gilshenan, Harriet Dyer, Genevieve Morris', null, 'The nightly exploits of our boys and girls in blue, and their shady criminal counterparts, through an unfolding kidnapping investigation. Truth is, being a cop or a crook is nowhere near as exciting as Hollywood would have us believe. Long nights with nothing to do but watch and wait, and spin a yarn or two... or, in the case of these over-caffeinated, sleep-deprived souls, share way too much information about themselves, opine on matters far beyond their qualifications, and discuss topics that most would agree are strictly NSFW.', 'The nightly exploits of our boys and girls in blue, and their shady criminal counterparts, through an unfolding kidnapping investigation. Truth is, being a cop or a crook is nowhere near as exciting as Hollywood would have us believe. Long nights with nothing to do but watch and wait, and spin a yarn or two... or, in the case of these over-caffeinated, sleep-deprived souls, share way too much information about themselves, opine on matters far beyond their qualifications, and discuss topics that most would agree are strictly NSFW.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJOrMWTA37tzZGHZhWch7SoZTxK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64489'),
  ('1050531317496326065', 'No Activity', 2017, 'Comedy, Animation, Drama', 'Patrick Brammall, Trent O''Donnell', null, 'Tim Meadows, Patrick Brammall, Sunita Mani, Amy Sedaris', 'TV-MA', 'Set against the backdrop of a major drug cartel bust, the series follows two low-level cops who have spent far too much time in a car together, two criminals who are largely kept in the dark, two dispatch workers who haven''t really clicked and two Mexican tunnelers who are in way too small a space considering they''ve only just met.', 'Set against the backdrop of a major drug cartel bust, the series follows two low-level cops who have spent far too much time in a car together, two criminals who are largely kept in the dark, two dispatch workers who haven''t really clicked and two Mexican tunnelers who are in way too small a space considering they''ve only just met.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQTmlqa0jlaMxQ2FZXkKAcMP547.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:74317'),
  ('116091480075375303', 'No Activity: Italy', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Valerio Vestoso', null, 'Luca Zingaretti, Rocco Papaleo, Carla Signoris, Emanuela Fanelli, Fabio Balsamo, Alessandro Tiberi, Maccio Capatonda, Tommaso Ragno', null, 'Three couples on very different duties -- 2 cops, 2 dispatch officers and 2 criminals -- are stuck together in their narrow workspace, be it a police car, a radio station or a container. As the wait prolongs, their personal stories unfold in comic dialogues and unusual bonds form.', 'Three couples on very different duties -- 2 cops, 2 dispatch officers and 2 criminals -- are stuck together in their narrow workspace, be it a police car, a radio station or a container. As the wait prolongs, their personal stories unfold in comic dialogues and unusual bonds form.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mi1Yv34DJ6n2laHJKZ83E97hjCd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242932'),
