  ('102180224175285', 'Norm Macdonald Has a Show', 2018, 'Talk, Comedy', 'Norm Macdonald', 'Norm Macdonald, Josh Gardner', 'Norm Macdonald, Adam Eget', null, 'Building on their original talk show, comedian Norm Macdonald and sidekick Adam Eget sit down and chat with celebrity guests about their life, career and views in a somewhat unconventional and often irreverent way.', 'Building on their original talk show, comedian Norm Macdonald and sidekick Adam Eget sit down and chat with celebrity guests about their life, career and views in a somewhat unconventional and often irreverent way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99RcaUmpgdXqbEXmhyPTWCFbm8K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82193'),
