  ('1040008017855180482', 'Norn9', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mitsuki Saiga, Takuya Sato, Hiro Shimono, Kenji Hamada, Asami Seto, Nagi Yanagi, Ryoka Yuzuki, Noriaki Sugiyama', null, 'Guided by a strange, haunting song, elementary-schooler Sorata Suzuhara from the Heisei Era is warped back in time to 1919, in a high-tech ship called Norn9. This ship, flying above towns resembling that of the Meiji or Taishō period, harbours The Gifted, a group of three girls and eight boys with special abilities. As he tries to find a way to return to his time, he discovers incredible secrets about the world and spacetime itself.', 'Guided by a strange, haunting song, elementary-schooler Sorata Suzuhara from the Heisei Era is warped back in time to 1919, in a high-tech ship called Norn9. This ship, flying above towns resembling that of the Meiji or Taishō period, harbours The Gifted, a group of three girls and eight boys with special abilities. As he tries to find a way to return to his time, he discovers incredible secrets about the world and spacetime itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0ts9p6VN51pFeNIiW1vWRA9yd9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66120'),
  ('553895378895919006', 'Norsemen', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jon Iver Helgaker, Jonas Torgersen', 'Jonas Torgersen, Jon Iver Helgaker', 'Trond Fausa Aurvåg, Jon Øigarden, Kåre Conradi, Silje Torp, Mikkel Bratt Silset, Nils Jørgen Kaalstad, Kristine Riis, Bjørn Hallgeir Myrene', 'TV-MA', 'Norsemen is an epic and humorous drama series set in the Viking Age. The residents of an 8th-century Viking village experience political rivalry, social change and innovations that upend their culture and way of life.', 'Norsemen is an epic and humorous drama series set in the Viking Age. The residents of an 8th-century Viking village experience political rivalry, social change and innovations that upend their culture and way of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCt02AL7i395Nwfq8jbq1C54mvX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:68126'),
  ('295372865891260708', 'Norskov', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', 'Dunja Gry Jensen', 'Dunja Gry Jensen', 'Thomas Levin, Jacob Lohmann, Claus Riis Østergaard, Henrik Birch, Anne Sofie Espersen, Mathias Käki Jørgensen, Daniel Bevensee, Mette Marckmann', null, 'Norskov is a police drama that takes place in an industrial city in northern Denmark. The city is raw and unsentimental, and the financial crisis has left its mark, but there is still a lot of community spirit and empowerment. In the series we follow the policeman Tom Noack, who returns to the city he left almost 20 years ago, and his two childhood friends who in the meantime have become the mayor and primary contractor.', 'Norskov is a police drama that takes place in an industrial city in northern Denmark. The city is raw and unsentimental, and the financial crisis has left its mark, but there is still a lot of community spirit and empowerment. In the series we follow the policeman Tom Noack, who returns to the city he left almost 20 years ago, and his two childhood friends who in the meantime have become the mayor and primary contractor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1VB7lJPOUWEtl3OxapZXVsFIIc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63997'),
  ('628524386062859183', 'North & South', 2004, 'Drama', 'Elizabeth Gaskell, Sandy Welch', 'Sandy Welch', 'Richard Armitage, Daniela Denby-Ashe, Sinéad Cusack, Jo Joyner, Tim Pigott-Smith, Pauline Quirke, Kay Lyon, Brendan Coyle', null, 'Margaret Hale is a southerner from a country vicarage newly settled in the industrial northern town of Milton. In the shock of her move, she misjudges charismatic cotton mill-owner John Thornton, whose strength of purpose and passion are a match for her own pride and willfulness. When the workers of Milton call a strike, Margaret takes their side, and the two are brought into deeper conflict. As events spiral out of control, Margaret - to her surprise - begins to fall in love with Thornton...', 'Margaret Hale is a southerner from a country vicarage newly settled in the industrial northern town of Milton. In the shock of her move, she misjudges charismatic cotton mill-owner John Thornton, whose strength of purpose and passion are a match for her own pride and willfulness. When the workers of Milton call a strike, Margaret takes their side, and the two are brought into deeper conflict. As events spiral out of control, Margaret - to her surprise - begins to fall in love with Thornton...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djdM8JblEUsJN23vXd869X7ACQE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13643'),
  ('87377321904719218', 'North and South', 1985, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Richard T. Heffron', null, 'James Read, Lesley-Anne Down, Patrick Swayze, Philip Casnoff, Terri Garber, Jonathan Frakes, Kyle Chandler, Cathy Lee Crosby', 'TV-PG', 'The story of the enduring friendship between Orry Main of South Carolina and George Hazard of Pennsylvania, who become best friends while attending the United States Military Academy at West Point but later find themselves and their families on opposite sides of the American Civil War.', 'The story of the enduring friendship between Orry Main of South Carolina and George Hazard of Pennsylvania, who become best friends while attending the United States Military Academy at West Point but later find themselves and their families on opposite sides of the American Civil War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yd6Gtg8GntTsOqPf27gGIkS9vIe.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3266'),
  ('387151096175835498', 'North of 60', 1992, 'Drama', null, null, 'Gordon Tootoosis, Tom Jackson, Tina Keeper, Nathaniel Arcand, John Oliver, Wilma Pelly', null, 'North of 60 is a mid-1990s Canadian television series depicting life in the sub-Arctic northern boreal forest. It first aired on CBC Television in 1992 and was syndicated around the world. It is set in the fictional community of Lynx River, a primarily Native-run town depicted as being in the Dehcho Region, Northwest Territories. Most of the characters were Dene. Some non-native characters had important roles: the restaurant/motel owner, the band manager, the nurse and the town''s main RCMP officer. The show explored themes of Native poverty, alcoholism, cultural preservation and conflict over land settlements and natural resource exploitation. Originally somewhat light-hearted, it quickly became a more dramatic and ponderous series.', 'North of 60 is a mid-1990s Canadian television series depicting life in the sub-Arctic northern boreal forest. It first aired on CBC Television in 1992 and was syndicated around the world. It is set in the fictional community of Lynx River, a primarily Native-run town depicted as being in the Dehcho Region, Northwest Territories. Most of the characters were Dene. Some non-native characters had important roles: the restaurant/motel owner, the band manager, the nurse and the town''s main RCMP officer. The show explored themes of Native poverty, alcoholism, cultural preservation and conflict over land settlements and natural resource exploitation. Originally somewhat light-hearted, it quickly became a more dramatic and ponderous series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twsoO8NCTitfW4My9wKz2p5yJou.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:55'),
  ('869706412117537201', 'North of North', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Stacey Aglok MacDonald, Alethea Arnaquq-Baril', null, 'Anna Lambe, Maika Harper, Braeden Clarke, Zorga Qaunaq, Bailey Poching, Jay Ryan, Mary Lynn Rajskub, Keira Cooper', null, 'A young Inuk woman wants to build a new future for herself after a spontaneous and extremely public exit from her marriage. It won''t be easy in a small Arctic town where everybody knows your business.', 'A young Inuk woman wants to build a new future for herself after a spontaneous and extremely public exit from her marriage. It won''t be easy in a small Arctic town where everybody knows your business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAtcsq5ciJ6TBfGzM0b6BzVCaPA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:249023'),
  ('492737325398615039', 'North Shore', 2004, 'Soap, Drama', null, null, 'Kristoffer Polaha, Brooke Burns, Corey Sevier, Nikki DeLoach, Jason Momoa, Jay Kenneth Johnson, Amanda Righetti, James Remar', null, 'North Shore is an American prime-time soap opera It centered around the staff and guests of the fictional Grand Waimea Hotel and Resort on Oahu''s North Shore in Hawaii.', 'North Shore is an American prime-time soap opera It centered around the staff and guests of the fictional Grand Waimea Hotel and Resort on Oahu''s North Shore in Hawaii.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSqrHZEtpr1pEtAFHYMfR8aYA2S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1650'),
  ('985785588622122028', 'North Shore', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mike Bullen', 'Mike Bullen, Marcia Gardner', 'John Bradley, Joanne Froggatt, Kirsty Sturgess, Dan Spielman, Rob Carlton, Matt Passmore, Rhys Muldoon, Claire Lovering', null, 'When the 19-year-old daughter of a UK politician is found dead in Sydney Harbour, cultures clash as a British and an Australian detective team up to solve a complex murder mystery. But this international investigation will expose more than murder, as the two detectives begin to uncover a conspiracy with political consequences.', 'When the 19-year-old daughter of a UK politician is found dead in Sydney Harbour, cultures clash as a British and an Australian detective team up to solve a complex murder mystery. But this international investigation will expose more than murder, as the two detectives begin to uncover a conspiracy with political consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EwbJS9G5utrEspbIeaXk0l5QVn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226267'),
  ('635508978566125914', 'North South', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Ece Yörenç', 'Melek Gençoğlu, Ece Yörenç', 'Kıvanç Tatlıtuğ, Buğra Gülsoy, Öykü Karayel, Mustafa Avkıran, Semra Dinçer, Zerrin Tekindor, Ünal Silver, Çağdaş Onur Öztürk', 'NR', 'Brothers, Kuzey and Guney, are poles apart in character and perception. Despite their differences, the brothers fall in love with the same girl, Cemre.', 'Brothers, Kuzey and Guney, are poles apart in character and perception. Despite their differences, the brothers fall in love with the same girl, Cemre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eG35U9iYp6cWigQxIpzwlPEPY0l.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:42099'),
  ('1145959970721994119', 'Northern Exposure', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Joshua Brand, John Falsey', null, 'Rob Morrow, Janine Turner, Barry Corbin, John Cullum, Darren E. Burrows, John Corbett, Cynthia Geary, Elaine Miles', 'TV-PG', 'After receiving a scholarship from the state, a recent Columbia University medical school graduate is required to set up his practice in an eccentric Alaskan town.', 'After receiving a scholarship from the state, a recent Columbia University medical school graduate is required to set up his practice in an eccentric Alaskan town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BUSw61C2kNoMuKFQTamIgqMC5.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4396'),
  ('621002824416719125', 'Northern Rescue', 2019, 'Drama', 'Dwayne Hill, Mark Bacci, David Cormican', null, 'William Baldwin, Kathleen Robertson, Amalia Williamson, Spencer MacPherson, Taylor Thorne, Michelle Nolden', 'TV-14', 'After the death of his wife, Sarah, John West, packs up his three children and moves from their hectic urban life to his small northern hometown to take command of the local search-and-rescue service. Once there, the family struggles with their new surroundings, new friends and accepting Sarah''s death.', 'After the death of his wife, Sarah, John West, packs up his three children and moves from their hectic urban life to his small northern hometown to take command of the local search-and-rescue service. Once there, the family struggles with their new surroundings, new friends and accepting Sarah''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8aFWAeQnS5VkalLqjRW7vXH1s03.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87172'),
  ('986856965022563623', 'Northward', 2025, 'Drama', 'Xu Zechen', 'Zhao Dongling', 'Bai Lu, Ou Hao, Tu Ling, Zhai Zilu, Gao Zhiting, Vanda Margraf, Liu Hengfu, Li Naiwen', null, 'The story revolves around several boys and girls who grew up together along the canal, after leaving to make their own growth, reunite after many years. After experiencing competition and the pressures of life, they rediscover the hope for a new life.', 'The story revolves around several boys and girls who grew up together along the canal, after leaving to make their own growth, reunite after many years. After experiencing competition and the pressures of life, they rediscover the hope for a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4D8DBDvQZ5EbfWAuMSulCTAfiTr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233961'),
  ('535476351059819099', 'Northwest Years', 2024, 'Drama', null, 'Long Pingping, 夏蒙', 'Jin Dong, Yu Hewei, Ni Ni, Ding Yongdai, Yan Bingyan, Tong Ruixin, Hou XiangLing, Wang Weizhi', null, 'Amid the upheaval of Chiang Kai-shek’s 1927 coup, young revolutionary Xi Zhongxun defies political terror and emerges as a leader. Inspired by Liu Zhidan’s uprising, he joins forces to establish the Shaanxi-Gansu Red Army. During the Anti-Japanese War, he strengthens the revolutionary base and fosters its development, earning Mao Zedong’s praise for his loyalty to the cause. After Japan’s surrender, Xi Zhongxun fiercely defends the Northwest, helping to lay a foundation for national progress.', 'Amid the upheaval of Chiang Kai-shek’s 1927 coup, young revolutionary Xi Zhongxun defies political terror and emerges as a leader. Inspired by Liu Zhidan’s uprising, he joins forces to establish the Shaanxi-Gansu Red Army. During the Anti-Japanese War, he strengthens the revolutionary base and fosters its development, earning Mao Zedong’s praise for his loyalty to the cause. After Japan’s surrender, Xi Zhongxun fiercely defends the Northwest, helping to lay a foundation for national progress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lF6i7JfT0aA0Neyo0OBHz0gbEki.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275495'),
  ('170534943657352855', 'Nos Tempos do Imperador', 2021, 'Soap, Drama', 'Alessandro Marson, Thereza Falcão', 'Thereza Falcão, Alessandro Marson, Wendell Bendelack', 'Selton Mello, Mariana Ximenes, Letícia Sabatella, Gabriela Medvedovski, Michel Gomes, Alexandre Nero, Daphne Bozaski, João Pedro Zappa', null, 'In 1856, the emperor Dom Pedro II lived a marriage of appearances with Teresa Cristina, with whom he was forced to marry at a young age by his parents'' political alliance, having two daughters with her: Isabel and Leopoldina. He truly loves Countess Luisa, a cultured and time-ahead woman who fights for the abolitionist cause and women''s rights, married to Eugenio, the emperor Napoleon''s cousin. At the same time there are sisters Pilar and Dolores: the first went to a convent after her mother''s death in childhood, growing up among books and dreaming of studying medicine - inspired by the story of Elizabeth Blackwell, the first doctor in the world -, while the second stayed at home to take care of her father, Colonel Eudoro, growing up repressed, illiterate and without vanity.', 'In 1856, the emperor Dom Pedro II lived a marriage of appearances with Teresa Cristina, with whom he was forced to marry at a young age by his parents'' political alliance, having two daughters with her: Isabel and Leopoldina. He truly loves Countess Luisa, a cultured and time-ahead woman who fights for the abolitionist cause and women''s rights, married to Eugenio, the emperor Napoleon''s cousin. At the same time there are sisters Pilar and Dolores: the first went to a convent after her mother''s death in childhood, growing up among books and dreaming of studying medicine - inspired by the story of Elizabeth Blackwell, the first doctor in the world -, while the second stayed at home to take care of her father, Colonel Eudoro, growing up repressed, illiterate and without vanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YW1k4mFB17STW4jy9mLGwHe53m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100127'),
  ('504034155276324511', 'NOS4A2', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Joe Hill, Jami O''Brien', null, 'Ashleigh Cummings, Ólafur Darri Ólafsson, Jahkara Smith, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Virginia Kull, Jonathan Langdon, Ashley Romans, Mattea Conforti', 'TV-14', 'A young Victoria "Vic" McQueen discovers she has the power to unlock portals that help her find lost objects. As she delves further into this hidden universe, she encounters many other "inscape travelers" - some benevolent, and some who have been corrupted by their power. When Vic encounters Charlie Manx, an immortal who stays that way by feeding off of the souls of children, she makes a sworn enemy of Manx.', 'A young Victoria "Vic" McQueen discovers she has the power to unlock portals that help her find lost objects. As she delves further into this hidden universe, she encounters many other "inscape travelers" - some benevolent, and some who have been corrupted by their power. When Vic encounters Charlie Manx, an immortal who stays that way by feeding off of the souls of children, she makes a sworn enemy of Manx.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnosVTTRTCqooJuipwU6C0bgOGf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:85273'),
  ('560298065020467998', 'Nosotros los Guapos', 2016, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Adrián Uribe, Ariel Miramontes, Carmen Salinas, Wendy Braga, Manuel ''Flaco'' Ibáñez, Vanessa Bauche, Malillany Marín', 'TV-PG', 'Vítor and Albertano are in pursuit of the same objective: to find a place to live, and as much as they don''t want to, get a job that allows them to live and pay the rent for the room that the two decide to share at Doña Cuca''s house.', 'Vítor and Albertano are in pursuit of the same objective: to find a place to live, and as much as they don''t want to, get a job that allows them to live and pay the rent for the room that the two decide to share at Doña Cuca''s house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ec8kUtQNOG8ufOjbtuqOJo2Aot.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:67872'),
  ('1017013138281166701', 'Not Born Beautiful', 2005, 'Comedy', null, 'Ivan Ugarov, Elena Kryakovtseva, Mikhail Sokolovsky', 'Nelly Uvarova, Grigoriy Antipenko, Tatyana Novik, Artyom Semakin, Pyotr Krasilov, Olga Lomonosova, Mikhail Zhigalov, Irina Muravyova', null, 'Katya, a plain-looking girl, works as a secretary at the company Zimaletto, a manufacturer of uniforms and wedding dresses. No man has paid attention to her yet, but she doesn''t allow her looks to keep her from dreaming about love and happiness.', 'Katya, a plain-looking girl, works as a secretary at the company Zimaletto, a manufacturer of uniforms and wedding dresses. No man has paid attention to her yet, but she doesn''t allow her looks to keep her from dreaming about love and happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/du9uAsR3sNrhLSnM8oQdTNJFt6D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46083'),
  ('73500002377828455', 'Not Dead Yet', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Casey Johnson, David Windsor', null, 'Gina Rodriguez, Hannah Simone, Lauren Ash, Rick Glassman, Josh Banday, Angela Elayne Gibbs, Brad Garrett', 'TV-14', 'Nell Serrano is a broke and newly single self-described disaster. She works to restart the life and career she left behind some 10 years ago. When writing obituaries is the only job she can find, Nell starts getting life advice from an unlikely (and dead) source.', 'Nell Serrano is a broke and newly single self-described disaster. She works to restart the life and career she left behind some 10 years ago. When writing obituaries is the only job she can find, Nell starts getting life advice from an unlikely (and dead) source.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8QXtqpE5bCQHuSj7e2tRt6HdTK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:203178'),
  ('453937499421599285', 'Not Going Out', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Lee Mack', 'Liam Woodman', 'Lee Mack, Sally Bretton', 'TV-14', 'Lee is a childish northerner who lives in a fancy penthouse apartment in London who goes through a variety of jobs such as a janitor and ice cream man, as well as attempting relationships with female flatmates. His best mate, Daily Mail reading, middle-class citizen Tim is always there to stop Lee from getting in trouble, or not? Mayhem is never far away with cleaner Barbara who has never done an honest day''s work in her life.', 'Lee is a childish northerner who lives in a fancy penthouse apartment in London who goes through a variety of jobs such as a janitor and ice cream man, as well as attempting relationships with female flatmates. His best mate, Daily Mail reading, middle-class citizen Tim is always there to stop Lee from getting in trouble, or not? Mayhem is never far away with cleaner Barbara who has never done an honest day''s work in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzOriVp3DtlEZxh0plXZWBvzWB9.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:1393'),
  ('1013518817768073350', 'Not Just Flatmates', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odinZfEPwRVaO52WjxQX4ogrkKg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228515'),
  ('10834688187253407', 'Not Me', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Mystery', 'Thanutnun Vitsivakun', null, 'Atthaphan Phunsawat, Jumpol Adulkittiporn, Kanaphan Puitrakul, Tanutchai Wijitvongtong, Gawin Caskey, Harit Cheewagaroon, Phromphiriya Thongputtaruk, Rachanun Mahawan', null, 'White returns to Thailand after years abroad to find his twin Black in a coma. Disguising himself as Black, he seeks to uncover the truth behind the betrayal.', 'White returns to Thailand after years abroad to find his twin Black in a coma. Disguising himself as Black, he seeks to uncover the truth behind the betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIkQnUsDEKRr3gS1TuYZ1b8mDxC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122015'),
  ('372011063297248858', 'Not My Fault: Mexico', 2021, 'Drama', 'Emilia Salde, Ana María Parra, Alicia Flores', null, 'Giovanna Utrilla, Gonzalo Vega Jr., Damián Alcázar, Raúl Méndez, Vicky Araico', 'TV-MA', 'Two years after her sister Liliana disappeared without a trace, Mariana receives painful closure when her body is finally discovered. Mariana’s pain empowers her to embark on a tireless mission to learn the truth about what happened to Liliana – a decision that will open her eyes to despicable statistics of a country unable to stem the brutal violence against women.', 'Two years after her sister Liliana disappeared without a trace, Mariana receives painful closure when her body is finally discovered. Mariana’s pain empowers her to embark on a tireless mission to learn the truth about what happened to Liliana – a decision that will open her eyes to despicable statistics of a country unable to stem the brutal violence against women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuMZp0ZADSi0HEEQkCDkhNXgQEP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128067'),
  ('334459299607103298', 'Not Others', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Min-woo, Min Seon-ae', null, 'Jeon Hye-jin, Sooyoung Choi, Ahn Jae-wook, Park Sung-hoon, Kim Hye-eun, Lim Sung-kyun, Seo Ye-hwa, Kim Sang-ho', null, 'Eun-mi is just like any other woman her age, with the exception that she gave birth to her daughter, Jin-hee, while she was in high school. Living under the same roof as Eun-mi is no different for Jin-hee than raising her own daughter, and it''s often difficult to determine who plays the role of the mother. Despite their roommate-like conflicts, deep down they know they can rely on each other when things get a little too chaotic. As a fresh day begins, Eun-mi and Jin-hee step into another day of their remarkable journey, where the ordinary becomes extraordinary in their uniquely intertwined lives.', 'Eun-mi is just like any other woman her age, with the exception that she gave birth to her daughter, Jin-hee, while she was in high school. Living under the same roof as Eun-mi is no different for Jin-hee than raising her own daughter, and it''s often difficult to determine who plays the role of the mother. Despite their roommate-like conflicts, deep down they know they can rely on each other when things get a little too chaotic. As a fresh day begins, Eun-mi and Jin-hee step into another day of their remarkable journey, where the ordinary becomes extraordinary in their uniquely intertwined lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7xA9FQWZBXEWaUQSTdC3DbokDF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:214891'),
  ('683910136660824973', 'Not Quite Narwhal', 2023, 'Kids, Animation', null, null, 'Nevin Kar, Lucy Lowe, Ryan Anderson Lopez, Scarlett Kate Ferguson, Sasha Knight, Mixie Chen', 'TV-Y', 'Curious little Kelp''s been living his whole life as a narwhal... until he finds out he''s actually a unicorn. Now he''s got two worlds to explore!', 'Curious little Kelp''s been living his whole life as a narwhal... until he finds out he''s actually a unicorn. Now he''s got two worlds to explore!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldlcEzhWtVIrX1YGmkQsWHC8FmY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:218576'),
  ('518039959035653909', 'Not Safe for Work', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'D.C. Moore', null, 'Zawe Ashton, Anastasia Hille, Tom Weston-Jones, Sacha Dhawan, Sophie Rundle, Jo Hartley, Samuel Barnett', null, 'Not Safe for Work is a 2015 British comedy-drama series created and written by D.C. Moore for Channel 4. A group of disillusioned Londoner civil servants are forced to relocate to Northampton after public sector cuts, focusing on their personal and professional struggles as they navigate a new, less glamourous office environment.', 'Not Safe for Work is a 2015 British comedy-drama series created and written by D.C. Moore for Channel 4. A group of disillusioned Londoner civil servants are forced to relocate to Northampton after public sector cuts, focusing on their personal and professional struggles as they navigate a new, less glamourous office environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hJqn2QO7oObLT7CDyjn8H4KJC3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63071'),
  ('1038679860408080395', 'Not Safe with Nikki Glaser', 2016, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Nikki Glaser', null, 'Nikki Glaser', 'TV-MA', 'Not Safe with Nikki Glaser blends interviews, experiments, and discussions about subjects revolving around sex, relationships, and the stuff nobody wants to talk about.', 'Not Safe with Nikki Glaser blends interviews, experiments, and discussions about subjects revolving around sex, relationships, and the stuff nobody wants to talk about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yFBKegu06yXUc1lRYiCS2Eo6f4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65680'),
  ('441764848543634680', 'Not the Nine O''Clock News', 1979, 'Comedy', null, 'Rowan Atkinson', 'Rowan Atkinson, Mel Smith, Pamela Stephenson, Griff Rhys Jones, Chris Langham', null, 'Classic sketch comedy show satirising the news and culture of the late 70s and early 80s which introduced Rowan Atkinson, Mel Smith, Griff Rhys Jones and Pamela Stephenson.', 'Classic sketch comedy show satirising the news and culture of the late 70s and early 80s which introduced Rowan Atkinson, Mel Smith, Griff Rhys Jones and Pamela Stephenson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2HPl3FFf38Ofg6Y0rkEcsthUZS.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4153'),
  ('411402251373673314', 'Nothing', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mariano Cohn, Gastón Duprat', 'Mariano Cohn, Emanuel Diez, Gastón Duprat', 'Luis Brandoni, María José Cabrera, Robert De Niro, Enrique Piñeyro, Silvia Kutika, María Rosa Fugazot, Belén Chavanne, Ariadna Asturzzi', null, 'An iconic bon vivant, who barely has enough resources to maintain his affluent lifestyle, hires a young woman from Paraguay to replace the recently deceased maid who took care of him for more than 40 years.', 'An iconic bon vivant, who barely has enough resources to maintain his affluent lifestyle, hires a young woman from Paraguay to replace the recently deceased maid who took care of him for more than 40 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3eYCCO52a511A7SNbAMvowMwuA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201413'),
  ('969733236883440017', 'Nothing But Thirty', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Maggie Jiang, Tong Yao, Mao Xiaotong, Yang Le, Li Zefeng, Edward Ma Chi-Wai, Yan Zidong', null, 'Wang Manni, Gu Jia, and Zhong Xiaoqin each face crises that upend their marriages and force them to rethink love and identity. Manni’s whirlwind romance reveals deep incompatibilities, Gu Jia fights to save the marriage she built from the ground up, and Xiaoqin’s sudden success flips the power balance at home. As their lives shift in unexpected ways, the three women lean on one another while navigating ambition, heartbreak, and the search for happiness on their own terms.', 'Wang Manni, Gu Jia, and Zhong Xiaoqin each face crises that upend their marriages and force them to rethink love and identity. Manni’s whirlwind romance reveals deep incompatibilities, Gu Jia fights to save the marriage she built from the ground up, and Xiaoqin’s sudden success flips the power balance at home. As their lives shift in unexpected ways, the three women lean on one another while navigating ambition, heartbreak, and the search for happiness on their own terms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGxOsXLScVPxBrnDuSy7MdkPUV8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105961'),
  ('1042576338772223547', 'Nothing But You', 2023, 'Drama', null, 'Zhang Yingji', 'Leo Wu, Zhou Yutong, Jiang Peiyao, Zhu Yongteng, Zhang Tao, Xia Haoran, Ma Fanding, Li Qing', null, 'Liang Youan, a workplace elite who entered the bottleneck period of life, and Song Sanchuan, an athlete who was always a substitute, both joined a grass tennis club by chance. Liang Youan was a half-way club manager, and Song Sanchuan also switched to a tennis player from badminton. The two and their teammates worked together to overcome difficulties and strived to build an amazing professional club. In the process, Liang Youan and Song Sanchuan gradually fell in love, along with conflicts in ideas and experience. As the club continued to develop, they surpassed themselves and strengthened trust in dealing with challenges, and ultimately gained professional growth and sweet love.', 'Liang Youan, a workplace elite who entered the bottleneck period of life, and Song Sanchuan, an athlete who was always a substitute, both joined a grass tennis club by chance. Liang Youan was a half-way club manager, and Song Sanchuan also switched to a tennis player from badminton. The two and their teammates worked together to overcome difficulties and strived to build an amazing professional club. In the process, Liang Youan and Song Sanchuan gradually fell in love, along with conflicts in ideas and experience. As the club continued to develop, they surpassed themselves and strengthened trust in dealing with challenges, and ultimately gained professional growth and sweet love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdT8Pn6e4IogDI6LK1ymjVoeJ0c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210580'),
  ('643132391367902950', 'Nothing Gold Can Stay', 2017, 'Drama', 'Ding Hei, Zhijie Han', null, 'Sun Li, Chen Xiao, Myolie Wu Hang-Yee, Yu Haoming, Morning Chang, Zeng Qi, Peter Ho, Niki Chow Lai-Kei', null, 'Zhou Ying is sold to the powerful Shen family by her foster father, yet successfully escapes by sneaking into merchant Wu Ping’s palanquin. The Wu family agreed to take her in after witnessing her remarkable business acumen, and she ends up marrying Wu Ping. The drama will chronicle the life of the Qing Dynasty''s richest female merchant, and her struggles to keep the Wu family business afloat during the last years of the Qing Dynasty. Shen Xingyi is a happy-go-lucky young sir who has never known hardship in his life. After meeting Zhou Ying, he eventually decides to change his ways and becomes a mature noble who is willing to protect his country and family from disaster. He has a seemingly unrequited love for Zhou Ying.', 'Zhou Ying is sold to the powerful Shen family by her foster father, yet successfully escapes by sneaking into merchant Wu Ping’s palanquin. The Wu family agreed to take her in after witnessing her remarkable business acumen, and she ends up marrying Wu Ping. The drama will chronicle the life of the Qing Dynasty''s richest female merchant, and her struggles to keep the Wu family business afloat during the last years of the Qing Dynasty. Shen Xingyi is a happy-go-lucky young sir who has never known hardship in his life. After meeting Zhou Ying, he eventually decides to change his ways and becomes a mature noble who is willing to protect his country and family from disaster. He has a seemingly unrequited love for Zhou Ying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYKhn1VWs2Thz2sfe8uQZZ0SSoD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73625'),
  ('126121987490157255', 'Nothing to See Here', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Santiago Limón', null, 'Alexis Arroyo, Kike Vázquez', 'TV-MA', 'When an aspiring blind comedian goes after his dreams, it''s him and his best friend with cerebral palsy against the world, no matter what runs them over.', 'When an aspiring blind comedian goes after his dreams, it''s him and his best friend with cerebral palsy against the world, no matter what runs them over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1b8piHiTrF1IIXKYhtRkttDsJ2I.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:237983'),
  ('618020603097061275', 'Notorious', 2016, 'Drama', 'Allie Hagan, Josh Berman', null, 'Daniel Sunjata, Piper Perabo, Kate Jennings Grant, Kevin Zegers, Aimee Teegarden, J. August Richards, Sepideh Moafi, Ryan Guzman', null, 'Follows the professional and personal relationship between a charismatic attorney and a powerhouse television producer as they attempt to control the media, the justice system, and ultimately - each other...', 'Follows the professional and personal relationship between a charismatic attorney and a powerhouse television producer as they attempt to control the media, the justice system, and ultimately - each other...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tj1PiPPCp01NhBdYVAnoOQAv2U4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67119'),
