  ('506267691575770932', 'NOVA', 1974, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'PBS'' premier science series helps viewers of all ages explore the science behind the headlines. Along the way, NOVA demystifies science and technology, and highlights the people involved in scientific pursuits.', 'PBS'' premier science series helps viewers of all ages explore the science behind the headlines. Along the way, NOVA demystifies science and technology, and highlights the people involved in scientific pursuits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giUBXYnDAaJgNqA6iE3BMVE2EHp.jpg', 53, 'tmdb:tv:3562'),
  ('808061348611904321', 'November 13: Attack on Paris', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Gédéon Naudet, Jules Naudet', null, 'François Hollande', 'TV-MA', 'Survivors and first responders share personal stories of anguish, kindness and bravery that unfolded amid the Paris terror attacks of Nov. 13, 2015.', 'Survivors and first responders share personal stories of anguish, kindness and bravery that unfolded amid the Paris terror attacks of Nov. 13, 2015.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TdpNQfW7VwUxIkrOxWzpOtlgun.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79932'),
  ('253396678901838168', 'November Story', 2021, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Indhra Subramanian', 'Indhra Subramanian', 'Tamannaah Bhatia, G. M. Kumar, Pasupathy, Vivek Prasanna, Aruldoss, Namita Krishnamurthy, Myna Nandhini, Pujitha Devaraju', null, 'A celebrated crime novelist suffering from Alzheimer''s is found at a murder scene with no memory of what happened. Now, it is up to his daughter to save him.', 'A celebrated crime novelist suffering from Alzheimer''s is found at a murder scene with no memory of what happened. Now, it is up to his daughter to save him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l93GSW1EO7qO6bPUp5qHCDkfyOT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125938'),
  ('916532247097148785', 'Novo Mundo', 2017, 'Soap, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Thereza Falcão, Alessandro Marson', 'Thereza Falcão, Alessandro Marson, Duba Elia', 'Isabelle Drummond, Chay Suede, Caio Castro, Letícia Colin, Gabriel Braga Nunes, Agatha Moreira, Ingrid Guimarães, Vivianne Pasmanter', 'NR', 'Anna Millman is a portuguese teacher, she falls for Joaquim Martinho, an actor. Both meet in Europe and travel to Brazil together with the future princess of Brazil, Leopoldina from Austria. The romance between the teacher and the actor evolves during a time of revolution, the independence of Brazil', 'Anna Millman is a portuguese teacher, she falls for Joaquim Martinho, an actor. Both meet in Europe and travel to Brazil together with the future princess of Brazil, Leopoldina from Austria. The romance between the teacher and the actor evolves during a time of revolution, the independence of Brazil', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcevG4iwVe2D26G8gMxR6kUdAGC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70984'),
  ('1003132406993002464', 'Novoland: Eagle Flag', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Chang Jiang', 'Liu Haoran, Song Zuer, Chen Ruoxuan, Zhang Jiayi, Xu Qing, Zhang Zhijian, Zhang Fengyi, Maggie Jiang', null, 'Lü Guichen is the heir of the nomadic Qingyang tribe, and is sent to the Eastern Land as hostage. He meets Ji Ye, an unfavoured illegitimate son who is training to become a warrior, and Yu Ran, the princess of the Winged tribe. The three become close friends, and the boys’ feelings for Yu Ran soon turn romantic. At the same time, powerful warlord Ying Wuyi has been maintaining a firm control over the Emperor, giving him unprecedented power over the nobles. Lü Guichen, Ji Ye and Yu Ran decide to join the decisive battle against Ying Wuyi at Shangyang Pass, but unbeknownst to them, an even darker conspiracy is yet to unfold.', 'Lü Guichen is the heir of the nomadic Qingyang tribe, and is sent to the Eastern Land as hostage. He meets Ji Ye, an unfavoured illegitimate son who is training to become a warrior, and Yu Ran, the princess of the Winged tribe. The three become close friends, and the boys’ feelings for Yu Ran soon turn romantic. At the same time, powerful warlord Ying Wuyi has been maintaining a firm control over the Emperor, giving him unprecedented power over the nobles. Lü Guichen, Ji Ye and Yu Ran decide to join the decisive battle against Ying Wuyi at Shangyang Pass, but unbeknownst to them, an even darker conspiracy is yet to unfold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWXHVLn0WL9d5duvP5Az7bALWxt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91280'),
  ('220124345413189397', 'Novoland: Pearl Eclipse', 2021, 'Drama', 'Xiao Ruse', null, 'Yang Mi, William Chan, Xu Kaicheng, Chen Xiaoyun, Wang Sen, Yuan Yuxuan, Ye Qing, Zeng Yongti', null, 'Set in the Zheng dynasty of the fantasy world Novoland, the drama revolves around a young girl of the merfolk tribe Ye Haishi; and her love story with the current Emperor, Fang Zhu.', 'Set in the Zheng dynasty of the fantasy world Novoland, the drama revolves around a young girl of the merfolk tribe Ye Haishi; and her love story with the current Emperor, Fang Zhu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJ0vndu5q7S2MDSYsEJFRWO4JMb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103310'),
  ('1022730615800414533', 'Novoland: The Castle in the Sky', 2016, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Zhang Ruoyun, Guan Xiaotong, Liu Chang, Ju Jingyi, Chen Ruoxuan, Zhu Shengyi, Zhang Luyi, Liu Min', null, 'In the ancient time, the human honored the winged clan as gods for their ability to fly and to build a castle in the sky. The day when the castle was to be lifted off the ground an explosion destroyed it. A human girl was suspected to have the done deed. However, a man from the winged clan didn''t believe it and saved her life. As it turned out, it was a faction of the winged clan trying to start a war with the humans in order to expand their control.', 'In the ancient time, the human honored the winged clan as gods for their ability to fly and to build a castle in the sky. The day when the castle was to be lifted off the ground an explosion destroyed it. A human girl was suspected to have the done deed. However, a man from the winged clan didn''t believe it and saved her life. As it turned out, it was a faction of the winged clan trying to start a war with the humans in order to expand their control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JNheidGnIxsuqNzpKhrOF4ZUcQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68057'),
  ('369536855697719634', 'Novoland: The Castle In the Sky 2', 2020, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Zhao Jin-Tao, Jinqing Zhang', 'Zhili Yang, Youyou', 'Xu Zhengxi, Wang Yuwen, Daisy Li, Dai Wenwen, Wang Ziqi, Chai Ge, Xu Xiaonuo, Liang Yolin', null, 'The story centers around the human tribe and the winged tribe. Feng Ruche is Feng Tianyi and Yi Fuling''s daughter whose fate is intertwined with the greatest magician of Lanzhou.', 'The story centers around the human tribe and the winged tribe. Feng Ruche is Feng Tianyi and Yi Fuling''s daughter whose fate is intertwined with the greatest magician of Lanzhou.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7avHgNizJ13WSRTRNtcMvhx01L.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124702'),
  ('456766192327974929', 'Now and Again', 1999, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Glenn Gordon Caron', null, 'Eric Close, Dennis Haysbert, Margaret Colin, Gerrit Graham, Heather Matarazzo', null, 'When insurance salesman and family man Michael Wiseman is killed in a subway accident, the U.S. government preserves his brain and puts it into a new, genetically bio-engineered body that''s young, attractive, and can do anything a superhero can do. But as a top-secret experiment and weapon, the new and improved Michael can never let his wife Lisa or daughter Heather know his true identity. With the strict but brilliant Dr. Morris as his mentor, Michael takes on deadly terrorists, corrupt agents, killer bugs, and an extremely dangerous international criminal known as "the Egg Man." Michael can do anything...except stay away from the family that he loves.', 'When insurance salesman and family man Michael Wiseman is killed in a subway accident, the U.S. government preserves his brain and puts it into a new, genetically bio-engineered body that''s young, attractive, and can do anything a superhero can do. But as a top-secret experiment and weapon, the new and improved Michael can never let his wife Lisa or daughter Heather know his true identity. With the strict but brilliant Dr. Morris as his mentor, Michael takes on deadly terrorists, corrupt agents, killer bugs, and an extremely dangerous international criminal known as "the Egg Man." Michael can do anything...except stay away from the family that he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCAXhFIxJTbQFqJAt5nZtFSnBbQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:165'),
  ('992561786287692420', 'Now and Then', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Teresa Fernández-Valdés, Ramón Campos, Gema R. Neira', null, 'Rosie Perez, Marina de Tavira, José María Yázpik, Maribel Verdú, Manolo Cardona, Soledad Villamil, Željko Ivanek, Jorge López', 'TV-MA', 'On the eve of college graduation, six best friends embark on an epic weekend to celebrate—but it takes a fatal turn. Nearly 20 years later, the survivors are reluctantly reunited by a blackmail text threatening to expose the truth about that fateful night.', 'On the eve of college graduation, six best friends embark on an epic weekend to celebrate—but it takes a fatal turn. Nearly 20 years later, the survivors are reluctantly reunited by a blackmail text threatening to expose the truth about that fateful night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2z4ePy6Z6cURDvNnEmR36nidBNU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123854'),
  ('1086579139964512565', 'Now and Then, Here and There', 1999, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Akemi Okamura, Kaori Nazuka, Azusa Nakao, Yuka Imai, Reiko Yasuhara, Koji Ishii, Hiroko Konishi, Rica Matsumoto', null, 'Shu is a typical Japanese boy, but has an unbeatable, optimistic and determined attitude. However, when he sees a mysterious girl with strange eyes named Lala-Ru up on a smokestack, he is soon pulled into a strange desert world. Shu soon discovers the true terrors of war, which includes genocide, brutal torture, hunger, thirst, and child explotation. Now Shu is trying to save Lala-Ru, as well as his hard earned, and often relunctant, new friends from the insane dictator, Hamdo. Whether Shu can possibly accomplish saving those he cares about while still holding up to his values remains to be seen.', 'Shu is a typical Japanese boy, but has an unbeatable, optimistic and determined attitude. However, when he sees a mysterious girl with strange eyes named Lala-Ru up on a smokestack, he is soon pulled into a strange desert world. Shu soon discovers the true terrors of war, which includes genocide, brutal torture, hunger, thirst, and child explotation. Now Shu is trying to save Lala-Ru, as well as his hard earned, and often relunctant, new friends from the insane dictator, Hamdo. Whether Shu can possibly accomplish saving those he cares about while still holding up to his values remains to be seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjw3X2Tv1C9zT2StFTdgPEJkxnB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26340'),
  ('219304892610616439', 'Now Apocalypse', 2019, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Gregg Araki', null, 'Avan Jogia, Kelli Berglund, Beau Mirchoff, Roxane Mesquida', 'TV-MA', 'This surreal, coming-of-age comedy series follows Ulysses and his friends Carly, Ford, and Severine, who are on various quests pursuing love, sex and fame. Between sexual and romantic dating-app adventures, Ulysses grows increasingly troubled as foreboding premonitory dreams make him wonder if some kind of dark and monstrous conspiracy is going on, or if he is just smoking too much weed.', 'This surreal, coming-of-age comedy series follows Ulysses and his friends Carly, Ford, and Severine, who are on various quests pursuing love, sex and fame. Between sexual and romantic dating-app adventures, Ulysses grows increasingly troubled as foreboding premonitory dreams make him wonder if some kind of dark and monstrous conspiracy is going on, or if he is just smoking too much weed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCjy2VzLM4tkUJ62DAFCkdq0LHM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84880'),
  ('360663448925193098', 'Now, We Are Breaking Up', 2021, 'Drama', 'Je-in, Kang Eun-kyung', 'Je-in', 'Song Hye-kyo, Jang Ki-yong, Moon Choi, Kim Ju-hun, Park Hyo-ju, Yoon Na-moo, Nam Kee-ae, Choi Hong-il', null, 'Will tell stories of emotional love and breakups. Ha Young-eun, a manager of the design team at a fashion label who is a trendy and intelligent realist. Yoon Jae-guk, a wealthy and popular freelancer photographer who also has the brains and looks. Hwang Chi-sook is a director of the fashion label’s design team who attended high school with Ha Young-eun and Seok Do-hoon is a skilled PR company CEO.', 'Will tell stories of emotional love and breakups. Ha Young-eun, a manager of the design team at a fashion label who is a trendy and intelligent realist. Yoon Jae-guk, a wealthy and popular freelancer photographer who also has the brains and looks. Hwang Chi-sook is a director of the fashion label’s design team who attended high school with Ha Young-eun and Seok Do-hoon is a skilled PR company CEO.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUn67I9Pzpb2XNz6HxSCa26T0rD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129887'),
  ('267221167816550979', 'Nowhere Boys', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Tony Ayres', null, 'Kamil Ellis, Joe Klocek, Jordie Race-Coldrey, Luca Sardelis, William McKenna', 'TV-Y', 'Four teenage boys get lost in the forest and discover, when they return home, that they are in an alternate world identical to theirs except for one startling difference - they were never born.', 'Four teenage boys get lost in the forest and discover, when they return home, that they are in an alternate world identical to theirs except for one startling difference - they were never born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9E8xLyzhV9rUpdxbHp9wCWZCc8.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:54866'),
  ('267123251638731747', 'Nowhere Man', 1995, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Lawrence Hertzog', null, 'Bruce Greenwood', null, 'Thomas Veil is a documentary photographer who, in the course of one evening, seemingly has his whole existence erased...', 'Thomas Veil is a documentary photographer who, in the course of one evening, seemingly has his whole existence erased...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMQ0IDjUs7tLf9XefBQGZ7AkvpP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10494'),
  ('989005283347696413', 'Nowhere Man', 2019, 'Crime', null, 'Yin-jung Chen, Chan Chun-chieh, Po-Shen Kuo', 'Alyssa Chia, Mavis Fan, Joseph Chang, Edison Wang, Chou Min-fu, Greg Hsu', 'TV-MA', 'Two nefarious schemes taking place 10 years apart entangle a dauntless triad member, who must break out of prison to rescue a loved one.', 'Two nefarious schemes taking place 10 years apart entangle a dauntless triad member, who must break out of prison to rescue a loved one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFt2MlgRizkHerAuQkBLyPXaZU8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94384'),
